(584116, 60299, 3419, '<td valign="top">Hmmm - the lighting seems really hard (hard shadows), and because of it''s brightness, I''m not getting any feel for texture in this shot. If you''d photographed the other side of the strawberry, the photo would be more suitable for this challenge. Nevertheless, good color and detail. My mouth is watering!</td>', 'Hmmm - the lighting seems really hard (hard shadows), and because of it''s brightness, I''m not getting any feel for texture in this shot. If you''d photographed the other side of the strawberry, the photo would be more suitable for this challenge. Nevertheless, good color and detail. My mouth is watering!', '2004-02-18 00:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(584117, 59889, 13403, '<td valign="top">are you sure this isn''t a surface shot of the moon... or maybe even mars desaturated of color? :-p</td>', 'are you sure this isn''t a surface shot of the moon... or maybe even mars desaturated of color? :-p', '2004-02-18 00:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(584118, 60832, 10055, '<td valign="top">Cute shot!...best for a people chanllege. but I''m sure you are proudof your son (I suppose) and couldn''t help it... I like it anyways.</td>', 'Cute shot!...best for a people chanllege. but I''m sure you are proudof your son (I suppose) and couldn''t help it... I like it anyways.', '2004-02-18 00:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
