(584144, 60013, 13403, '<td valign="top">wow.  i like the contrast and saturation..  excellent photo.. i don''t know about how well it fits the ''texture'' challange..  i mean.. it has texture.. but you''re digging deep in that sense.    ..  i have never seen lines so defined in a person''s iris.. but lines aren''t texture.  an eye is smooth....  this photo doesn''t really make me think of the texture "smooth" so i don''t think i can give it a 10.   I would if I could.</td>', 'wow.  i like the contrast and saturation..  excellent photo.. i don''t know about how well it fits the ''texture'' challange..  i mean.. it has texture.. but you''re digging deep in that sense.    ..  i have never seen lines so defined in a person''s iris.. but lines aren''t texture.  an eye is smooth....  this photo doesn''t really make me think of the texture "smooth" so i don''t think i can give it a 10.   I would if I could.', '2004-02-18 00:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(584146, 60486, 16648, '<td valign="top">something does not look right to me - the duck body is too dark, some of the forest floor appears out of focus, the neck fether appear blurred (may be optical illusion)<br/> <br/>composition leaves me cold</td>', 'something does not look right to me - the duck body is too dark, some of the forest floor appears out of focus, the neck fether appear blurred (may be optical illusion) composition leaves me cold', '2004-02-18 00:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
