(584160, 61090, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how the picture is divided into thirds by the different textures and colors.  I think, though, that if the black had been a deeper black and had been in the middle, with not blue showing, it might have been more effective.</td>', 'I like how the picture is divided into thirds by the different textures and colors.  I think, though, that if the black had been a deeper black and had been in the middle, with not blue showing, it might have been more effective.', '2004-02-18 00:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(584162, 59955, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice color patterns. Nice attempt to capture the texture of a feather. It is a feather, correct? Would prefer that it was in focus. However, the focus method does give it an abstract feeling.</td>', 'Nice color patterns. Nice attempt to capture the texture of a feather. It is a feather, correct? Would prefer that it was in focus. However, the focus method does give it an abstract feeling.', '2004-02-18 00:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
