(584164, 61086, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the composition on this, and the bw really gives it an interesting twist.  I do think, however, that the soft focus (while normally effective for shots like this) kinda hurts since it is a "texture" challenge, and the texture isn''t real obvious, to me.</td>', 'I love the composition on this, and the bw really gives it an interesting twist.  I do think, however, that the soft focus (while normally effective for shots like this) kinda hurts since it is a "texture" challenge, and the texture isn''t real obvious, to me.', '2004-02-18 00:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(584166, 60852, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - absolutely beautiful. My dog, Marilyn, a lab/husky cross has beautiful eyes like this, but she''s afraid of my camera and won''t let me photograph her. Great detail in the hair texture. I see this placing very very high.</td>', 'Beautiful - absolutely beautiful. My dog, Marilyn, a lab/husky cross has beautiful eyes like this, but she''s afraid of my camera and won''t let me photograph her. Great detail in the hair texture. I see this placing very very high.', '2004-02-18 00:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(584167, 60737, 12108, '<td valign="top">great texture, and I like how the window or door on the left it gives the photo some depth. It just seems to lack the punch to get it over the top.  (6)</td>', 'great texture, and I like how the window or door on the left it gives the photo some depth. It just seems to lack the punch to get it over the top.  (6)', '2004-02-18 00:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
