(584620, 61087, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ There is texture present. Fortunately you mention in the title that this subject should resemble a feather <br/>- I think the bird from whom this feather was must have been died a terrible death as these feathers are just so poor and fragile :(. Very uninteresting photo and combined with the strange unsharpness at the left side of this picture makes this a sad thing to view.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ There is texture present. Fortunately you mention in the title that this subject should resemble a feather - I think the bird from whom this feather was must have been died a terrible death as these feathers are just so poor and fragile :(. Very uninteresting photo and combined with the strange unsharpness at the left side of this picture makes this a sad thing to view.', '2004-02-18 04:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(584621, 61109, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Nice use of light to bring the texture in the viewers mind (it is the first thing that is noticable).<br/>- Focus seems to be a bit of, golfballs have been used many times before, composition isn''t quite attractive.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Nice use of light to bring the texture in the viewers mind (it is the first thing that is noticable).- Focus seems to be a bit of, golfballs have been used many times before, composition isn''t quite attractive.', '2004-02-18 04:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
