(584623, 60721, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ You picked the right moment to bring the textures out of this building. The composition brings interest to this building.<br/>- The (power?) lines are a little distracting (if only you were allowed to use PS in this challenge ;)). It probably wasn''t possible but if all the windows were blue there was an even great contrast between the glass &amp; the sky versus the rest of the building.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ You picked the right moment to bring the textures out of this building. The composition brings interest to this building.- The (power?) lines are a little distracting (if only you were allowed to use PS in this challenge ;)). It probably wasn''t possible but if all the windows were blue there was an even great contrast between the glass & the sky versus the rest of the building.', '2004-02-18 04:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
