(584677, 60565, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very white highlights - give a plastic feel. Perhaps a softer light would reduce that. Some detail missing, just lacking that edge of sharpness. Kind of ''ugly'' to do well here, but nice idea.</td>', 'Very white highlights - give a plastic feel. Perhaps a softer light would reduce that. Some detail missing, just lacking that edge of sharpness. Kind of ''ugly'' to do well here, but nice idea.', '2004-02-18 05:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
