(584680, 60083, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s a 1970''s low-contrast feel to this - quite interesting. Certainly captured the texture of the outside, but the pearl and the inside of the shell seem to have been relegated to almost an insignificant detail. Composition  doesn''t work for me - perhaps because of the tight crop on the left of the shell and leaving the right side open.</td>', 'There''s a 1970''s low-contrast feel to this - quite interesting. Certainly captured the texture of the outside, but the pearl and the inside of the shell seem to have been relegated to almost an insignificant detail. Composition  doesn''t work for me - perhaps because of the tight crop on the left of the shell and leaving the right side open.', '2004-02-18 05:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(584681, 60769, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Textures are present. Composition is okay.<br/>- The grey background is dull in relation with the vivid colours of the paint.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Textures are present. Composition is okay.- The grey background is dull in relation with the vivid colours of the paint.', '2004-02-18 05:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(584683, 59973, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Textures are here.<br/>- There isn''t much else to look at. The photo isn''t very appealing. <br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Textures are here.- There isn''t much else to look at. The photo isn''t very appealing. ', '2004-02-18 05:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(584684, 60148, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intersting graphically - but I think it''s a question of colours here rather than texture - I get no sensation of roughness from any of this wood, and only a suggestion from the metal bar. I also think your composition could be improved - all the ''weight'' of this is to the left (the metal, the join of the planks, and even that hole is almost centre.</td>', 'Intersting graphically - but I think it''s a question of colours here rather than texture - I get no sensation of roughness from any of this wood, and only a suggestion from the metal bar. I also think your composition could be improved - all the ''weight'' of this is to the left (the metal, the join of the planks, and even that hole is almost centre.', '2004-02-18 05:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(584687, 60988, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Good capture of the water (heaps of action!); the rocks bring appeal to this photo. The composition and framing are excellent.<br/>- Can''t think of any.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Good capture of the water (heaps of action!); the rocks bring appeal to this photo. The composition and framing are excellent.- Can''t think of any.', '2004-02-18 05:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(584688, 60745, 6948, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and lighting!</td>', 'I love the colors and lighting!', '2004-02-18 05:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(584689, 60248, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Excellent product shot. Perhaps you should have s(h)aved this one for the Mundane challenge ;). <br/>- Can''t think of any.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Excellent product shot. Perhaps you should have s(h)aved this one for the Mundane challenge ;). - Can''t think of any.', '2004-02-18 05:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(584690, 60188, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit too head-on to really emphasise the texture. Some feeling of rough/smooth with those edges and surfaces survives, however. Perfectly well in focus, but seems to lack that edge of detail - processing? camera? don''t know...</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit too head-on to really emphasise the texture. Some feeling of rough/smooth with those edges and surfaces survives, however. Perfectly well in focus, but seems to lack that edge of detail - processing? camera? don''t know...', '2004-02-18 05:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(584691, 60815, 17081, '<td valign="top">a bit blurry</td>', 'a bit blurry', '2004-02-18 05:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(584692, 59907, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ There are textures present.<br/>- Subject choice isn''t that great. Photo doesn''t hold my attention for very long.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ There are textures present.- Subject choice isn''t that great. Photo doesn''t hold my attention for very long.', '2004-02-18 05:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(584693, 60572, 6948, '<td valign="top">Nice macro!</td>', 'Nice macro!', '2004-02-18 05:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(584695, 59961, 6948, '<td valign="top">Very good macro and DOF, good luck!</td>', 'Very good macro and DOF, good luck!', '2004-02-18 05:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(584696, 60771, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting thinking - and at least trying to do more than one thing. Compositionally a bit blunt (did you try positioning the knife further left in frame?), and the texture of the stone is not well shown - no sensation of that light graininess of it, for me.</td>', 'Interesting thinking - and at least trying to do more than one thing. Compositionally a bit blunt (did you try positioning the knife further left in frame?), and the texture of the stone is not well shown - no sensation of that light graininess of it, for me.', '2004-02-18 05:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(584697, 60742, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Well, you have tried to be original.<br/>- The weird colours and distoration can''t really seem to hold my attention for too long.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Well, you have tried to be original.- The weird colours and distoration can''t really seem to hold my attention for too long.', '2004-02-18 05:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(584698, 60923, 12802, '<td valign="top">Think your shallow DOF here doesn''t help much.  The egg in front is in focus, but the cotton wool at the left hand side isn''t in focus.  A larger F stop would have helped you here.</td>', 'Think your shallow DOF here doesn''t help much.  The egg in front is in focus, but the cotton wool at the left hand side isn''t in focus.  A larger F stop would have helped you here.', '2004-02-18 05:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(584699, 60563, 17081, '<td valign="top">nice shot but doesn''t suite the theme very well.</td>', 'nice shot but doesn''t suite the theme very well.', '2004-02-18 05:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(584700, 60288, 12802, '<td valign="top">Wish I could read what it says on the statue...  Th esepia tones are good, makes it loko more interesting, the sky also looks really nice.</td>', 'Wish I could read what it says on the statue...  Th esepia tones are good, makes it loko more interesting, the sky also looks really nice.', '2004-02-18 05:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(584701, 59961, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ The macro puts the attention on the texture of the candy.<br/>- DOF seems to be too shallow. The candies aren''t a subject that really hold my attention for more than a few seconds.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ The macro puts the attention on the texture of the candy.- DOF seems to be too shallow. The candies aren''t a subject that really hold my attention for more than a few seconds.', '2004-02-18 05:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(584703, 60738, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ There is texture present (this only prevents me from not giving you a 1).<br/>- That is about it. Very poor and disappointing attempt :(.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ There is texture present (this only prevents me from not giving you a 1).- That is about it. Very poor and disappointing attempt :(.', '2004-02-18 05:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(584705, 60185, 6999, '<td valign="top">This may be the first time I''ve seen a shot with on-board flash that actually achieves some quality of texture :-) makes it look very hard - though as it''s presumably dead that''s probably accurate. The top shadow is a shame - constantly pulls the eye away from that in-focus area where I think, for this challenge, you''d want the eye to rest. Actually, in classicla composition terms, you have leading lines working against your area of interst, which is what makes this a little unsatisfying despite the good texture.</td>', 'This may be the first time I''ve seen a shot with on-board flash that actually achieves some quality of texture :-) makes it look very hard - though as it''s presumably dead that''s probably accurate. The top shadow is a shame - constantly pulls the eye away from that in-focus area where I think, for this challenge, you''d want the eye to rest. Actually, in classicla composition terms, you have leading lines working against your area of interst, which is what makes this a little unsatisfying despite the good texture.', '2004-02-18 05:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(584706, 59912, 6948, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, good luck!</td>', 'Nice DOF, good luck!', '2004-02-18 05:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(584707, 60470, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Lots of textures!<br/>- If you have come a little closer the photo would have gained even more appeal (perhaps a closeup / macro of one leave with snow on top of it would have worked better?). There is too much going on and the composition leaves room for improvement.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Lots of textures!- If you have come a little closer the photo would have gained even more appeal (perhaps a closeup / macro of one leave with snow on top of it would have worked better?). There is too much going on and the composition leaves room for improvement.', '2004-02-18 05:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(584710, 60765, 6948, '<td valign="top">Maybe if it was a little sharper, but nice macro! Good luck!</td>', 'Maybe if it was a little sharper, but nice macro! Good luck!', '2004-02-18 05:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(584711, 60922, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Texture is present. Good macro.<br/>- The white border is somehow distracting. DOF is a little too shallow.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Texture is present. Good macro.- The white border is somehow distracting. DOF is a little too shallow.', '2004-02-18 05:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(584712, 61141, 6948, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, good luck!</td>', 'Nice macro, good luck!', '2004-02-18 05:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(584713, 60782, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Its nose has a interesting texture. Good choice of using B/W.<br/>- Not again a dog *sigh*. Composition could be better.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Its nose has a interesting texture. Good choice of using B/W.- Not again a dog *sigh*. Composition could be better.', '2004-02-18 05:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(584714, 61102, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good. Almost nothing <i>but</i> texture. Like the low-key, like the suspicion of movement within the leather, perhaps the suggestion of it having formed to s body, and those creases being an echo of that person. Perhaps too close to the abstact, too minimalist to do well here; and also to hold my interst very long, I''m afraid. Competent stuff though.</td>', 'Good. Almost nothing but texture. Like the low-key, like the suspicion of movement within the leather, perhaps the suggestion of it having formed to s body, and those creases being an echo of that person. Perhaps too close to the abstact, too minimalist to do well here; and also to hold my interst very long, I''m afraid. Competent stuff though.', '2004-02-18 05:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(584715, 60270, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>- I have some difficulty find the texture here; <br/>+ but it is present :). Nice and lovely pose.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]- I have some difficulty find the texture here; + but it is present :). Nice and lovely pose.', '2004-02-18 05:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(584716, 61114, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Excellent light, wonderful colours and good choice of subject. The border fits the photo very well.<br/>- Can''t think of any.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Excellent light, wonderful colours and good choice of subject. The border fits the photo very well.- Can''t think of any.', '2004-02-18 05:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(584717, 60257, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good contrast of subject, but the framing of them lets this down. Also the moment of light you''ve chosen - I get no real sensation of variation of texture between these two things.</td>', 'Good contrast of subject, but the framing of them lets this down. Also the moment of light you''ve chosen - I get no real sensation of variation of texture between these two things.', '2004-02-18 05:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(584718, 60129, 6948, '<td valign="top">I like it because it''s unusual! Good luck!</td>', 'I like it because it''s unusual! Good luck!', '2004-02-18 05:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(584719, 61108, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Great shot with excellent use of light and darkness that shows us the textures. Your composition is very good.<br/>- Can''t think of any.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Great shot with excellent use of light and darkness that shows us the textures. Your composition is very good.- Can''t think of any.', '2004-02-18 05:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(584720, 60999, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Good choice of B/W. The waterdrops bring interest to the photo and the composition and choice of POV is very good.<br/>- Can''t think of any.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Good choice of B/W. The waterdrops bring interest to the photo and the composition and choice of POV is very good.- Can''t think of any.', '2004-02-18 05:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(584721, 60993, 12802, '<td valign="top">This is nice, could have done with being sharper though.  I''ve done it in PS and it make the cream colour of the veins come out even more...  Also, a larger F Stop would have made the whole leave look in focus, it''s out of focus on the left.</td>', 'This is nice, could have done with being sharper though.  I''ve done it in PS and it make the cream colour of the veins come out even more...  Also, a larger F Stop would have made the whole leave look in focus, it''s out of focus on the left.', '2004-02-18 05:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(584722, 61089, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Okay there is texture present.<br/>- And that is about it :(.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Okay there is texture present.- And that is about it :(.', '2004-02-18 05:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(584723, 61031, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lighting and the level of contrast (perhaps rather the level of mid-tones) you''ve chosen to use here don''t do a lot for this. I think the idea of the contrast of young and old skin is good, though I find the ''joke'' a bit twee, and this doesn''t communicate that contrast effectively.</td>', 'Lighting and the level of contrast (perhaps rather the level of mid-tones) you''ve chosen to use here don''t do a lot for this. I think the idea of the contrast of young and old skin is good, though I find the ''joke'' a bit twee, and this doesn''t communicate that contrast effectively.', '2004-02-18 05:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(584724, 60814, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ There are textures present.<br/>- And that is about it; the photo doesn''t have a lot of appeal in my opinion.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ There are textures present.- And that is about it; the photo doesn''t have a lot of appeal in my opinion.', '2004-02-18 05:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(584725, 61101, 6999, '<td valign="top">The roughness of apparently smooth things :-) The angle is good, and the complex/simple contrast. My eye is constantly pulled toward the foreground keys, and then back to where you''ve placed the focal plane, whcih makes for a disconcerting conflict in such a minimal composition. I have no problem with the very shallow DOF, but more with the point fo focus you''ve chosen.</td>', 'The roughness of apparently smooth things :-) The angle is good, and the complex/simple contrast. My eye is constantly pulled toward the foreground keys, and then back to where you''ve placed the focal plane, whcih makes for a disconcerting conflict in such a minimal composition. I have no problem with the very shallow DOF, but more with the point fo focus you''ve chosen.', '2004-02-18 05:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(584727, 60537, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Woow that house is completely wrecked :). More than enough textures to meet the challenge. The composition is done quite well.<br/>- The photo is a bit overexposed.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Woow that house is completely wrecked :). More than enough textures to meet the challenge. The composition is done quite well.- The photo is a bit overexposed.', '2004-02-18 05:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(584728, 60879, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Excellent macro and use of light to bring out the lovely textures in this feather. <br/>- It has been done before.<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Excellent macro and use of light to bring out the lovely textures in this feather. - It has been done before.', '2004-02-18 05:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(584729, 60595, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ There are textures.<br/>- The photo isn''t appealing in any way; it feels like a snapshot (which doesn''t have to be bad in all cases but here it is :().<br/></td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ There are textures.- The photo isn''t appealing in any way; it feels like a snapshot (which doesn''t have to be bad in all cases but here it is :().', '2004-02-18 05:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(584730, 59874, 6999, '<td valign="top">Blatantly dpc-friendly blue background here :-) Well enough lit to show the skin texture, though that of the note suffers and has become very bland. Skin tones are oddly red (maybe that''s just you :-)).</td>', 'Blatantly dpc-friendly blue background here :-) Well enough lit to show the skin texture, though that of the note suffers and has become very bland. Skin tones are oddly red (maybe that''s just you :-)).', '2004-02-18 05:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(584731, 59882, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh my. Blurry to the point of abstraction. Has a quality of wetness - mucus-like, almost. The odd sensation of small circles emerging from the mess. It also has the appearance of an out-of-focus shot of something.</td>', 'Oh my. Blurry to the point of abstraction. Has a quality of wetness - mucus-like, almost. The odd sensation of small circles emerging from the mess. It also has the appearance of an out-of-focus shot of something.', '2004-02-18 05:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(584732, 60563, 6999, '<td valign="top">Hmm. Is ''doesn''t meet the challenge'' a new thing to say here? It''s a very beautiful shot, I''ll give you that, and well captured, has great serenity. I really think it''s too much of a stretch to enter it in a challenge whose theme is ''texture'', as what you''ve captured is an effect of light in air, and in your darkening of the sea you''ve preactically removed <i>all</i> textures from this image. I''m afraid you''ll be scored down, and not just by me.</td>', 'Hmm. Is ''doesn''t meet the challenge'' a new thing to say here? It''s a very beautiful shot, I''ll give you that, and well captured, has great serenity. I really think it''s too much of a stretch to enter it in a challenge whose theme is ''texture'', as what you''ve captured is an effect of light in air, and in your darkening of the sea you''ve preactically removed all textures from this image. I''m afraid you''ll be scored down, and not just by me.', '2004-02-18 05:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(584733, 60855, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good textures, almost a landscape feel. Perhaps more about the colour than the texture, though. I find the composition a bit bothersome: there isn''t a real subject here - the eye just wanders, but the inclusion of the sky makes it more than a rhythmically composed shot, drawing the eye toward the ''horizon'' all the time.</td>', 'Good textures, almost a landscape feel. Perhaps more about the colour than the texture, though. I find the composition a bit bothersome: there isn''t a real subject here - the eye just wanders, but the inclusion of the sky makes it more than a rhythmically composed shot, drawing the eye toward the ''horizon'' all the time.', '2004-02-18 05:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(584734, 60070, 6948, '<td valign="top">I love the eye, I wanted to picture an eye too, but I don''t have equipment for it, Good luck!</td>', 'I love the eye, I wanted to picture an eye too, but I don''t have equipment for it, Good luck!', '2004-02-18 05:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(584735, 60925, 16426, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, very good expression of Italian Texture</td>', 'Beautiful, very good expression of Italian Texture', '2004-02-18 05:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(584736, 59839, 6999, '<td valign="top">Seriously ugly! :-) Way too much flash, completely killing any ambient light. White stripe in background an odd touch. properly lit the conjunction of thumb and finger could be interesting - like this, well poor work, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Seriously ugly! :-) Way too much flash, completely killing any ambient light. White stripe in background an odd touch. properly lit the conjunction of thumb and finger could be interesting - like this, well poor work, I''m afraid.', '2004-02-18 05:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(584737, 60848, 6948, '<td valign="top">I apsolutely love it! Something different, good luck! <br/>perfect 10</td>', 'I apsolutely love it! Something different, good luck! perfect 10', '2004-02-18 05:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(584738, 61097, 15832, '<td valign="top">The fockus is bit off.</td>', 'The fockus is bit off.', '2004-02-18 05:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(584739, 60013, 6948, '<td valign="top">Perfect macro, good luck</td>', 'Perfect macro, good luck', '2004-02-18 05:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(584740, 60070, 6999, '<td valign="top">Bizarre tones, interesting reflection - though the most interesting thing for me is trying to work out what that word is, and then trying to understand its relevance. As far as a quality of reflectiveness is a quality of texture this is OK - but the other things goig on don''t make that the primary interst of this shot, and thus not what it''s about. Don''t understand the colour-cast, don''t see a point to it.</td>', 'Bizarre tones, interesting reflection - though the most interesting thing for me is trying to work out what that word is, and then trying to understand its relevance. As far as a quality of reflectiveness is a quality of texture this is OK - but the other things goig on don''t make that the primary interst of this shot, and thus not what it''s about. Don''t understand the colour-cast, don''t see a point to it.', '2004-02-18 05:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(584743, 60413, 6999, '<td valign="top">Never really found these liquid-metal tone photos very likeable. This seems more about refraction of light than of texture. Obviously a ''good'' photo, and those tones are pretty well brought out. negative space to right of frame is a pity - though if i brighten things up a lot I can see stuff there. I guess ther is some suggestion of the feel of water, after looking a while, so I won''t give you the ''doesn''t fit the challenge'' thing :-) 6</td>', 'Never really found these liquid-metal tone photos very likeable. This seems more about refraction of light than of texture. Obviously a ''good'' photo, and those tones are pretty well brought out. negative space to right of frame is a pity - though if i brighten things up a lot I can see stuff there. I guess ther is some suggestion of the feel of water, after looking a while, so I won''t give you the ''doesn''t fit the challenge'' thing :-) 6', '2004-02-18 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(584744, 59883, 6999, '<td valign="top">Real depth of detail lost in that loss of sharpness - camera resolution, cropping or processing I''ve no idea. Kind of intersting subject, though rather chaotically organised - a very busy shot and the background doesn''t help that at all. Close-cropping can be a great trick, but is only half-applied here.</td>', 'Real depth of detail lost in that loss of sharpness - camera resolution, cropping or processing I''ve no idea. Kind of intersting subject, though rather chaotically organised - a very busy shot and the background doesn''t help that at all. Close-cropping can be a great trick, but is only half-applied here.', '2004-02-18 06:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(584746, 60135, 6999, '<td valign="top">Greetings-card pretty, and well composed photograph. Doesn''t really communicate a great feeling of tactility to me though - I''m not sure snow is a great subject for texture - that conjunction of appearance and experience, the fact that it looks all fluffy and feel cold and wet ...</td>', 'Greetings-card pretty, and well composed photograph. Doesn''t really communicate a great feeling of tactility to me though - I''m not sure snow is a great subject for texture - that conjunction of appearance and experience, the fact that it looks all fluffy and feel cold and wet ...', '2004-02-18 06:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(584747, 59972, 15832, '<td valign="top">Like it.. also because u hit the theme realy well.   (8)</td>', 'Like it.. also because u hit the theme realy well.   (8)', '2004-02-18 06:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(584748, 60906, 15832, '<td valign="top">Textures indeed.</td>', 'Textures indeed.', '2004-02-18 06:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(584749, 61116, 6999, '<td valign="top">Liek the sparkle you''ve captured, almost over-exposing for those icicles. I find this weak compositionally though, and the point you''ve chosen for the incidence of the horizo (or whatever) and your subjects a bit weird. There is at least some sensation of texture in the nearer icicle.</td>', 'Liek the sparkle you''ve captured, almost over-exposing for those icicles. I find this weak compositionally though, and the point you''ve chosen for the incidence of the horizo (or whatever) and your subjects a bit weird. There is at least some sensation of texture in the nearer icicle.', '2004-02-18 06:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(584754, 60088, 15832, '<td valign="top">Feel like munchies ;)</td>', 'Feel like munchies ;)', '2004-02-18 06:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(584755, 61114, 15832, '<td valign="top">Shells are popular in this theme...</td>', 'Shells are popular in this theme...', '2004-02-18 06:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(584761, 60486, 15832, '<td valign="top">I have too say.. This is the weirdest duck head i ever seen!<br/>The combination is good. The background is screaming texture and the colors of the duck comes realy sharp at you.. (7)</td>', 'I have too say.. This is the weirdest duck head i ever seen!The combination is good. The background is screaming texture and the colors of the duck comes realy sharp at you.. (7)', '2004-02-18 06:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(584762, 59933, 6999, '<td valign="top">Odd positioning of subject: distribution of elements within frame is poor. Some texture, but can''t escape the fact that there''s probably a lot more there than you''ve shown.</td>', 'Odd positioning of subject: distribution of elements within frame is poor. Some texture, but can''t escape the fact that there''s probably a lot more there than you''ve shown.', '2004-02-18 06:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(584763, 59956, 6999, '<td valign="top">Bizarrely low contrast shot - almost appears to go negative at one point. Composition is weak, and what I''m seeing doesn''t say smooth as your title does.</td>', 'Bizarrely low contrast shot - almost appears to go negative at one point. Composition is weak, and what I''m seeing doesn''t say smooth as your title does.', '2004-02-18 06:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
