(584766, 60872, 8139, '<td valign="top">Great colors. And a subject, it''s rare in this challenge. <br/>Maybe i''d tryed to get the lines horizontal.<br/>9</td>', 'Great colors. And a subject, it''s rare in this challenge. Maybe i''d tryed to get the lines horizontal.9', '2004-02-18 06:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(584767, 61137, 15920, '<td valign="top">I think the left side is either slightly over sharpened or maybe slightly over exposed.  It doesn''t make me less hungry though, becuase this is a nice shot.</td>', 'I think the left side is either slightly over sharpened or maybe slightly over exposed.  It doesn''t make me less hungry though, becuase this is a nice shot.', '2004-02-18 06:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(584769, 60758, 15920, '<td valign="top">I would have used more depth of field.  The texture in the front is interesting, but runs out too soon.</td>', 'I would have used more depth of field.  The texture in the front is interesting, but runs out too soon.', '2004-02-18 06:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(584770, 60922, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst you have shown this surface quite well, there is a lot more to be got out of this kind of subject. The levl of reflection used is effective in making the point of your title, but I think perhaps over-done from a visual point of view - I mean simply, doesn''t look so good. Cropping and framing make it a very clauustrophobic image.</td>', 'Whilst you have shown this surface quite well, there is a lot more to be got out of this kind of subject. The levl of reflection used is effective in making the point of your title, but I think perhaps over-done from a visual point of view - I mean simply, doesn''t look so good. Cropping and framing make it a very clauustrophobic image.', '2004-02-18 06:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(584771, 61107, 15920, '<td valign="top">Deeper depth of field would have helped here.  This could be interesting everywhere sine the colors are good, and you arranged the feathers very well.</td>', 'Deeper depth of field would have helped here.  This could be interesting everywhere sine the colors are good, and you arranged the feathers very well.', '2004-02-18 06:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(584772, 60795, 15920, '<td valign="top">The highlights are slightly overexposed, but this is nice.</td>', 'The highlights are slightly overexposed, but this is nice.', '2004-02-18 06:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(584774, 60905, 15920, '<td valign="top">Good composition, good focus, interesting picture.</td>', 'Good composition, good focus, interesting picture.', '2004-02-18 06:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(584775, 60068, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well lit, and I suspect a genuinely ''found'' subject, but the leaves are distracting, and the stalk being almost exactly on the edge of the focal plane is confusing. Visually, the texture seems to be primarily visible on that stalk, and yet it''s barely in focus - makes the image confusing and rather odd.</td>', 'Well lit, and I suspect a genuinely ''found'' subject, but the leaves are distracting, and the stalk being almost exactly on the edge of the focal plane is confusing. Visually, the texture seems to be primarily visible on that stalk, and yet it''s barely in focus - makes the image confusing and rather odd.', '2004-02-18 06:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(584776, 60198, 15832, '<td valign="top">Very nice.. Maby if you could have made it just a bit darker between the balls so the shape would be  better on the photo u would have got 1 more point  from me.<br/>7</td>', 'Very nice.. Maby if you could have made it just a bit darker between the balls so the shape would be  better on the photo u would have got 1 more point  from me.7', '2004-02-18 06:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
