(584797, 60879, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract-ish shot. Great light, great feel. Not quite sure it really gives an impression of texture - it seems more graphical than that, more about lines and colours than surfaces, but I''m sure the impact of the shot will get past that in most voters minds. Still a 7.</td>', 'Wonderful abstract-ish shot. Great light, great feel. Not quite sure it really gives an impression of texture - it seems more graphical than that, more about lines and colours than surfaces, but I''m sure the impact of the shot will get past that in most voters minds. Still a 7.', '2004-02-18 06:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
