(584808, 60039, 6999, '<td valign="top">There is at least texture here - though let down by a weak and disorganised picture: the shape of that spill of chocolate, the cropping, the munber of elements to take the eye.</td>', 'There is at least texture here - though let down by a weak and disorganised picture: the shape of that spill of chocolate, the cropping, the munber of elements to take the eye.', '2004-02-18 06:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
