(584816, 60470, 17478, '<td valign="top">There is an attempt to provide a focal point of interest by using the snow, and the texture is good.  Overall though the picture fails to really grab my interest in terms of colour, and composition.  Its good but not great.</td>', 'There is an attempt to provide a focal point of interest by using the snow, and the texture is good.  Overall though the picture fails to really grab my interest in terms of colour, and composition.  Its good but not great.', '2004-02-18 07:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
