(584840, 61151, 17478, '<td valign="top">interesting light, well suited to monochrome.  good tonal range.  Not the most interesting picture I have seen but technically very good.  OVerall composition is well balanced.</td>', 'interesting light, well suited to monochrome.  good tonal range.  Not the most interesting picture I have seen but technically very good.  OVerall composition is well balanced.', '2004-02-18 07:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
