(585366, 61132, 14986, '<td valign="top">Simple idea, well shot I think.  Good texture and focus.  Good colors and lighting.</td>', 'Simple idea, well shot I think.  Good texture and focus.  Good colors and lighting.', '2004-02-18 11:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
