(585379, 60874, 14986, '<td valign="top">Lighting is really harsh.    Don''t see the dog hair?   Leather is a good idea for texture, but I don''t think it''s presented strongly here.</td>', 'Lighting is really harsh.    Don''t see the dog hair?   Leather is a good idea for texture, but I don''t think it''s presented strongly here.', '2004-02-18 11:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(585380, 61125, 14986, '<td valign="top">Composition is okay.  I don''t care for the orange tone and I would have liked the whole thing in sharp focus.</td>', 'Composition is okay.  I don''t care for the orange tone and I would have liked the whole thing in sharp focus.', '2004-02-18 11:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
