(585385, 59912, 14986, '<td valign="top">Would have been good for the dof challenge.  Texture is there, good photo technically, but no interest.</td>', 'Would have been good for the dof challenge.  Texture is there, good photo technically, but no interest.', '2004-02-18 11:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
