(585393, 61113, 12108, '<td valign="top">Looked at this photo for quite some time and can find nothing against it, lighting is good and there are some very interesting textures. (8)</td>', 'Looked at this photo for quite some time and can find nothing against it, lighting is good and there are some very interesting textures. (8)', '2004-02-18 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(585394, 61010, 14986, '<td valign="top">Good texture, but I wish it was presented a little more creatively.  I''m sure the simplicity is intentional, but it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Good texture, but I wish it was presented a little more creatively.  I''m sure the simplicity is intentional, but it doesn''t work for me.', '2004-02-18 11:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(585396, 60950, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks 3D. Don''t really care for the lack of focus...and the narrow field of focus.........yes I realize it was shot through glass. I applaud you for that but feel is lacking interest. Fish? Just seems to need something more. Sorry not slamming your shot, just my thoughts.</td>', 'Looks 3D. Don''t really care for the lack of focus...and the narrow field of focus.........yes I realize it was shot through glass. I applaud you for that but feel is lacking interest. Fish? Just seems to need something more. Sorry not slamming your shot, just my thoughts.', '2004-02-18 11:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(585397, 60880, 14986, '<td valign="top">Needs better DOF focus to make the texture stonger.</td>', 'Needs better DOF focus to make the texture stonger.', '2004-02-18 11:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(585398, 59895, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.   Good focus, lighting and composition.  Love the tones of the shot.  For this one, I think the border really finishes it off nicely.</td>', 'This is wonderful.   Good focus, lighting and composition.  Love the tones of the shot.  For this one, I think the border really finishes it off nicely.', '2004-02-18 11:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(585399, 60765, 14986, '<td valign="top">Good macro, but seems to have lost some details.  Seems a little dim.  The texture is there.</td>', 'Good macro, but seems to have lost some details.  Seems a little dim.  The texture is there.', '2004-02-18 11:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(585400, 60306, 14986, '<td valign="top">Would have liked this better against a darker background.  I like the choice for texture, however.</td>', 'Would have liked this better against a darker background.  I like the choice for texture, however.', '2004-02-18 11:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(585401, 60593, 12108, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the shadows in this photo (6)</td>', 'I like the colors and the shadows in this photo (6)', '2004-02-18 11:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(585402, 59766, 327, '<td valign="top">I love the leading lines. I would of liked a bit more saturation as the colors appear  flat. I realized this may be their true color. Also the back could of been cropped off completely.  Good focus and interesting lines.</td>', 'I love the leading lines. I would of liked a bit more saturation as the colors appear  flat. I realized this may be their true color. Also the back could of been cropped off completely.  Good focus and interesting lines.', '2004-02-18 11:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(585404, 60144, 11467, '<td valign="top">Is someone in love with their iPod??<br/>I think a bit more of the iPod being visible would improve the image.</td>', 'Is someone in love with their iPod??I think a bit more of the iPod being visible would improve the image.', '2004-02-18 11:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(585405, 59837, 12108, '<td valign="top">Great Idea, Just seems that is the photo was a little sharper it would bring out the texture in the toad little better. (7)</td>', 'Great Idea, Just seems that is the photo was a little sharper it would bring out the texture in the toad little better. (7)', '2004-02-18 11:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(585406, 61031, 14986, '<td valign="top">Different take on the "hands" texture.  It''s odd that the upper arm is black (black sleeve?) and the lower arm is bare.  Different kids?  It looks a little odd.</td>', 'Different take on the "hands" texture.  It''s odd that the upper arm is black (black sleeve?) and the lower arm is bare.  Different kids?  It looks a little odd.', '2004-02-18 11:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(585407, 60017, 17478, '<td valign="top">great idea, lacks a little detail and interest maybe.</td>', 'great idea, lacks a little detail and interest maybe.', '2004-02-18 11:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(585408, 60923, 327, '<td valign="top">Hummm.............I guess I see what you were shooting for but I don''t find it appealing. Sorry, good luck.</td>', 'Hummm.............I guess I see what you were shooting for but I don''t find it appealing. Sorry, good luck.', '2004-02-18 11:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(585410, 60036, 11467, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Can''t work out what that is on the Right??</td>', 'Interesting. Can''t work out what that is on the Right??', '2004-02-18 11:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(585411, 60978, 14986, '<td valign="top">I expected a lot of rope shots, but I gotta admit I like this one.  I think the lighting makes it strong.  Border is a bit overwhelming.</td>', 'I expected a lot of rope shots, but I gotta admit I like this one.  I think the lighting makes it strong.  Border is a bit overwhelming.', '2004-02-18 11:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(585412, 59711, 327, '<td valign="top">Not an unattractive shot and it does show texture. I do like the yellow/gold color but think the bottom lighting is too over exposed. [fried] Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not an unattractive shot and it does show texture. I do like the yellow/gold color but think the bottom lighting is too over exposed. [fried] Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 11:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(585413, 60758, 11467, '<td valign="top">The same image of a real flower would get more points.</td>', 'The same image of a real flower would get more points.', '2004-02-18 11:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(585414, 60512, 12108, '<td valign="top">wow what a colorful little creature. Very nice photo. (7)</td>', 'wow what a colorful little creature. Very nice photo. (7)', '2004-02-18 11:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(585415, 60990, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice example of texture. I think clearing the background or making it darker with levels adjustment would of been a good idea. Hang on to that super basket, nice one.</td>', 'Nice example of texture. I think clearing the background or making it darker with levels adjustment would of been a good idea. Hang on to that super basket, nice one.', '2004-02-18 11:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
