(585422, 60069, 14986, '<td valign="top">Details are very washed out in this, and the smallness of the shot doesn''t help.  Looks like it could be very cute.   Border is way too think IMO.</td>', 'Details are very washed out in this, and the smallness of the shot doesn''t help.  Looks like it could be very cute.   Border is way too think IMO.', '2004-02-18 11:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
