(585424, 60270, 14986, '<td valign="top">Expression looks a little impatient here  :)      I like it in black and white.  For textures, it''s okay.  Not strong but not too bad.</td>', 'Expression looks a little impatient here  :)      I like it in black and white.  For textures, it''s okay.  Not strong but not too bad.', '2004-02-18 11:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(585425, 60824, 16595, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. But the blue background jars a bit imho</td>', 'I like the idea. But the blue background jars a bit imho', '2004-02-18 11:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(585426, 60808, 327, '<td valign="top">Two suggestions. One the main subject is too centered ----and ----two the top of the rocks are cut off. The sand and rocks alone would of been a good example of texture.<br/>Not too many will find a dead fish very appealing. I wish you luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Two suggestions. One the main subject is too centered ----and ----two the top of the rocks are cut off. The sand and rocks alone would of been a good example of texture.Not too many will find a dead fish very appealing. I wish you luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(585427, 60021, 11467, '<td valign="top">I can feel it. Image displays texture nicels, but as a whole is a little un interesting</td>', 'I can feel it. Image displays texture nicels, but as a whole is a little un interesting', '2004-02-18 11:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(585428, 60593, 11467, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting &amp; sharpness.</td>', 'Lovely lighting & sharpness.', '2004-02-18 11:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(585429, 60499, 14986, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell what this is without the title.  The angle and lighting on this just don''t help the presentation of texture.   The ceiling light or whatever that is at the top showing through is distracting.</td>', 'Hard to tell what this is without the title.  The angle and lighting on this just don''t help the presentation of texture.   The ceiling light or whatever that is at the top showing through is distracting.', '2004-02-18 11:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(585431, 61129, 327, '<td valign="top">Simple idea and good title. I would only of liked the focus to be a bit more sharp and the light extended a bit. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple idea and good title. I would only of liked the focus to be a bit more sharp and the light extended a bit. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 11:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(585432, 61061, 11241, '<td valign="top">Very detailed and great color in this shot, the border color adds to the photo too...great shot!</td>', 'Very detailed and great color in this shot, the border color adds to the photo too...great shot!', '2004-02-18 11:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(585433, 59839, 14986, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...texture is there and that''s all.  LIghting is harsh, subject is lost on me and white in the background looks accidental.</td>', 'Hmmm...texture is there and that''s all.  LIghting is harsh, subject is lost on me and white in the background looks accidental.', '2004-02-18 11:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(585434, 60262, 327, '<td valign="top">Your color balance is wonderful along with the focus. I only would of like more of the swan''s face visible. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your color balance is wonderful along with the focus. I only would of like more of the swan''s face visible. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 11:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(585435, 61152, 10768, '<td valign="top">Great minds thing alike . . . I used the same subject and title for my entry.  Yours is a better photo though.  I like your composition, lighting and border.  Good luck in the challenge, this one should place high!</td>', 'Great minds thing alike . . . I used the same subject and title for my entry.  Yours is a better photo though.  I like your composition, lighting and border.  Good luck in the challenge, this one should place high!', '2004-02-18 11:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(585436, 60109, 14986, '<td valign="top">Texture is there and this is interesting wood.</td>', 'Texture is there and this is interesting wood.', '2004-02-18 11:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(585437, 60915, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty sunny day and the light is really bright. Polorized filter would help here.</td>', 'Pretty sunny day and the light is really bright. Polorized filter would help here.', '2004-02-18 11:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(585438, 60241, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot; only nit is that it looks a little "hot" by the nose</td>', 'Beautiful shot; only nit is that it looks a little "hot" by the nose', '2004-02-18 11:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(585439, 60771, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the movement of the blade.  Would have worked better for me if the whetstone was totally in focus.</td>', 'I like the movement of the blade.  Would have worked better for me if the whetstone was totally in focus.', '2004-02-18 11:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(585440, 59851, 17478, '<td valign="top">really good colours, maybe a little busy. would make a lovely screen background</td>', 'really good colours, maybe a little busy. would make a lovely screen background', '2004-02-18 11:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(585441, 60961, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice colors~</td>', 'Nice colors~', '2004-02-18 11:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(585442, 59956, 14986, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to photograph snow and ice.  Little variance in tone, composition is not interesting to me, not sure why.  I do see texture.</td>', 'It''s hard to photograph snow and ice.  Little variance in tone, composition is not interesting to me, not sure why.  I do see texture.', '2004-02-18 11:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(585443, 61108, 327, '<td valign="top">Just needs a bit more focus. I love the aged beauty of the old ball and the tones are good too.</td>', 'Just needs a bit more focus. I love the aged beauty of the old ball and the tones are good too.', '2004-02-18 11:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(585444, 60789, 17478, '<td valign="top">even tighter cropping of the margerine might help, background is a little distracting. great idea though.</td>', 'even tighter cropping of the margerine might help, background is a little distracting. great idea though.', '2004-02-18 11:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(585445, 60572, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been stronger cropped to isolate that water drop.  Okay for texture.</td>', 'I think this would have been stronger cropped to isolate that water drop.  Okay for texture.', '2004-02-18 11:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(585446, 59933, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup, would have been a bit more interesting to see a directional light source on here.</td>', 'Nice closeup, would have been a bit more interesting to see a directional light source on here.', '2004-02-18 11:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(585447, 60273, 14986, '<td valign="top">Good for texture.  Subject doesn''t hole my interst much though.</td>', 'Good for texture.  Subject doesn''t hole my interst much though.', '2004-02-18 11:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(585448, 60885, 327, '<td valign="top">Little oof and the lighting is harsh. Because this is a common entry it would have to be perfect to score high. I don''t think this is a bad try it just needed to stand out and be sharper. Your color is good.</td>', 'Little oof and the lighting is harsh. Because this is a common entry it would have to be perfect to score high. I don''t think this is a bad try it just needed to stand out and be sharper. Your color is good.', '2004-02-18 11:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(585449, 60226, 12108, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I really like the colors as well as the lighting (not to bright not to dim) (7)</td>', 'Good idea, I really like the colors as well as the lighting (not to bright not to dim) (7)', '2004-02-18 11:28:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(585451, 61027, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful!!  Just a tad hot on the right.</td>', 'Very beautiful!!  Just a tad hot on the right.', '2004-02-18 11:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(585452, 59779, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see texture, but I''m not sure what this is.</td>', 'I see texture, but I''m not sure what this is.', '2004-02-18 11:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(585453, 60580, 327, '<td valign="top">Pink Floyd.  I like these old bricks. Several are mishapped. Colorful entry. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Pink Floyd.  I like these old bricks. Several are mishapped. Colorful entry. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 11:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(585454, 60805, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of using clouds for texture.</td>', 'I like the idea of using clouds for texture.', '2004-02-18 11:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(585457, 60037, 14986, '<td valign="top">I might have liked this better in color...not sure.   Good texture</td>', 'I might have liked this better in color...not sure.   Good texture', '2004-02-18 11:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(585458, 60024, 327, '<td valign="top">The focus appears a bit soft and I think part of that is due to the bright light. Strong sunshine is tough to shoot with. Polarized filters help. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The focus appears a bit soft and I think part of that is due to the bright light. Strong sunshine is tough to shoot with. Polarized filters help. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 11:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(585459, 60885, 12108, '<td valign="top">You really captures the texture of the peel but the light on the right is a little over powering. (6)</td>', 'You really captures the texture of the peel but the light on the right is a little over powering. (6)', '2004-02-18 11:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(585460, 59836, 772, '<td valign="top">This shot has a nice sense of ''mystery'' to it.  The light at the end of the tunnel... excellent work :)</td>', 'This shot has a nice sense of ''mystery'' to it.  The light at the end of the tunnel... excellent work :)', '2004-02-18 11:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(585461, 60789, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good shot, this would have been more artistic with a black background.</td>', 'Good shot, this would have been more artistic with a black background.', '2004-02-18 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(585462, 61127, 12108, '<td valign="top">Excellent Photo, the dimples really come out in this photo. (8)</td>', 'Excellent Photo, the dimples really come out in this photo. (8)', '2004-02-18 11:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(585464, 60975, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good texture; you might consider cropping the bottom 1/2 inch to eliminate the lower left area which seems a little yellow, as well as having a bit too much of a tunnel perspective.</td>', 'Good texture; you might consider cropping the bottom 1/2 inch to eliminate the lower left area which seems a little yellow, as well as having a bit too much of a tunnel perspective.', '2004-02-18 11:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
