(585812, 61136, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good. Think I would have pushed the contrast a little to cope with the brightness of the direct light, just to bring out the light/shade a toucch more, but this is pretty well controlled as it is. Doesn''t quite do it for me though - with such a centred composition I think you need more to lead the eye in and out of the image - not necessarily directly, but concentric rings like this I think we need to see more of, to give greater context, to balance the hole/crater area more carefully. If that makes sense.</td>', 'Good. Think I would have pushed the contrast a little to cope with the brightness of the direct light, just to bring out the light/shade a toucch more, but this is pretty well controlled as it is. Doesn''t quite do it for me though - with such a centred composition I think you need more to lead the eye in and out of the image - not necessarily directly, but concentric rings like this I think we need to see more of, to give greater context, to balance the hole/crater area more carefully. If that makes sense.', '2004-02-18 13:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
