(585972, 60746, 14476, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this rendition of the Challenge.  You took something ''ordinary'' and made it very special.  Like the composition very much, but wish the lower left was in better focus, nevertheless, fine job.  7</td>', 'I really, really like this rendition of the Challenge.  You took something ''ordinary'' and made it very special.  Like the composition very much, but wish the lower left was in better focus, nevertheless, fine job.  7', '2004-02-18 14:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
