(586061, 60768, 4543, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  Nice composition!</td>', 'Lovely!  Nice composition!', '2004-02-18 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(586062, 60588, 14603, '<td valign="top">What a capture...great subject..texture by the barrowload.<br/>9</td>', 'What a capture...great subject..texture by the barrowload.9', '2004-02-18 15:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(586063, 61127, 327, '<td valign="top">Not too bad. Good texture. I think the light so muted is causing your orange color to appear a bit flat.</td>', 'Not too bad. Good texture. I think the light so muted is causing your orange color to appear a bit flat.', '2004-02-18 15:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(586064, 59883, 811, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little harsh.  To soften it up, maybe use a darker surrounding, and use a small flashlight to light it while using a long exposure (if your camera does that).</td>', 'The lighting is a little harsh.  To soften it up, maybe use a darker surrounding, and use a small flashlight to light it while using a long exposure (if your camera does that).', '2004-02-18 15:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(586065, 60995, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool idea for the challenge. Might of cropped the bottom off to eliminate the oof area and causing the eye to focus on the center.</td>', 'Cool idea for the challenge. Might of cropped the bottom off to eliminate the oof area and causing the eye to focus on the center.', '2004-02-18 15:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(586066, 60884, 327, '<td valign="top">I think all of this works but the paper towel...or drop you used. Nice presentation, maybe a bit heavy on the frame.</td>', 'I think all of this works but the paper towel...or drop you used. Nice presentation, maybe a bit heavy on the frame.', '2004-02-18 15:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(586067, 60039, 811, '<td valign="top">Okay, now I''m hungry, and I don''t even like strawberries.  Great color capture on this!  The blue background really gives it a hint of elegance.  Black might be nice too, but it may have made it too dark.</td>', 'Okay, now I''m hungry, and I don''t even like strawberries.  Great color capture on this!  The blue background really gives it a hint of elegance.  Black might be nice too, but it may have made it too dark.', '2004-02-18 15:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(586068, 61128, 14045, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen the whole thing.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen the whole thing.', '2004-02-18 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(586070, 60495, 327, '<td valign="top">I think your idea is excellent and the composition is also good. <br/>I don''t see focus on any area of your shot. The light is way too harsh  causes the colors to wash out. Try to diffuse your light a bit or add some saturation/contrast. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think your idea is excellent and the composition is also good. I don''t see focus on any area of your shot. The light is way too harsh  causes the colors to wash out. Try to diffuse your light a bit or add some saturation/contrast. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 15:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(586072, 60809, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty no doubt....love the rocks. Would suggest..remove partial ? on the left and either include or remove the top partial building. the colors, light are beautiful. Good luck.</td>', 'Pretty no doubt....love the rocks. Would suggest..remove partial ? on the left and either include or remove the top partial building. the colors, light are beautiful. Good luck.', '2004-02-18 15:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(586073, 60145, 14603, '<td valign="top">Has to be telephoto...no swan would let you that close.<br/>Great image..well done</td>', 'Has to be telephoto...no swan would let you that close.Great image..well done', '2004-02-18 15:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(586074, 60069, 327, '<td valign="top">Bit too much light.</td>', 'Bit too much light.', '2004-02-18 15:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(586075, 60011, 327, '<td valign="top">lol love the title..hee hee. Good photo, clean shot nice tones.</td>', 'lol love the title..hee hee. Good photo, clean shot nice tones.', '2004-02-18 15:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(586076, 60105, 14603, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly lit.....really shows the texture off to perfection...9</td>', 'Brilliantly lit.....really shows the texture off to perfection...9', '2004-02-18 15:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(586078, 60034, 327, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.....very. Needs a little saturation, levels adjustment.....but other then that small note......great going. I really like this. 9 from me.</td>', 'Very pretty.....very. Needs a little saturation, levels adjustment.....but other then that small note......great going. I really like this. 9 from me.', '2004-02-18 15:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(586079, 61125, 5534, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I don''t really care for the color of the feather and how the quill(?) is a bit out off focus near the middle of the photo. 6</td>', 'I like this shot, but I don''t really care for the color of the feather and how the quill(?) is a bit out off focus near the middle of the photo. 6', '2004-02-18 15:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(586080, 61057, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty macro...great light control and use. I think the the one on the far right could go, but that it! The rest is super. 8 from me.</td>', 'Pretty macro...great light control and use. I think the the one on the far right could go, but that it! The rest is super. 8 from me.', '2004-02-18 15:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(586081, 59996, 327, '<td valign="top">Abstract, very interesting eye you have.</td>', 'Abstract, very interesting eye you have.', '2004-02-18 15:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(586082, 60284, 16089, '<td valign="top">subtle colors, not much texture-4</td>', 'subtle colors, not much texture-4', '2004-02-18 15:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(586084, 60596, 6948, '<td valign="top">Maybe if the whole picture was a little sharper, but good luck anyway!</td>', 'Maybe if the whole picture was a little sharper, but good luck anyway!', '2004-02-18 15:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(586085, 60872, 14603, '<td valign="top">The blend of colours, textures and overall composition do give this image the feel of a painting.<br/>Good work</td>', 'The blend of colours, textures and overall composition do give this image the feel of a painting.Good work', '2004-02-18 15:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(586086, 60795, 327, '<td valign="top">It''s a very unique shot, a bit strange and wonderful all in one. I can''t help but like it. The shadows/light are very appealing. 9 from me.</td>', 'It''s a very unique shot, a bit strange and wonderful all in one. I can''t help but like it. The shadows/light are very appealing. 9 from me.', '2004-02-18 15:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(586087, 61088, 327, '<td valign="top">Great looking building, bet the campus is awesome. I love stone buildings. Nice job.</td>', 'Great looking building, bet the campus is awesome. I love stone buildings. Nice job.', '2004-02-18 15:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(586088, 60807, 6948, '<td valign="top">Maybe picture would be better if the lighting is better, anyway, good luck!</td>', 'Maybe picture would be better if the lighting is better, anyway, good luck!', '2004-02-18 15:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(586089, 61026, 327, '<td valign="top">Just needed a bit of focus in my opinion. I do like it, love the empty feel. 8 from me.</td>', 'Just needed a bit of focus in my opinion. I do like it, love the empty feel. 8 from me.', '2004-02-18 15:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(586090, 60262, 14603, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image....exceptionally well captured.</td>', 'Beautiful image....exceptionally well captured.', '2004-02-18 15:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(586091, 60978, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty....wee. Looks like Goldie Locks!! :)</td>', 'Pretty....wee. Looks like Goldie Locks!! :)', '2004-02-18 15:37:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(586093, 61090, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of colour and light.....8</td>', 'Good composition and use of colour and light.....8', '2004-02-18 15:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(586094, 60664, 16402, '<td valign="top">well done. nice composition, mix of textures and exposure.</td>', 'well done. nice composition, mix of textures and exposure.', '2004-02-18 15:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(586096, 60167, 811, '<td valign="top">The focus on the bug is just a bit off, which makes the eyes go to the stick which isn''t near as interesting, in my opinion.</td>', 'The focus on the bug is just a bit off, which makes the eyes go to the stick which isn''t near as interesting, in my opinion.', '2004-02-18 15:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(586098, 60418, 811, '<td valign="top">This is simply gorgeous.  I love the white against the blue and the texture of the feathers that are shown.  Nice work.</td>', 'This is simply gorgeous.  I love the white against the blue and the texture of the feathers that are shown.  Nice work.', '2004-02-18 15:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(586099, 60458, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed. Not sure I like the angle but I''m sure it was an effort to get cobwebs exposed against dark background.</td>', 'Nicely exposed. Not sure I like the angle but I''m sure it was an effort to get cobwebs exposed against dark background.', '2004-02-18 15:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(586100, 60809, 15768, '<td valign="top">this isn''t a texture, but a beautiful picture, too bad</td>', 'this isn''t a texture, but a beautiful picture, too bad', '2004-02-18 15:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(586101, 60338, 16438, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of light in this picture.  The way the object was layed out and the angle from which the picture was taken was well chosen.  I like it.</td>', 'I really like the use of light in this picture.  The way the object was layed out and the angle from which the picture was taken was well chosen.  I like it.', '2004-02-18 15:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(586102, 60932, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good composition and lighting</td>', 'Good composition and lighting', '2004-02-18 15:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(586103, 60742, 16402, '<td valign="top">Textures are there but to me just get lost or overwhelmed by all the unusual coloring.</td>', 'Textures are there but to me just get lost or overwhelmed by all the unusual coloring.', '2004-02-18 15:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(586104, 59956, 15768, '<td valign="top">increase the gamma for contrast.</td>', 'increase the gamma for contrast.', '2004-02-18 15:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(586107, 60852, 16402, '<td valign="top">Great take on subject. Excellent exposure. I''d have cropped from left a bit to eliminate shadow from other eye socket, though.</td>', 'Great take on subject. Excellent exposure. I''d have cropped from left a bit to eliminate shadow from other eye socket, though.', '2004-02-18 15:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(586108, 60167, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Doesn''t have the real presence of detail that the top shots have, and sense of texture is a touch diluted by that.</td>', 'Nicely done. Doesn''t have the real presence of detail that the top shots have, and sense of texture is a touch diluted by that.', '2004-02-18 15:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(586111, 61106, 15768, '<td valign="top">lacks sharpness</td>', 'lacks sharpness', '2004-02-18 15:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(586114, 60024, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very little sense of light and shade within the actual subject - it all seems lit the same, which almost by definition removes any great sensation of texture. The reflection of the sunlight also seems a bit odd. If you were to photograph this from an angle, so that the sun is not directly behind you, you might find that the unevenness of the surface is emphasised more by the light slanting across it. This way, the very small areas of shade that are created by that slanting light, and that are the things we see as ''texture'', are not visible.</td>', 'Very little sense of light and shade within the actual subject - it all seems lit the same, which almost by definition removes any great sensation of texture. The reflection of the sunlight also seems a bit odd. If you were to photograph this from an angle, so that the sun is not directly behind you, you might find that the unevenness of the surface is emphasised more by the light slanting across it. This way, the very small areas of shade that are created by that slanting light, and that are the things we see as ''texture'', are not visible.', '2004-02-18 15:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(586115, 60879, 14603, '<td valign="top">Superb clarity and very well composed and lit.....10</td>', 'Superb clarity and very well composed and lit.....10', '2004-02-18 15:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(586117, 60439, 15768, '<td valign="top">why the small crop...looks like a beautiful image</td>', 'why the small crop...looks like a beautiful image', '2004-02-18 15:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(586121, 61111, 15768, '<td valign="top">IMO, it should be redshifted</td>', 'IMO, it should be redshifted', '2004-02-18 15:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(586122, 60013, 6999, '<td valign="top">Don''t see texture here - no sensation of feel, of a tactile surface, of graduation of smoothness and roughness. Intriguing subject that this is -  and fine illustration of an iris (and the extreme colouring is very interesting) - I think it out of place in a challenge of this title.</td>', 'Don''t see texture here - no sensation of feel, of a tactile surface, of graduation of smoothness and roughness. Intriguing subject that this is -  and fine illustration of an iris (and the extreme colouring is very interesting) - I think it out of place in a challenge of this title.', '2004-02-18 15:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(586125, 60993, 15768, '<td valign="top">try title: Veiny Leaf.  less boring.</td>', 'try title: Veiny Leaf.  less boring.', '2004-02-18 15:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(586129, 60947, 15768, '<td valign="top">Awesome. I could feel his touch. What with the border though?</td>', 'Awesome. I could feel his touch. What with the border though?', '2004-02-18 15:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(586132, 60914, 15768, '<td valign="top">nice progressive gradient of shadows.</td>', 'nice progressive gradient of shadows.', '2004-02-18 15:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(586133, 60338, 6999, '<td valign="top">A traditional African place-mat? Are you quite sure? Thought that was more a part of the Indo-European tradition. <br/> <br/>Whatever. This is good photography: and good lighting (not that those aren''t pretty much the same thing anyhow). You really have caught the texture of this, with that fabulously soft light. It suffers slightly from being a fairly ordinary subject (despite the protestations of your title), and presented in a quite straightforward manner. Still - its sheer competence puts it far above the majority.</td>', 'A traditional African place-mat? Are you quite sure? Thought that was more a part of the Indo-European tradition.  Whatever. This is good photography: and good lighting (not that those aren''t pretty much the same thing anyhow). You really have caught the texture of this, with that fabulously soft light. It suffers slightly from being a fairly ordinary subject (despite the protestations of your title), and presented in a quite straightforward manner. Still - its sheer competence puts it far above the majority.', '2004-02-18 15:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(586134, 61066, 15768, '<td valign="top">I could smell and feel it!</td>', 'I could smell and feel it!', '2004-02-18 15:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(586138, 59766, 11570, '<td valign="top">Interesting Texture and DOF picture.  The suggestion of a road makes me think there needs to be a model car OOF in the distance.</td>', 'Interesting Texture and DOF picture.  The suggestion of a road makes me think there needs to be a model car OOF in the distance.', '2004-02-18 15:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(586139, 60706, 15768, '<td valign="top">good image, nasty border</td>', 'good image, nasty border', '2004-02-18 15:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(586142, 60088, 11570, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and idea but IMHO to give more texture the DOF needs to have more in focus back to front.</td>', 'Lovely colours and idea but IMHO to give more texture the DOF needs to have more in focus back to front.', '2004-02-18 15:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(586148, 60192, 11570, '<td valign="top">Almost surreal.  Has the look of coral ~ where is that clown fish!<br/> <br/>Nicely thought out and done</td>', 'Almost surreal.  Has the look of coral ~ where is that clown fish! Nicely thought out and done', '2004-02-18 16:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(586150, 61106, 14476, '<td valign="top">A beautiful rendition of the challenge.  I''m glad you included several shapes and textures of leather in the composition   It definately adds to the overall interest.</td>', 'A beautiful rendition of the challenge.  I''m glad you included several shapes and textures of leather in the composition   It definately adds to the overall interest.', '2004-02-18 16:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(586153, 61128, 16438, '<td valign="top">This is a great pictue with alot of texture just wonder why you didn''t show the entire lizard.</td>', 'This is a great pictue with alot of texture just wonder why you didn''t show the entire lizard.', '2004-02-18 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(586155, 60804, 14476, '<td valign="top">You found a good example of texture that fits the Challenge well.  Composition is also very nice and the red background color adds a good deal to this entry.</td>', 'You found a good example of texture that fits the Challenge well.  Composition is also very nice and the red background color adds a good deal to this entry.', '2004-02-18 16:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(586156, 59883, 15768, '<td valign="top">lower gamma, increase sharpness. Should be very nice.</td>', 'lower gamma, increase sharpness. Should be very nice.', '2004-02-18 16:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(586160, 60727, 15768, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, why the small crop?</td>', 'nice lighting, why the small crop?', '2004-02-18 16:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(586161, 61102, 16402, '<td valign="top">Exposure is good on this but there''s no point of focus.</td>', 'Exposure is good on this but there''s no point of focus.', '2004-02-18 16:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(586165, 61071, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, very well done!  I had to look at it the 2nd time to see the bed of rice below the luscious strawberry that was so beautifully photographed.  The rice is a perfect foil for the strong red/green colors.  Lovely.  10</td>', 'Oh, very well done!  I had to look at it the 2nd time to see the bed of rice below the luscious strawberry that was so beautifully photographed.  The rice is a perfect foil for the strong red/green colors.  Lovely.  10', '2004-02-18 16:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(586168, 59956, 16402, '<td valign="top">Seems underexposed to me.</td>', 'Seems underexposed to me.', '2004-02-18 16:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(586171, 60915, 16402, '<td valign="top">Works as a pattern but not a texture.</td>', 'Works as a pattern but not a texture.', '2004-02-18 16:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(586172, 60093, 14476, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what the "pure" stands for, but the composition is lovely and certainly meets the challenge.  (If it was mine, I''d probably hide the printing and just go with form and texture.  But it isn''t mine, it''s yours and nicely done.</td>', 'I don''t know what the "pure" stands for, but the composition is lovely and certainly meets the challenge.  (If it was mine, I''d probably hide the printing and just go with form and texture.  But it isn''t mine, it''s yours and nicely done.', '2004-02-18 16:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(586173, 60299, 16402, '<td valign="top">I think a softer light would have helped this photo.</td>', 'I think a softer light would have helped this photo.', '2004-02-18 16:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(586174, 60068, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautifully photographed and certainly meets the challenge.</td>', 'Beautifully photographed and certainly meets the challenge.', '2004-02-18 16:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(586176, 60770, 14476, '<td valign="top">I very much lilke the way you interspersed color with the strong texture of the whisk.  Good seeing and a good take on the challenge.</td>', 'I very much lilke the way you interspersed color with the strong texture of the whisk.  Good seeing and a good take on the challenge.', '2004-02-18 16:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(586178, 60894, 17485, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice reflections in the headlight, yet photographer can''t be made out.  Difficult to do when shooting something that casts so many reflections.</td>', 'Great shot, nice reflections in the headlight, yet photographer can''t be made out.  Difficult to do when shooting something that casts so many reflections.', '2004-02-18 16:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(586179, 60105, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well, you certainly got a grip with this exciting textural  photograph.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Well, you certainly got a grip with this exciting textural  photograph.  Nicely done.', '2004-02-18 16:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(586180, 59817, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.</td>', 'Very nice colors.', '2004-02-18 16:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(586181, 60988, 17485, '<td valign="top">Nice soft motion blur.</td>', 'Nice soft motion blur.', '2004-02-18 16:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(586183, 59766, 6948, '<td valign="top">I love the DOF!Nice job, good luck!</td>', 'I love the DOF!Nice job, good luck!', '2004-02-18 16:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(586185, 60145, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely .10</td>', 'Lovely .10', '2004-02-18 16:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(586186, 61031, 14476, '<td valign="top">Touching and lovely take on the challenge.  I like the slightly soft focus of this composition.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Touching and lovely take on the challenge.  I like the slightly soft focus of this composition.  Nicely done.', '2004-02-18 16:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(586188, 59848, 17485, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, a little dark on the left.</td>', 'Nice shot, a little dark on the left.', '2004-02-18 16:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(586190, 59861, 6130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2004-02-18 16:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(586191, 59817, 17485, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF on this one, would like to see more of the hydrant though.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the DOF on this one, would like to see more of the hydrant though.  Nicely done.', '2004-02-18 16:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(586193, 60982, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice take on interpreting the challenge.  Quite good texture in the orange and the knife helps add interest to the composition.  If it was mine, I''d probably crop a tad off the left to get that orange out of the center, but it''s not mine, it''s yours; nicely done!</td>', 'Nice take on interpreting the challenge.  Quite good texture in the orange and the knife helps add interest to the composition.  If it was mine, I''d probably crop a tad off the left to get that orange out of the center, but it''s not mine, it''s yours; nicely done!', '2004-02-18 16:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(586194, 60691, 17485, '<td valign="top">Maybe a better submission for Conflict?</td>', 'Maybe a better submission for Conflict?', '2004-02-18 16:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(586195, 60098, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it very much.</td>', 'I like it very much.', '2004-02-18 16:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(586196, 60108, 17485, '<td valign="top">Good DOF but a little too much backlighting for my tastes.  No pun intended.</td>', 'Good DOF but a little too much backlighting for my tastes.  No pun intended.', '2004-02-18 16:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(586198, 61125, 14476, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge with good textures showing.   Focus could have been just a touch sharper but all in all, it''s a pleasant composition.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge with good textures showing.   Focus could have been just a touch sharper but all in all, it''s a pleasant composition.', '2004-02-18 16:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(586199, 60762, 17485, '<td valign="top">Don''t drop the soap!</td>', 'Don''t drop the soap!', '2004-02-18 16:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(586201, 59910, 4767, '<td valign="top">OH yeah!  Nice outside the box thinking!</td>', 'OH yeah!  Nice outside the box thinking!', '2004-02-18 16:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(586203, 60734, 4767, '<td valign="top">great lighting here!  LOVE those leading lines!</td>', 'great lighting here!  LOVE those leading lines!', '2004-02-18 16:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(586204, 60934, 14476, '<td valign="top">A good case for looking around to see the obvious and make it exciting.  This exciting composition works well for the texture challenge.  Bet you wish you held it out for the "Mundane" event.  Works for both!</td>', 'A good case for looking around to see the obvious and make it exciting.  This exciting composition works well for the texture challenge.  Bet you wish you held it out for the "Mundane" event.  Works for both!', '2004-02-18 16:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(586205, 61074, 15768, '<td valign="top">lower gamma. should be very nice then</td>', 'lower gamma. should be very nice then', '2004-02-18 16:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(586208, 60809, 4767, '<td valign="top">Very idyllic shot. Doesn''t scream "TEXTURE" to me, but I love the image!</td>', 'Very idyllic shot. Doesn''t scream "TEXTURE" to me, but I love the image!', '2004-02-18 16:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
