(586391, 61024, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting technique, but I think that if it didn''t have the dark triangle on the right, it would look less like an accident.  Right now, it seems to me like you saw something interesting, and had to shoot quickly before it was gone, resulting in a haphazard composition.  Cropping it so that the triangle wasn''t showing would make for a stronger composition, but hten you would lose the other squiggly lines on the right.</td>', 'Interesting technique, but I think that if it didn''t have the dark triangle on the right, it would look less like an accident.  Right now, it seems to me like you saw something interesting, and had to shoot quickly before it was gone, resulting in a haphazard composition.  Cropping it so that the triangle wasn''t showing would make for a stronger composition, but hten you would lose the other squiggly lines on the right.', '2004-02-18 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
