(586404, 61010, 327, '<td valign="top">I like your shot it''s technically very good. However...it looks lonely, should be tilted up or your above. The shadow is a bother. I think the real and only flaw is the angle. 8 from me.</td>', 'I like your shot it''s technically very good. However...it looks lonely, should be tilted up or your above. The shadow is a bother. I think the real and only flaw is the angle. 8 from me.', '2004-02-18 18:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(586407, 60226, 811, '<td valign="top">I can feel it now!!  I like the colors, and you have it exposed it pretty well (a couple of small hot spots).</td>', 'I can feel it now!!  I like the colors, and you have it exposed it pretty well (a couple of small hot spots).', '2004-02-18 18:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(586410, 60767, 327, '<td valign="top">Yeah! That''s one big foot. You had real sighting!! lol Just a bit bright on the lighting and looks somewhat over sharpened.</td>', 'Yeah! That''s one big foot. You had real sighting!! lol Just a bit bright on the lighting and looks somewhat over sharpened.', '2004-02-18 18:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(586411, 60160, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, though a wider DOF perhaps .  Colors and composition are nice.  Title is unnecessarily verbose in my opinion.  Good potential.</td>', 'Nice idea, though a wider DOF perhaps .  Colors and composition are nice.  Title is unnecessarily verbose in my opinion.  Good potential.', '2004-02-18 18:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(586412, 60434, 14773, '<td valign="top">great pic and title</td>', 'great pic and title', '2004-02-18 18:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(586414, 61152, 14773, '<td valign="top">awesome texture, reminds me of biology slides of amoeba</td>', 'awesome texture, reminds me of biology slides of amoeba', '2004-02-18 18:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(586415, 60746, 14008, '<td valign="top">nice mix of textures, good composition</td>', 'nice mix of textures, good composition', '2004-02-18 18:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(586418, 60129, 14008, '<td valign="top">excellent idea, positioning of posts doesn''t ''feel'' balanced.</td>', 'excellent idea, positioning of posts doesn''t ''feel'' balanced.', '2004-02-18 18:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(586421, 60789, 14773, '<td valign="top">love the margarine, not crazy about the rest of the picture..6....I''m totally drawn to the margarine for some reason!</td>', 'love the margarine, not crazy about the rest of the picture..6....I''m totally drawn to the margarine for some reason!', '2004-02-18 18:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(586423, 60705, 811, '<td valign="top">I am going to assume it is my monitor (though I can see the bars at the bottom), but it is a touch too dark I think.  while this lends to a dramatic effect, it leaves the viewer lacking if they are looking for texture.</td>', 'I am going to assume it is my monitor (though I can see the bars at the bottom), but it is a touch too dark I think.  while this lends to a dramatic effect, it leaves the viewer lacking if they are looking for texture.', '2004-02-18 18:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(586424, 60914, 14773, '<td valign="top">beautiful..that''s all I wanted to say.  Shows great texture.</td>', 'beautiful..that''s all I wanted to say.  Shows great texture.', '2004-02-18 18:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(586426, 60656, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I love the colors in this.  Very nicely done.', '2004-02-18 18:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(586427, 59858, 16402, '<td valign="top">Now that''s texture. Excellent exposure, good composition. Very nice.</td>', 'Now that''s texture. Excellent exposure, good composition. Very nice.', '2004-02-18 18:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(586430, 59903, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot of one cool shell. Conch shell? Good light control but could be a bit brighter. Nice job. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely shot of one cool shell. Conch shell? Good light control but could be a bit brighter. Nice job. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 18:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(586433, 60418, 327, '<td valign="top">I have held a swan and they are very soft but not as soft as a goose. :) This one is really pretty. Lovely against the blue of the water.</td>', 'I have held a swan and they are very soft but not as soft as a goose. :) This one is really pretty. Lovely against the blue of the water.', '2004-02-18 18:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(586435, 61128, 327, '<td valign="top">Darling title, and cool shot. Yikes</td>', 'Darling title, and cool shot. Yikes', '2004-02-18 18:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(586437, 60766, 14008, '<td valign="top">very nice; I might have preferred bigger DOF, I guess hard with macro shot?</td>', 'very nice; I might have preferred bigger DOF, I guess hard with macro shot?', '2004-02-18 18:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(586438, 60980, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the light, the frame and the tones. I just think this needs more focus. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Love the light, the frame and the tones. I just think this needs more focus. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 18:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(586440, 60808, 14008, '<td valign="top">texture not rreally the subject here is it?</td>', 'texture not rreally the subject here is it?', '2004-02-18 18:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(586441, 59916, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks like a little camera shake. Awesome shot....love to see more from you of this area.</td>', 'Looks like a little camera shake. Awesome shot....love to see more from you of this area.', '2004-02-18 18:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(586443, 60789, 14008, '<td valign="top">nice but background detracts</td>', 'nice but background detracts', '2004-02-18 18:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(586446, 61086, 327, '<td valign="top">You know I think this works for the most part, -----the soft focus doesn''t along with the crop. The top is trimmed too tight. Sorry.</td>', 'You know I think this works for the most part, -----the soft focus doesn''t along with the crop. The top is trimmed too tight. Sorry.', '2004-02-18 18:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(586449, 60923, 14008, '<td valign="top">what challenge was this for?</td>', 'what challenge was this for?', '2004-02-18 18:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(586451, 60809, 811, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if it is a lack of focus, neatimage, or just muted colors, but it just seems to lack punch.  Maybe some contrast added to it, or something.  Also, though I know it is not tilted (the river leads nicely up and into the picture) the road or whatever that is at the top gives the impression that it is tilted.</td>', 'I can''t tell if it is a lack of focus, neatimage, or just muted colors, but it just seems to lack punch.  Maybe some contrast added to it, or something.  Also, though I know it is not tilted (the river leads nicely up and into the picture) the road or whatever that is at the top gives the impression that it is tilted.', '2004-02-18 18:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(586452, 61099, 327, '<td valign="top">Good job on the lighting. Nice shot.</td>', 'Good job on the lighting. Nice shot.', '2004-02-18 18:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(586455, 60756, 11248, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. A closer view would be IMHO more impressive.</td>', 'Nice idea. A closer view would be IMHO more impressive.', '2004-02-18 18:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(586456, 60820, 811, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  I think a differently colored background would have given this shot a little more interest, though your current background does serve to provide a nice contrast with the pine cone.</td>', 'Neat shot.  I think a differently colored background would have given this shot a little more interest, though your current background does serve to provide a nice contrast with the pine cone.', '2004-02-18 18:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(586459, 59817, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful deep colors, vivid. I would like to have seen a bit more of it. Awesome for the challenge and great focus. 8 from me.</td>', 'Wonderful deep colors, vivid. I would like to have seen a bit more of it. Awesome for the challenge and great focus. 8 from me.', '2004-02-18 18:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(586460, 61087, 811, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallow depth of field.  The small crop is good to create "anxiety" in the viewer, if that is what you want, but I felt that it needed something else to load.</td>', 'Good use of shallow depth of field.  The small crop is good to create "anxiety" in the viewer, if that is what you want, but I felt that it needed something else to load.', '2004-02-18 18:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(586462, 59984, 14008, '<td valign="top">very strong image - but I''m seeing it as pattern not texture.</td>', 'very strong image - but I''m seeing it as pattern not texture.', '2004-02-18 18:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(586465, 60905, 811, '<td valign="top">Great exposure.  You have captured the details without blowing anything out or getting a grainy look to it.  the leaf really adds interest.</td>', 'Great exposure.  You have captured the details without blowing anything out or getting a grainy look to it.  the leaf really adds interest.', '2004-02-18 18:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(586466, 60924, 11248, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but IMHO I think that a low side lighting would fit better to create more relief.</td>', 'Nice idea but IMHO I think that a low side lighting would fit better to create more relief.', '2004-02-18 18:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(586468, 60747, 327, '<td valign="top">I would of liked this much more with more dof. In this case. I do love the b&amp;w, the subject and the tones. It''s a good entry.</td>', 'I would of liked this much more with more dof. In this case. I do love the b&w, the subject and the tones. It''s a good entry.', '2004-02-18 18:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(586469, 61097, 11248, '<td valign="top">Interresting idea but lack of sharpness does''nt help.</td>', 'Interresting idea but lack of sharpness does''nt help.', '2004-02-18 18:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(586472, 61138, 327, '<td valign="top">wonderful piece to have and great colors. I do think this is tilted to the right and that hurts the over all shot.</td>', 'wonderful piece to have and great colors. I do think this is tilted to the right and that hurts the over all shot.', '2004-02-18 18:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(586474, 59851, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and neat colors. Good entry, just needs some focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, and neat colors. Good entry, just needs some focus.', '2004-02-18 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(586477, 60814, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this. Very abstract shooting!</td>', 'I like this. Very abstract shooting!', '2004-02-18 18:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(586478, 60405, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the textures shown here, but the uniformity of color doesn''t do much for me.  Also, the camera is focusing on the backdrop/ground, and not the object, which is okay sometimes, but not particularly effective here, I think.</td>', 'I like the textures shown here, but the uniformity of color doesn''t do much for me.  Also, the camera is focusing on the backdrop/ground, and not the object, which is okay sometimes, but not particularly effective here, I think.', '2004-02-18 18:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(586480, 60963, 11248, '<td valign="top">Well seen. I would prefer  Lihting being a  bit less harsh at the right.</td>', 'Well seen. I would prefer  Lihting being a  bit less harsh at the right.', '2004-02-18 18:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(586482, 60848, 811, '<td valign="top">That is a creative approach to textures.  Never thought of it htat way before.</td>', 'That is a creative approach to textures.  Never thought of it htat way before.', '2004-02-18 18:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(586483, 60815, 327, '<td valign="top">Not too bad. Just a bit too bright in the light. Sun is difficult to shoot in. Try a polarizing filter and keep the sun to your back if you can.</td>', 'Not too bad. Just a bit too bright in the light. Sun is difficult to shoot in. Try a polarizing filter and keep the sun to your back if you can.', '2004-02-18 18:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(586484, 61096, 14008, '<td valign="top">very challenging shot, well done</td>', 'very challenging shot, well done', '2004-02-18 18:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(586485, 60976, 811, '<td valign="top">This seems a little over exposed to me, and as a result, I think you are losing some good color.</td>', 'This seems a little over exposed to me, and as a result, I think you are losing some good color.', '2004-02-18 18:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(586487, 60983, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of movement. You can almost feel the spray. I''m not crazy for the crop it makes the top feel cramped.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of movement. You can almost feel the spray. I''m not crazy for the crop it makes the top feel cramped.', '2004-02-18 18:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(586488, 60736, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern set up by the wood, but I think the lighting is a bit harsh.</td>', 'I like the pattern set up by the wood, but I think the lighting is a bit harsh.', '2004-02-18 18:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(586489, 60630, 327, '<td valign="top">Angles? I don''t get the tilte, but think your shot is very nice. I love building shots anytime.</td>', 'Angles? I don''t get the tilte, but think your shot is very nice. I love building shots anytime.', '2004-02-18 18:24:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(586490, 60815, 11248, '<td valign="top">With a better sharpness it would be a very nice picture.</td>', 'With a better sharpness it would be a very nice picture.', '2004-02-18 18:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(586491, 60832, 327, '<td valign="top">Little cutie pie. Just need to brighten his face a bit and a little more focus on cutie.</td>', 'Little cutie pie. Just need to brighten his face a bit and a little more focus on cutie.', '2004-02-18 18:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(586492, 59993, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the different textures you have here adn how they all "slope" down from top left to bottom right, except the bottom left hand  corner, which sets up a nice contrast.    I think something in the upper right hand corner besides space would have made it feel more balance.</td>', 'I like the different textures you have here adn how they all "slope" down from top left to bottom right, except the bottom left hand  corner, which sets up a nice contrast.    I think something in the upper right hand corner besides space would have made it feel more balance.', '2004-02-18 18:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(586493, 61153, 811, '<td valign="top">Looks like a waterfall!  Neat idea.</td>', 'Looks like a waterfall!  Neat idea.', '2004-02-18 18:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(586494, 60787, 327, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting and crop are hurting your shot. The focus is okay but either more light or closer to the toast. The table on the lower right is a distraction. This is a good entry and I hope you do well.</td>', 'I think the lighting and crop are hurting your shot. The focus is okay but either more light or closer to the toast. The table on the lower right is a distraction. This is a good entry and I hope you do well.', '2004-02-18 18:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(586496, 61118, 327, '<td valign="top">Strange crop. I''m not sure why you cropped the eye so tight and left so much on the left side? Not a bad entry, hope you do well.</td>', 'Strange crop. I''m not sure why you cropped the eye so tight and left so much on the left side? Not a bad entry, hope you do well.', '2004-02-18 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(586498, 60083, 327, '<td valign="top">I think the shell in front [and yes I realize it''s showing the texture] could of been placed better. I think we see too much of it. With these two reversed we''d of still seen plenty of texture. Composition. You did well on lighting, tones and focus. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think the shell in front [and yes I realize it''s showing the texture] could of been placed better. I think we see too much of it. With these two reversed we''d of still seen plenty of texture. Composition. You did well on lighting, tones and focus. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 18:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(586499, 60999, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice one. Not crazy for the light/shadow, but a good shot all in all. Good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice one. Not crazy for the light/shadow, but a good shot all in all. Good luck to you in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 18:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(586500, 60995, 811, '<td valign="top">Though bw helps to bring the texture out in this shot, I think a colored background would have been more interesting.</td>', 'Though bw helps to bring the texture out in this shot, I think a colored background would have been more interesting.', '2004-02-18 18:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(586502, 60512, 12973, '<td valign="top">Totally wierd! I like the macro if this moth, if that''s what it is. It fits the category perfect! the soft almost velvet like texture together with the hard brittle leaf. A real nice opportunity caught!</td>', 'Totally wierd! I like the macro if this moth, if that''s what it is. It fits the category perfect! the soft almost velvet like texture together with the hard brittle leaf. A real nice opportunity caught!', '2004-02-18 18:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(586503, 59817, 15381, '<td valign="top">cheers mate</td>', 'cheers mate', '2004-02-18 18:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(586504, 60921, 6179, '<td valign="top">IMO black and white was the only way to go on this photo. You captured texture beautifully. Very crisp photo. (no pun intended)</td>', 'IMO black and white was the only way to go on this photo. You captured texture beautifully. Very crisp photo. (no pun intended)', '2004-02-18 18:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(586505, 60879, 12973, '<td valign="top">Great shot....</td>', 'Great shot....', '2004-02-18 18:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(586506, 60845, 6179, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and sharpness. I really like how the shadow adds depth and additional texture.</td>', 'Nice detail and sharpness. I really like how the shadow adds depth and additional texture.', '2004-02-18 18:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(586507, 60947, 12973, '<td valign="top">Too cool.... can''t make out if its a real hand or not! Looks like a statue!</td>', 'Too cool.... can''t make out if its a real hand or not! Looks like a statue!', '2004-02-18 18:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(586509, 60145, 12973, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail! Great shot!</td>', 'Incredible detail! Great shot!', '2004-02-18 18:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(586510, 60932, 6179, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and point of view. This really grabbed my attention.</td>', 'Interesting subject and point of view. This really grabbed my attention.', '2004-02-18 18:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(586512, 59935, 6179, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and texture.</td>', 'Wonderful color and texture.', '2004-02-18 18:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(586514, 59972, 11832, '<td valign="top">Its a nice silhouette, but I dont see the "texture"</td>', 'Its a nice silhouette, but I dont see the "texture"', '2004-02-18 18:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(586517, 60482, 11248, '<td valign="top">Could be a fantastic texture photo with more sharpness.</td>', 'Could be a fantastic texture photo with more sharpness.', '2004-02-18 18:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(586518, 60109, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty chunk of wood with the interesting knots. I think your light was too strong, but your could help this with a burn tool or re-shooting with diffuse light. Neat shot.</td>', 'Pretty chunk of wood with the interesting knots. I think your light was too strong, but your could help this with a burn tool or re-shooting with diffuse light. Neat shot.', '2004-02-18 18:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(586519, 60470, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the title and the shot. Just would of tighted up on the crop. Your light is super as is the colors. Good job, hope you do well in the challenge.</td>', 'Love the title and the shot. Just would of tighted up on the crop. Your light is super as is the colors. Good job, hope you do well in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 18:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(586520, 60366, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice, nice light. The focus is good also. I just would suggest the left crop is tighter then the right. Good entry, hope you do well, it''s very nicely done.</td>', 'Nice, nice light. The focus is good also. I just would suggest the left crop is tighter then the right. Good entry, hope you do well, it''s very nicely done.', '2004-02-18 18:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(586522, 61140, 12973, '<td valign="top">Cool Macro!</td>', 'Cool Macro!', '2004-02-18 18:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(586525, 61076, 327, '<td valign="top">I love the different colors, textures and shapes. Neat idea. <br/>You have a very narrow [dof] area of focus here, maybe /deeper/wider would of been a bit better for this shot.</td>', 'I love the different colors, textures and shapes. Neat idea. You have a very narrow [dof] area of focus here, maybe /deeper/wider would of been a bit better for this shot.', '2004-02-18 18:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(586526, 60894, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool headlight and colors.</td>', 'Cool headlight and colors.', '2004-02-18 19:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(586530, 61099, 14614, '<td valign="top">oh I like this -- abstract impact and, upon study, I like the bit of black space on either side (perhaps even more would be good?)</td>', 'oh I like this -- abstract impact and, upon study, I like the bit of black space on either side (perhaps even more would be good?)', '2004-02-18 19:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(586531, 61108, 16479, '<td valign="top">good focus....nice shot on this one...</td>', 'good focus....nice shot on this one...', '2004-02-18 19:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(586535, 60546, 14614, '<td valign="top">Like the square framing, colors are calming and fit the image, solid image - to make it better -- lessen the crop on top/bottom (cut off part of the design) and play around with lighting to add more drama to the carved image.</td>', 'Like the square framing, colors are calming and fit the image, solid image - to make it better -- lessen the crop on top/bottom (cut off part of the design) and play around with lighting to add more drama to the carved image.', '2004-02-18 19:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(586537, 60929, 15330, '<td valign="top">You should have put the middle of the web on one of the thirds of the photo (rule of thirds). You should have tried to be a little more creative with your perspective, and composition, but the photo has potential.</td>', 'You should have put the middle of the web on one of the thirds of the photo (rule of thirds). You should have tried to be a little more creative with your perspective, and composition, but the photo has potential.', '2004-02-18 19:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(586538, 60514, 16479, '<td valign="top">nice concept.....</td>', 'nice concept.....', '2004-02-18 19:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(586539, 60753, 327, '<td valign="top">What a special looking dragon fly. I have never seen one so colorful. Nice job.</td>', 'What a special looking dragon fly. I have never seen one so colorful. Nice job.', '2004-02-18 19:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(586540, 61126, 14614, '<td valign="top">such great texture - solid image.  To make it better - some pixel drop out (I know you can''t spot edit), a flater background (right now it''s so bright it detracts fromthe image)</td>', 'such great texture - solid image.  To make it better - some pixel drop out (I know you can''t spot edit), a flater background (right now it''s so bright it detracts fromthe image)', '2004-02-18 19:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(586541, 60192, 15330, '<td valign="top">That dark hole on the right draws my attention too much, I don''t think you ment that to be your subject. When taking photos like this its better for something to stand out, and not just have a random pattern.</td>', 'That dark hole on the right draws my attention too much, I don''t think you ment that to be your subject. When taking photos like this its better for something to stand out, and not just have a random pattern.', '2004-02-18 19:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(586542, 60787, 14614, '<td valign="top">I can taste the dry!  Would like to see a bigger dof and the lighting brought up a notch to see more of the texture inthe bread.</td>', 'I can taste the dry!  Would like to see a bigger dof and the lighting brought up a notch to see more of the texture inthe bread.', '2004-02-18 19:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(586543, 60560, 16479, '<td valign="top">good focus and composition...</td>', 'good focus and composition...', '2004-02-18 19:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(586544, 60850, 327, '<td valign="top">The title is stating exactly what this is. I don''t want to say the word boring but it''s not very interesting. Yes, it''s texture..but the trick is to also invoke interest for the viewer. Trick is the key here. :) The upper part of the broom would of been very good all by it''s self...closer. It has contrast and texture, and would of been abstract to the viewer. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The title is stating exactly what this is. I don''t want to say the word boring but it''s not very interesting. Yes, it''s texture..but the trick is to also invoke interest for the viewer. Trick is the key here. :) The upper part of the broom would of been very good all by it''s self...closer. It has contrast and texture, and would of been abstract to the viewer. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-18 19:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(586546, 60470, 10799, '<td valign="top">I think I would like to see this cropped a bit to get rid of the upper left hand corner.  I really like the texture of the rest of this photo.</td>', 'I think I would like to see this cropped a bit to get rid of the upper left hand corner.  I really like the texture of the rest of this photo.', '2004-02-18 19:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(586547, 60721, 327, '<td valign="top">I love these stone buildings. I really think they are a treasure and so much more interesting then some of the all glass. Good one.</td>', 'I love these stone buildings. I really think they are a treasure and so much more interesting then some of the all glass. Good one.', '2004-02-18 19:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
