(587149, 60876, 7252, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it is over sharpening or too much contrast that has destroyed this photo. With a more limited amount of which ever it was, use of a diffuser to reduce the harsh glare on the leaf tip, and a levels adjustment to make the background black this would be very nice.</td>', 'I''m not sure if it is over sharpening or too much contrast that has destroyed this photo. With a more limited amount of which ever it was, use of a diffuser to reduce the harsh glare on the leaf tip, and a levels adjustment to make the background black this would be very nice.', '2004-02-19 00:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(587150, 60210, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m a guitar player, so I''m a sucker for this one.  Actually, I think it provides some nice textures.   The bright sunlight on the hand is a little distracting, but probably couldn''t be helped.</td>', 'I''m a guitar player, so I''m a sucker for this one.  Actually, I think it provides some nice textures.   The bright sunlight on the hand is a little distracting, but probably couldn''t be helped.', '2004-02-19 00:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
