(587213, 61127, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully composed and elegantly lighted.  I every much l ike the composition and it surely shows off texture brilliantly.  Nicely done.  8</td>', 'This is beautifully composed and elegantly lighted.  I every much l ike the composition and it surely shows off texture brilliantly.  Nicely done.  8', '2004-02-19 00:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(587214, 60883, 14986, '<td valign="top">I thought someone might do a bread shot.  This one is good but composition details I think could have made it better.  I would have darkened the tone just a bit, got rid of the plastic Parkay bucket and opted for something prettier....a small dish of jam or something perhaps, and shown more of the crust of the bread.</td>', 'I thought someone might do a bread shot.  This one is good but composition details I think could have made it better.  I would have darkened the tone just a bit, got rid of the plastic Parkay bucket and opted for something prettier....a small dish of jam or something perhaps, and shown more of the crust of the bread.', '2004-02-19 00:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(587215, 61034, 7252, '<td valign="top">I think a more natural looking coloration would be more pleasing, at least to my eyes.</td>', 'I think a more natural looking coloration would be more pleasing, at least to my eyes.', '2004-02-19 00:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
