(587253, 60057, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love the texture in this fence post.  It may be that you  sharpened it a bit much (or maybe not);  it''s a good example of the play of lights and darks against a good complementary background.</td>', 'Oh, I love the texture in this fence post.  It may be that you  sharpened it a bit much (or maybe not);  it''s a good example of the play of lights and darks against a good complementary background.', '2004-02-19 00:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587256, 60845, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple, to the point.  I like the lighting.  I like that the right side isn''t completely back.</td>', 'Nice, simple, to the point.  I like the lighting.  I like that the right side isn''t completely back.', '2004-02-19 00:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(587257, 60379, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately beautiful texture.  And a lot of it too.  I love how it fills the frame, but I''m thinking the lighting could be better.  See how it''s bright in the upper right and dark in the lower left?  I''d like to see it more uniform all around.  Otherwise very nice for the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately beautiful texture.  And a lot of it too.  I love how it fills the frame, but I''m thinking the lighting could be better.  See how it''s bright in the upper right and dark in the lower left?  I''d like to see it more uniform all around.  Otherwise very nice for the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 00:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587258, 60011, 14986, '<td valign="top">Like the shot and the title.  They go together weill.  I like the black and white.</td>', 'Like the shot and the title.  They go together weill.  I like the black and white.', '2004-02-19 00:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(587259, 60009, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(587260, 59894, 14476, '<td valign="top">I don''t know anything abuot chanel endings, but I do know a nice powder puff when I see one and this captures the Challenge beautifully.   It is tough to do, but I wish focus has been sharp all the way through.  Still,  a good image.</td>', 'I don''t know anything abuot chanel endings, but I do know a nice powder puff when I see one and this captures the Challenge beautifully.   It is tough to do, but I wish focus has been sharp all the way through.  Still,  a good image.', '2004-02-19 00:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(587261, 60691, 14986, '<td valign="top">That had to hurt.  I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'That had to hurt.  I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(587263, 61111, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(587264, 60833, 3080, '<td valign="top">The DOF is nice, and focus on the subject is nice.  Background is not distracting at all, and lighting is good.  I guess my only glitch is that it''s not really something that I could sit and stare at for hours.  Lacking on the excitement factor...but technically a very well done photo. ~Heather~</td>', 'The DOF is nice, and focus on the subject is nice.  Background is not distracting at all, and lighting is good.  I guess my only glitch is that it''s not really something that I could sit and stare at for hours.  Lacking on the excitement factor...but technically a very well done photo. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 00:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(587265, 60167, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(587266, 60091, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(587267, 61136, 14476, '<td valign="top">I like to see creatures in wood, and (for me) there''s a fine owl in this image.  Enough of that, you have a good image here that captures the category well.   Maybe it''s a bit light, maybe not...  Anyhow, good seeing!</td>', 'I like to see creatures in wood, and (for me) there''s a fine owl in this image.  Enough of that, you have a good image here that captures the category well.   Maybe it''s a bit light, maybe not...  Anyhow, good seeing!', '2004-02-19 00:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(587268, 60147, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of seeing al lthe stuff at the bottom as a distraction.  the shell is beautiful and tefinately a texture, but the stuff at the bottom is all out of focus, and being out of focus, doesn''t seem like it''s a main subject at all, and therefor doesn''t really seem to fit in with the photo at all.  Also, I think I''d like to see different crops of this.  The bright spot in the center of the shell is actually appealing to me in this case.  normally I don''t like bright spots, but I think it works here well. ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m kind of seeing al lthe stuff at the bottom as a distraction.  the shell is beautiful and tefinately a texture, but the stuff at the bottom is all out of focus, and being out of focus, doesn''t seem like it''s a main subject at all, and therefor doesn''t really seem to fit in with the photo at all.  Also, I think I''d like to see different crops of this.  The bright spot in the center of the shell is actually appealing to me in this case.  normally I don''t like bright spots, but I think it works here well. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 00:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(587269, 61057, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely shot.  The focus and exposure really bring out the soft texture.</td>', 'This is very nicely shot.  The focus and exposure really bring out the soft texture.', '2004-02-19 00:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(587270, 61147, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(587271, 60388, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The leaf really makes it, but the focus, exposure and composition bring it to life.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The leaf really makes it, but the focus, exposure and composition bring it to life.', '2004-02-19 00:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(587272, 60933, 14476, '<td valign="top">I love the texture of the weaving which is nicely photographed.  Ttoo many times during this competition, I have written, "wouldn''t it be nice to have another shape or color to provide contrast?"  Well you have done that and done it well.  Very, very nice.</td>', 'I love the texture of the weaving which is nicely photographed.  Ttoo many times during this competition, I have written, "wouldn''t it be nice to have another shape or color to provide contrast?"  Well you have done that and done it well.  Very, very nice.', '2004-02-19 00:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(587273, 61013, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the sillouette here.  Very nice and not something I would think of for a texture shot, but it works here.</td>', 'I like the use of the sillouette here.  Very nice and not something I would think of for a texture shot, but it works here.', '2004-02-19 00:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(587274, 60596, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like a straw hat.  I like the textures, however, the out of focus edge really cuts throught the photo for me.  because it''s the only thing that is of soft focus, it really draws my attention and I find myself looking at it more than at the texture of the hat.  I like the colors and the lighting seems good.  I also like where you have placed it within the frame.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Looks like a straw hat.  I like the textures, however, the out of focus edge really cuts throught the photo for me.  because it''s the only thing that is of soft focus, it really draws my attention and I find myself looking at it more than at the texture of the hat.  I like the colors and the lighting seems good.  I also like where you have placed it within the frame.  ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 00:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(587275, 60876, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(587276, 60563, 15330, '<td valign="top">The border is too thick, I would rather see more of the image than the border. I like the photo, the streaming rays of light are great. Having a ship way out in the distance would help the photo, it would show the scale of everything.</td>', 'The border is too thick, I would rather see more of the image than the border. I like the photo, the streaming rays of light are great. Having a ship way out in the distance would help the photo, it would show the scale of everything.', '2004-02-19 00:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587277, 60896, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(587278, 60393, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(587279, 60997, 3080, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this with the bottom soft focus section cropped off.  It doesn''t really add much to the photo, and it''s such a large part of the photo that it is kind of distracting from the main subject in my opinion.  I think your focus on the dark part of the tree is good, and it definately shows some interesting textures. ~Heather~</td>', 'I would like to see this with the bottom soft focus section cropped off.  It doesn''t really add much to the photo, and it''s such a large part of the photo that it is kind of distracting from the main subject in my opinion.  I think your focus on the dark part of the tree is good, and it definately shows some interesting textures. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 00:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(587280, 61151, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I think I would have liked it better in color, but not sure.  I even like the leg of whatever that is at the top right, but not sure others would agree.</td>', 'I like this.  I think I would have liked it better in color, but not sure.  I even like the leg of whatever that is at the top right, but not sure others would agree.', '2004-02-19 00:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
