(587290, 59837, 674, '<td valign="top">Shows the texture of the toad/frog beautifully</td>', 'Shows the texture of the toad/frog beautifully', '2004-02-19 00:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587291, 60088, 10943, '<td valign="top">Nice texture -- looks edible! ;-)</td>', 'Nice texture -- looks edible! ;-)', '2004-02-19 00:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(587292, 60866, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(587293, 60840, 14926, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2004-02-19 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(587294, 60226, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the color, and your focus and clarity are really good.  definately some texture going on in the shot.  I am not sure though if I like the shadows that are going throughout the koosh.  kind of makes it look dark, and if there were more lighting that maybe the color could be brought out more.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I like the color, and your focus and clarity are really good.  definately some texture going on in the shot.  I am not sure though if I like the shadows that are going throughout the koosh.  kind of makes it look dark, and if there were more lighting that maybe the color could be brought out more.  ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 00:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(587296, 59874, 14476, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a good job of texture on the hand.  While if it were mine, I''d probably hold back on the saturation button a bit, it isn''t mine, it''s yours and you''ve done a good job depicting your take on the subject.</td>', 'You''ve done a good job of texture on the hand.  While if it were mine, I''d probably hold back on the saturation button a bit, it isn''t mine, it''s yours and you''ve done a good job depicting your take on the subject.', '2004-02-19 00:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(587297, 60160, 14986, '<td valign="top">Really love this idea.  Would have like a little less crop and more DOF to have focus on the eyes as well as the knit.  Title too long, but voting not based on it.</td>', 'Really love this idea.  Would have like a little less crop and more DOF to have focus on the eyes as well as the knit.  Title too long, but voting not based on it.', '2004-02-19 00:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(587298, 60727, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(587299, 60767, 14986, '<td valign="top">Great texture, but not much interest for me in this shot.   What kind of foot is it?  A bearskin rug?</td>', 'Great texture, but not much interest for me in this shot.   What kind of foot is it?  A bearskin rug?', '2004-02-19 00:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(587300, 60372, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(587302, 60529, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587303, 60015, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think this is a little too abstract for my own personal taste.  Looks like fuzzy carpet, or a rock.  Not really sure.  There is texture, but can''t really tell if it''s hard, or soft, or what.  looks bumpy.  can''t really tell if it''s in focus or not, since i''m not really sure what I''m looking at.  I know some people will just love it, but for me, it''s just not my thing. ~Heather~</td>', 'I think this is a little too abstract for my own personal taste.  Looks like fuzzy carpet, or a rock.  Not really sure.  There is texture, but can''t really tell if it''s hard, or soft, or what.  looks bumpy.  can''t really tell if it''s in focus or not, since i''m not really sure what I''m looking at.  I know some people will just love it, but for me, it''s just not my thing. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 00:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587305, 59883, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(587306, 60905, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture and beautifully seen.  The needed contrast is provided with the green leaf, and the pattern of the roots keep the viewer in the picture.  I might go for just a bit more color.  Nevertheless, the pattern is strong.  Good work.</td>', 'Lovely texture and beautifully seen.  The needed contrast is provided with the green leaf, and the pattern of the roots keep the viewer in the picture.  I might go for just a bit more color.  Nevertheless, the pattern is strong.  Good work.', '2004-02-19 00:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(587307, 61066, 14986, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-02-19 00:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(587308, 60512, 14986, '<td valign="top">What the heck is that thing?  Is it real? Colorful little guy.  Nice macro.</td>', 'What the heck is that thing?  Is it real? Colorful little guy.  Nice macro.', '2004-02-19 00:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(587309, 60855, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.  I do like the colors alot.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.  I do like the colors alot.', '2004-02-19 00:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(587310, 60488, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject  just doesn''t hold my interest.  I think it''s very well photographed, however.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject  just doesn''t hold my interest.  I think it''s very well photographed, however.', '2004-02-19 00:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(587311, 60203, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(587312, 60158, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely landscape.  But, you know, the Challenge story opf texture is (Iin my opinion) in the foreground.  A judicious crop would enhance this very nice image.</td>', 'This is a lovely landscape.  But, you know, the Challenge story opf texture is (Iin my opinion) in the foreground.  A judicious crop would enhance this very nice image.', '2004-02-19 00:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(587313, 59961, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(587316, 60656, 3080, '<td valign="top">Light and a 3dimensional surface.  This is the first photo yet that has really screamed that to me.  A lot of photos are showing texture, and I give them that, but this one shows it by the challenge description.  Very nice shot.  Love the depth and the colors.  quite hard to look at, but I think that''s what makes me love it even more.  really great for the challenge, and nicely done.  One of my favorites so far. ~Heather~</td>', 'Light and a 3dimensional surface.  This is the first photo yet that has really screamed that to me.  A lot of photos are showing texture, and I give them that, but this one shows it by the challenge description.  Very nice shot.  Love the depth and the colors.  quite hard to look at, but I think that''s what makes me love it even more.  really great for the challenge, and nicely done.  One of my favorites so far. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 00:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(587317, 60147, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is okay.  I wish the lighting was a little more even.  I like the texture.</td>', 'This is okay.  I wish the lighting was a little more even.  I like the texture.', '2004-02-19 00:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587318, 61097, 674, '<td valign="top">good idea but not sharp enough and a bit overexposed</td>', 'good idea but not sharp enough and a bit overexposed', '2004-02-19 00:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(587319, 61143, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(587321, 60887, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587322, 60595, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(587323, 60879, 14986, '<td valign="top">Are these feathers?  Like the colors ant teh sharpness of this.</td>', 'Are these feathers?  Like the colors ant teh sharpness of this.', '2004-02-19 00:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(587324, 60789, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 00:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(587325, 59972, 3080, '<td valign="top">There are the textures in the ropes.  They make lots of nice patterns.  I wish this were cropped up a bit.  maybe to not show te benches.  that way our eyes are automatically drawn up to the bridge and the ropes.  The benches really aren''t adding anything for me here.  I love the lighting.  really created itself here, and you have placed it nicely.  ~Heather~</td>', 'There are the textures in the ropes.  They make lots of nice patterns.  I wish this were cropped up a bit.  maybe to not show te benches.  that way our eyes are automatically drawn up to the bridge and the ropes.  The benches really aren''t adding anything for me here.  I love the lighting.  really created itself here, and you have placed it nicely.  ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 00:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(587326, 61141, 14476, '<td valign="top">You spend a lot of time getting to know this beauty and came up with a fine rendition for the challenge.  Colors and composition are good.  Depth of field ( in my opinion for what it''s worth) could have been just a bit stronger in the lower section of the image.  Neverthe less, it is a strong image.</td>', 'You spend a lot of time getting to know this beauty and came up with a fine rendition for the challenge.  Colors and composition are good.  Depth of field ( in my opinion for what it''s worth) could have been just a bit stronger in the lower section of the image.  Neverthe less, it is a strong image.', '2004-02-19 00:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(587327, 60322, 674, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better as a macro shot of a portion of the cactus</td>', 'I think this would have worked better as a macro shot of a portion of the cactus', '2004-02-19 00:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(587328, 61010, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately some texture here.  I don''t like the shadow though.  You could try to place a light source on each side of the cookie and see if that lessens that shadow a bit.  Focus and clarity look ok.  I wonder too if you could try some kind of an interesting angle, or different placement within the frame.  Kind of dead center.  Not off enough to really scream dramatic angle.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately some texture here.  I don''t like the shadow though.  You could try to place a light source on each side of the cookie and see if that lessens that shadow a bit.  Focus and clarity look ok.  I wonder too if you could try some kind of an interesting angle, or different placement within the frame.  Kind of dead center.  Not off enough to really scream dramatic angle.  ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 00:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(587332, 61086, 3080, '<td valign="top">really grainy.  I like the soft focus, it works well here, but I''m not really clicking with this shot.  there is something that is not holding my interest.  maybe if it were just the front flower, but I''m thinking that the rear flower is taking away something from the shot.  black and white works well with the soft focus. ~Heather~</td>', 'really grainy.  I like the soft focus, it works well here, but I''m not really clicking with this shot.  there is something that is not holding my interest.  maybe if it were just the front flower, but I''m thinking that the rear flower is taking away something from the shot.  black and white works well with the soft focus. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 01:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(587334, 59882, 3080, '<td valign="top">well...it''s texture, but to be perfectly honest, I am not very fond of it.  I''m not really finding a spot that is in focus.  that bothers me.  maybe if the lighting were different, and there were not so many shadows or dark spots.  I don''t know.  something just doesn''t work here.  The color is nice.  I like the reds.  I also wish the top were cropped off.  the black stripe is adding nothing, and creating a distractin from the ''wrapping''.  ~Heather~</td>', 'well...it''s texture, but to be perfectly honest, I am not very fond of it.  I''m not really finding a spot that is in focus.  that bothers me.  maybe if the lighting were different, and there were not so many shadows or dark spots.  I don''t know.  something just doesn''t work here.  The color is nice.  I like the reds.  I also wish the top were cropped off.  the black stripe is adding nothing, and creating a distractin from the ''wrapping''.  ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 01:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(587337, 60404, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great textures.  I like how the lighting/shadows increase the effect of the textures.  Focus and clarity are really good, and I like where you have placed this within the frame.  The dark space in the upper right is a slight distraction because it is way darker than the rest of the shot, it draws attention to itself.  otherwise really nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'Great textures.  I like how the lighting/shadows increase the effect of the textures.  Focus and clarity are really good, and I like where you have placed this within the frame.  The dark space in the upper right is a slight distraction because it is way darker than the rest of the shot, it draws attention to itself.  otherwise really nice. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 01:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(587339, 60978, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice texture.  I like how the light reflects off the rope in some places.  That makes it interesting to me.  Had it all be uniform and all the same color, I don''t think this would hold as much interest for me.  looks like waves.  I like the color and your focus and clarity are really nice as well.  great shot for the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'Nice texture.  I like how the light reflects off the rope in some places.  That makes it interesting to me.  Had it all be uniform and all the same color, I don''t think this would hold as much interest for me.  looks like waves.  I like the color and your focus and clarity are really nice as well.  great shot for the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 01:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(587340, 60798, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures in the stone and in the artwork it surrounds.  Nicely photographed and presented. This piece of artwork fits the texture challenge, but could use (in my opinion, of course) something original from the photographer to set it off.</td>', 'Beautiful textures in the stone and in the artwork it surrounds.  Nicely photographed and presented. This piece of artwork fits the texture challenge, but could use (in my opinion, of course) something original from the photographer to set it off.', '2004-02-19 01:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(587342, 61138, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like how the white spots kind of stand out of the photo.  The bottom section of the photo with the strings looks a little soft focus, but it might just be the way the threads look.  something things are hard to make look right.  The black background works here.  Definately texture.  I''m not really sure about the 3D part of the challenge.  I don''t really understand that much, but this isn''t really 3D, but still an alright photo. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like how the white spots kind of stand out of the photo.  The bottom section of the photo with the strings looks a little soft focus, but it might just be the way the threads look.  something things are hard to make look right.  The black background works here.  Definately texture.  I''m not really sure about the 3D part of the challenge.  I don''t really understand that much, but this isn''t really 3D, but still an alright photo. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 01:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(587343, 61138, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good take on this weaving which certainly fits the category.,  It could possibly use just a touch more contrast (sharpening) but the orange/black combination is lovely.  Maybe just a slightly tighter crop on the right side.  Lovely to look at.</td>', 'Good take on this weaving which certainly fits the category.,  It could possibly use just a touch more contrast (sharpening) but the orange/black combination is lovely.  Maybe just a slightly tighter crop on the right side.  Lovely to look at.', '2004-02-19 01:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(587345, 61139, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think the red tint here bothers me.  Doesn''t seem natural and my mind keeps wanting to change the color of this shot.  Also the background is a little off.  it''s mostly black, but then near the left side middle, it has color.  I''d like to see that more uniform.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I think the red tint here bothers me.  Doesn''t seem natural and my mind keeps wanting to change the color of this shot.  Also the background is a little off.  it''s mostly black, but then near the left side middle, it has color.  I''d like to see that more uniform.  ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 01:11:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(587346, 60845, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is well photographed and nicely lighted.  I wonder what it would look like againsst a colorful background.  The beige/brown seems to cry out for a bright color behind it!  Nevertheless, it''s a good take on the Challenge.</td>', 'This is well photographed and nicely lighted.  I wonder what it would look like againsst a colorful background.  The beige/brown seems to cry out for a bright color behind it!  Nevertheless, it''s a good take on the Challenge.', '2004-02-19 01:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(587347, 60009, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, if you took this during the popping process, you are a brave photographer!  If it were mine, I''d probably crop a bit tighter on that popped piece, but it isn''t mine, it''s yours.   Good seeing and a good take on the Challenge.</td>', 'Oh, if you took this during the popping process, you are a brave photographer!  If it were mine, I''d probably crop a bit tighter on that popped piece, but it isn''t mine, it''s yours.   Good seeing and a good take on the Challenge.', '2004-02-19 01:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(587348, 61134, 14476, '<td valign="top">Your design of the flax seeds meets the challenge beautifully and it is well photographed as well.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Your design of the flax seeds meets the challenge beautifully and it is well photographed as well.  Nicely done.', '2004-02-19 01:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(587349, 61096, 3080, '<td valign="top">the large area near the front of the photo is soft focus.  I do think that soft focus works and DOF is important to a lot of photos, but I think that here, the area that is soft is so large, that it draws a lot of attention, and away from the ring.  I would like to see the ring in a brighter part of the photo.  see how it is sitting in the shadows?  kind of dark.  The upper right looks more inviting, and the ring is just hiding down there in the darkness.  It should be the brightest part of the photo in my opinion. ~Heather~</td>', 'the large area near the front of the photo is soft focus.  I do think that soft focus works and DOF is important to a lot of photos, but I think that here, the area that is soft is so large, that it draws a lot of attention, and away from the ring.  I would like to see the ring in a brighter part of the photo.  see how it is sitting in the shadows?  kind of dark.  The upper right looks more inviting, and the ring is just hiding down there in the darkness.  It should be the brightest part of the photo in my opinion. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 01:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(587352, 60588, 3080, '<td valign="top">this has got to be the ugliest animal in the history of ugliness.  wow.  what texture though.  looks a lot like intestines or something.  I will never eat turkey again.  ugh.  my only glitch with the photo is the large black blob near the turky''s head in the background.  wish that weren''t there, but otherwise a very nice shot for the challenge.  ew again. ~Heather~</td>', 'this has got to be the ugliest animal in the history of ugliness.  wow.  what texture though.  looks a lot like intestines or something.  I will never eat turkey again.  ugh.  my only glitch with the photo is the large black blob near the turky''s head in the background.  wish that weren''t there, but otherwise a very nice shot for the challenge.  ew again. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 01:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587356, 61121, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting POV</td>', 'Interesting POV', '2004-02-19 01:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(587357, 60537, 3080, '<td valign="top">this isn''t what I had pictured for this challenge, but there is texture.  I''m not fond of the blaring white sky, and wonder how this would look black and white.  a lot of times, when the color is removed, our eyes concentrate more on texture and shapes.  would be something to try anyway. ~Heather~</td>', 'this isn''t what I had pictured for this challenge, but there is texture.  I''m not fond of the blaring white sky, and wonder how this would look black and white.  a lot of times, when the color is removed, our eyes concentrate more on texture and shapes.  would be something to try anyway. ~Heather~', '2004-02-19 01:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(587358, 61001, 15305, '<td valign="top">I almost can taste it.....   :-)  -  Nice macro shot, interesting POV</td>', 'I almost can taste it.....   :-)  -  Nice macro shot, interesting POV', '2004-02-19 01:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(587359, 60248, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great contrast in textures. Nice composition.</td>', 'Great contrast in textures. Nice composition.', '2004-02-19 01:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(587360, 60792, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting POV and contrast of structures vs background. I don''t "feel" the texture of the structure.</td>', 'Interesting POV and contrast of structures vs background. I don''t "feel" the texture of the structure.', '2004-02-19 01:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(587361, 59997, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture. This looks like digital art rather than photography</td>', 'Interesting texture. This looks like digital art rather than photography', '2004-02-19 01:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(587363, 60758, 15305, '<td valign="top">The macro idea is good, but the DOF of the shot doesn''t let me "feel" the texture.</td>', 'The macro idea is good, but the DOF of the shot doesn''t let me "feel" the texture.', '2004-02-19 01:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(587364, 60982, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, interesting contrast between cold metal and soft tender and juicy natural texture.  Nice effect created by light reflections on background.</td>', 'Nice shot, interesting contrast between cold metal and soft tender and juicy natural texture.  Nice effect created by light reflections on background.', '2004-02-19 01:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587366, 60924, 16479, '<td valign="top">nice composition....good cropping...</td>', 'nice composition....good cropping...', '2004-02-19 01:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(587368, 61103, 15305, '<td valign="top">Very interesting texture, nice shot.</td>', 'Very interesting texture, nice shot.', '2004-02-19 01:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(587369, 60144, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but too dark to make out the texture.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but too dark to make out the texture.', '2004-02-19 01:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(587370, 60862, 15305, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, nice contrast in texture created by the rust. Great macro lens!!!</td>', 'Very interesting shot, nice contrast in texture created by the rust. Great macro lens!!!', '2004-02-19 01:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587396, 60795, 16930, '<td valign="top">So awesome, the angle and the lights, all perfect 10.  It looks petrified and sparkly at the same time.  The picture is beautiful truly, done by a real artist for sure <br/></td>', 'So awesome, the angle and the lights, all perfect 10.  It looks petrified and sparkly at the same time.  The picture is beautiful truly, done by a real artist for sure ', '2004-02-19 02:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(587409, 60099, 11467, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. A little dark for my likeing. <br/>Composition is good, perhaps a little chopped off on the left i.e. too much black</td>', 'Interesting idea. A little dark for my likeing. Composition is good, perhaps a little chopped off on the left i.e. too much black', '2004-02-19 02:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(587411, 60814, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure. Perhaps if the belt was more vertical it whoud help the image.</td>', 'Nice exposure. Perhaps if the belt was more vertical it whoud help the image.', '2004-02-19 03:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(587412, 59916, 11467, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures. <br/>I like this picture. Perhaps the brown areas middle right &amp; far left distract a little. (Ansel Adams would paint them green) In PS you can clone them out, then I can see this picture hanging on the wall with a nice black frame.</td>', 'Beautiful textures. I like this picture. Perhaps the brown areas middle right & far left distract a little. (Ansel Adams would paint them green) In PS you can clone them out, then I can see this picture hanging on the wall with a nice black frame.', '2004-02-19 03:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(587415, 60265, 11467, '<td valign="top">Contrast is perhaps a little extreme. Difficult for a camera. No real subject in the picture.</td>', 'Contrast is perhaps a little extreme. Difficult for a camera. No real subject in the picture.', '2004-02-19 03:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(587416, 60262, 11467, '<td valign="top">Great exposure balance and DOF.</td>', 'Great exposure balance and DOF.', '2004-02-19 03:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(587417, 60872, 11467, '<td valign="top">Having the crate line up with the top of the frame would improve the image. = if the camera position was more to the right &amp; facing the container directly</td>', 'Having the crate line up with the top of the frame would improve the image. = if the camera position was more to the right & facing the container directly', '2004-02-19 03:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(587419, 61071, 11467, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. If advanced editing was allowed you could clone out the red rice, and the red on the stem.</td>', 'Very nice image. If advanced editing was allowed you could clone out the red rice, and the red on the stem.', '2004-02-19 03:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
