(587450, 60291, 15260, '<td valign="top">i think i''d have preferred this image fully in focus...</td>', 'i think i''d have preferred this image fully in focus...', '2004-02-19 04:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(587451, 61066, 15260, '<td valign="top">nice composition. and beautiful colours</td>', 'nice composition. and beautiful colours', '2004-02-19 04:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(587452, 60835, 14526, '<td valign="top">definitely texture over shape</td>', 'definitely texture over shape', '2004-02-19 04:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(587453, 60760, 17228, '<td valign="top">nice closeup and feeling of texture</td>', 'nice closeup and feeling of texture', '2004-02-19 04:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(587454, 61094, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Wow I like this photo; it is somewhat strange in a special kind of way (do I make any sense?). Excellent use of light and darkness. The expressions of your subject are almost unreal combined with all the other elements in the photo.<br/>- The connection with the challenge is thin; at least thinner than most other photos I have seen so far which may or may not be a good thing :).</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Wow I like this photo; it is somewhat strange in a special kind of way (do I make any sense?). Excellent use of light and darkness. The expressions of your subject are almost unreal combined with all the other elements in the photo.- The connection with the challenge is thin; at least thinner than most other photos I have seen so far which may or may not be a good thing :).', '2004-02-19 04:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(587456, 60747, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Textures are here just like rhythm! Good use of B/W to bring out the shapes and textures.<br/>- The DOF is too shallow.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Textures are here just like rhythm! Good use of B/W to bring out the shapes and textures.- The DOF is too shallow.', '2004-02-19 04:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(587457, 60167, 15260, '<td valign="top">nice catch...</td>', 'nice catch...', '2004-02-19 04:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587458, 60377, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Textures are present. Interesting tree.<br/>- The colours feel washed out and the photo is not able to hold my attention for more than a few seconds.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Textures are present. Interesting tree.- The colours feel washed out and the photo is not able to hold my attention for more than a few seconds.', '2004-02-19 04:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(587459, 59833, 15260, '<td valign="top">like the sharpness....however it think it''s slightly overexposed..</td>', 'like the sharpness....however it think it''s slightly overexposed..', '2004-02-19 04:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(587460, 60563, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Really like the spotlight on water''s horizon and undulating folds of light through clouds.</td>', 'Nice shot. Really like the spotlight on water''s horizon and undulating folds of light through clouds.', '2004-02-19 04:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(587461, 60037, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Interesting sculpture; it has texture indeed. Good use of B/W; I think if you had used colour the shapes and textures wouldn''t be as visible as it now is.<br/>- There are a number of distracting elements present like the lamppost and the sign to the right. The image is a little too dark.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Interesting sculpture; it has texture indeed. Good use of B/W; I think if you had used colour the shapes and textures wouldn''t be as visible as it now is.- There are a number of distracting elements present like the lamppost and the sign to the right. The image is a little too dark.', '2004-02-19 04:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(587462, 61070, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Shaggy sure has textures! <br/>- I would have liked to see more of shaggy''s eye; perhaps a different POV would have brought more appeal?</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Shaggy sure has textures! - I would have liked to see more of shaggy''s eye; perhaps a different POV would have brought more appeal?', '2004-02-19 04:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(587463, 61111, 16493, '<td valign="top">looks a bit too blue</td>', 'looks a bit too blue', '2004-02-19 04:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(587464, 60812, 17228, '<td valign="top">Picture looks rather static at this wide an angle. Although splash in water adds a focal point, it doesn''t really add to alot to the theme of textures.</td>', 'Picture looks rather static at this wide an angle. Although splash in water adds a focal point, it doesn''t really add to alot to the theme of textures.', '2004-02-19 04:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(587465, 59935, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ The contrast between light and darkness is good, textures are interesting just like the composition.<br/>- Can''t really think of any. Perhaps a negative point is that is has been done before.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ The contrast between light and darkness is good, textures are interesting just like the composition.- Can''t really think of any. Perhaps a negative point is that is has been done before.', '2004-02-19 04:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(587466, 60011, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Good use of light to bring out the textures, nice composition to bring appeal to an ordinary shoe.<br/>- Can''t think of any.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Good use of light to bring out the textures, nice composition to bring appeal to an ordinary shoe.- Can''t think of any.', '2004-02-19 04:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(587467, 60257, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Composition is interesting; contrast between life and death is okay.<br/>- Colours feel washed out; this photo could use more saturation.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Composition is interesting; contrast between life and death is okay.- Colours feel washed out; this photo could use more saturation.', '2004-02-19 04:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(587468, 60876, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nicely backlit subject shows form and texture well. Overexposed hotspots at the tip of leaf are  distracting though.</td>', 'Nicely backlit subject shows form and texture well. Overexposed hotspots at the tip of leaf are  distracting though.', '2004-02-19 04:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587469, 60405, 6999, '<td valign="top">This appears more focussed on the background than the rose - which has caught some texture there, at least. The rose is not completely out, of course, just a little beyond the range of acceptably sharp, for me. Also, there is no composition here - you''ve just plonked the thing down. or put your camera right over it, so that it''s completely centre-of-frame; no context, nothing to balance it. If it were a genuinely interesting shape, or more striking to look at, that might work - but that confusion of planes and angles, especially with the lack of detail, leads to - well, confusion, only.</td>', 'This appears more focussed on the background than the rose - which has caught some texture there, at least. The rose is not completely out, of course, just a little beyond the range of acceptably sharp, for me. Also, there is no composition here - you''ve just plonked the thing down. or put your camera right over it, so that it''s completely centre-of-frame; no context, nothing to balance it. If it were a genuinely interesting shape, or more striking to look at, that might work - but that confusion of planes and angles, especially with the lack of detail, leads to - well, confusion, only.', '2004-02-19 04:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(587470, 60918, 17228, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is (water ripples I assume) but it looks pretty cool. Would have been interesting to see how it looked with a closer view as well. Variety of broken colors adds to the feel of texture.</td>', 'Not sure what this is (water ripples I assume) but it looks pretty cool. Would have been interesting to see how it looked with a closer view as well. Variety of broken colors adds to the feel of texture.', '2004-02-19 04:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(587471, 60769, 16493, '<td valign="top">needs a bit more sharpness</td>', 'needs a bit more sharpness', '2004-02-19 04:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(587473, 60299, 16493, '<td valign="top">yummy</td>', 'yummy', '2004-02-19 04:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587477, 61142, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject for this challenge, certainly. There''s an odd sensation of there being a lack of detail in this, though close inspection reveals that there is no significant processing or pixelation going on: I think it''s to do with the light you''ve chosen. This has the feel of a very uniform light, like an overcast day when there are no real shadows: something more directional, even if it were soft, would bring out the texture of the rust more - would produce those small shadows that the eye percieves as texture. Here, you have good work on tones and shapes, but little feel of the quality of those surfaces. I also find this a touch random compositionally.</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject for this challenge, certainly. There''s an odd sensation of there being a lack of detail in this, though close inspection reveals that there is no significant processing or pixelation going on: I think it''s to do with the light you''ve chosen. This has the feel of a very uniform light, like an overcast day when there are no real shadows: something more directional, even if it were soft, would bring out the texture of the rust more - would produce those small shadows that the eye percieves as texture. Here, you have good work on tones and shapes, but little feel of the quality of those surfaces. I also find this a touch random compositionally.', '2004-02-19 04:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(587478, 61140, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ I have no idea what it is. Because of that I keep on looking at it trying to figure it out; your image certainly has appeal :). There are lots of textures to be seen here. Interesting colour combination.<br/>- Focus point should be a little more to the front. The black background is a little boring but at the same time contrast nicely with the orange/brownish foreground.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ I have no idea what it is. Because of that I keep on looking at it trying to figure it out; your image certainly has appeal :). There are lots of textures to be seen here. Interesting colour combination.- Focus point should be a little more to the front. The black background is a little boring but at the same time contrast nicely with the orange/brownish foreground.', '2004-02-19 04:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(587479, 61031, 17228, '<td valign="top">Enjoyed the visual story behind the pic. Not sure why one arm has a sleeve and the other doesn''t? Kinda makes right hand look like it''s unattached and floating in air. Otherwise nice pic.</td>', 'Enjoyed the visual story behind the pic. Not sure why one arm has a sleeve and the other doesn''t? Kinda makes right hand look like it''s unattached and floating in air. Otherwise nice pic.', '2004-02-19 04:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(587480, 60458, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ I can almost feel the textures. The composition is interesting and you used the light in an excellent way.<br/>- You should do a little more cleaning now and then ;).</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ I can almost feel the textures. The composition is interesting and you used the light in an excellent way.- You should do a little more cleaning now and then ;).', '2004-02-19 04:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(587481, 60596, 6999, '<td valign="top">Little variation in light across the in-focus areas of the hat - leaves little impression of the feel of the surface. The out of focus line of the brim where it curls up really pulls the eye, to poor effect I fear. There is far more texture visible in the extreme top right of frame, but your composition has relegated that area so far that it barely registers without a deliberate search.</td>', 'Little variation in light across the in-focus areas of the hat - leaves little impression of the feel of the surface. The out of focus line of the brim where it curls up really pulls the eye, to poor effect I fear. There is far more texture visible in the extreme top right of frame, but your composition has relegated that area so far that it barely registers without a deliberate search.', '2004-02-19 04:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(587482, 60804, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Good composition and use of light. <br/>- There is overexposure noticable at the top of the photo.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Good composition and use of light. - There is overexposure noticable at the top of the photo.', '2004-02-19 04:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(587483, 61098, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ There are textures present.<br/>- One coin is almost overexposed and that is distracting; photo doesn''t have a long attention span.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ There are textures present.- One coin is almost overexposed and that is distracting; photo doesn''t have a long attention span.', '2004-02-19 04:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(587484, 59766, 17228, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Pic could use more contrast to make texture pop, looks kinda washed-out.</td>', 'Cool idea. Pic could use more contrast to make texture pop, looks kinda washed-out.', '2004-02-19 04:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(587485, 59882, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ There is texture to be seen here this prevents me from giving you a 1.<br/>- As there isn''t much else I just want to forget this photo and go on to the next one.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ There is texture to be seen here this prevents me from giving you a 1.- As there isn''t much else I just want to forget this photo and go on to the next one.', '2004-02-19 04:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(587487, 61070, 6999, '<td valign="top">As with almost all animal shots, the immediate point of interest for the viewer''s eye is the subject''s eye - it''s almost a photographic maxim that so long as the eye is in focus it doesn''t matter too much about the rest of the subject. Shooting it half-masked like this produces a sense of confusion, I think.  Along the line of the nose, and some of that fringe there is certainly a sense of texture, but your composition of this has unbalanced that, for me, and i find my eye wandering through the frame without finding a point to hold it.</td>', 'As with almost all animal shots, the immediate point of interest for the viewer''s eye is the subject''s eye - it''s almost a photographic maxim that so long as the eye is in focus it doesn''t matter too much about the rest of the subject. Shooting it half-masked like this produces a sense of confusion, I think.  Along the line of the nose, and some of that fringe there is certainly a sense of texture, but your composition of this has unbalanced that, for me, and i find my eye wandering through the frame without finding a point to hold it.', '2004-02-19 04:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(587488, 61128, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ There are some nice and different textures to be seen. There is a good contrast between your subject and the background.<br/>- DOF is a tad to shallow; perhaps one stop more and you would have had an excellent capture. I would have liked to see Showin''s head :).</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ There are some nice and different textures to be seen. There is a good contrast between your subject and the background.- DOF is a tad to shallow; perhaps one stop more and you would have had an excellent capture. I would have liked to see Showin''s head :).', '2004-02-19 04:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(587489, 60691, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good capture, good motion-stopping, focus, etc. Some sense of texture in the sand, but compositionally entirely naive - subject dead centre, no sense of how the viewer''s eye might move through frame. Seems presented entirely because it was a difficult capture.</td>', 'Good capture, good motion-stopping, focus, etc. Some sense of texture in the sand, but compositionally entirely naive - subject dead centre, no sense of how the viewer''s eye might move through frame. Seems presented entirely because it was a difficult capture.', '2004-02-19 04:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(587490, 59766, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Nice use of DOF; it certainly brings appeal to this photo. There are textures!<br/>- The colours feel a bit washed out; chair doesn''t hold my attention for too long (not even with the use of DOF. POV could be a little more exciting.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Nice use of DOF; it certainly brings appeal to this photo. There are textures!- The colours feel a bit washed out; chair doesn''t hold my attention for too long (not even with the use of DOF. POV could be a little more exciting.', '2004-02-19 04:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(587491, 61058, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Good use of light to bring out the texture. <br/>- The standard classical way to portrait texture; try to be a little more creative next time.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Good use of light to bring out the texture. - The standard classical way to portrait texture; try to be a little more creative next time.', '2004-02-19 04:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(587492, 61032, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and pop on this B&amp;W. Varying shades of snow against black branches kept this pic interesting and the viewer from going snowblind.</td>', 'Nice contrast and pop on this B&W. Varying shades of snow against black branches kept this pic interesting and the viewer from going snowblind.', '2004-02-19 04:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(587493, 59836, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ It is a tunnel of light filled with textures :). Very nicely done. Did you experiment by putting your point of interest more the right or left: giving your photo a slightly off balanced feeling? Perhaps this would have made your photo even more interesting.<br/>- Can''t think of any.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ It is a tunnel of light filled with textures :). Very nicely done. Did you experiment by putting your point of interest more the right or left: giving your photo a slightly off balanced feeling? Perhaps this would have made your photo even more interesting.- Can''t think of any.', '2004-02-19 04:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(587495, 60488, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ There are some textures present. Your bear is cute.<br/>- It feels like a snapshot and not special in any kind of way.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ There are some textures present. Your bear is cute.- It feels like a snapshot and not special in any kind of way.', '2004-02-19 04:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(587496, 60744, 6999, '<td valign="top">The movement from light to shade, and the broken nature of that surface is well captured. Photographically, a difficult composition - one''s eye searches for patterns in near-abstract images such as this, and there is a sense of two stonger horizontal lines in this surface, but they lead me only to the silhouetted edge of the tree - I think I''d have tried a wider aspect ratio thatn this 4:3, to bring those lines closer to top of frame, then the combined lines of the edge and those two would produce a triangular feel with the brighter area of bark: might (only might) find that the eye moved through that more happily.</td>', 'The movement from light to shade, and the broken nature of that surface is well captured. Photographically, a difficult composition - one''s eye searches for patterns in near-abstract images such as this, and there is a sense of two stonger horizontal lines in this surface, but they lead me only to the silhouetted edge of the tree - I think I''d have tried a wider aspect ratio thatn this 4:3, to bring those lines closer to top of frame, then the combined lines of the edge and those two would produce a triangular feel with the brighter area of bark: might (only might) find that the eye moved through that more happily.', '2004-02-19 04:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(587497, 60265, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ There is texture.<br/>- ... and that''s about it. Forgettable :(.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ There is texture.- ... and that''s about it. Forgettable :(.', '2004-02-19 04:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(587498, 60949, 17228, '<td valign="top">Much of the texture goes unnoticed due to shallow depth of field. Focus seems to be on beak which doesn''t hold much in the way of texture or interest. Hard shot to capture perfectly I''m sure, good effort.</td>', 'Much of the texture goes unnoticed due to shallow depth of field. Focus seems to be on beak which doesn''t hold much in the way of texture or interest. Hard shot to capture perfectly I''m sure, good effort.', '2004-02-19 04:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(587499, 60768, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Interesting pose and a lovely contrast between the fur of the blanket and the smooth skin of your subject. I like the colours as well.<br/>- Can''t really think of any.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Interesting pose and a lovely contrast between the fur of the blanket and the smooth skin of your subject. I like the colours as well.- Can''t really think of any.', '2004-02-19 04:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(587501, 60501, 6999, '<td valign="top">Took some looking to see it, and only when I focussed on that darker line of shade in the water did it come to me - I was looking for something larger.  I like this composition - like the movement through the frame produced by the rush of water and the lines of the fir tree, and I also like the tonality. The ''point'' of the shot, especially given your title, doesn''t seem to be a texture though, which makes it an odd thing to submit to this challenge, perhaps. There is perhaps some suggestion of tactility in the water, but only at a stretch.</td>', 'Took some looking to see it, and only when I focussed on that darker line of shade in the water did it come to me - I was looking for something larger.  I like this composition - like the movement through the frame produced by the rush of water and the lines of the fir tree, and I also like the tonality. The ''point'' of the shot, especially given your title, doesn''t seem to be a texture though, which makes it an odd thing to submit to this challenge, perhaps. There is perhaps some suggestion of tactility in the water, but only at a stretch.', '2004-02-19 04:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(587503, 60410, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ You meet the challenge.<br/>- Colours are washed out; certainly need more saturation. The distortion on the top left is distracting. You miss interest; perhaps another POV would have worked better.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ You meet the challenge.- Colours are washed out; certainly need more saturation. The distortion on the top left is distracting. You miss interest; perhaps another POV would have worked better.', '2004-02-19 05:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
