(587513, 61094, 6999, '<td valign="top">Rather a good photograph. Semi-naked man''s arm appearing from black woman''s head is odd seeming, but in a slightly surreal image like this it doesn''t offend me. Oh to dodge and burn a touch though - compositionally, that near-silhouette pulls the eye so strongly, and she (he?), being not quite silhouetted my eye is searching for detail there that is difficult to see - kind of unsettling, but not in a good sense. Like it though - softness of toning on the walls through the door add a great sense of marble, and rich stone-work, and then that oddly posed figure to add some more disruption. Almost great.</td>', 'Rather a good photograph. Semi-naked man''s arm appearing from black woman''s head is odd seeming, but in a slightly surreal image like this it doesn''t offend me. Oh to dodge and burn a touch though - compositionally, that near-silhouette pulls the eye so strongly, and she (he?), being not quite silhouetted my eye is searching for detail there that is difficult to see - kind of unsettling, but not in a good sense. Like it though - softness of toning on the walls through the door add a great sense of marble, and rich stone-work, and then that oddly posed figure to add some more disruption. Almost great.', '2004-02-19 05:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(587514, 60604, 7263, '<td valign="top">quite soft which is nice, but for textures it needs to be sharper,</td>', 'quite soft which is nice, but for textures it needs to be sharper,', '2004-02-19 05:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
