(587570, 59817, 9109, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, I like the use of DOF here.</td>', 'Interesting angle, I like the use of DOF here.', '2004-02-19 05:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(587571, 60099, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice tone to this pic. Overall lighting is rather flat and soft. Might have highlighted taller cotton swabs for greater variation, interest. and display of texture.</td>', 'Nice tone to this pic. Overall lighting is rather flat and soft. Might have highlighted taller cotton swabs for greater variation, interest. and display of texture.', '2004-02-19 05:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(587572, 60737, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work - good sense of feel. Positioning of the edge of the door frame in your frame i aarbitrary-seeming. With something bordering on the abstract - as in it''s more about the textures and shapes, rather than the objects as such, I think you could have been a little less rigidly orthodix regards the thirds ''rule'' to good effect. Like this, the shadowy world of the window behind the door (?) becomes too important to the image.</td>', 'Good work - good sense of feel. Positioning of the edge of the door frame in your frame i aarbitrary-seeming. With something bordering on the abstract - as in it''s more about the textures and shapes, rather than the objects as such, I think you could have been a little less rigidly orthodix regards the thirds ''rule'' to good effect. Like this, the shadowy world of the window behind the door (?) becomes too important to the image.', '2004-02-19 05:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587573, 60753, 17228, '<td valign="top">Good composition and great color contrasts. Very nice all around.</td>', 'Good composition and great color contrasts. Very nice all around.', '2004-02-19 05:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(587576, 60413, 11467, '<td valign="top">Colour &amp; lighting are great. A bit too abstract for my likeing in that I can''t tell what it is.</td>', 'Colour & lighting are great. A bit too abstract for my likeing in that I can''t tell what it is.', '2004-02-19 05:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
