(587584, 60405, 17228, '<td valign="top">Shallow depth of field. Camera focused on background rather than center subject, leaving it out of focus and in the viewer''s mind, unimportant. Unfortunately in this case, it''s dead center in this pic. A closeup of this rock could have proven very nice indeed.</td>', 'Shallow depth of field. Camera focused on background rather than center subject, leaving it out of focus and in the viewer''s mind, unimportant. Unfortunately in this case, it''s dead center in this pic. A closeup of this rock could have proven very nice indeed.', '2004-02-19 06:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(587585, 60787, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. The crumbs on th eplate distract from the "Perfect Image"</td>', 'Nice photo. The crumbs on th eplate distract from the "Perfect Image"', '2004-02-19 06:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587586, 60758, 9109, '<td valign="top">Composition is good but DOF is lacking.</td>', 'Composition is good but DOF is lacking.', '2004-02-19 06:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(587587, 60735, 9109, '<td valign="top">Very creative use of lighting and composition of elements.</td>', 'Very creative use of lighting and composition of elements.', '2004-02-19 06:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(587588, 60464, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think this would look better in a warmer tone. But the Composition Idea &amp; exposure are great</td>', 'I think this would look better in a warmer tone. But the Composition Idea & exposure are great', '2004-02-19 06:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(587589, 61121, 17228, '<td valign="top">Very small sliver of photo is in focus, and even that shows hardly any texture, highlights or shadows.  A better 3D subject under these same conditions would have produced much improved results for you.</td>', 'Very small sliver of photo is in focus, and even that shows hardly any texture, highlights or shadows.  A better 3D subject under these same conditions would have produced much improved results for you.', '2004-02-19 06:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(587590, 60780, 15832, '<td valign="top">Good work. Nice simulaction.</td>', 'Good work. Nice simulaction.', '2004-02-19 06:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(587591, 60105, 11467, '<td valign="top">Lighting is harsh, but works well in this photo</td>', 'Lighting is harsh, but works well in this photo', '2004-02-19 06:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(587592, 61141, 6999, '<td valign="top">The very finest detail seems slightly lost - like there was just a fraction of camera shake - it may be just a function of the light almost as much as focus or shake, but it doesn''t quite have the immediacy of perfect detail. The sense of the dusting of pollen on the curves of the petals is well caught however. The yellowness of that top petal, and those black striations, perhaps compete too much with the stamen for attention.</td>', 'The very finest detail seems slightly lost - like there was just a fraction of camera shake - it may be just a function of the light almost as much as focus or shake, but it doesn''t quite have the immediacy of perfect detail. The sense of the dusting of pollen on the curves of the petals is well caught however. The yellowness of that top petal, and those black striations, perhaps compete too much with the stamen for attention.', '2004-02-19 06:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(587593, 59837, 11467, '<td valign="top">Did you kiss it??<br/>Light seems a little harsh. somehow the texture contrasts don''t come out as well as they could</td>', 'Did you kiss it??Light seems a little harsh. somehow the texture contrasts don''t come out as well as they could', '2004-02-19 06:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(587594, 60815, 11467, '<td valign="top">The eye is just not quite sharp enough</td>', 'The eye is just not quite sharp enough', '2004-02-19 06:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(587595, 59883, 11467, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little harsh. The image overall seems a little bright</td>', 'Lighting is a little harsh. The image overall seems a little bright', '2004-02-19 06:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(587596, 61114, 11467, '<td valign="top">Great focus and lighting</td>', 'Great focus and lighting', '2004-02-19 06:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(587597, 61096, 11467, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if the focus is right on. Top left the texture is sharp, but the ring just doesn''t stand out like it should</td>', 'I don''t know if the focus is right on. Top left the texture is sharp, but the ring just doesn''t stand out like it should', '2004-02-19 06:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(587598, 60892, 6999, '<td valign="top">Graphically wonderful - very intriguing. From a sense of blance, perhaps the roundels have been taken too far toward edge of frame, and the positioning of the edge of that frame within your frame is maybe too blatant, or perhaps simply too close not to feel constricted. There''s an odd sense of not neing able to work out the three dimensionality of the wood, too. seems to dwell more on the shapes, and the composition than the texture - can''t work out what''s going on with the lighting - it seems to be coming from two different and opposed directions at the same time.</td>', 'Graphically wonderful - very intriguing. From a sense of blance, perhaps the roundels have been taken too far toward edge of frame, and the positioning of the edge of that frame within your frame is maybe too blatant, or perhaps simply too close not to feel constricted. There''s an odd sense of not neing able to work out the three dimensionality of the wood, too. seems to dwell more on the shapes, and the composition than the texture - can''t work out what''s going on with the lighting - it seems to be coming from two different and opposed directions at the same time.', '2004-02-19 06:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(587599, 61098, 11467, '<td valign="top">Using external lighting to get some shadow, less reflectio &amp; more contrast would improve the image</td>', 'Using external lighting to get some shadow, less reflectio & more contrast would improve the image', '2004-02-19 06:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(587600, 60729, 11467, '<td valign="top">Brrr!! Nice colours. I think the ice at the top shouldn''t be cropped.</td>', 'Brrr!! Nice colours. I think the ice at the top shouldn''t be cropped.', '2004-02-19 06:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(587601, 59903, 11467, '<td valign="top">Lighting focus &amp; exposure are great:-) Composition seems a little static. Having the image more off center might improve it.</td>', 'Lighting focus & exposure are great:-) Composition seems a little static. Having the image more off center might improve it.', '2004-02-19 06:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(587602, 60829, 11467, '<td valign="top">The colours are a bit drab. Could be pepped up with a bit more illumination on the cactus</td>', 'The colours are a bit drab. Could be pepped up with a bit more illumination on the cactus', '2004-02-19 06:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(587603, 60705, 11467, '<td valign="top">Too dark. On my monitor I find it very hard to see.</td>', 'Too dark. On my monitor I find it very hard to see.', '2004-02-19 06:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(587604, 60918, 11467, '<td valign="top">I Love the colours &amp; patterns in this image</td>', 'I Love the colours & patterns in this image', '2004-02-19 06:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(587605, 61128, 17458, '<td valign="top">I really want to see the head ! Nice detail though.</td>', 'I really want to see the head ! Nice detail though.', '2004-02-19 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(587606, 60588, 11467, '<td valign="top">Man those things are UGLY!<br/>Great picture. <br/>Colour, composition &amp; exposure are spot on :-) Maybe a little dark on the feathers.</td>', 'Man those things are UGLY!Great picture. Colour, composition & exposure are spot on :-) Maybe a little dark on the feathers.', '2004-02-19 06:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(587607, 60765, 11467, '<td valign="top">A little soft or out of focus</td>', 'A little soft or out of focus', '2004-02-19 06:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(587608, 60105, 17458, '<td valign="top">Would have liked it with sloghtly less darkness. Get a greate feel of the texture though. Nice.</td>', 'Would have liked it with sloghtly less darkness. Get a greate feel of the texture though. Nice.', '2004-02-19 06:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(587609, 60769, 17478, '<td valign="top">really good subject, I just felt the colours were a little disjointed and separate from each other..... but then I was born awkward...  I like it.</td>', 'really good subject, I just felt the colours were a little disjointed and separate from each other..... but then I was born awkward...  I like it.', '2004-02-19 06:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(587610, 61071, 17478, '<td valign="top">good strong colours, sharp focus, well lit.<br/>it makes me hungry!<br/>nice highlights on the fruit.</td>', 'good strong colours, sharp focus, well lit.it makes me hungry!nice highlights on the fruit.', '2004-02-19 06:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(587611, 60782, 17478, '<td valign="top">image with a strong impact.  good focus on the detail of the nose.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'image with a strong impact.  good focus on the detail of the nose.  I like this a lot.', '2004-02-19 06:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587613, 59895, 17478, '<td valign="top">Fantastic texture, good composition, suits monochrome well.<br/>this is my favourite picture so far.</td>', 'Fantastic texture, good composition, suits monochrome well.this is my favourite picture so far.', '2004-02-19 06:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(587616, 60820, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good subject, well isolated from background both in toning and focus. Fine detail not quite evident, but the texture still gets through.</td>', 'Good subject, well isolated from background both in toning and focus. Fine detail not quite evident, but the texture still gets through.', '2004-02-19 07:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(587617, 60824, 6999, '<td valign="top">Such direct light perhaps mutes the feel of this - making the shape of the whole thing rather more imprtant to the image than the feel of it. Slightly odd angle to choose, relegating that cut end of shaft so far out of frame. Good colour, but not in the end a convincing entry for me.</td>', 'Such direct light perhaps mutes the feel of this - making the shape of the whole thing rather more imprtant to the image than the feel of it. Slightly odd angle to choose, relegating that cut end of shaft so far out of frame. Good colour, but not in the end a convincing entry for me.', '2004-02-19 07:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(587618, 59961, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very good detailing and feel within focus range. Your choice of shot is perhaps a touch too confused for a great image - such a choas of objects without ever finding one single point to hold the eye. Pretty good work, nevertheless.</td>', 'Very good detailing and feel within focus range. Your choice of shot is perhaps a touch too confused for a great image - such a choas of objects without ever finding one single point to hold the eye. Pretty good work, nevertheless.', '2004-02-19 07:05:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(587619, 60009, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, though I think you are just a touch over-exposed on that bloom (it actually looks like a piece of paper screwed up). beyond that it''s well poitioned within frame, and the texture of those seeds is well caught. The over-exposure loses you some level of detail and thus texture in the bloom itself, which is a shame as it is inevitably the main subject of this image.</td>', 'Good lighting, though I think you are just a touch over-exposed on that bloom (it actually looks like a piece of paper screwed up). beyond that it''s well poitioned within frame, and the texture of those seeds is well caught. The over-exposure loses you some level of detail and thus texture in the bloom itself, which is a shame as it is inevitably the main subject of this image.', '2004-02-19 07:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(587620, 60144, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think you needed a bit more fill-light to bring out the texture of the thing against the brightness of its own lights - that balance seems skewed in favour of the screen and buttons. It might just be a processing thing, but I have to really brighten my screen to see other than just one edge - and yes, my machine is calibrated.</td>', 'I think you needed a bit more fill-light to bring out the texture of the thing against the brightness of its own lights - that balance seems skewed in favour of the screen and buttons. It might just be a processing thing, but I have to really brighten my screen to see other than just one edge - and yes, my machine is calibrated.', '2004-02-19 07:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(587621, 60829, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not a good composition I''m afraid. Those shapes don''t lead the eye anywhere, and the blown out sky attracts the eye by sheer force of its whiteness. It''s difficult to say exactly where you think the main centre of interest is here, as there appears to be no one thing as a primary subject. The light is far too general to capture good texture.</td>', 'Not a good composition I''m afraid. Those shapes don''t lead the eye anywhere, and the blown out sky attracts the eye by sheer force of its whiteness. It''s difficult to say exactly where you think the main centre of interest is here, as there appears to be no one thing as a primary subject. The light is far too general to capture good texture.', '2004-02-19 07:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(587622, 60098, 15920, '<td valign="top">Composition could have been better.  The concrete line in the middle is too even.  I also might have used more depth of field.</td>', 'Composition could have been better.  The concrete line in the middle is too even.  I also might have used more depth of field.', '2004-02-19 07:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(587623, 60762, 15920, '<td valign="top">Looks just a tad out of focus.</td>', 'Looks just a tad out of focus.', '2004-02-19 07:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(587624, 61127, 6999, '<td valign="top">heavily saturated colour - to the extent that in the brightest area of the fruit it''s begun to lose detail, and yet the overall image isn''t very bright at all. The idea is good, and the execution not far off, but perhaps brightening the whole thing and then reducing the saturation to bring back those details would help graduate the light across the skin? Still, a good illustration of the smooth/shiny and pitted feel of orange skin.</td>', 'heavily saturated colour - to the extent that in the brightest area of the fruit it''s begun to lose detail, and yet the overall image isn''t very bright at all. The idea is good, and the execution not far off, but perhaps brightening the whole thing and then reducing the saturation to bring back those details would help graduate the light across the skin? Still, a good illustration of the smooth/shiny and pitted feel of orange skin.', '2004-02-19 07:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(587625, 61119, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intriguing - might make a good wallpaper. Your very muted b&amp;w has some merit, though perhaps to bring out the quality of texture you might want to try setting black and white points further away from grey than this, to allow more graduation of light and shade throughout the image.</td>', 'Intriguing - might make a good wallpaper. Your very muted b&w has some merit, though perhaps to bring out the quality of texture you might want to try setting black and white points further away from grey than this, to allow more graduation of light and shade throughout the image.', '2004-02-19 07:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(587626, 60757, 14221, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot.  The lighting is just a little too harsh for me, but I think that''s what you were going for.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot.  The lighting is just a little too harsh for me, but I think that''s what you were going for.', '2004-02-19 07:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(587627, 61031, 14221, '<td valign="top">Nice idea</td>', 'Nice idea', '2004-02-19 07:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(587628, 61071, 14221, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot.  Lighting is just about perfect.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot.  Lighting is just about perfect.', '2004-02-19 07:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(587629, 60963, 15420, '<td valign="top">The Nike logo actually looks like it is pasted onto the image :)<br/></td>', 'The Nike logo actually looks like it is pasted onto the image :)', '2004-02-19 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(587630, 60705, 15920, '<td valign="top">Too dark, but the reflection on the top head are great.  If you could have gotten that on the other figures this would have been neat.</td>', 'Too dark, but the reflection on the top head are great.  If you could have gotten that on the other figures this would have been neat.', '2004-02-19 07:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(587631, 60742, 14221, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but not entirely "texture" oriented.  I would think the natural look would bring out the textures better.</td>', 'Interesting, but not entirely "texture" oriented.  I would think the natural look would bring out the textures better.', '2004-02-19 07:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(587632, 60807, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great subtlety of tone and colour - really a good piece of work. Lighting is excellent for the purposes, and there is a great sense of texture to it. No real reservations other than that in neither its subject nor its presentation does it really get to me at all. But technically, rather good.</td>', 'Great subtlety of tone and colour - really a good piece of work. Lighting is excellent for the purposes, and there is a great sense of texture to it. No real reservations other than that in neither its subject nor its presentation does it really get to me at all. But technically, rather good.', '2004-02-19 07:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(587634, 60706, 14221, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The blue border definitely brings out the color in this shot.  For me personally, I would''ve liked to see a close-up of just the circular door in all its blue and rusted glory.</td>', 'I like this.  The blue border definitely brings out the color in this shot.  For me personally, I would''ve liked to see a close-up of just the circular door in all its blue and rusted glory.', '2004-02-19 07:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(587636, 60388, 14221, '<td valign="top">Clean shot, very nice.  You were able to capture the texture of the ripples....not easy to do.</td>', 'Clean shot, very nice.  You were able to capture the texture of the ripples....not easy to do.', '2004-02-19 07:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587637, 61145, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work - great use of the light-tent kind of trick, although there is suspicion of some detailed reflection toward (presumably) camera. Gives a sense of the smoothness and creasing of the foil very well. Perspective is well handled too - no sign of distortion that I can see. That glow of light toward the top of the thing really speaks quality - advertisers would love you. A bit bland, as a subject, but you''re by no means the only one to suffer from that here.</td>', 'Good work - great use of the light-tent kind of trick, although there is suspicion of some detailed reflection toward (presumably) camera. Gives a sense of the smoothness and creasing of the foil very well. Perspective is well handled too - no sign of distortion that I can see. That glow of light toward the top of the thing really speaks quality - advertisers would love you. A bit bland, as a subject, but you''re by no means the only one to suffer from that here.', '2004-02-19 07:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(587639, 60572, 14221, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  The out-of-foocus drop in the lower left detracts, I think.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  The out-of-foocus drop in the lower left detracts, I think.', '2004-02-19 07:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(587642, 59979, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m never going to put one of these muted, low-contrast images in my favourites, but I do rather appreciate them when they come up. I mean low contrast in the sense of subject, rather than technically in terms of black and white points I should say. A criticism would be that the pure rhythm of this shot focus the mind more on pattern than texture, but I''m perhaps being pedantic.</td>', 'I''m never going to put one of these muted, low-contrast images in my favourites, but I do rather appreciate them when they come up. I mean low contrast in the sense of subject, rather than technically in terms of black and white points I should say. A criticism would be that the pure rhythm of this shot focus the mind more on pattern than texture, but I''m perhaps being pedantic.', '2004-02-19 07:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587643, 60896, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work - a first thought was that this was too muted in its contrast, but I don''t know now whether that''s really the case. next though was that it was a desert shot - that those were trees, and it maintains that sense of scale even after the realisation that they''re perhaps more properly termed shrubs. Great use of the lines in the dune and the lines in the sky to emphasise the composition.</td>', 'Good work - a first thought was that this was too muted in its contrast, but I don''t know now whether that''s really the case. next though was that it was a desert shot - that those were trees, and it maintains that sense of scale even after the realisation that they''re perhaps more properly termed shrubs. Great use of the lines in the dune and the lines in the sky to emphasise the composition.', '2004-02-19 07:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(587646, 60768, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good mood - great use of muted colour, and you''ve captured a wistful moment well, and the catch-light in the eyes really lends some life to what might have been a rather drear scene without it. I do find the out-of-focus foreground area to be distracting - mainly because it seems to loom up into the image, rather than being a function of distance - don''t get much sense of teh blanket receding into focus, if you follow me. texture? Good smoothness of skin, and a sense of softness and not or wiriness in the blanket. Borderline twee for me - I find that with a lot of child portraits, but excellently done.</td>', 'Good mood - great use of muted colour, and you''ve captured a wistful moment well, and the catch-light in the eyes really lends some life to what might have been a rather drear scene without it. I do find the out-of-focus foreground area to be distracting - mainly because it seems to loom up into the image, rather than being a function of distance - don''t get much sense of teh blanket receding into focus, if you follow me. texture? Good smoothness of skin, and a sense of softness and not or wiriness in the blanket. Borderline twee for me - I find that with a lot of child portraits, but excellently done.', '2004-02-19 07:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(587649, 60906, 6999, '<td valign="top">Kind of clumsy looking composition - random cropping out of fingernails, bottom half of thumb. Movement of shapes through the frame is difficult on the eye. The moderate depth of field makes the two more distant fingers appear to belong to a different hand. Some sense of skin texture.</td>', 'Kind of clumsy looking composition - random cropping out of fingernails, bottom half of thumb. Movement of shapes through the frame is difficult on the eye. The moderate depth of field makes the two more distant fingers appear to belong to a different hand. Some sense of skin texture.', '2004-02-19 07:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(587652, 60433, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good capture, though missing the fine detail needed for a great shot. You seem to have set contrast more for the tree than the bird - the graduation of light across the white feathers is muted. There is a sense of featheriness neverthless, so good work there. The confusion of branches doesn''t help the coherence of the image, in ''dpc'' terms, but its nice work.</td>', 'Good capture, though missing the fine detail needed for a great shot. You seem to have set contrast more for the tree than the bird - the graduation of light across the white feathers is muted. There is a sense of featheriness neverthless, so good work there. The confusion of branches doesn''t help the coherence of the image, in ''dpc'' terms, but its nice work.', '2004-02-19 07:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(587653, 61111, 6999, '<td valign="top">Choice of colour temperature is different - and quite effective. Lends a mystical quality to the subject, makes the first perception one of a landscape rather than a detail, which I quite like - in fact I''d go so far as to say you might have cropped this to contain only the tree, and lose the sky and stuff top right of frame. DOF is a bit too shallow to really show us a breadth of texture - it rather concentrates on a very narrow area bottom third of frame, but there''s still great interest there. One function of this colour that I don''t like so much is the coldness it brings to the image, but that''s inevitable. Intersting.</td>', 'Choice of colour temperature is different - and quite effective. Lends a mystical quality to the subject, makes the first perception one of a landscape rather than a detail, which I quite like - in fact I''d go so far as to say you might have cropped this to contain only the tree, and lose the sky and stuff top right of frame. DOF is a bit too shallow to really show us a breadth of texture - it rather concentrates on a very narrow area bottom third of frame, but there''s still great interest there. One function of this colour that I don''t like so much is the coldness it brings to the image, but that''s inevitable. Intersting.', '2004-02-19 07:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(587662, 60316, 17065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color on the apple in nice contrast to the metal. I can almost feel my knuckles hurting... 10</td>', 'Beautiful color on the apple in nice contrast to the metal. I can almost feel my knuckles hurting... 10', '2004-02-19 07:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(587663, 59895, 6999, '<td valign="top">Tonality reminiscent of Mr Setzler - and a capture of a quality of waxiness in that leaf that wouldn''t be out of place in his work either. I don''t know that allowing the curl of the leaf to drift out of frame bottom left is so reminiscent though, and vertainly not a choice I would have made. Strong feeling that the composition would be more harmonious if that stem and the rest of the leaf were included, so that they didn''t appearto be emerging separately into view. That said, great meeting of the challenge, and great feel and life to the photography - kind of orthodoxly classical, if you understand. A great example.</td>', 'Tonality reminiscent of Mr Setzler - and a capture of a quality of waxiness in that leaf that wouldn''t be out of place in his work either. I don''t know that allowing the curl of the leaf to drift out of frame bottom left is so reminiscent though, and vertainly not a choice I would have made. Strong feeling that the composition would be more harmonious if that stem and the rest of the leaf were included, so that they didn''t appearto be emerging separately into view. That said, great meeting of the challenge, and great feel and life to the photography - kind of orthodoxly classical, if you understand. A great example.', '2004-02-19 07:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(587666, 61153, 6999, '<td valign="top">Dark, mysterious, forbidding, odd, flat, evocative, suggestive, but for me, without the challenge bounds - interesting shot, but not in my mind a great one. Refreshingly different though.</td>', 'Dark, mysterious, forbidding, odd, flat, evocative, suggestive, but for me, without the challenge bounds - interesting shot, but not in my mind a great one. Refreshingly different though.', '2004-02-19 07:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(587667, 60831, 17065, '<td valign="top">Nice picture!! But the soft light does not really reveal the texture of the rose. Still a good one. 8</td>', 'Nice picture!! But the soft light does not really reveal the texture of the rose. Still a good one. 8', '2004-02-19 07:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(587673, 60729, 17065, '<td valign="top">Nice balance between the dark and the light parts. I like this one alot. 10</td>', 'Nice balance between the dark and the light parts. I like this one alot. 10', '2004-02-19 07:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(587675, 60299, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent example of a certain type of work. Vibrant, the high-key excellently done, some sense of feel, but more of colour and shape, perhaps. Good work though.</td>', 'Excellent example of a certain type of work. Vibrant, the high-key excellently done, some sense of feel, but more of colour and shape, perhaps. Good work though.', '2004-02-19 08:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587676, 60441, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fine detail missed, apart maybe from the extreme centre of the thing. Balance of light on the subject and nackground doesn''t help, and the other ''buds'' in background confuse. No great sense of feel coming through. Not sure whether your processing (though it''s a very small file size) or perhaps hand-holding the shot (?) has caused this.</td>', 'Fine detail missed, apart maybe from the extreme centre of the thing. Balance of light on the subject and nackground doesn''t help, and the other ''buds'' in background confuse. No great sense of feel coming through. Not sure whether your processing (though it''s a very small file size) or perhaps hand-holding the shot (?) has caused this.', '2004-02-19 08:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(587677, 60791, 17065, '<td valign="top">Nice background color, and a beautiful picture. 9</td>', 'Nice background color, and a beautiful picture. 9', '2004-02-19 08:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(587679, 60322, 6999, '<td valign="top">I find the close-cropping of this unuseful - and lighting from the same direction as the camera has reduced the effect of texture in the shot - try sideways lighting, you''ll get mote light and shade, and more interst for the eye. Good shots of cactus are rare - I think generally because they''re such lumpy ugly things.</td>', 'I find the close-cropping of this unuseful - and lighting from the same direction as the camera has reduced the effect of texture in the shot - try sideways lighting, you''ll get mote light and shade, and more interst for the eye. Good shots of cactus are rare - I think generally because they''re such lumpy ugly things.', '2004-02-19 08:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(587681, 60464, 17478, '<td valign="top">I just love this picture, it really drags you in.</td>', 'I just love this picture, it really drags you in.', '2004-02-19 08:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(587682, 60785, 17065, '<td valign="top">My first thought for this challenge was "jeans". I think the picture would have been even better with a DOF that had kept it all in focus. But its a great pic. 8</td>', 'My first thought for this challenge was "jeans". I think the picture would have been even better with a DOF that had kept it all in focus. But its a great pic. 8', '2004-02-19 08:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(587683, 61144, 17478, '<td valign="top">this is definately the best of the ''facial hair'' texture pictures.  An interesting chin, excellent light, like the monochrome.  Can''t fault it.</td>', 'this is definately the best of the ''facial hair'' texture pictures.  An interesting chin, excellent light, like the monochrome.  Can''t fault it.', '2004-02-19 08:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(587686, 60768, 17478, '<td valign="top">This picture really drags you in and won''t let go.  The contrast of the blanket to the smooth face is good and the eyes have highlights that really lift them and grab the attention.  The fuzzy bit at the bottom of the picture really gives a depth to the image.  This is one of my top 5 favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'This picture really drags you in and won''t let go.  The contrast of the blanket to the smooth face is good and the eyes have highlights that really lift them and grab the attention.  The fuzzy bit at the bottom of the picture really gives a depth to the image.  This is one of my top 5 favourites in this challenge.', '2004-02-19 08:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(587687, 60982, 17065, '<td valign="top">Yum!  The texture of the orange comes through very well. <br/>I think I may have considered cropping a bit of the left side if it was me. But it isn''t. Good one! 9</td>', 'Yum!  The texture of the orange comes through very well. I think I may have considered cropping a bit of the left side if it was me. But it isn''t. Good one! 9', '2004-02-19 08:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(587688, 60860, 17478, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best of the ''nuts'' pictures.  Good focus, great colours.  Much more interesting seeing the nuts themselves as well as the shells.  I also like that they fill the frame and having an empty shell at the centre really does provide a good focal point in the image.  Great stuff.</td>', 'I think this is the best of the ''nuts'' pictures.  Good focus, great colours.  Much more interesting seeing the nuts themselves as well as the shells.  I also like that they fill the frame and having an empty shell at the centre really does provide a good focal point in the image.  Great stuff.', '2004-02-19 08:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587689, 60921, 17478, '<td valign="top">fantastic texture.... best of the ''fruit and veg'' collection!</td>', 'fantastic texture.... best of the ''fruit and veg'' collection!', '2004-02-19 08:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
