(587734, 59910, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. Well balanced image, and good contrast of substances. Don''t think it quite holds my attention enough, but it''s a valid attempt.</td>', 'Neat idea. Well balanced image, and good contrast of substances. Don''t think it quite holds my attention enough, but it''s a valid attempt.', '2004-02-19 09:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(587736, 60753, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fine study. You''ve captured some texture in those wings for sure - real fragility there, and also some degree of feel to the stick. DOF is excellent, and also the colour. Photographically, it doesn''t quite appeal to me so much - perhaps that rush of colours in the background, but an excellent wildlife macro, for all that.</td>', 'Fine study. You''ve captured some texture in those wings for sure - real fragility there, and also some degree of feel to the stick. DOF is excellent, and also the colour. Photographically, it doesn''t quite appeal to me so much - perhaps that rush of colours in the background, but an excellent wildlife macro, for all that.', '2004-02-19 09:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(587738, 60878, 6999, '<td valign="top">processing means this could be the result of anything - there could be texture in the original, or there could just be the variety of colours that have produced this patterning after playing with it. Ther isn''t much impression of texture given to me here, even taking an impressionistic view of it - it feels like looking at a litho plate - very flat, with odd markings.</td>', 'processing means this could be the result of anything - there could be texture in the original, or there could just be the variety of colours that have produced this patterning after playing with it. Ther isn''t much impression of texture given to me here, even taking an impressionistic view of it - it feels like looking at a litho plate - very flat, with odd markings.', '2004-02-19 09:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(587739, 60358, 10887, '<td valign="top">Wow! Good work, great texture!</td>', 'Wow! Good work, great texture!', '2004-02-19 09:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(587740, 60270, 6999, '<td valign="top">No. Good prtrait, of its type, but both a very small image, and in the manner of good portraits it has reduced the level of texture in a flattering manner - even in the hair and the fur edging of that coat there isn''t much.</td>', 'No. Good prtrait, of its type, but both a very small image, and in the manner of good portraits it has reduced the level of texture in a flattering manner - even in the hair and the fur edging of that coat there isn''t much.', '2004-02-19 09:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(587741, 59858, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done - real fine detail as is essential in my view for this challenge. Great tones, great subtlety to the moment of light you''ve chosen. Perhaps a touch centred in photographic terms - I would have placed it further to the left, so that the eye could wander into the distnace of the bank and return to the plant. Serene colours.</td>', 'Beautifully done - real fine detail as is essential in my view for this challenge. Great tones, great subtlety to the moment of light you''ve chosen. Perhaps a touch centred in photographic terms - I would have placed it further to the left, so that the eye could wander into the distnace of the bank and return to the plant. Serene colours.', '2004-02-19 09:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(587746, 61090, 6999, '<td valign="top">Rather disorganised for a near-abstract shot, and rather in-harmonious in your selection of colours. Some sense of feel in the materials, but let down by those other compositional elements. What interest there is is in the idea of a found moment of contrasts, but I fear that for me that interest is only slight.</td>', 'Rather disorganised for a near-abstract shot, and rather in-harmonious in your selection of colours. Some sense of feel in the materials, but let down by those other compositional elements. What interest there is is in the idea of a found moment of contrasts, but I fear that for me that interest is only slight.', '2004-02-19 09:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(587750, 61062, 6999, '<td valign="top">Light seems quite harsh, though the angle of it has produced a good impression of texture here. Rather messy - why are almost all cactus photos so ugly? - but excellent on the vivid colours. Lacks interest in the composition - just an illustrative shot of a cactus leaf, really, albeit one that does display texture to some extent.</td>', 'Light seems quite harsh, though the angle of it has produced a good impression of texture here. Rather messy - why are almost all cactus photos so ugly? - but excellent on the vivid colours. Lacks interest in the composition - just an illustrative shot of a cactus leaf, really, albeit one that does display texture to some extent.', '2004-02-19 09:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(587751, 60372, 6999, '<td valign="top">Despite the very ropey focussing, and odd colouring, there is some extent a feeling of the plastic texture of this. The patterning comes through OK - but it really is quite an uninteresting shot I''m afraid.</td>', 'Despite the very ropey focussing, and odd colouring, there is some extent a feeling of the plastic texture of this. The patterning comes through OK - but it really is quite an uninteresting shot I''m afraid.', '2004-02-19 09:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587757, 60832, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good sense of the sensation of freshly laundered cloth. Fine portraiture, but perhaps more interesting to the child''s relatives than to me. I can imagine the aunts cooing from here. 6</td>', 'Good sense of the sensation of freshly laundered cloth. Fine portraiture, but perhaps more interesting to the child''s relatives than to me. I can imagine the aunts cooing from here. 6', '2004-02-19 09:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587759, 60947, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neat approach - interesting to take the idea of touch in this way, as wellas to communicate the feel of metal (?), or perhaps laquered wood as well as you have photographically. A very coherent, balanced photograph. Detailing is excellent, and the tonality brings the focus to the fel of the subject very well.</td>', 'Neat approach - interesting to take the idea of touch in this way, as wellas to communicate the feel of metal (?), or perhaps laquered wood as well as you have photographically. A very coherent, balanced photograph. Detailing is excellent, and the tonality brings the focus to the fel of the subject very well.', '2004-02-19 09:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(587761, 60916, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great tones here. Sufficient space for the eye to wander through the frame, and never loses the attention. Even with what appears to be quite direct lighting, your contrast work and colour has presented a great feel of these things.</td>', 'Great tones here. Sufficient space for the eye to wander through the frame, and never loses the attention. Even with what appears to be quite direct lighting, your contrast work and colour has presented a great feel of these things.', '2004-02-19 09:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(587763, 60993, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost ... the light is perhaps a shade or two too general to really communicate the feel here - I don;t think you''ve made quite enough of the variations in the surface - perhaps a lower angle still to the surface of the leaf would bring out the feel more. Good detailing though.</td>', 'Almost ... the light is perhaps a shade or two too general to really communicate the feel here - I don;t think you''ve made quite enough of the variations in the surface - perhaps a lower angle still to the surface of the leaf would bring out the feel more. Good detailing though.', '2004-02-19 09:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(587767, 60780, 6999, '<td valign="top">There was another one of these recently, was there not? Was that you too? Intriguing view, though doesn''t have a great deal to do with texture to me, ertainly not as in feel. An interesting perspective though.</td>', 'There was another one of these recently, was there not? Was that you too? Intriguing view, though doesn''t have a great deal to do with texture to me, ertainly not as in feel. An interesting perspective though.', '2004-02-19 09:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
