(587807, 60705, 14620, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this is a little dark which I think tends to make it lose some of it''s textures.  It is an interesting subject that I think just a little more light would''ve helped.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this is a little dark which I think tends to make it lose some of it''s textures.  It is an interesting subject that I think just a little more light would''ve helped.', '2004-02-19 10:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
