(587809, 60833, 15295, '<td valign="top">This is the type of picture my wife told me to take.  And I didn''t...good thing because it wouldn''t have come out this good.  Meet the challenge dead on.  Good use of lighting to focus on your beard.</td>', 'This is the type of picture my wife told me to take.  And I didn''t...good thing because it wouldn''t have come out this good.  Meet the challenge dead on.  Good use of lighting to focus on your beard.', '2004-02-19 10:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(587813, 61139, 14221, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this.  Focus could be sharper to show more of the textures.  Also, on my monitor it looks a little too red. You could try lowering the saturation in the Red channel, and adjusting Hue to get a more natural color, unless the redness was your intent.</td>', 'I like the composition on this.  Focus could be sharper to show more of the textures.  Also, on my monitor it looks a little too red. You could try lowering the saturation in the Red channel, and adjusting Hue to get a more natural color, unless the redness was your intent.', '2004-02-19 10:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(587814, 60821, 15295, '<td valign="top">Ah come on, you could''ve come up with something if you had time to shoot this.  No excuses!  hehehehehe</td>', 'Ah come on, you could''ve come up with something if you had time to shoot this.  No excuses!  hehehehehe', '2004-02-19 10:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
