(587823, 60817, 15295, '<td valign="top">I think it meets the challenge but I don''t know because it not a close up of the fur.  But this is a very nice picture and since it grabbed my attention I am giving you a 7.</td>', 'I think it meets the challenge but I don''t know because it not a close up of the fur.  But this is a very nice picture and since it grabbed my attention I am giving you a 7.', '2004-02-19 10:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(587824, 60108, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great shot, good lighting. What I like the most about this shot is that you can''t tell how large these things are. They look like big haystacks (?) but are probably tiny cerial pieces. Good job, suits the challenge well as well.</td>', 'Great shot, good lighting. What I like the most about this shot is that you can''t tell how large these things are. They look like big haystacks (?) but are probably tiny cerial pieces. Good job, suits the challenge well as well.', '2004-02-19 10:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(587825, 61153, 15295, '<td valign="top">Very original, great job.</td>', 'Very original, great job.', '2004-02-19 10:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(587826, 61071, 15295, '<td valign="top">Strwberries and Rice?  Never seen that before, but it is a good way to bring out the color of the strawberries.  I feel the texture, nice shot!</td>', 'Strwberries and Rice?  Never seen that before, but it is a good way to bring out the color of the strawberries.  I feel the texture, nice shot!', '2004-02-19 10:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(587827, 60372, 15295, '<td valign="top">Out of focus and boring.  Nice try though.</td>', 'Out of focus and boring.  Nice try though.', '2004-02-19 10:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(587830, 61145, 15295, '<td valign="top">Are you trying to show the texture of the wrapper or the chocolate?  I would go with the wrapper but who am I.  Nice shot none the less.</td>', 'Are you trying to show the texture of the wrapper or the chocolate?  I would go with the wrapper but who am I.  Nice shot none the less.', '2004-02-19 10:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(587831, 60787, 7543, '<td valign="top">Strange crop, just between a close crop and a wide one, not for my taste at least. Maybe it would be better to focus on the top of the toast to get the texture "out of it". Good DOF.</td>', 'Strange crop, just between a close crop and a wide one, not for my taste at least. Maybe it would be better to focus on the top of the toast to get the texture "out of it". Good DOF.', '2004-02-19 10:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(587833, 60988, 15295, '<td valign="top">NIce, really nice.</td>', 'NIce, really nice.', '2004-02-19 10:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(587834, 60158, 15295, '<td valign="top">Dag, now that is messed up that you live somewhere that cold.  I feel you though because I am in Chicago and it has been very cold lately.  Nice shot...I am going to put on my coat now...brrrr!</td>', 'Dag, now that is messed up that you live somewhere that cold.  I feel you though because I am in Chicago and it has been very cold lately.  Nice shot...I am going to put on my coat now...brrrr!', '2004-02-19 10:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(587835, 60982, 6999, '<td valign="top">There is some sense of a variety of textures here, though I don''t know that they''re actually shown rather than just emphasised by the familiarity of these things. Composition is static - nowhere for the eye to wander around the frame, and it seems an odd choice, with this set-up, to place the orange so centrally.</td>', 'There is some sense of a variety of textures here, though I don''t know that they''re actually shown rather than just emphasised by the familiarity of these things. Composition is static - nowhere for the eye to wander around the frame, and it seems an odd choice, with this set-up, to place the orange so centrally.', '2004-02-19 10:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(587836, 60795, 16850, '<td valign="top">surrealistic, like it a lot especially combined with the wood. Very nice.</td>', 'surrealistic, like it a lot especially combined with the wood. Very nice.', '2004-02-19 10:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(587837, 60756, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field keeps texture going throughout pic.</td>', 'Nice depth of field keeps texture going throughout pic.', '2004-02-19 10:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(587838, 60803, 15295, '<td valign="top">Texture on the wall is visible...but is that what you were trying to show?</td>', 'Texture on the wall is visible...but is that what you were trying to show?', '2004-02-19 10:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(587839, 59907, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lacks much real sense of texture for me: as a rhythmic composition it has good points, especially your colour rendition - but I get no impression of roughness or smoothness from this.</td>', 'Lacks much real sense of texture for me: as a rhythmic composition it has good points, especially your colour rendition - but I get no impression of roughness or smoothness from this.', '2004-02-19 10:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(587840, 60762, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...I would''ve focused on the bubles to make them very sharp.  6</td>', 'Nice shot...I would''ve focused on the bubles to make them very sharp.  6', '2004-02-19 10:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(587842, 60210, 15295, '<td valign="top">Texture????  Focus on the hair on the hand, the texture of the guitar string, the texture of the shirt, the jacket, but to put it all in the picture turns this into a snap shot.</td>', 'Texture????  Focus on the hair on the hand, the texture of the guitar string, the texture of the shirt, the jacket, but to put it all in the picture turns this into a snap shot.', '2004-02-19 10:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(587845, 59933, 15295, '<td valign="top">I would''ve cropped the white out and only show the face.  Just MHO!</td>', 'I would''ve cropped the white out and only show the face.  Just MHO!', '2004-02-19 10:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(587846, 60488, 15295, '<td valign="top">Texture all over the place!  Nice!</td>', 'Texture all over the place!  Nice!', '2004-02-19 10:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(587847, 59912, 6999, '<td valign="top">If only there were a touch more interest at the point of focus - perhaps a spoon or something, just to break up the unrelenting similarity of this - even the background tones very closely with the rice. Not really enough detail to capture the texture of that rice where its in focus, even though sharpness seems ok.</td>', 'If only there were a touch more interest at the point of focus - perhaps a spoon or something, just to break up the unrelenting similarity of this - even the background tones very closely with the rice. Not really enough detail to capture the texture of that rice where its in focus, even though sharpness seems ok.', '2004-02-19 10:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(587848, 60124, 17228, '<td valign="top">Lots to look at, maybe TOO much in fact. Eyes bouncing around pic, looking for somewhere to rest my attention on.</td>', 'Lots to look at, maybe TOO much in fact. Eyes bouncing around pic, looking for somewhere to rest my attention on.', '2004-02-19 10:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(587850, 61058, 15295, '<td valign="top">This looks like one of the three rope pictures submitted in the last textures challenge.  Unoriginal, I would''ve tried a different approach with the rope to make it my own.</td>', 'This looks like one of the three rope pictures submitted in the last textures challenge.  Unoriginal, I would''ve tried a different approach with the rope to make it my own.', '2004-02-19 10:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(587854, 60439, 15295, '<td valign="top">I think you should''ve made this picture bigger, but I won''t dock you for that.</td>', 'I think you should''ve made this picture bigger, but I won''t dock you for that.', '2004-02-19 10:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587857, 61144, 16850, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. I find the zipper distracting tho.</td>', 'Nice concept. I find the zipper distracting tho.', '2004-02-19 10:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(587860, 60747, 6999, '<td valign="top">No sense of a point fo focus in this, for me. The very shallow dof works against the image a little - I think just a touch more depth might have given the eye somehwere to dwell, for at least a while. The metallicness of the metalwork is fine, but I''d love to see some sense of the texture of the roller surfaces too. Not a bad use of mono though.</td>', 'No sense of a point fo focus in this, for me. The very shallow dof works against the image a little - I think just a touch more depth might have given the eye somehwere to dwell, for at least a while. The metallicness of the metalwork is fine, but I''d love to see some sense of the texture of the roller surfaces too. Not a bad use of mono though.', '2004-02-19 10:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(587861, 60721, 15295, '<td valign="top">The sun really help you get a way with this picture.  Without the sun I would''ve complained that you shold''ve gotten closer to show the texture.  But it works, good job.</td>', 'The sun really help you get a way with this picture.  Without the sun I would''ve complained that you shold''ve gotten closer to show the texture.  But it works, good job.', '2004-02-19 10:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(587864, 61125, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the color bothers me a little bit, but to each is own.  I won''t dock you for that.</td>', 'Nice idea, the color bothers me a little bit, but to each is own.  I won''t dock you for that.', '2004-02-19 10:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(587865, 60832, 16850, '<td valign="top">A bit flat for me.</td>', 'A bit flat for me.', '2004-02-19 10:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(587866, 61110, 15295, '<td valign="top">I see the patterns but I don''t see the texture.</td>', 'I see the patterns but I don''t see the texture.', '2004-02-19 10:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(587867, 61114, 15295, '<td valign="top">really nice shot.</td>', 'really nice shot.', '2004-02-19 10:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(587869, 59895, 15295, '<td valign="top">I really like the b&amp;w.  Nice shot, this should do really well.</td>', 'I really like the b&w.  Nice shot, this should do really well.', '2004-02-19 10:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(587871, 60842, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh - very peculiar. Good contrast of the metal of the screw and the softness of the bread, both of which textures you''ve really brought out here. The rest of teh pastry seems superfluous to the image, and just serves to crowd that moment with the screw, and a shame you couldn''t have edited that background to black and got rid of some of those crumbs - certainly in dpc terms, but also they serve to make the composition look huried, and suggest that not enough care has been taken woth the presentation.</td>', 'Oh - very peculiar. Good contrast of the metal of the screw and the softness of the bread, both of which textures you''ve really brought out here. The rest of teh pastry seems superfluous to the image, and just serves to crowd that moment with the screw, and a shame you couldn''t have edited that background to black and got rid of some of those crumbs - certainly in dpc terms, but also they serve to make the composition look huried, and suggest that not enough care has been taken woth the presentation.', '2004-02-19 10:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(587872, 61070, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nothing to say here...nice shot.</td>', 'Nothing to say here...nice shot.', '2004-02-19 10:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(587875, 60727, 15295, '<td valign="top">Too small, out of focus, good idea, nice light, but the first to points I made is what really hurt you.</td>', 'Too small, out of focus, good idea, nice light, but the first to points I made is what really hurt you.', '2004-02-19 10:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(587876, 60932, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very nice execution of unique idea.</td>', 'Very nice execution of unique idea.', '2004-02-19 10:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(587877, 60925, 15295, '<td valign="top">yum...good use of light...</td>', 'yum...good use of light...', '2004-02-19 10:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(587878, 60963, 16850, '<td valign="top">Nice balance in the composition.</td>', 'Nice balance in the composition.', '2004-02-19 10:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(587879, 60302, 16402, '<td valign="top">For hair, yes. For ribbon, I don''t think so.</td>', 'For hair, yes. For ribbon, I don''t think so.', '2004-02-19 10:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(587880, 60757, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice high-contrast work, and a great sense of plasticity in the capture of the reflections on the leather. The brass grommets on the holes are well exhibited too. Certainly meets the challenge, and should score well, I hope.</td>', 'Nice high-contrast work, and a great sense of plasticity in the capture of the reflections on the leather. The brass grommets on the holes are well exhibited too. Certainly meets the challenge, and should score well, I hope.', '2004-02-19 10:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587882, 60247, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nice b&amp;w, and I like the position of the light, but I wish I could see more of the texture on the rose.  Nice picture to hang on a wall though.</td>', 'Nice b&w, and I like the position of the light, but I wish I could see more of the texture on the rose.  Nice picture to hang on a wall though.', '2004-02-19 10:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(587884, 59997, 17228, '<td valign="top">Dig the pastel color palette. Almost looks like computer art. Holds viewers interest.</td>', 'Dig the pastel color palette. Almost looks like computer art. Holds viewers interest.', '2004-02-19 10:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(587885, 60281, 15295, '<td valign="top">I know the texture is there but it doesn''t jump put at me.</td>', 'I know the texture is there but it doesn''t jump put at me.', '2004-02-19 10:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(587886, 59882, 15295, '<td valign="top">out of focus.  what type of wrapping is this...bubble wrap???</td>', 'out of focus.  what type of wrapping is this...bubble wrap???', '2004-02-19 10:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(587888, 60035, 15295, '<td valign="top">This nice...should place in the top 10.</td>', 'This nice...should place in the top 10.', '2004-02-19 10:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(587889, 59953, 16850, '<td valign="top">too soft for me</td>', 'too soft for me', '2004-02-19 10:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(587890, 60158, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice lines. Good call on the stones in the foreground. The bridge seems to blend in with the sky and dissapears partly. Exp. problems due to large range in lighting, the foreground is perfect, but the after parts of the shot are too dark. Would be a good chance to try blending two exposures in PS if that would be "legal" here. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice lines. Good call on the stones in the foreground. The bridge seems to blend in with the sky and dissapears partly. Exp. problems due to large range in lighting, the foreground is perfect, but the after parts of the shot are too dark. Would be a good chance to try blending two exposures in PS if that would be "legal" here. Good luck.', '2004-02-19 10:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(587891, 59912, 15295, '<td valign="top">I docked for this focus technique.  But I won''t do that to you...nice shot.</td>', 'I docked for this focus technique.  But I won''t do that to you...nice shot.', '2004-02-19 10:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587892, 60957, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite contrasty (a good thing), and good on the colour tones. Detailing seems somewhat squashed - as though this were a near 1:1 magnification off the sensor, which loses some sense of feel in the textures.</td>', 'Quite contrasty (a good thing), and good on the colour tones. Detailing seems somewhat squashed - as though this were a near 1:1 magnification off the sensor, which loses some sense of feel in the textures.', '2004-02-19 10:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(587893, 60815, 15295, '<td valign="top">A bit out of focus...and I don''t feel like it meets the challenge in showing texture.</td>', 'A bit out of focus...and I don''t feel like it meets the challenge in showing texture.', '2004-02-19 10:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(587894, 61153, 15273, '<td valign="top">very cool effect. colors are great.</td>', 'very cool effect. colors are great.', '2004-02-19 10:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(587895, 59845, 15295, '<td valign="top">Fussy, or Fuzzy?  hahaha  Nice shot but I think you should''ve come in closer to really show the roughness or fuzziness of the beard. 7</td>', 'Fussy, or Fuzzy?  hahaha  Nice shot but I think you should''ve come in closer to really show the roughness or fuzziness of the beard. 7', '2004-02-19 10:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(587896, 60767, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, somebody needs to cut those claws!</td>', 'Nice shot, somebody needs to cut those claws!', '2004-02-19 10:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(587897, 60921, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF captures texture over entire subject. B&amp;W certainly helps this pic''s mood.</td>', 'Nice DOF captures texture over entire subject. B&W certainly helps this pic''s mood.', '2004-02-19 10:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(587898, 60338, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I like the way the light helps to show the texture.</td>', 'Nice picture, I like the way the light helps to show the texture.', '2004-02-19 10:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(587899, 60284, 6999, '<td valign="top">Weird - is that desaturation, or is it really grey? Good on the patterning, and the spines of the leaves, but lacking a sense of surface texture.</td>', 'Weird - is that desaturation, or is it really grey? Good on the patterning, and the spines of the leaves, but lacking a sense of surface texture.', '2004-02-19 10:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(587900, 61071, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Lighting and exposure show off strawberry well, and rice was a great choice for a textured background.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Lighting and exposure show off strawberry well, and rice was a great choice for a textured background.', '2004-02-19 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(587905, 60789, 16402, '<td valign="top">Margarine looks great but background is very distracting.</td>', 'Margarine looks great but background is very distracting.', '2004-02-19 10:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(587906, 61037, 17228, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit soft, which doesn''t help reveal subject''s texture here</td>', 'Focus seems a bit soft, which doesn''t help reveal subject''s texture here', '2004-02-19 10:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587907, 61113, 6999, '<td valign="top">aha - a spiky green thing photograph that isn''t as ugly as sin for once. Good capture of the little leaves, as well as of the rough surface beneath. Kind of gives more feeling of reflection than illumination, which I think makes the surface llok harder than perhaps it is, and the very finest level of detail is not quite present - that sense of subtlety that really good lighting brings.</td>', 'aha - a spiky green thing photograph that isn''t as ugly as sin for once. Good capture of the little leaves, as well as of the rough surface beneath. Kind of gives more feeling of reflection than illumination, which I think makes the surface llok harder than perhaps it is, and the very finest level of detail is not quite present - that sense of subtlety that really good lighting brings.', '2004-02-19 10:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587909, 60866, 17228, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see padlock in better focus with greater DOF since your eye is immediately drawn to it.</td>', 'Would have liked to see padlock in better focus with greater DOF since your eye is immediately drawn to it.', '2004-02-19 10:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(587910, 60410, 17228, '<td valign="top">Focus is rather soft throughout, so texture isn''t revealed throughout.</td>', 'Focus is rather soft throughout, so texture isn''t revealed throughout.', '2004-02-19 10:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(587912, 60262, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very good. I think you''ve just allowed some areas of feathers to get away from you in terms of exposure, though tricky when it''s still got its young feathers on its neck. great sense of the furry neck feathers, a touch less successful with the pure white back feathers.Composition is a bit odd - cropped so close to the curve of the neck, and that loop of the neck only bringing the eye to centre of the frame.</td>', 'Very good. I think you''ve just allowed some areas of feathers to get away from you in terms of exposure, though tricky when it''s still got its young feathers on its neck. great sense of the furry neck feathers, a touch less successful with the pure white back feathers.Composition is a bit odd - cropped so close to the curve of the neck, and that loop of the neck only bringing the eye to centre of the frame.', '2004-02-19 10:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(587913, 61151, 16402, '<td valign="top">For most of the texture shots I think B&amp;W is the way to go, but not this one. I think color of wood would have actually added to this.</td>', 'For most of the texture shots I think B&W is the way to go, but not this one. I think color of wood would have actually added to this.', '2004-02-19 10:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(587916, 60929, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intriguing pattern - and shows good understanding of the ideas behind regular and rhythmic compositions such as this - even allowing the handle to break that pattern is  effective. Touch of brightness lower left is amazingly distracting for such a small area, thugh it''s a function of the regularity of the patterning. Get some feeling of plastic from the image, but mutedly so. Nice work.</td>', 'Intriguing pattern - and shows good understanding of the ideas behind regular and rhythmic compositions such as this - even allowing the handle to break that pattern is  effective. Touch of brightness lower left is amazingly distracting for such a small area, thugh it''s a function of the regularity of the patterning. Get some feeling of plastic from the image, but mutedly so. Nice work.', '2004-02-19 10:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(587917, 60874, 6999, '<td valign="top">You seem out fo control of the lighting, and the placing of the subject is poor - is that a shoe in the background? Don''t find the graphical structure of this very intersting at all, seems rather confused as to where the lines want ot be in the image.</td>', 'You seem out fo control of the lighting, and the placing of the subject is poor - is that a shoe in the background? Don''t find the graphical structure of this very intersting at all, seems rather confused as to where the lines want ot be in the image.', '2004-02-19 10:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(587920, 60994, 14221, '<td valign="top">This has an almost 3D effect.  Good Job.  There is a slight overexposure in the highlights, but the overall effect is still very good.</td>', 'This has an almost 3D effect.  Good Job.  There is a slight overexposure in the highlights, but the overall effect is still very good.', '2004-02-19 10:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(587921, 60924, 16850, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and great composition. I''d like to see more sidelight</td>', 'Nice concept and great composition. I''d like to see more sidelight', '2004-02-19 10:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(587922, 61120, 6999, '<td valign="top">What? Don''t understand. Help. Very small pic. Contrast is quite extreme, and loses a lot of the surface qualities that might bring this into the challenge. Can''t see the point ...</td>', 'What? Don''t understand. Help. Very small pic. Contrast is quite extreme, and loses a lot of the surface qualities that might bring this into the challenge. Can''t see the point ...', '2004-02-19 10:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(587924, 60039, 16850, '<td valign="top">lighting is distracting</td>', 'lighting is distracting', '2004-02-19 10:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587925, 60366, 14221, '<td valign="top">The lighting here does a great job capturing the texture.  Good shot.</td>', 'The lighting here does a great job capturing the texture.  Good shot.', '2004-02-19 10:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(587927, 60965, 16850, '<td valign="top">too soft for me</td>', 'too soft for me', '2004-02-19 10:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(587928, 61061, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good. Great sense of plasticity, great sense of tone. the regular composition works very well too: strong graphic element to hold the eye, and a sense of depth to give some relief (in both emotional and topographic meanings). Not perhps something I''d want to buy, but ought to place highly, and technically assured work.</td>', 'Good. Great sense of plasticity, great sense of tone. the regular composition works very well too: strong graphic element to hold the eye, and a sense of depth to give some relief (in both emotional and topographic meanings). Not perhps something I''d want to buy, but ought to place highly, and technically assured work.', '2004-02-19 10:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(587929, 60982, 16402, '<td valign="top">Orange is a little to centered for my taste but a pretty nice shot all in all.</td>', 'Orange is a little to centered for my taste but a pretty nice shot all in all.', '2004-02-19 10:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587930, 60404, 16850, '<td valign="top">Nice texture but the composition escapes me</td>', 'Nice texture but the composition escapes me', '2004-02-19 10:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(587931, 60795, 14221, '<td valign="top">Very creative use of lighting.</td>', 'Very creative use of lighting.', '2004-02-19 10:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(587933, 60069, 6999, '<td valign="top">Poor. Badly over-exposed and dreadfully lit anyway. very small, but even so the quality of the image remains distinctly dodgy. No real sense of feeling at all.</td>', 'Poor. Badly over-exposed and dreadfully lit anyway. very small, but even so the quality of the image remains distinctly dodgy. No real sense of feeling at all.', '2004-02-19 10:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(587935, 60736, 16850, '<td valign="top">my eye keeps falling out</td>', 'my eye keeps falling out', '2004-02-19 10:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(587936, 61053, 16402, '<td valign="top">Relfections are very distracting. If that was an intentional part of the texture, then it is too much competition among focal points to keep my interest.</td>', 'Relfections are very distracting. If that was an intentional part of the texture, then it is too much competition among focal points to keep my interest.', '2004-02-19 10:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(587937, 59908, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good light, and a good capture of a sense of smoothness on the box. Leaving that glass half out of shot seems a poor decision on the face of it, and I can''t see what purpose it serves in compositional terms. Kind of dull subject matter, really: without the text, would there be anything to hold the eye?</td>', 'Good light, and a good capture of a sense of smoothness on the box. Leaving that glass half out of shot seems a poor decision on the face of it, and I can''t see what purpose it serves in compositional terms. Kind of dull subject matter, really: without the text, would there be anything to hold the eye?', '2004-02-19 10:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587938, 60656, 15888, '<td valign="top">Love this picture!!  I am wondering what it is...? Blinds for a window? Anyway, thought it turned out reaaly amazing.</td>', 'Love this picture!!  I am wondering what it is...? Blinds for a window? Anyway, thought it turned out reaaly amazing.', '2004-02-19 10:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(587940, 60753, 16402, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped it tighter.</td>', 'I''d have cropped it tighter.', '2004-02-19 10:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(587943, 60887, 14221, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Good eye, good shot.</td>', 'Great composition.  Good eye, good shot.', '2004-02-19 10:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(587944, 60765, 16850, '<td valign="top">a little too soft for me</td>', 'a little too soft for me', '2004-02-19 10:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(587945, 60706, 6999, '<td valign="top">Damn damn amn I Hate that border -so obtrusive it defies belief! it actually has a negative effect on the photograph, making the blue in the image seem like a bizarre optical illusion due to the border. Very nasty indeed, I''m afraid. Can''t get round it ata ll to look at the picture, I just keep wanting to look away. Sorry.</td>', 'Damn damn amn I Hate that border -so obtrusive it defies belief! it actually has a negative effect on the photograph, making the blue in the image seem like a bizarre optical illusion due to the border. Very nasty indeed, I''m afraid. Can''t get round it ata ll to look at the picture, I just keep wanting to look away. Sorry.', '2004-02-19 10:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(587947, 60858, 14221, '<td valign="top">For this kind of shot to work for me, it has to be well lit with super sharp focus.  Not easy to do.</td>', 'For this kind of shot to work for me, it has to be well lit with super sharp focus.  Not easy to do.', '2004-02-19 10:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(587949, 59885, 14221, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2004-02-19 10:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(587950, 60817, 811, '<td valign="top">My 2yo picked this one out of the page of thumbnails.  He really likes it.  He says it is "soft" so in that respect, I guess you nailed the "texture" part of the challenge.  I like the bw, though it may have been more dramatic if the background was the same color as the feet and ears.  Also, maybe get a little more closer so it is not so centered -- it kinda looks static and non-dynamic.</td>', 'My 2yo picked this one out of the page of thumbnails.  He really likes it.  He says it is "soft" so in that respect, I guess you nailed the "texture" part of the challenge.  I like the bw, though it may have been more dramatic if the background was the same color as the feet and ears.  Also, maybe get a little more closer so it is not so centered -- it kinda looks static and non-dynamic.', '2004-02-19 10:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(587953, 60824, 14221, '<td valign="top">The composition works well here.</td>', 'The composition works well here.', '2004-02-19 10:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(587955, 60439, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot that shows strong texture.  Probably more effective in a larger size.</td>', 'This is a good shot that shows strong texture.  Probably more effective in a larger size.', '2004-02-19 10:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(587957, 60124, 14986, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for this black and white treatment on this one.</td>', 'I don''t care for this black and white treatment on this one.', '2004-02-19 10:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(587959, 60766, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is neat.  Good texture, lighting and tones.  I would have cropped the bottom ever so slightly.</td>', 'This is neat.  Good texture, lighting and tones.  I would have cropped the bottom ever so slightly.', '2004-02-19 10:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(587962, 59845, 14986, '<td valign="top">Lot''s of beard shots to contemplate, but so far I like the lighting and composition of this one the best.  Just not my interest for subject.</td>', 'Lot''s of beard shots to contemplate, but so far I like the lighting and composition of this one the best.  Just not my interest for subject.', '2004-02-19 10:54:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(587964, 60963, 14986, '<td valign="top">Good focus, lighting and texture.  Composition and subject really don''t do anything for me.</td>', 'Good focus, lighting and texture.  Composition and subject really don''t do anything for me.', '2004-02-19 10:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(587966, 60111, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very much like the golden tones to this shot.  Nice texture on both the material and the glass.</td>', 'Very much like the golden tones to this shot.  Nice texture on both the material and the glass.', '2004-02-19 10:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(587967, 60879, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors as well as textures in this shot.  Also has a very nice composition to it.</td>', 'Wonderful colors as well as textures in this shot.  Also has a very nice composition to it.', '2004-02-19 10:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(587969, 61114, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and focus and nice arrangement of shells.  I would have preferred something other than the plain black background, and I think the border detracts.</td>', 'Nice lighting and focus and nice arrangement of shells.  I would have preferred something other than the plain black background, and I think the border detracts.', '2004-02-19 10:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(587971, 60737, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 10:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(587972, 60804, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 10:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(587973, 60933, 14221, '<td valign="top">Love this.  Nice juxtaposition and arrangement.....great lighting. <br/>Hang-on-the-wall,  poster-size quality art.</td>', 'Love this.  Nice juxtaposition and arrangement.....great lighting. Hang-on-the-wall,  poster-size quality art.', '2004-02-19 10:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(587974, 60932, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Fits challenge very well.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Fits challenge very well.', '2004-02-19 10:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(587976, 59935, 14221, '<td valign="top">Wow, excellent. Almost looks computer-generated.  Great job.</td>', 'Wow, excellent. Almost looks computer-generated.  Great job.', '2004-02-19 10:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(587980, 59995, 14221, '<td valign="top">One of the best facial textures shot I''ve seen.  Good job.</td>', 'One of the best facial textures shot I''ve seen.  Good job.', '2004-02-19 11:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(587983, 61152, 14986, '<td valign="top">Really well done.  Nice lighting and composition.  Thoughtfully photographed.</td>', 'Really well done.  Nice lighting and composition.  Thoughtfully photographed.', '2004-02-19 11:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(587984, 60111, 14221, '<td valign="top">Perfect example of smooth.  The lighting here is excellent.</td>', 'Perfect example of smooth.  The lighting here is excellent.', '2004-02-19 11:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(587985, 60273, 14221, '<td valign="top">The lighting really makes this shot.  Nice composition as well.</td>', 'The lighting really makes this shot.  Nice composition as well.', '2004-02-19 11:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(587986, 59914, 14836, '<td valign="top">Great texture.</td>', 'Great texture.', '2004-02-19 11:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(587988, 60789, 14836, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Too bad for the piece of cromb at the top left of the margarine. I know I am overeacting!</td>', 'Very nice. Too bad for the piece of cromb at the top left of the margarine. I know I am overeacting!', '2004-02-19 11:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(587989, 60158, 14986, '<td valign="top">One of the best outdoor shots I''ve seen for this challenge.  I like the perspective and the line of rocks in the foreground.  Maybe just a touch more contrast.</td>', 'One of the best outdoor shots I''ve seen for this challenge.  I like the perspective and the line of rocks in the foreground.  Maybe just a touch more contrast.', '2004-02-19 11:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(587990, 60088, 16402, '<td valign="top">I love the unusual choice of fruit but the DOF is way to limited to most effectively convey the texture. Think I''d have also included more of the hairy peel.</td>', 'I love the unusual choice of fruit but the DOF is way to limited to most effectively convey the texture. Think I''d have also included more of the hairy peel.', '2004-02-19 11:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(587991, 60735, 14836, '<td valign="top">Interesting but maybe too much computerized effect. Would have been great in the color challenge.</td>', 'Interesting but maybe too much computerized effect. Would have been great in the color challenge.', '2004-02-19 11:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(587992, 61127, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice but perhaps a bit dark. More lighting would have emphasize the texture of this orange.</td>', 'Nice but perhaps a bit dark. More lighting would have emphasize the texture of this orange.', '2004-02-19 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(587993, 60021, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice! Very intriging whatever this is !</td>', 'Nice! Very intriging whatever this is !', '2004-02-19 11:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587995, 61134, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice. I think the pattern of the seeds take away from a natural form of texture.</td>', 'Nice. I think the pattern of the seeds take away from a natural form of texture.', '2004-02-19 11:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(587996, 60565, 14836, '<td valign="top">Great focus but perhaps a bit dark. Good idea though.</td>', 'Great focus but perhaps a bit dark. Good idea though.', '2004-02-19 11:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(587998, 61107, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice! A bit out of focus on some areas but still interesting.</td>', 'Nice! A bit out of focus on some areas but still interesting.', '2004-02-19 11:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(588001, 60878, 14836, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this shot has too much negative effect. Very grainy because of that as well.</td>', 'Unfortunately this shot has too much negative effect. Very grainy because of that as well.', '2004-02-19 11:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(588002, 60291, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice but too much onfocused areas.</td>', 'Nice but too much onfocused areas.', '2004-02-19 11:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(588003, 61065, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not a bad go, of its type. Can''t recall ever seeing one of these CD reflection shots doing that well here, which i think is a little odd given the prettiness of those refractions. As an interpretation of texture this takes some knowledge to fit in, and its an approach that I don''t think many others have taken (nor will understand, I fear).</td>', 'Not a bad go, of its type. Can''t recall ever seeing one of these CD reflection shots doing that well here, which i think is a little odd given the prettiness of those refractions. As an interpretation of texture this takes some knowledge to fit in, and its an approach that I don''t think many others have taken (nor will understand, I fear).', '2004-02-19 11:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(588004, 61097, 14836, '<td valign="top">Too bad this shot is so small. I would have gotten closer to the ashes and perhaps less flash. Too much blues and not enough natural colors.</td>', 'Too bad this shot is so small. I would have gotten closer to the ashes and perhaps less flash. Too much blues and not enough natural colors.', '2004-02-19 11:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(588005, 60785, 16402, '<td valign="top">Including the brass snap as an added texture was a great idea.</td>', 'Including the brass snap as an added texture was a great idea.', '2004-02-19 11:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(588006, 60807, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup. More even lighting would have helped.</td>', 'Nice closeup. More even lighting would have helped.', '2004-02-19 11:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(588007, 60791, 14836, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. Great sharpness.</td>', 'Very interesting. Great sharpness.', '2004-02-19 11:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(588008, 60629, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Nice colors</td>', 'Nice shot. Nice colors', '2004-02-19 11:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(588009, 60916, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2004-02-19 11:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(588012, 60379, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2004-02-19 11:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(588013, 60705, 6999, '<td valign="top">Having trouble seeing any detail in this. I hate the plethora of comments about thing being too dark sometimes, but I''ve looked at this under a number of different brighness settings and can''t really get much visible. Those few reflections give quite a strong sense of texture though - of harness, of being cut from stone.</td>', 'Having trouble seeing any detail in this. I hate the plethora of comments about thing being too dark sometimes, but I''ve looked at this under a number of different brighness settings and can''t really get much visible. Those few reflections give quite a strong sense of texture though - of harness, of being cut from stone.', '2004-02-19 11:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(588014, 60829, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2004-02-19 11:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(588015, 61051, 14836, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how this fit the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t know how this fit the challenge.', '2004-02-19 11:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(588016, 60070, 16402, '<td valign="top">I applaud the effort but really don''t find much about this that works. Colors are off, texture is not terribly effident, focus is questionable and reflection (although I''m sure difficult to avoid) is a huge distraction.</td>', 'I applaud the effort but really don''t find much about this that works. Colors are off, texture is not terribly effident, focus is questionable and reflection (although I''m sure difficult to avoid) is a huge distraction.', '2004-02-19 11:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(588019, 60656, 14836, '<td valign="top">Interesting but where is the texture ?</td>', 'Interesting but where is the texture ?', '2004-02-19 11:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(588020, 60795, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 11:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(588021, 61148, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 11:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(588022, 60593, 14836, '<td valign="top">cool! I would have made a macro shot of whatever this is.</td>', 'cool! I would have made a macro shot of whatever this is.', '2004-02-19 11:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(588024, 59833, 6999, '<td valign="top">Won''t comment on the spelling :-) Good illustration of available textures. Especially like the metallic plastic you''ve caught on the surface of the mouse. Well lit (but those two things are pretty much the same really). Doesn''t hold the interst everso long as a photograph however - just perhaps not enough interest in the subject.</td>', 'Won''t comment on the spelling :-) Good illustration of available textures. Especially like the metallic plastic you''ve caught on the surface of the mouse. Well lit (but those two things are pretty much the same really). Doesn''t hold the interst everso long as a photograph however - just perhaps not enough interest in the subject.', '2004-02-19 11:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(588025, 60905, 16402, '<td valign="top">Thank you for including the leaf!</td>', 'Thank you for including the leaf!', '2004-02-19 11:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(588026, 60145, 14836, '<td valign="top">Very nice close up. Should the title have been feather of a bird ? Nice colors. Scored it high.</td>', 'Very nice close up. Should the title have been feather of a bird ? Nice colors. Scored it high.', '2004-02-19 11:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(588028, 61142, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2004-02-19 11:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(588029, 60457, 6999, '<td valign="top">Tonally quite good, and good definition within the field of focus. A shame you''ve had to include so very much of that badly blown out sky to get that, as that area holds so mich attention, perhaps due to the interaction of those colours.</td>', 'Tonally quite good, and good definition within the field of focus. A shame you''ve had to include so very much of that badly blown out sky to get that, as that area holds so mich attention, perhaps due to the interaction of those colours.', '2004-02-19 11:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(588030, 59910, 16402, '<td valign="top">Absolutely excellent. Interesting combination of textures, great idea. Could have had a bit more DOF for me, but still one of my favorites for this theme.</td>', 'Absolutely excellent. Interesting combination of textures, great idea. Could have had a bit more DOF for me, but still one of my favorites for this theme.', '2004-02-19 11:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(588034, 60978, 6999, '<td valign="top">Sparkling effect of direct light (flash?) is quite pretty, and gives a sense of shininess, but I think the addition of some kind of side-light would add a sense of depth and therefore a more convincing sense of texture. Good rhythmic composition, no distractions.</td>', 'Sparkling effect of direct light (flash?) is quite pretty, and gives a sense of shininess, but I think the addition of some kind of side-light would add a sense of depth and therefore a more convincing sense of texture. Good rhythmic composition, no distractions.', '2004-02-19 11:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(588036, 61105, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 11:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(588037, 60068, 14986, '<td valign="top">Actually, I would have liked this better without the thorns.  Nicely photographed, though.</td>', 'Actually, I would have liked this better without the thorns.  Nicely photographed, though.', '2004-02-19 11:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(588038, 61049, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 11:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(588039, 59958, 11467, '<td valign="top">A little crooked at the bottom. Subject is a little uninteresting.</td>', 'A little crooked at the bottom. Subject is a little uninteresting.', '2004-02-19 11:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(588040, 60265, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.  It''s also very small and hard to see.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.  It''s also very small and hard to see.', '2004-02-19 11:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(588044, 60812, 16850, '<td valign="top">lost in the frame</td>', 'lost in the frame', '2004-02-19 11:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(588045, 60404, 11467, '<td valign="top">Several similar images in this challenge. Texture is very clear, composition also appealing.</td>', 'Several similar images in this challenge. Texture is very clear, composition also appealing.', '2004-02-19 11:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(588046, 60824, 11467, '<td valign="top">Very nice. <br/>Composition, colour &amp; focus are great!</td>', 'Very nice. Composition, colour & focus are great!', '2004-02-19 11:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(588049, 61101, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, lighting &amp; focus.</td>', 'Nice composition, lighting & focus.', '2004-02-19 11:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(588050, 60795, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think this has been a little oversharpened which gives it an unnatural look</td>', 'I think this has been a little oversharpened which gives it an unnatural look', '2004-02-19 11:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(588053, 61128, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent work with lighting, really evinces the textures here. Compositionally a bit odd - placing that leg dead centre upsets the blance of the image, and makes the other leg look like it got in the way, rather than featuring it.</td>', 'Excellent work with lighting, really evinces the textures here. Compositionally a bit odd - placing that leg dead centre upsets the blance of the image, and makes the other leg look like it got in the way, rather than featuring it.', '2004-02-19 11:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(588056, 60132, 11467, '<td valign="top">A little dull in colour &amp; composition, therefore probably won''t do too well</td>', 'A little dull in colour & composition, therefore probably won''t do too well', '2004-02-19 11:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(588057, 60102, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern, little sense of surface texture. I think you''ve lost too much fine detail for that reeally to show through.</td>', 'Interesting pattern, little sense of surface texture. I think you''ve lost too much fine detail for that reeally to show through.', '2004-02-19 11:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(588061, 61129, 16850, '<td valign="top">Nice. Needs an eye stopper tho.</td>', 'Nice. Needs an eye stopper tho.', '2004-02-19 11:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(588062, 59997, 11467, '<td valign="top">Definitley intergalactic!!<br/>Maybe a little over brightened, but the colours, composition &amp; focus are good. Whatever it is.</td>', 'Definitley intergalactic!!Maybe a little over brightened, but the colours, composition & focus are good. Whatever it is.', '2004-02-19 11:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(588063, 60734, 7263, '<td valign="top">Nice low light and shadows. Can''t see whay you''ve kept the top right corner as it is - kind of ruins the pattern. But good pic nevertheless.</td>', 'Nice low light and shadows. Can''t see whay you''ve kept the top right corner as it is - kind of ruins the pattern. But good pic nevertheless.', '2004-02-19 11:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(588064, 60129, 11467, '<td valign="top">Great colours &amp; texture depicted here</td>', 'Great colours & texture depicted here', '2004-02-19 11:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(588068, 60769, 16850, '<td valign="top">focus is too soft for me.</td>', 'focus is too soft for me.', '2004-02-19 11:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(588069, 60039, 11467, '<td valign="top">Texture on the focused area of the cloth distracts a bit. But looks like a delicious photo</td>', 'Texture on the focused area of the cloth distracts a bit. But looks like a delicious photo', '2004-02-19 11:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(588070, 61114, 7263, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures - bit of a pink cast going on it seems - but doesn''t seem to bad really, but the border is dire. Sorry<br/> <br/></td>', 'Interesting textures - bit of a pink cast going on it seems - but doesn''t seem to bad really, but the border is dire. Sorry ', '2004-02-19 11:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(588074, 60768, 7263, '<td valign="top">Oh how I love subdued colors. Never see it on DPC really. Great DOF too really draws ones eye to hers. 10<br/></td>', 'Oh how I love subdued colors. Never see it on DPC really. Great DOF too really draws ones eye to hers. 10', '2004-02-19 11:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(588076, 60009, 16850, '<td valign="top">A ''pile of'' photo well done!</td>', 'A ''pile of'' photo well done!', '2004-02-19 11:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(588078, 60894, 7263, '<td valign="top">Very swish and smooth. Looks like Tower bridge in the reflection? 10 as so crisp and clean I just want to grab it.</td>', 'Very swish and smooth. Looks like Tower bridge in the reflection? 10 as so crisp and clean I just want to grab it.', '2004-02-19 11:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(588079, 60767, 6999, '<td valign="top">Seems to lack the detail needed to really communicate a sense of feeling. Quite possibly that is because of the light - there just isn''t that progression of light and shade needed to produce texture in images.</td>', 'Seems to lack the detail needed to really communicate a sense of feeling. Quite possibly that is because of the light - there just isn''t that progression of light and shade needed to produce texture in images.', '2004-02-19 11:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(588080, 61125, 11467, '<td valign="top">Colour seems a bit unnaturally bright making the image look unreal. If the feather already was that colour, then my appologies</td>', 'Colour seems a bit unnaturally bright making the image look unreal. If the feather already was that colour, then my appologies', '2004-02-19 11:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(588081, 60808, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt here.  I would have composed it with the fish not being centered and used a fill flash to knock off some of those shadows a bit.</td>', 'Nice attempt here.  I would have composed it with the fish not being centered and used a fill flash to knock off some of those shadows a bit.', '2004-02-19 11:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(588083, 60241, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is freaky.  Good lighting and focus.  Texture is there.</td>', 'This is freaky.  Good lighting and focus.  Texture is there.', '2004-02-19 11:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(588084, 60144, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 11:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(588085, 59903, 14986, '<td valign="top">I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.</td>', 'I see the texture, but the subject and composition just don''t hold my interest.', '2004-02-19 11:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(588086, 61058, 7263, '<td valign="top">Rope is a texture cliche IMHO - seen it so many times and quite boring to photograph.</td>', 'Rope is a texture cliche IMHO - seen it so many times and quite boring to photograph.', '2004-02-19 11:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(588088, 60808, 6999, '<td valign="top">What a find - and an ugly looking little thing too. Centred composition shows a lack of consideration in framing the shot - in fact has a real snapshot feel. Why exclude the range of rocks behind? Why not use the sea as a backdrop to it? Very intersting object, but quite poorly photographed.</td>', 'What a find - and an ugly looking little thing too. Centred composition shows a lack of consideration in framing the shot - in fact has a real snapshot feel. Why exclude the range of rocks behind? Why not use the sea as a backdrop to it? Very intersting object, but quite poorly photographed.', '2004-02-19 11:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(588089, 60433, 7263, '<td valign="top">too much empty messy space around the bird. Good bird capture though.</td>', 'too much empty messy space around the bird. Good bird capture though.', '2004-02-19 11:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(588091, 59833, 7263, '<td valign="top">think a smoother flooring would be more apt, but see why u used rough..</td>', 'think a smoother flooring would be more apt, but see why u used rough..', '2004-02-19 11:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(588092, 60160, 16850, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. Not sure about the soft eyes.</td>', 'Nice concept. Not sure about the soft eyes.', '2004-02-19 11:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(588093, 60248, 7263, '<td valign="top">good texture but the composition coming from the top seems akward.</td>', 'good texture but the composition coming from the top seems akward.', '2004-02-19 11:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(588094, 59851, 11467, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit small so difficult to see clearly.</td>', 'Image is a bit small so difficult to see clearly.', '2004-02-19 11:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(588095, 60879, 16850, '<td valign="top">Outstanding</td>', 'Outstanding', '2004-02-19 11:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
