(588576, 60934, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like how you''ve tried to use a unique perspective.  not many people do.  however, i am not totally sold on it in this picture because of the very strong horizon, and the imbalence it creates having it tilted.  if the horizon wasn''t so defined i would be all for the tilt.</td>', 'i really like how you''ve tried to use a unique perspective.  not many people do.  however, i am not totally sold on it in this picture because of the very strong horizon, and the imbalence it creates having it tilted.  if the horizon wasn''t so defined i would be all for the tilt.', '2004-02-19 15:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(588582, 60808, 259, '<td valign="top">talk about anti-DPCish.  interesting find and a nice bold move by posting it.</td>', 'talk about anti-DPCish.  interesting find and a nice bold move by posting it.', '2004-02-19 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
