(588639, 61086, 12654, '<td valign="top">Errr.............<br/>Its a nice picture ...<br/>But - there is no texture to be seen, the petals are out of focus and there is some noise in the picture - possibly due to high ISO.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Errr.............Its a nice picture ...But - there is no texture to be seen, the petals are out of focus and there is some noise in the picture - possibly due to high ISO. ', '2004-02-19 15:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(588641, 60850, 6999, '<td valign="top">Little real sense of texture here: the light source is close to the line of shot that there is almost no chance for any meaningful depth of shadows to form on the subject - and it''s those shadows thrown across a subject, by lighting from the side, or towards the rear, that allow the eye to percieve texture. A shame, as there are good compositional elements here, that strong line across the frame, and your control of exposure is very assured.</td>', 'Little real sense of texture here: the light source is close to the line of shot that there is almost no chance for any meaningful depth of shadows to form on the subject - and it''s those shadows thrown across a subject, by lighting from the side, or towards the rear, that allow the eye to percieve texture. A shame, as there are good compositional elements here, that strong line across the frame, and your control of exposure is very assured.', '2004-02-19 15:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(588642, 60789, 10918, '<td valign="top">Get closer, a lot closer!</td>', 'Get closer, a lot closer!', '2004-02-19 15:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
