(588646, 61132, 12654, '<td valign="top">I think if you had put the popcorn in a bowl, put some butter on them and taken a close up of the popcorn - it would have created a better texture effect.<br/></td>', 'I think if you had put the popcorn in a bowl, put some butter on them and taken a close up of the popcorn - it would have created a better texture effect.', '2004-02-19 15:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
