(588685, 59938, 6999, '<td valign="top">Tonally, and technically in terms of detail, faultless. my first reaction was to wish you hadn''t included the bunrt-out sky, and then to think how you might have avoided it ... couldn''t say, but just ''cos it couldn''t be helped doesn''t mean it''s good. Still, the rest of the image is excellent, love the movement from colour to reflected light as the eye follows around the stack.</td>', 'Tonally, and technically in terms of detail, faultless. my first reaction was to wish you hadn''t included the bunrt-out sky, and then to think how you might have avoided it ... couldn''t say, but just ''cos it couldn''t be helped doesn''t mean it''s good. Still, the rest of the image is excellent, love the movement from colour to reflected light as the eye follows around the stack.', '2004-02-19 15:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(588686, 60780, 5891, '<td valign="top">best concept  in the comp</td>', 'best concept  in the comp', '2004-02-19 15:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(588687, 59861, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, detail, but falling into the trap of only showing us texture - despite the vibrancy of the colours, and the striations here, and the technically assured work, I feel it lacks a spark of interest.</td>', 'Good exposure, detail, but falling into the trap of only showing us texture - despite the vibrancy of the colours, and the striations here, and the technically assured work, I feel it lacks a spark of interest.', '2004-02-19 16:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
