(588698, 60858, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully controlled lighting and exposure - not losing the brightness of the subject, yet without that glare so very common in these shots. Very slight drift of focus to the left of frame I think, just doesn''t have quite the sparkling sharpness of the other.</td>', 'Wonderfully controlled lighting and exposure - not losing the brightness of the subject, yet without that glare so very common in these shots. Very slight drift of focus to the left of frame I think, just doesn''t have quite the sparkling sharpness of the other.', '2004-02-19 16:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
