(588775, 60098, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Deth of field can''t quite cope with the shot as you have it set here - this kind of hyper-focal shot I think requires the use of manual focussing really. Good texture on the nearer wall, a touch too dim and just beyond the focal plane on the farther one.</td>', 'Interesting. Deth of field can''t quite cope with the shot as you have it set here - this kind of hyper-focal shot I think requires the use of manual focussing really. Good texture on the nearer wall, a touch too dim and just beyond the focal plane on the farther one.', '2004-02-19 16:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
