(588839, 60880, 6999, '<td valign="top">This appears quite indistinct - not simply because of the very shallow depth of field bt more because that area within the focal plane doesn''t have the quality of light needed to really show the texture. There are areas where the feel ought to be evident, but the distinction between those and the more out of focus areas is small.</td>', 'This appears quite indistinct - not simply because of the very shallow depth of field bt more because that area within the focal plane doesn''t have the quality of light needed to really show the texture. There are areas where the feel ought to be evident, but the distinction between those and the more out of focus areas is small.', '2004-02-19 16:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(588844, 60458, 14045, '<td valign="top">looks like something you can bust your nuckles on</td>', 'looks like something you can bust your nuckles on', '2004-02-19 17:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(588847, 61020, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good showing of the surface of the water, but the reflections and the presence of that stalk kind of let the thing down - I think perhaps you''ve fallen between two stools somehow - it''s neither a shot of reflections nor purely of the patterns formed by water. Well exposed though, and with good detail.</td>', 'Good showing of the surface of the water, but the reflections and the presence of that stalk kind of let the thing down - I think perhaps you''ve fallen between two stools somehow - it''s neither a shot of reflections nor purely of the patterns formed by water. Well exposed though, and with good detail.', '2004-02-19 17:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(588854, 60832, 259, '<td valign="top">one of the best shots this week.</td>', 'one of the best shots this week.', '2004-02-19 17:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(588856, 61087, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very obscure - though likeable enough, in its way. I like the impressionistic, wind-blown quality, but it''s hard to see it as a portrayal of a quality of texture - more of the quality of the lightness of a feather (in which approach, it''s really rather good). 5</td>', 'Very obscure - though likeable enough, in its way. I like the impressionistic, wind-blown quality, but it''s hard to see it as a portrayal of a quality of texture - more of the quality of the lightness of a feather (in which approach, it''s really rather good). 5', '2004-02-19 17:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(588872, 60914, 6999, '<td valign="top">Rather good this. Great sense of texture, great depth, beautiful progression of light. Feels a touch not straight, to me: may simply be an optical illusion from the curve of the banding: looking at the very top of the thing though, that impression is reinforced. Fairly minor point though. Best so far.</td>', 'Rather good this. Great sense of texture, great depth, beautiful progression of light. Feels a touch not straight, to me: may simply be an optical illusion from the curve of the banding: looking at the very top of the thing though, that impression is reinforced. Fairly minor point though. Best so far.', '2004-02-19 17:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(588877, 60248, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good. Very high-tech image, the background serves to re-infoce that. Good smoothness, and great feel in all areas. Neat work.</td>', 'Good. Very high-tech image, the background serves to re-infoce that. Good smoothness, and great feel in all areas. Neat work.', '2004-02-19 17:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(588887, 61089, 6999, '<td valign="top">Cool image, but I only see this as texture with a real stretch - even a lot of leeway won''t get it there. I suppose there''''s a sensation of seeing the representation of texture, but that''s not really a philosophical place I want to go.</td>', 'Cool image, but I only see this as texture with a real stretch - even a lot of leeway won''t get it there. I suppose there''''s a sensation of seeing the representation of texture, but that''s not really a philosophical place I want to go.', '2004-02-19 17:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(588889, 60932, 17503, '<td valign="top">great macro shot</td>', 'great macro shot', '2004-02-19 17:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(588895, 61010, 259, '<td valign="top">clean and simple.  i like it.</td>', 'clean and simple.  i like it.', '2004-02-19 17:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
