(589211, 59938, 14476, '<td valign="top">Each of the rust pieces in this Challenge has its own personality and each, so far, has been well done.  This is no exception.  It might have been fun to try different exposures to see if a tad darker one would  have been interesting.  Nevertheless, you photographed a pleasant composition.</td>', 'Each of the rust pieces in this Challenge has its own personality and each, so far, has been well done.  This is no exception.  It might have been fun to try different exposures to see if a tad darker one would  have been interesting.  Nevertheless, you photographed a pleasant composition.', '2004-02-19 20:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
