(589216, 60039, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well, you have the chocolate vote, of course.  Nicely, composed,  photographed, with great colors.  And you undoubtedly had a feast later (and with the rejects) 8</td>', 'Well, you have the chocolate vote, of course.  Nicely, composed,  photographed, with great colors.  And you undoubtedly had a feast later (and with the rejects) 8', '2004-02-19 20:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
