(589219, 60768, 14614, '<td valign="top">delightful expression and nice lighting.  To make this solid image better, I''d like to see the fuzzy stuff cropped out of the foreground</td>', 'delightful expression and nice lighting.  To make this solid image better, I''d like to see the fuzzy stuff cropped out of the foreground', '2004-02-19 20:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
