(589230, 60160, 14476, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, very nice photograph.  The knitted cap and scarf are perfect for this little one.   I know it must have been a deliberate decision to have the child''s eyes out of focus in the frame, but I wish you''d gone the other way.  The little mischievious eyes would have put the Wow in this picture!</td>', 'Ohhh, very nice photograph.  The knitted cap and scarf are perfect for this little one.   I know it must have been a deliberate decision to have the child''s eyes out of focus in the frame, but I wish you''d gone the other way.  The little mischievious eyes would have put the Wow in this picture!', '2004-02-19 20:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(589232, 60068, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice use of the thorns to frame out in interesting aspect of your composition.  To make this solid image a bit better, I''d like to see the foreground in crisp focus (since thorns are in your title)</td>', 'nice use of the thorns to frame out in interesting aspect of your composition.  To make this solid image a bit better, I''d like to see the foreground in crisp focus (since thorns are in your title)', '2004-02-19 20:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(589233, 60580, 14476, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a good job with this.  I find the story in the excellent brickwork and the greenery.  The highly lit shield seems to take interest away from the textural theme and (picky, ,picky, that blue sky in the upper right should go away)  Nevertheless, in my opinion you did an above average job on this nice photo.</td>', 'You''ve done a good job with this.  I find the story in the excellent brickwork and the greenery.  The highly lit shield seems to take interest away from the textural theme and (picky, ,picky, that blue sky in the upper right should go away)  Nevertheless, in my opinion you did an above average job on this nice photo.', '2004-02-19 20:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(589234, 59914, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a very good take on the texture category.  The image is quite sharp with interesting patterns.  It might have more excitement if you could introduce a contrasting shape or color to keep the viewer in the picture.</td>', 'This is a very good take on the texture category.  The image is quite sharp with interesting patterns.  It might have more excitement if you could introduce a contrasting shape or color to keep the viewer in the picture.', '2004-02-19 20:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
