(589237, 60769, 14476, '<td valign="top">You''ve added something new with these good renditions of oil or acrylic paints.  It might add some excitement to the composition if you blended them more (on the order of the yellow/blue mix in the upper right.  Or in some other way tied the composition together.  But it is fun to see the two artforms in action together.  Good.</td>', 'You''ve added something new with these good renditions of oil or acrylic paints.  It might add some excitement to the composition if you blended them more (on the order of the yellow/blue mix in the upper right.  Or in some other way tied the composition together.  But it is fun to see the two artforms in action together.  Good.', '2004-02-19 21:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(589240, 60366, 14476, '<td valign="top">Your walnut piece is beautifully photographed.  If you could have introduced another shape or color contrast to add interest it could really zing.  Nevertheless, you did a creditable job.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Your walnut piece is beautifully photographed.  If you could have introduced another shape or color contrast to add interest it could really zing.  Nevertheless, you did a creditable job.  Nicely done.', '2004-02-19 21:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
