(589246, 60855, 14476, '<td valign="top">You know it is lichen and I know it''s lichen, but it might be tough for someone to tell that without a rock or whatever formation this is growing on for comparison, so perhaps a Rock substitution for the blue sky would be more exciting.  Maybe a little more depth of field would help.  Nevertheless, you have an interesting subject and I like it overall.</td>', 'You know it is lichen and I know it''s lichen, but it might be tough for someone to tell that without a rock or whatever formation this is growing on for comparison, so perhaps a Rock substitution for the blue sky would be more exciting.  Maybe a little more depth of field would help.  Nevertheless, you have an interesting subject and I like it overall.', '2004-02-19 21:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(589247, 60039, 14614, '<td valign="top">yum! smooth texture captured in your stop action pour. blue background doesn''t compiment colors - suggest you use lighting more to pull subject from the background</td>', 'yum! smooth texture captured in your stop action pour. blue background doesn''t compiment colors - suggest you use lighting more to pull subject from the background', '2004-02-19 21:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
