(589283, 61107, 14476, '<td valign="top">There have been several good feather entries in this texture challenge and all, including yours, fit it nicely.  Yours is well seen and quite nicely composed.  It could be a bit more in focus and in this case, I''d give the advice that sometimes "less is more."  Nevertheless it is a creditable entry and a nice job.</td>', 'There have been several good feather entries in this texture challenge and all, including yours, fit it nicely.  Yours is well seen and quite nicely composed.  It could be a bit more in focus and in this case, I''d give the advice that sometimes "less is more."  Nevertheless it is a creditable entry and a nice job.', '2004-02-19 21:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(589286, 60914, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is well seen, beautifully photographed and fits the challenge nicely.  It is simple and understated and should do well.</td>', 'This is well seen, beautifully photographed and fits the challenge nicely.  It is simple and understated and should do well.', '2004-02-19 21:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(589287, 60034, 15506, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus and bright colors.  I like it!</td>', 'Nice sharp focus and bright colors.  I like it!', '2004-02-19 21:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(589288, 59998, 15506, '<td valign="top">cute and soft</td>', 'cute and soft', '2004-02-19 21:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(589289, 60560, 14476, '<td valign="top">This lovely scene of well worn rocks (with their own waary texture) and the nice soft water make for a muted but pleasant composition.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This lovely scene of well worn rocks (with their own waary texture) and the nice soft water make for a muted but pleasant composition.  Nicely done.', '2004-02-19 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(589291, 61096, 15506, '<td valign="top">The ring looks a little out of focus.   But great photo.</td>', 'The ring looks a little out of focus.   But great photo.', '2004-02-19 21:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(589294, 60315, 14476, '<td valign="top">Ohh, these dancing branches are the exception to my usual rule for a pattern type image:  "add a shape or contrasting color to add interest."  This composition stands on its own and must have been very hard to see and do.  Congratulations.  You did it.</td>', 'Ohh, these dancing branches are the exception to my usual rule for a pattern type image:  "add a shape or contrasting color to add interest."  This composition stands on its own and must have been very hard to see and do.  Congratulations.  You did it.', '2004-02-19 21:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(589296, 60501, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a good artwork that fits the challenge nice.  Good job.</td>', 'This is a good artwork that fits the challenge nice.  Good job.', '2004-02-19 21:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(589299, 60563, 811, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge.  Nice shot.', '2004-02-19 21:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(589300, 60188, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nicely photographed, with sharp detail.  I''d like to see a contrasting shape introduced to break up the pattern of repetition so that viewers would stay in the picture to admire this fine detail shot.</td>', 'Nicely photographed, with sharp detail.  I''d like to see a contrasting shape introduced to break up the pattern of repetition so that viewers would stay in the picture to admire this fine detail shot.', '2004-02-19 21:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(589301, 60932, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic photo....I really think it will do well.  Good luck.  10</td>', 'What a fantastic photo....I really think it will do well.  Good luck.  10', '2004-02-19 21:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(589302, 61062, 811, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors</td>', 'wonderful colors', '2004-02-19 21:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(589304, 60325, 811, '<td valign="top">great exposure.  I love how the rivelets in the sand set up a contrasting line with the water.  nicely done.</td>', 'great exposure.  I love how the rivelets in the sand set up a contrasting line with the water.  nicely done.', '2004-02-19 21:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(589307, 60036, 811, '<td valign="top">nice colors.  a couple of overexposed areas that are mildly distracting.  I like the composition.</td>', 'nice colors.  a couple of overexposed areas that are mildly distracting.  I like the composition.', '2004-02-19 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(589310, 60855, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice color. I might''ve cropped it to exclude the out-of-focus areas.</td>', 'Nice color. I might''ve cropped it to exclude the out-of-focus areas.', '2004-02-19 21:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(589315, 59817, 11769, '<td valign="top">Great title. Wonderful image. Like everything here.</td>', 'Great title. Wonderful image. Like everything here.', '2004-02-19 21:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(589316, 60185, 811, '<td valign="top">Great use of leading lines to capture attention, and the bw really pulls out hte texture.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Great use of leading lines to capture attention, and the bw really pulls out hte texture.  Nice shot.', '2004-02-19 21:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(589317, 60950, 15506, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful colors', '2004-02-19 21:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(589318, 59984, 10818, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot with a great break in the photo with the drain...nice job.  8</td>', 'fantastic shot with a great break in the photo with the drain...nice job.  8', '2004-02-19 21:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(589319, 61071, 12674, '<td valign="top">Texture of the rice draws my attention away from the texture of the strawberry.</td>', 'Texture of the rice draws my attention away from the texture of the strawberry.', '2004-02-19 21:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(589320, 61142, 11769, '<td valign="top">A real feeling of texture and perfect composition.</td>', 'A real feeling of texture and perfect composition.', '2004-02-19 21:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(589321, 60963, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and cropping.  Dimples seem to lack depth - could be the angle of the light?</td>', 'I like the composition and cropping.  Dimples seem to lack depth - could be the angle of the light?', '2004-02-19 21:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(589322, 60041, 811, '<td valign="top">The texture is good, but the exposure is too much in some places, and not enough in others, making it appear "flat" and without a main focus of attention.</td>', 'The texture is good, but the exposure is too much in some places, and not enough in others, making it appear "flat" and without a main focus of attention.', '2004-02-19 21:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(589323, 60737, 11769, '<td valign="top">I think it is time to paint the doors. Nice texture and comp. Good work.</td>', 'I think it is time to paint the doors. Nice texture and comp. Good work.', '2004-02-19 21:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(589324, 60519, 17203, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Foreground mass a little distracting, though. Full sun might have brightened the top.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Foreground mass a little distracting, though. Full sun might have brightened the top.', '2004-02-19 21:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(589325, 61136, 14614, '<td valign="top">one of the nicer "tree bark" shots.  To make it a bit better: composition might be better moving the hole out of the center of the frame.</td>', 'one of the nicer "tree bark" shots.  To make it a bit better: composition might be better moving the hole out of the center of the frame.', '2004-02-19 21:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(589327, 60488, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the different textures exhibited here -- they set up nice contrasts with each other.  I think getting closer to the bear, though, and eliminating some of the "edge space" would be more effective.</td>', 'I like the different textures exhibited here -- they set up nice contrasts with each other.  I think getting closer to the bear, though, and eliminating some of the "edge space" would be more effective.', '2004-02-19 21:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(589329, 60664, 14614, '<td valign="top">great macro - shows off the metal and cloth.</td>', 'great macro - shows off the metal and cloth.', '2004-02-19 21:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(589330, 60756, 11769, '<td valign="top">Did you know my favorite cereal was cheerios? You get an extra point for this.</td>', 'Did you know my favorite cereal was cheerios? You get an extra point for this.', '2004-02-19 21:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(589331, 60284, 17203, '<td valign="top">More shape than texture to me.</td>', 'More shape than texture to me.', '2004-02-19 21:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(589332, 60069, 14614, '<td valign="top">too small to see much texture</td>', 'too small to see much texture', '2004-02-19 21:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(589333, 60745, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and a great perspective.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and a great perspective.', '2004-02-19 21:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(589334, 60129, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice shutter speed to give the smooth feel.  Lighting would enhance if a bit brighter</td>', 'nice shutter speed to give the smooth feel.  Lighting would enhance if a bit brighter', '2004-02-19 21:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(589336, 60831, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I don''t feel texture.</td>', 'Nice image, but I don''t feel texture.', '2004-02-19 21:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(589337, 61049, 811, '<td valign="top">A sharper focus would help tremendously here.</td>', 'A sharper focus would help tremendously here.', '2004-02-19 21:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(589340, 60124, 14614, '<td valign="top">think I''d like to see what color offers here.  also closer in on one of the many textures might add so focus for me - quite a lot going on.</td>', 'think I''d like to see what color offers here.  also closer in on one of the many textures might add so focus for me - quite a lot going on.', '2004-02-19 21:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(589342, 60934, 11769, '<td valign="top">Interesting view. Very nice feeling of depth.</td>', 'Interesting view. Very nice feeling of depth.', '2004-02-19 21:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(589343, 61119, 811, '<td valign="top">Hey, I have a picture of altoids, too, somewhere in my portfolio. Perhaps in the Contrast challenge.<br/> <br/>I like the randomness of the composition, and while it looks like they are "out of focus" I have found that this kind of candy is hard to look in focus, even if it is.  Maybe a bit more contrast would help.</td>', 'Hey, I have a picture of altoids, too, somewhere in my portfolio. Perhaps in the Contrast challenge. I like the randomness of the composition, and while it looks like they are "out of focus" I have found that this kind of candy is hard to look in focus, even if it is.  Maybe a bit more contrast would help.', '2004-02-19 21:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(589344, 60588, 14614, '<td valign="top">yep, lots of texture - to make this fine shot better, I''d like to be closer to the head (photographically speaking - not really in real life lol)</td>', 'yep, lots of texture - to make this fine shot better, I''d like to be closer to the head (photographically speaking - not really in real life lol)', '2004-02-19 21:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(589346, 60488, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of textures. One of the better photos. A bit flat and soft for my taste, though. 7</td>', 'Nice contrast of textures. One of the better photos. A bit flat and soft for my taste, though. 7', '2004-02-19 21:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(589348, 60834, 811, '<td valign="top">Great colors, interesting point of view.</td>', 'Great colors, interesting point of view.', '2004-02-19 21:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(589349, 61128, 10818, '<td valign="top">Great title..and a very nice shot.  great job.</td>', 'Great title..and a very nice shot.  great job.', '2004-02-19 21:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(589350, 59759, 811, '<td valign="top">Great texture, but I almost think this is one instance where color may have been more interesting.</td>', 'Great texture, but I almost think this is one instance where color may have been more interesting.', '2004-02-19 21:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(589351, 59883, 17203, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the exposure just wasn''t there. The white balance is pretty far off- maybe grayscale would have worked better.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the exposure just wasn''t there. The white balance is pretty far off- maybe grayscale would have worked better.', '2004-02-19 21:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(589352, 60753, 10818, '<td valign="top">amazing shot....just wonderful colors, clearity..and oh yeah...texture.  10</td>', 'amazing shot....just wonderful colors, clearity..and oh yeah...texture.  10', '2004-02-19 21:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(589354, 61153, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. Nice job!</td>', 'One of my favorites. Nice job!', '2004-02-19 21:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(589355, 61086, 14614, '<td valign="top">artistically very nice - would like a larger dof for the challenge to get the sense of the texture you saw.</td>', 'artistically very nice - would like a larger dof for the challenge to get the sense of the texture you saw.', '2004-02-19 21:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
