(589450, 59889, 17203, '<td valign="top">Contrast is too extreme for me. The texture is there, but it might show better at an angle rather that straight-on.</td>', 'Contrast is too extreme for me. The texture is there, but it might show better at an angle rather that straight-on.', '2004-02-19 22:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
