(589467, 60980, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the Challenge.  Good shadows and good rendition of the textures that constitute the challenge.  I like the "face" that appears in the upper left on the wood.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice take on the Challenge.  Good shadows and good rendition of the textures that constitute the challenge.  I like the "face" that appears in the upper left on the wood.  Good job.', '2004-02-19 22:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
