(589481, 60872, 14476, '<td valign="top">This was a good catch and good for the Challenge.  Maybe it would be good to check different exposures.  I  wonder if a stop under exposed would also look good.   Nevertheless, it''s a good image and shows that you enjoyed finding it.</td>', 'This was a good catch and good for the Challenge.  Maybe it would be good to check different exposures.  I  wonder if a stop under exposed would also look good.   Nevertheless, it''s a good image and shows that you enjoyed finding it.', '2004-02-19 22:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
