(589690, 61118, 8759, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and clear details, good texture. I would have liked it more croped a little to the left. The skin on left distracts my eyes. The reflection on the iris also distracts</td>', 'Very sharp and clear details, good texture. I would have liked it more croped a little to the left. The skin on left distracts my eyes. The reflection on the iris also distracts', '2004-02-20 01:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(589693, 60866, 8759, '<td valign="top">Good texture, nice colours. The lock, somekind, spoils the picture. Too new and too shinny and does not creat the idea of old and new opposing (at least not for me)</td>', 'Good texture, nice colours. The lock, somekind, spoils the picture. Too new and too shinny and does not creat the idea of old and new opposing (at least not for me)', '2004-02-20 01:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(589694, 61105, 8759, '<td valign="top">Maybe too abstract... Poor focus spoils the potential texture. The light too strong...</td>', 'Maybe too abstract... Poor focus spoils the potential texture. The light too strong...', '2004-02-20 01:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(589695, 61053, 8759, '<td valign="top">Favourite! Nice colours, very sharp and clear. The reflection on top first annoyed me. Then I realised that adds a kind of mistery. You can feel the cloudy day outside</td>', 'Favourite! Nice colours, very sharp and clear. The reflection on top first annoyed me. Then I realised that adds a kind of mistery. You can feel the cloudy day outside', '2004-02-20 01:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
