(590036, 61149, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice thinking, nice idea for a contrast of textures. compositionally, I don''t think this works - the relative angles of the two subjects is unharmonious, and the exclusion of so much of the rose (and perhaps also of the brick, though less so) seems restrictive. Your lighting hasn''t allowed very much of the textures to come though however - it seems too general, not allowing those little graduations of surfaces to show.</td>', 'Nice thinking, nice idea for a contrast of textures. compositionally, I don''t think this works - the relative angles of the two subjects is unharmonious, and the exclusion of so much of the rose (and perhaps also of the brick, though less so) seems restrictive. Your lighting hasn''t allowed very much of the textures to come though however - it seems too general, not allowing those little graduations of surfaces to show.', '2004-02-20 07:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(590038, 60596, 7263, '<td valign="top">It''s ok but not grabbing in any way. A title would help ;)<br/></td>', 'It''s ok but not grabbing in any way. A title would help ;)', '2004-02-20 07:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
