(590074, 61109, 14614, '<td valign="top">A couple of ideas to play around with - more lighting on the left might throw more of the right into black and eliminate the hot spots/glare that distract from the darkness of the right side, there''s a lot of writing here - perhaps a ball with less letters would let me experience the ball more.</td>', 'A couple of ideas to play around with - more lighting on the left might throw more of the right into black and eliminate the hot spots/glare that distract from the darkness of the right side, there''s a lot of writing here - perhaps a ball with less letters would let me experience the ball more.', '2004-02-20 07:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
