(590077, 61139, 6999, '<td valign="top">Could have emphasised the texture more - this light is very flat. without that sense of feel, it makes for a pretty uninteresting shot I''m afraid.  The sense of looming out of the dark might have been well done, but you''ve cropped too closely to let that impression form properly.</td>', 'Could have emphasised the texture more - this light is very flat. without that sense of feel, it makes for a pretty uninteresting shot I''m afraid.  The sense of looming out of the dark might have been well done, but you''ve cropped too closely to let that impression form properly.', '2004-02-20 07:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
