(590081, 61118, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great interpretatin of the "eyeball" good texture of skin and the iris is interesting  The washed out lower left could be removed and nothing would be missing in your composition (I like the tilted angle)</td>', 'Great interpretatin of the "eyeball" good texture of skin and the iris is interesting  The washed out lower left could be removed and nothing would be missing in your composition (I like the tilted angle)', '2004-02-20 07:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
