(590089, 59958, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not enough detailing to really show the feel of the wood. Focussed well enough, but that very fine detail isn''t quite coming through. Nice subject, and could have been straighter in frame really.</td>', 'Not enough detailing to really show the feel of the wood. Focussed well enough, but that very fine detail isn''t quite coming through. Nice subject, and could have been straighter in frame really.', '2004-02-20 07:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
