(590094, 60241, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good representative shot. Focus of light on the nose has an intriguing effect too, but perhaps detracts from the sense of communicated texture - the blowing out of those details there is a shame.</td>', 'Good representative shot. Focus of light on the nose has an intriguing effect too, but perhaps detracts from the sense of communicated texture - the blowing out of those details there is a shame.', '2004-02-20 07:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(590099, 61137, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good colour, on both the fruit and the leaves. Some sense of texture, but the disorganisation of those leaves upsets the puirt of your composition - being so well isolated, and well lit, takes it out of the natural already, and thus makes that randomness an inappropriate seeming element rather than a bonus.</td>', 'Good colour, on both the fruit and the leaves. Some sense of texture, but the disorganisation of those leaves upsets the puirt of your composition - being so well isolated, and well lit, takes it out of the natural already, and thus makes that randomness an inappropriate seeming element rather than a bonus.', '2004-02-20 07:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(590100, 61090, 14614, '<td valign="top">Would really help to have your dof bigger here since your title tells me there are three sujbects but I can''t get a fix on the black/back one.  The color combination of soft green and punch red doesn''t work as well as other combos might.</td>', 'Would really help to have your dof bigger here since your title tells me there are three sujbects but I can''t get a fix on the black/back one.  The color combination of soft green and punch red doesn''t work as well as other combos might.', '2004-02-20 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
