(590103, 60815, 14401, '<td valign="top">If just a little sharper in focus, this would have been excellent!  I suspect you know that, though - it''s frustrating when what you see in your viewfinder isn''t quite as sharp on download!  Still, I give you a an "e" for effort and a better than average score!</td>', 'If just a little sharper in focus, this would have been excellent!  I suspect you know that, though - it''s frustrating when what you see in your viewfinder isn''t quite as sharp on download!  Still, I give you a an "e" for effort and a better than average score!', '2004-02-20 07:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(590107, 60734, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good shot - great moment of light to capture, and interesting compositionally. Doesn''t display much texture though, really.</td>', 'Good shot - great moment of light to capture, and interesting compositionally. Doesn''t display much texture though, really.', '2004-02-20 07:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(590110, 60721, 14401, '<td valign="top">I love the texture on these blocks - nice capture - good angle.</td>', 'I love the texture on these blocks - nice capture - good angle.', '2004-02-20 07:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(590114, 60964, 14401, '<td valign="top">I''ll be very interested to find out what this is - looks a little like the inside of a piano - I just can''t quite put my finger on it.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'I''ll be very interested to find out what this is - looks a little like the inside of a piano - I just can''t quite put my finger on it.  Very nice shot.', '2004-02-20 07:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(590115, 60648, 14401, '<td valign="top">I thought these were boring ''til I opened the image - Wow!  They''re really lovely and a very nice capture.  The texture of the petals is much more apparent than I would have guessed!</td>', 'I thought these were boring ''til I opened the image - Wow!  They''re really lovely and a very nice capture.  The texture of the petals is much more apparent than I would have guessed!', '2004-02-20 07:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(590118, 60546, 14401, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for anything art nouveau - and this is a lovely box!   Like the soft colors you''ve used for this capture.  Good job!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for anything art nouveau - and this is a lovely box!   Like the soft colors you''ve used for this capture.  Good job!', '2004-02-20 07:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(590119, 60633, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting visula trick as to which section of brick is the one in front. Good texture on that section of facing that''s parallel to the light, but the larger plane of brickwork displays no texture at all - oddly enough, it actually looks completely smooth, to the extent that it might even be a painted or printed panel. For a really saitisfying balance of composition, perhaps the right side is taken too far out of frame. Intriguing work though.</td>', 'Interesting visula trick as to which section of brick is the one in front. Good texture on that section of facing that''s parallel to the light, but the larger plane of brickwork displays no texture at all - oddly enough, it actually looks completely smooth, to the extent that it might even be a painted or printed panel. For a really saitisfying balance of composition, perhaps the right side is taken too far out of frame. Intriguing work though.', '2004-02-20 07:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(590121, 60768, 14401, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely precious.  The colors are perfect - I can "feel" the texture of the childs skin and the "blankie".  Very sweet!</td>', 'This is absolutely precious.  The colors are perfect - I can "feel" the texture of the childs skin and the "blankie".  Very sweet!', '2004-02-20 07:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(590123, 61125, 6999, '<td valign="top">very well done on the fringing of the feather, though I''m not sure the colour isn''t a touch too over-done for me. The spine of the feather though, where it comes out of focus in the right corner, really pulls the eye all the time, making too much of a distraction for me.</td>', 'very well done on the fringing of the feather, though I''m not sure the colour isn''t a touch too over-done for me. The spine of the feather though, where it comes out of focus in the right corner, really pulls the eye all the time, making too much of a distraction for me.', '2004-02-20 07:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(590125, 60921, 14614, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting that brings out the veins.</td>', 'Excellent lighting that brings out the veins.', '2004-02-20 08:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(590127, 61136, 14401, '<td valign="top">I think this is probably the best "bark" shot in this challenge.  Good job!</td>', 'I think this is probably the best "bark" shot in this challenge.  Good job!', '2004-02-20 08:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(590129, 61062, 14401, '<td valign="top">Texture is definitely there, colors are interesting - but the image isn''t very appealing to me - I think because of the flakey white stuff - can''t tell if it''s a fungus or what, but it kind of ruins it for me.</td>', 'Texture is definitely there, colors are interesting - but the image isn''t very appealing to me - I think because of the flakey white stuff - can''t tell if it''s a fungus or what, but it kind of ruins it for me.', '2004-02-20 08:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590131, 60111, 14401, '<td valign="top">Nice, golden glow.  Visually stimulating.</td>', 'Nice, golden glow.  Visually stimulating.', '2004-02-20 08:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(590132, 60831, 6999, '<td valign="top">neat idea. that smoke doesn;''t really register that well - probably you need more of it, rather than having done anything wrong technically. Good light on the rose, though some won''t like it being so direct and hard I would think. Quite whether it really ''mmets the challenge'', I''ll keave for others to say. good image.</td>', 'neat idea. that smoke doesn;''t really register that well - probably you need more of it, rather than having done anything wrong technically. Good light on the rose, though some won''t like it being so direct and hard I would think. Quite whether it really ''mmets the challenge'', I''ll keave for others to say. good image.', '2004-02-20 08:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(590135, 61110, 14401, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Texture doesn''t show up a lot though - perhaps a photo from a bit lower down and angled?  I can see that you were going more for the image of the design, though.</td>', 'Very nice.  Texture doesn''t show up a lot though - perhaps a photo from a bit lower down and angled?  I can see that you were going more for the image of the design, though.', '2004-02-20 08:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(590136, 60995, 14614, '<td valign="top">unique idea here (haven''t seen one like it yet) punchier lighting would help bring out the texture more.</td>', 'unique idea here (haven''t seen one like it yet) punchier lighting would help bring out the texture more.', '2004-02-20 08:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(590137, 60875, 6999, '<td valign="top">Daringly minimal photograph, and really won''t do well here I''m afraid. I like your thinking though. That graining doesn''t, however, register as a function of texture, perhaps because its so very fine - it reads more as eithe patterning or even possibly just digital noise. I certainly wouldn''t have said it was paper without your title, I must say. Interestingly different submission though, thanks.</td>', 'Daringly minimal photograph, and really won''t do well here I''m afraid. I like your thinking though. That graining doesn''t, however, register as a function of texture, perhaps because its so very fine - it reads more as eithe patterning or even possibly just digital noise. I certainly wouldn''t have said it was paper without your title, I must say. Interestingly different submission though, thanks.', '2004-02-20 08:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(590138, 59961, 14401, '<td valign="top">This would have made a great DOF shot.  There is definitely texture here, it''s just not the first thing that pops into mind.</td>', 'This would have made a great DOF shot.  There is definitely texture here, it''s just not the first thing that pops into mind.', '2004-02-20 08:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(590139, 59894, 14614, '<td valign="top">towel/puff that''s blurry in foreground detracts a bit from this lovely monochromatic composition</td>', 'towel/puff that''s blurry in foreground detracts a bit from this lovely monochromatic composition', '2004-02-20 08:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(590141, 59883, 14614, '<td valign="top">would like the tobacco crisper (i''m finding the red and white stops my eye from moving into your frame) creative idea and great texture on the pipe</td>', 'would like the tobacco crisper (i''m finding the red and white stops my eye from moving into your frame) creative idea and great texture on the pipe', '2004-02-20 08:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(590143, 61039, 11467, '<td valign="top">I like the compositio &amp; colour here. Maybe a little more DOF would be good, but overall a pleasing image</td>', 'I like the compositio & colour here. Maybe a little more DOF would be good, but overall a pleasing image', '2004-02-20 08:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(590144, 60918, 14401, '<td valign="top">I think a better title would have been "rough ripples" LOL!  But I really like this image - the color and clarity are just lovely.</td>', 'I think a better title would have been "rough ripples" LOL!  But I really like this image - the color and clarity are just lovely.', '2004-02-20 08:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590146, 60875, 11467, '<td valign="top">Not much to make the photo interesting. Needs some focal point</td>', 'Not much to make the photo interesting. Needs some focal point', '2004-02-20 08:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(590147, 61110, 14614, '<td valign="top">a closer view of the carpet would have had me feel more of the texture</td>', 'a closer view of the carpet would have had me feel more of the texture', '2004-02-20 08:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(590148, 60757, 11467, '<td valign="top">I find the contrast a bit harsh. The composition &amp; subject matter are great</td>', 'I find the contrast a bit harsh. The composition & subject matter are great', '2004-02-20 08:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(590150, 60596, 14614, '<td valign="top">a bigger dof would let me feel the texture more</td>', 'a bigger dof would let me feel the texture more', '2004-02-20 08:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(590151, 61066, 11467, '<td valign="top">Great focus light &amp; colour.  I think the cropping is perhaps a little tight, or the little triangle of black on the right between the petals needs to be hidden</td>', 'Great focus light & colour.  I think the cropping is perhaps a little tight, or the little triangle of black on the right between the petals needs to be hidden', '2004-02-20 08:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(590152, 60198, 14931, '<td valign="top">Are you sure this isn''t a hitch for a truck? nice juxtaposition of textures.</td>', 'Are you sure this isn''t a hitch for a truck? nice juxtaposition of textures.', '2004-02-20 08:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(590153, 59914, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good illustration of this surface. Rhythmical subjects like this I think either need to be incredibly regular, which this isn''t, despite the intricacy and repeating of those patterns, or have something to distrub that pattern to work as a composition; and that element is missing here. I do like the progression of light across the surface though. Just a sense throughout the image that the very finest level of detail is missing - camera, processing or shooting I couldn''t say, but it might well be a functions of being a hand-held shot, it has that feel to it.</td>', 'Good illustration of this surface. Rhythmical subjects like this I think either need to be incredibly regular, which this isn''t, despite the intricacy and repeating of those patterns, or have something to distrub that pattern to work as a composition; and that element is missing here. I do like the progression of light across the surface though. Just a sense throughout the image that the very finest level of detail is missing - camera, processing or shooting I couldn''t say, but it might well be a functions of being a hand-held shot, it has that feel to it.', '2004-02-20 08:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(590154, 60878, 11467, '<td valign="top">A little unnatural for my likeing</td>', 'A little unnatural for my likeing', '2004-02-20 08:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(590155, 61037, 14614, '<td valign="top">more light would have brought out more of the subject''s texture, like the closeness to the subject and the composition</td>', 'more light would have brought out more of the subject''s texture, like the closeness to the subject and the composition', '2004-02-20 08:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(590157, 60798, 6999, '<td valign="top">The ''floating in space'' thing doesn''t work for such an obviously weighty and real thing, in my mind. It looks too muc like it''s simply an illustration, rather than a artistic work of photography. You light is a bot too overall even to be really effective on those texture also, for me - perhpas from a more extreme angle woth the key-light, or perhaps not filling quite so much might have let more come through.</td>', 'The ''floating in space'' thing doesn''t work for such an obviously weighty and real thing, in my mind. It looks too muc like it''s simply an illustration, rather than a artistic work of photography. You light is a bot too overall even to be really effective on those texture also, for me - perhpas from a more extreme angle woth the key-light, or perhaps not filling quite so much might have let more come through.', '2004-02-20 08:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(590158, 60753, 14614, '<td valign="top">strong diagonal, title helps me focus on the element you saw as most interesting, excellent texture (and I am so not a bug person)</td>', 'strong diagonal, title helps me focus on the element you saw as most interesting, excellent texture (and I am so not a bug person)', '2004-02-20 08:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(590159, 59836, 14401, '<td valign="top">Move into the light . . . interesting - not too washed out in the center considering you were shooting upward.</td>', 'Move into the light . . . interesting - not too washed out in the center considering you were shooting upward.', '2004-02-20 08:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(590160, 60780, 14614, '<td valign="top">clever idea, need a bigger dof to give me a strong sense of texture</td>', 'clever idea, need a bigger dof to give me a strong sense of texture', '2004-02-20 08:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(590164, 60306, 14614, '<td valign="top">strong composition and arrangement.  To make this fine shot better (imho) the white background pulls my eye away from your subjects - less or darker would work better.</td>', 'strong composition and arrangement.  To make this fine shot better (imho) the white background pulls my eye away from your subjects - less or darker would work better.', '2004-02-20 08:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
