(590169, 61134, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice color palette, (must have taken a lot of patience to set up!)  to make this solid image a bit better, I''d like to see the seeds closer to bring out their texture even more</td>', 'nice color palette, (must have taken a lot of patience to set up!)  to make this solid image a bit better, I''d like to see the seeds closer to bring out their texture even more', '2004-02-20 08:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(590170, 61098, 15920, '<td valign="top">That over exposed penny hurts this a lot.  The focus seems just a tad off, but I think that might have been OK.  One question: why are all the pennies the same?  Why not an old one thrown in to give a different but similar thing to look at?</td>', 'That over exposed penny hurts this a lot.  The focus seems just a tad off, but I think that might have been OK.  One question: why are all the pennies the same?  Why not an old one thrown in to give a different but similar thing to look at?', '2004-02-20 08:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(590171, 59885, 14614, '<td valign="top">nicely framed abstract, good lighting and close enough to feel the texture</td>', 'nicely framed abstract, good lighting and close enough to feel the texture', '2004-02-20 08:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(590172, 60070, 11467, '<td valign="top">A little too much reflection. Also not realy a texture pic.</td>', 'A little too much reflection. Also not realy a texture pic.', '2004-02-20 08:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(590174, 60975, 15920, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.</td>', 'This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.', '2004-02-20 08:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(590175, 60011, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting &amp; focus</td>', 'Nice lighting & focus', '2004-02-20 08:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(590178, 61097, 6999, '<td valign="top">Small image, indistinct detail, and very poor lighting - on board flash IMO never looks very inofrmative on close-up shots. Even were it more clear, that flash would I suspect have wiped out any detail in the textures here.</td>', 'Small image, indistinct detail, and very poor lighting - on board flash IMO never looks very inofrmative on close-up shots. Even were it more clear, that flash would I suspect have wiped out any detail in the textures here.', '2004-02-20 08:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(590179, 60883, 15920, '<td valign="top">There are some artifacts on the margerine label, but, otherwise, this is a good shot.  Very crisp.</td>', 'There are some artifacts on the margerine label, but, otherwise, this is a good shot.  Very crisp.', '2004-02-20 08:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(590180, 59903, 14614, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition.  To give an extra point or two, I''d like to see the lighting brought up highlighting the interesting angles and shapes</td>', 'wonderful composition.  To give an extra point or two, I''d like to see the lighting brought up highlighting the interesting angles and shapes', '2004-02-20 08:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
