(590189, 61140, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great shot.  One thing though, I would have cropped so that the near part of the image was in focus and then faded.  The front blur doesn''t help this, which is too bad, because this is a great idea.  Oops, I said that already.  Must have meant it.....</td>', 'Great idea, great shot.  One thing though, I would have cropped so that the near part of the image was in focus and then faded.  The front blur doesn''t help this, which is too bad, because this is a great idea.  Oops, I said that already.  Must have meant it.....', '2004-02-20 08:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
