(590196, 61112, 15920, '<td valign="top">cally this seems well done to me.  Unfortunately in a contest of so many images, it doesnt have an interesting enough feature to separate it from the pack.</td>', 'cally this seems well done to me.  Unfortunately in a contest of so many images, it doesnt have an interesting enough feature to separate it from the pack.', '2004-02-20 08:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
