(590215, 60834, 17551, '<td valign="top">I like the POV and colours, but I think the left hand side could have been cropped a little bit to hide the stem.</td>', 'I like the POV and colours, but I think the left hand side could have been cropped a little bit to hide the stem.', '2004-02-20 08:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
