(590231, 60906, 17551, '<td valign="top">When I saw the title of this, I though I was going to be in for a real treat.. with corns and calluses all over.. Oh well! Nicely done version.</td>', 'When I saw the title of this, I though I was going to be in for a real treat.. with corns and calluses all over.. Oh well! Nicely done version.', '2004-02-20 08:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
