(590233, 60691, 17551, '<td valign="top">Great capture :-)<br/> <br/>You''ll get 10''s from the guys at least!</td>', 'Great capture :-) You''ll get 10''s from the guys at least!', '2004-02-20 08:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(590234, 61034, 17551, '<td valign="top">Wow, the red really brings this out.. great shot.</td>', 'Wow, the red really brings this out.. great shot.', '2004-02-20 08:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(590235, 60493, 6999, '<td valign="top">No sense of detail coming through in this shot - there just isn''t that crisp sharpness that would show that. The angle of the lighting seems to be good - not flash, and not directly head on; this lack of detail may come from very slight camera shake - especially as this has the look of being in focus. Did you use a tripod? Also seems under-exposed, the brighter areas aren''t really that bright.</td>', 'No sense of detail coming through in this shot - there just isn''t that crisp sharpness that would show that. The angle of the lighting seems to be good - not flash, and not directly head on; this lack of detail may come from very slight camera shake - especially as this has the look of being in focus. Did you use a tripod? Also seems under-exposed, the brighter areas aren''t really that bright.', '2004-02-20 08:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(590236, 60343, 17551, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot.. warm colours and slight soft focus mark it well</td>', 'I think this is a great shot.. warm colours and slight soft focus mark it well', '2004-02-20 08:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(590238, 61152, 17551, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-02-20 08:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(590239, 60514, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good sense of texture here, marred by a confusing and overly busy composition. There are too many different planes of paper, too many shapes angling in different doirections to give any real sense of flow through the frame.</td>', 'Good sense of texture here, marred by a confusing and overly busy composition. There are too many different planes of paper, too many shapes angling in different doirections to give any real sense of flow through the frame.', '2004-02-20 08:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(590241, 59953, 6999, '<td valign="top">Despite the focus, there is a sense of differing textures here - or perhaps more accurately differing shapes. Not convinced by the compositional arrangement of them though - seems quite bluntly organise dinto two bands, and the lines and forms don''t lead the eye comfortably through the picture. 5</td>', 'Despite the focus, there is a sense of differing textures here - or perhaps more accurately differing shapes. Not convinced by the compositional arrangement of them though - seems quite bluntly organise dinto two bands, and the lines and forms don''t lead the eye comfortably through the picture. 5', '2004-02-20 09:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(590242, 59848, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good toning, and good colour capture. Slight barrel distortion visible in that bar at the bottom. The ''real'' texture of the wall is too much masked by the graphic though, you haven''t quite got the balance of that painting and the real structure right to my eye.</td>', 'Good toning, and good colour capture. Slight barrel distortion visible in that bar at the bottom. The ''real'' texture of the wall is too much masked by the graphic though, you haven''t quite got the balance of that painting and the real structure right to my eye.', '2004-02-20 09:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(590244, 60512, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good sense of the surfaces, and effective depth of field. The compromise between filling the frame with the thing and getting all of it in has left an unhappy situation with those bits that go out of frame, for me. Slavishly following the ''thirds'' rule requires a little more balance in the other half of the frame, in my view, and here here is really nothing going on there.</td>', 'Good sense of the surfaces, and effective depth of field. The compromise between filling the frame with the thing and getting all of it in has left an unhappy situation with those bits that go out of frame, for me. Slavishly following the ''thirds'' rule requires a little more balance in the other half of the frame, in my view, and here here is really nothing going on there.', '2004-02-20 09:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(590245, 60529, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good abstract - good toning. Don''t really get a tactile sense from this though, so much as a patterning, though there is an impression of roughness and smoothness, on a longer look. Not a strong sense though - I feel I may have willed it to be there more than been shown it.</td>', 'Good abstract - good toning. Don''t really get a tactile sense from this though, so much as a patterning, though there is an impression of roughness and smoothness, on a longer look. Not a strong sense though - I feel I may have willed it to be there more than been shown it.', '2004-02-20 09:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(590247, 60464, 6999, '<td valign="top">The best so far of these rhythmic compositions. Real sense of texture in those wooden points, and a real sense of movement through the image. Sufficient regularity to work as a composition, and sufficient small differences to create some visual imterest. No fear of the simplicity of it, either. Good work.</td>', 'The best so far of these rhythmic compositions. Real sense of texture in those wooden points, and a real sense of movement through the image. Sufficient regularity to work as a composition, and sufficient small differences to create some visual imterest. No fear of the simplicity of it, either. Good work.', '2004-02-20 09:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(590249, 60835, 6999, '<td valign="top">Seem to be a lot of these bushes sprouting through snow type shots. This works neither better nor worse than the majority, for me. doen''t convincingly speak of texture to me, and graphically I don''t find it a pleasing image - too much confuusion, and not enough organisation in the elements of it.</td>', 'Seem to be a lot of these bushes sprouting through snow type shots. This works neither better nor worse than the majority, for me. doen''t convincingly speak of texture to me, and graphically I don''t find it a pleasing image - too much confuusion, and not enough organisation in the elements of it.', '2004-02-20 09:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(590251, 60203, 6999, '<td valign="top">Some degree of texture comes through, despite the lack of finer detail and the overall blurriness of it - it seems like you might have used too close to a 1:1 magnification of your original image, has that kind of quality to it,</td>', 'Some degree of texture comes through, despite the lack of finer detail and the overall blurriness of it - it seems like you might have used too close to a 1:1 magnification of your original image, has that kind of quality to it,', '2004-02-20 09:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(590253, 60288, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good composition - very strong on graphic elements. The light is too harsh, too directional to promote a sense of texture though - simply enough, with the inscription being barely distinct you''re harly likely to have captured a feel of the surfces of that stone.</td>', 'Good composition - very strong on graphic elements. The light is too harsh, too directional to promote a sense of texture though - simply enough, with the inscription being barely distinct you''re harly likely to have captured a feel of the surfces of that stone.', '2004-02-20 09:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(590254, 60105, 11155, '<td valign="top">Absolutely excellent.  Wonderful lighting and a very vivid image.  So far, my choice for the winner.  Good luck.</td>', 'Absolutely excellent.  Wonderful lighting and a very vivid image.  So far, my choice for the winner.  Good luck.', '2004-02-20 09:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(590256, 60858, 15920, '<td valign="top">More depth of field would have helped this.  Also, the image needs something composition wise to break it up.</td>', 'More depth of field would have helped this.  Also, the image needs something composition wise to break it up.', '2004-02-20 09:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(590258, 59953, 11155, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and colors, but image could be better focused.</td>', 'Nice lighting and colors, but image could be better focused.', '2004-02-20 09:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(590259, 60738, 6999, '<td valign="top">Challenging shot, and shows great competence. Not sure i completely go for that enormous progression of focus into the foreground, really -it provides a blalnce to the composition in therms of weight, but there''s just so very little information going on there that is seems almost completely arbitrary. gret subject though, and excellent detailing and at last some texture in your main subject. veru good on the fascination of the very ordinary.</td>', 'Challenging shot, and shows great competence. Not sure i completely go for that enormous progression of focus into the foreground, really -it provides a blalnce to the composition in therms of weight, but there''s just so very little information going on there that is seems almost completely arbitrary. gret subject though, and excellent detailing and at last some texture in your main subject. veru good on the fascination of the very ordinary.', '2004-02-20 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(590261, 61069, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but lots of noise.  I wonder if a lower filmspeed would have helped.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but lots of noise.  I wonder if a lower filmspeed would have helped.', '2004-02-20 09:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(590263, 60932, 11155, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines and subject.  Good subject for this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting lines and subject.  Good subject for this challenge.  Good luck.', '2004-02-20 09:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(590264, 60729, 11155, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and colors.  Makes me thirsty.  Excellent shot, good luck.</td>', 'Great lighting and colors.  Makes me thirsty.  Excellent shot, good luck.', '2004-02-20 09:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(590266, 59851, 6999, '<td valign="top">Such a small image size makes it difficul to comment, indeed it''s half the allowable maximum dimension. Nevertheless, some texture shows, albeit in what seems quite a disorganised composition.</td>', 'Such a small image size makes it difficul to comment, indeed it''s half the allowable maximum dimension. Nevertheless, some texture shows, albeit in what seems quite a disorganised composition.', '2004-02-20 09:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(590267, 59711, 12654, '<td valign="top">Nice - I like the shadows that are cast on the wall.</td>', 'Nice - I like the shadows that are cast on the wall.', '2004-02-20 09:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(590268, 61031, 15920, '<td valign="top">I hope you had a great time taking this picture.  Looks like some magical time spent with the different generations.  Not that you care since you had a good time, but, did you think about having both arms be the same (blacked out or shown) as the composition was slightly off.  Good luck.</td>', 'I hope you had a great time taking this picture.  Looks like some magical time spent with the different generations.  Not that you care since you had a good time, but, did you think about having both arms be the same (blacked out or shown) as the composition was slightly off.  Good luck.', '2004-02-20 09:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590272, 61092, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting trick - to have found ameans of communicating that texture pof the concrete, and the shape of the fleur-de-lys without any seeming variation in the brigher areas of the stone, just by shadow. Other than the bang-centre placing of the device. I rather like this. Perhaps fractioanlly heavy on the contrast - or rather perhaps fractionally too intensely direct a light to have chosen, but pretty good nevertheless.</td>', 'Interesting trick - to have found ameans of communicating that texture pof the concrete, and the shape of the fleur-de-lys without any seeming variation in the brigher areas of the stone, just by shadow. Other than the bang-centre placing of the device. I rather like this. Perhaps fractioanlly heavy on the contrast - or rather perhaps fractionally too intensely direct a light to have chosen, but pretty good nevertheless.', '2004-02-20 09:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(590274, 59858, 15920, '<td valign="top">I like this but would have moved the plant off center.  That aside, this worrks well with nice colors, and good focus.</td>', 'I like this but would have moved the plant off center.  That aside, this worrks well with nice colors, and good focus.', '2004-02-20 09:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(590280, 59958, 15920, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.</td>', 'This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.', '2004-02-20 09:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(590281, 59934, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh - there is some feel of surfaces here, hough almost despite the shot rather thanbecause of the way you''ve done it. It''s a very dull exposure - quite accurate to life in a way, I would suggest, which doesn''t necessarily make for a good shot. Bland compositionally - there''s just no sense of the dramatic to it, though in its sense of the absolutely mundane it has some appeal.</td>', 'Oh - there is some feel of surfaces here, hough almost despite the shot rather thanbecause of the way you''ve done it. It''s a very dull exposure - quite accurate to life in a way, I would suggest, which doesn''t necessarily make for a good shot. Bland compositionally - there''s just no sense of the dramatic to it, though in its sense of the absolutely mundane it has some appeal.', '2004-02-20 09:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(590282, 60363, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks slightly out of focus.</td>', 'This looks slightly out of focus.', '2004-02-20 09:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(590283, 59914, 15920, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.</td>', 'This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.', '2004-02-20 09:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(590284, 60069, 15920, '<td valign="top">An awfully big border for a small image.</td>', 'An awfully big border for a small image.', '2004-02-20 09:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(590285, 60933, 9821, '<td valign="top">simple ... i like it</td>', 'simple ... i like it', '2004-02-20 09:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(590288, 60273, 15920, '<td valign="top">The shadow really separates this from the rest of the pure texture entries.  I might have increased the depth of field to really bring home a top score, but this is above average.</td>', 'The shadow really separates this from the rest of the pure texture entries.  I might have increased the depth of field to really bring home a top score, but this is above average.', '2004-02-20 09:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(590289, 59817, 9821, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. The blurred white line in the background is a little distracting, but not much. Nice job.</td>', 'I like this one a lot. The blurred white line in the background is a little distracting, but not much. Nice job.', '2004-02-20 09:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(590291, 61035, 6999, '<td valign="top">Some impression of the quality of these surfaces, though really quite an ordinary illustration of the clock face. Lacks that dynamic that comes from good lighting, from a less straightforward approach. Good exposure, and accurate colours and sense of the object itself, but the shot hasn''t placed the emphasis on the textures really - would need more careful consideration of the affect of light on a surface in that area.</td>', 'Some impression of the quality of these surfaces, though really quite an ordinary illustration of the clock face. Lacks that dynamic that comes from good lighting, from a less straightforward approach. Good exposure, and accurate colours and sense of the object itself, but the shot hasn''t placed the emphasis on the textures really - would need more careful consideration of the affect of light on a surface in that area.', '2004-02-20 09:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(590292, 60226, 9821, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2004-02-20 09:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(590293, 60765, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks slightly out of focus.</td>', 'This looks slightly out of focus.', '2004-02-20 09:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590294, 61147, 9821, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2004-02-20 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(590295, 60291, 15920, '<td valign="top">I think this could have benefited from a little more unsharp masking, as it lacks a bit of crispness.  That having been said, I like it.</td>', 'I think this could have benefited from a little more unsharp masking, as it lacks a bit of crispness.  That having been said, I like it.', '2004-02-20 09:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590297, 60770, 9821, '<td valign="top">The upper right hand corner is a little attention drawing because it''s so bright ... but I still like it a lot.</td>', 'The upper right hand corner is a little attention drawing because it''s so bright ... but I still like it a lot.', '2004-02-20 09:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(590299, 60848, 6999, '<td valign="top">Exquisite shot of the glass, great use of the paper background, though perhps that low quality paper gives too grainy and confised looking a patterning to complement the smoothness of the glass. Like the depth of field on the bubbles enormously, and your control of this exposure. Very clean too, and the black surface of the water is marvellous. I would perhaps have suggested just using a single light panel to one side of the glass, not for illumination, but perhaps too provide a clean reflection to suggest the three-dimensionality of the glass a touch more - just in consideration of this challenge topic. Such a pure silhouette doesn''t really give a reat sense of texture; but it remains an excellent shot.</td>', 'Exquisite shot of the glass, great use of the paper background, though perhps that low quality paper gives too grainy and confised looking a patterning to complement the smoothness of the glass. Like the depth of field on the bubbles enormously, and your control of this exposure. Very clean too, and the black surface of the water is marvellous. I would perhaps have suggested just using a single light panel to one side of the glass, not for illumination, but perhaps too provide a clean reflection to suggest the three-dimensionality of the glass a touch more - just in consideration of this challenge topic. Such a pure silhouette doesn''t really give a reat sense of texture; but it remains an excellent shot.', '2004-02-20 09:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(590300, 61058, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very good on the sense of feel. I''d maybe suggest that the light is touch too even - that you''ve filled a little too far and removed any sense of the dramatic from the image by that. Minor point though.</td>', 'Very good on the sense of feel. I''d maybe suggest that the light is touch too even - that you''ve filled a little too far and removed any sense of the dramatic from the image by that. Minor point though.', '2004-02-20 09:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(590301, 61114, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a great image composition, color, and focus wise.  The border though hurt the score trmenedously.  This was more than strong enough to support a simple black background.</td>', 'This is a great image composition, color, and focus wise.  The border though hurt the score trmenedously.  This was more than strong enough to support a simple black background.', '2004-02-20 09:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(590302, 59956, 11467, '<td valign="top">Ice looks too grey. Lighting &amp; exosure need to be increased</td>', 'Ice looks too grey. Lighting & exosure need to be increased', '2004-02-20 09:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(590303, 61146, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks slightly out of focus.  But, the composition is good as is the lighting.<br/></td>', 'This looks slightly out of focus.  But, the composition is good as is the lighting.', '2004-02-20 09:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(590304, 60923, 6999, '<td valign="top">Suggestions of symbolism here that I just don''t get. Photographically intriguing, but ultimately for me unsatisfying. Basically, it doesn''t make any sense to me.</td>', 'Suggestions of symbolism here that I just don''t get. Photographically intriguing, but ultimately for me unsatisfying. Basically, it doesn''t make any sense to me.', '2004-02-20 09:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(590305, 60158, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks like the Cape Cod Canal to me.  I have way too many good memories of that area to score this objectively.  But, this is a great shot to boot.  I like the choices on focus, lighting, and depth of field.  Put very simply, I hope you win. - 10</td>', 'This looks like the Cape Cod Canal to me.  I have way too many good memories of that area to score this objectively.  But, this is a great shot to boot.  I like the choices on focus, lighting, and depth of field.  Put very simply, I hope you win. - 10', '2004-02-20 09:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(590307, 61140, 8152, '<td valign="top">I like it but there should be some cropped off the bottom or increase DOF a bit so that it is in focus at the bottom of the frame too.</td>', 'I like it but there should be some cropped off the bottom or increase DOF a bit so that it is in focus at the bottom of the frame too.', '2004-02-20 10:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(590308, 60088, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks slightly out of focus, and the border is over powering.  I do like the lighting though.</td>', 'This looks slightly out of focus, and the border is over powering.  I do like the lighting though.', '2004-02-20 10:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(590311, 60815, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks slightly out of focus, and the bird could be moved off center to great advantage.  The colors are good, though they might be slightly overexposed.</td>', 'This looks slightly out of focus, and the bird could be moved off center to great advantage.  The colors are good, though they might be slightly overexposed.', '2004-02-20 10:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(590312, 60980, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks overexposed in the highlight, which drew my attention there rather than to the other interesting parts of this shot.</td>', 'This looks overexposed in the highlight, which drew my attention there rather than to the other interesting parts of this shot.', '2004-02-20 10:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(590316, 59908, 8152, '<td valign="top">Good taste!</td>', 'Good taste!', '2004-02-20 10:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590318, 59912, 11467, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little flat &amp; image a little uninteresting.</td>', 'Lighting is a little flat & image a little uninteresting.', '2004-02-20 10:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(590320, 61098, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a good take on the Challenge.  Maybe a little hot on some of the pennies, but not bad.  To make this really interesting, you might try adding another shape or contrasting color as a foil.  Nevertheless, it''s a creditable job!</td>', 'This is a good take on the Challenge.  Maybe a little hot on some of the pennies, but not bad.  To make this really interesting, you might try adding another shape or contrasting color as a foil.  Nevertheless, it''s a creditable job!', '2004-02-20 10:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(590321, 61111, 14476, '<td valign="top">I very much like the blue cast to this image and the great depth of field.  Adds a bit of mystery to the Challenge subject matter.  Nice.</td>', 'I very much like the blue cast to this image and the great depth of field.  Adds a bit of mystery to the Challenge subject matter.  Nice.', '2004-02-20 10:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(590322, 60932, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice colour, composition , exposure &amp; focus. I can smell it!</td>', 'Nice colour, composition , exposure & focus. I can smell it!', '2004-02-20 10:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(590323, 59984, 11467, '<td valign="top">The texture on the manhole cover seems funny. Possibly through resizing or sharpening.<br/>Image is interesting butr somehow lacks something.</td>', 'The texture on the manhole cover seems funny. Possibly through resizing or sharpening.Image is interesting butr somehow lacks something.', '2004-02-20 10:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(590324, 60829, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a good take on the Challenge.  Could be a touch crisper, and maybe that righthand upper corner could have been used to add something extra to the image.  It''s pretty neutral now.  All in all, a good photo.</td>', 'This is a good take on the Challenge.  Could be a touch crisper, and maybe that righthand upper corner could have been used to add something extra to the image.  It''s pretty neutral now.  All in all, a good photo.', '2004-02-20 10:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590325, 60804, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think the dark shape in the background distracts a little.<br/>Nice colour, composition, and focus.</td>', 'I think the dark shape in the background distracts a little.Nice colour, composition, and focus.', '2004-02-20 10:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(590326, 60923, 14476, '<td valign="top">I don''t exactly understand the title, but it is a fun photo and I love your idea of the broken egg shells.  It might have been interesting to zero in on the shells and discard the rest of the information.  Nevertheless, a clever take.</td>', 'I don''t exactly understand the title, but it is a fun photo and I love your idea of the broken egg shells.  It might have been interesting to zero in on the shells and discard the rest of the information.  Nevertheless, a clever take.', '2004-02-20 10:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(590327, 59935, 17228, '<td valign="top">Cool shot with a cool subject. Only wish it had a greater DOF to keep it all in focus</td>', 'Cool shot with a cool subject. Only wish it had a greater DOF to keep it all in focus', '2004-02-20 10:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(590328, 60147, 11467, '<td valign="top">Would be better if it was a little sharper</td>', 'Would be better if it was a little sharper', '2004-02-20 10:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(590329, 60488, 14476, '<td valign="top">I really like the multiple textures you captured in this image.  It''s a good take on the Challenge.</td>', 'I really like the multiple textures you captured in this image.  It''s a good take on the Challenge.', '2004-02-20 10:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(590330, 60809, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but I feel doesn''t portray the theme texture</td>', 'Nice picture but I feel doesn''t portray the theme texture', '2004-02-20 10:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(590331, 60756, 6999, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand the title. Very good job of lighting, and some sense of texture here. Alsoa good sense of distance, given the subject matter :-)</td>', 'Don''t understand the title. Very good job of lighting, and some sense of texture here. Alsoa good sense of distance, given the subject matter :-)', '2004-02-20 10:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(590333, 60185, 14476, '<td valign="top">Yes, these guys really do have lots of bumps and patterns.  Good seeing.  It''s alwlays tough on these closeups, but if you could work on getting even more depth of field, it would really make this image jump!  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Yes, these guys really do have lots of bumps and patterns.  Good seeing.  It''s alwlays tough on these closeups, but if you could work on getting even more depth of field, it would really make this image jump!  Keep up the good work.', '2004-02-20 10:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(590334, 61087, 11467, '<td valign="top">A little too cropped. At first I waited thinking the rest of the image would load.</td>', 'A little too cropped. At first I waited thinking the rest of the image would load.', '2004-02-20 10:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(590336, 60975, 11467, '<td valign="top">No real focal point in the image</td>', 'No real focal point in the image', '2004-02-20 10:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(590337, 60721, 11467, '<td valign="top">Excelent shadows on the stone. Shows the texture nicels</td>', 'Excelent shadows on the stone. Shows the texture nicels', '2004-02-20 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(590338, 60257, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the Challenge.  Love delicacy of the succulent against the coarseness of the leaves.  Is it just a touch over-exposed?  Maybe, maybe not.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice take on the Challenge.  Love delicacy of the succulent against the coarseness of the leaves.  Is it just a touch over-exposed?  Maybe, maybe not.  Good job.', '2004-02-20 10:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(590339, 60013, 11467, '<td valign="top">Wow great eye shot</td>', 'Wow great eye shot', '2004-02-20 10:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(590340, 60629, 14476, '<td valign="top">I like your oranges spilling out of the hat.  Maybe you could have gotten a bit more texture out of the oranges, maybe not, but it was a really good try!  Nice.</td>', 'I like your oranges spilling out of the hat.  Maybe you could have gotten a bit more texture out of the oranges, maybe not, but it was a really good try!  Nice.', '2004-02-20 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(590341, 60486, 6999, '<td valign="top">very muted light here - works well to bring out the red of the thing''s (whatever you call the beak surround) face. Not a great deal of impression of texture however - which is the downside of that quality of light. Your positioning of teh duck''s head in frame leaves something to eb desired for me: it''s very central, and makes for an odd look to the overall composition, especially with the boidy going out of frame like that.</td>', 'very muted light here - works well to bring out the red of the thing''s (whatever you call the beak surround) face. Not a great deal of impression of texture however - which is the downside of that quality of light. Your positioning of teh duck''s head in frame leaves something to eb desired for me: it''s very central, and makes for an odd look to the overall composition, especially with the boidy going out of frame like that.', '2004-02-20 10:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(590342, 60241, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a scary guy this is.  The lighting is good and original, and the smooth texture works for the Challenge.  Good.</td>', 'Oh, what a scary guy this is.  The lighting is good and original, and the smooth texture works for the Challenge.  Good.', '2004-02-20 10:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(590343, 59903, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work on the texture. Shot has the feel of an exhibition catalogue, and seems purely representative to me. Anentirely competent representative shot, but still just that.</td>', 'Good work on the texture. Shot has the feel of an exhibition catalogue, and seems purely representative to me. Anentirely competent representative shot, but still just that.', '2004-02-20 10:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(590344, 60315, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract - though as with very many shots here its subject is patterning arther than texture: I get no sense of the three-dimensionality of this subject here. Like the exposure very much though, and the detail is excellent.</td>', 'Interesting abstract - though as with very many shots here its subject is patterning arther than texture: I get no sense of the three-dimensionality of this subject here. Like the exposure very much though, and the detail is excellent.', '2004-02-20 10:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(590345, 60883, 17228, '<td valign="top">Wow! This entire photo''s focus is so sharp I almost cut my eyes on it!!! Reveals good texture, although I''d prefer a beautiful female hand-model to spread my margarine in thick sensual S-shaped patterns.... er, I''m off subject, aren''t I? Nice shot!  :)</td>', 'Wow! This entire photo''s focus is so sharp I almost cut my eyes on it!!! Reveals good texture, although I''d prefer a beautiful female hand-model to spread my margarine in thick sensual S-shaped patterns.... er, I''m off subject, aren''t I? Nice shot!  :)', '2004-02-20 10:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(590346, 60037, 14476, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting sculpture and you captured it nicely.  Perhaps, for the Challenge, it would have been even better if you could have zeroed in on some of the textural shapes.  That way you might have eliminated the somewhat cluttered background.  Still, a good job.</td>', 'It''s an interesting sculpture and you captured it nicely.  Perhaps, for the Challenge, it would have been even better if you could have zeroed in on some of the textural shapes.  That way you might have eliminated the somewhat cluttered background.  Still, a good job.', '2004-02-20 10:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(590347, 60302, 6999, '<td valign="top">Answer: no. However, the smoothness  or crinkliness that you ahve captured in those curls is, and is well evinced here. Punchy bright colours are very good. The only real downside for me is that I fail to find a solid subject in this shot - it would make a great wallpaper, perhaps, but not something to hold the eye of itself.</td>', 'Answer: no. However, the smoothness  or crinkliness that you ahve captured in those curls is, and is well evinced here. Punchy bright colours are very good. The only real downside for me is that I fail to find a solid subject in this shot - it would make a great wallpaper, perhaps, but not something to hold the eye of itself.', '2004-02-20 10:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(590350, 60727, 14476, '<td valign="top">Enjoy your take on the challenge and it is quite nicely photographed.  To give it a bit of excitement, perhaps you might consider introducing a contrasting shape or color somewhere on the image.   (for example, I could see a nice but smallish bright blue blot on the absorbent paper) Nevertheless, its a good photo.</td>', 'Enjoy your take on the challenge and it is quite nicely photographed.  To give it a bit of excitement, perhaps you might consider introducing a contrasting shape or color somewhere on the image.   (for example, I could see a nice but smallish bright blue blot on the absorbent paper) Nevertheless, its a good photo.', '2004-02-20 10:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(590351, 60203, 17228, '<td valign="top">Soft focus is in conflict with the sharp edged subject, lessening the overall feel of it''s texture. Highlights look blownout on lower right side of photo as well.</td>', 'Soft focus is in conflict with the sharp edged subject, lessening the overall feel of it''s texture. Highlights look blownout on lower right side of photo as well.', '2004-02-20 10:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(590352, 61026, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the suggestion of your title very much. Would like to have seen more definition in these surfaces, which is just a function of the moment of light you''ve employed. The patterning of the sets isn''t enough alone to hold my interest, whereas the depiction of the surface texture migh have added that element.</td>', 'Like the suggestion of your title very much. Would like to have seen more definition in these surfaces, which is just a function of the moment of light you''ve employed. The patterning of the sets isn''t enough alone to hold my interest, whereas the depiction of the surface texture migh have added that element.', '2004-02-20 10:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(590353, 60792, 14476, '<td valign="top">I like your composition and the clarity of the bridge structural work.  And it does fit the Challenge.  Good work.</td>', 'I like your composition and the clarity of the bridge structural work.  And it does fit the Challenge.  Good work.', '2004-02-20 10:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(590356, 61153, 17228, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Really like the idea and how you controlled the light that fell on your subject.</td>', 'Cool shot. Really like the idea and how you controlled the light that fell on your subject.', '2004-02-20 10:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(590357, 60151, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good illumination of a texture here - though i do think you ought to have cropped entirely to the blue thing, rather than leaving that blank area at extreme top. Good light, good exposure, good colour, but lacking in a real subject for me: the patterning is simply not enough of itself.</td>', 'Good illumination of a texture here - though i do think you ought to have cropped entirely to the blue thing, rather than leaving that blank area at extreme top. Good light, good exposure, good colour, but lacking in a real subject for me: the patterning is simply not enough of itself.', '2004-02-20 10:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(590361, 60862, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, these rust pictures are all so interesting and a great take on the Challenge.  I expect you were trying for a really narrow depth of field shot, and if so you succeeded.  But for me, it would have been fun to see more definition on those rust patterns. It''s a good composition.</td>', 'Oh, these rust pictures are all so interesting and a great take on the Challenge.  I expect you were trying for a really narrow depth of field shot, and if so you succeeded.  But for me, it would have been fun to see more definition on those rust patterns. It''s a good composition.', '2004-02-20 10:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(590363, 59711, 6999, '<td valign="top">excellently done. The fan of the light really aids the composition, whilst never detroying the impact of that texture. real movement of light through the frame too. Looks like a floor and rotated image to me (no bad thing). Good colour too, not overwhelming the central idea of the shot.</td>', 'excellently done. The fan of the light really aids the composition, whilst never detroying the impact of that texture. real movement of light through the frame too. Looks like a floor and rotated image to me (no bad thing). Good colour too, not overwhelming the central idea of the shot.', '2004-02-20 10:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(590365, 60273, 14476, '<td valign="top">This overall pattern effect is a fine take on the Challenge, but maybe it would also be good if you added a contrasting shape to this nice composition to give it added interest.  Good job.</td>', 'This overall pattern effect is a fine take on the Challenge, but maybe it would also be good if you added a contrasting shape to this nice composition to give it added interest.  Good job.', '2004-02-20 10:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(590367, 61073, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good take on the Challenge and you pulled off a difficult shot nicely.  Good depth of field, quite nice patterning within the shot and so a quite good composition.  Nice.</td>', 'Good take on the Challenge and you pulled off a difficult shot nicely.  Good depth of field, quite nice patterning within the shot and so a quite good composition.  Nice.', '2004-02-20 10:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(590369, 59916, 17228, '<td valign="top">Finally! A wide angle, non-closeup photo that actually WORKS with the Texture theme! Woohoo!  :)</td>', 'Finally! A wide angle, non-closeup photo that actually WORKS with the Texture theme! Woohoo!  :)', '2004-02-20 10:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(590371, 61091, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nice smooth testure, but the picture is not interesting and the color are boring.  IMHO this is a hard shot to pull off and make great, but I am no professional.</td>', 'Nice smooth testure, but the picture is not interesting and the color are boring.  IMHO this is a hard shot to pull off and make great, but I am no professional.', '2004-02-20 10:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(590372, 60804, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quality bright punchy shot. Great detailing and colour and focus. Works compositionally too, within that framing. The black plastic thing visible through the button-hole is a shame, but not that terrible. Only does half a job on communicating texture to me though, don''t get a real sense of the feel of the denim.</td>', 'Quality bright punchy shot. Great detailing and colour and focus. Works compositionally too, within that framing. The black plastic thing visible through the button-hole is a shame, but not that terrible. Only does half a job on communicating texture to me though, don''t get a real sense of the feel of the denim.', '2004-02-20 10:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(590374, 60983, 15295, '<td valign="top">Long exposures and running water make great effects.  I really like this picture and your title matches perfectly.  8</td>', 'Long exposures and running water make great effects.  I really like this picture and your title matches perfectly.  8', '2004-02-20 10:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(590376, 60656, 14476, '<td valign="top">I wonder why your image had to be validated?  It''s a nice take on the Challenge, lovely colors and good seeing.  Probably venetian blinds or house siding. Possibly a blue filter...  It doesn''t matter, it''s terrific photography and an exciting visual as well.  Good! (also:  One of those rare incidences where the border works well with the picture. .. I''m not against borders, they just ought to work!)   9</td>', 'I wonder why your image had to be validated?  It''s a nice take on the Challenge, lovely colors and good seeing.  Probably venetian blinds or house siding. Possibly a blue filter...  It doesn''t matter, it''s terrific photography and an exciting visual as well.  Good! (also:  One of those rare incidences where the border works well with the picture. .. I''m not against borders, they just ought to work!)   9', '2004-02-20 10:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(590378, 60109, 15295, '<td valign="top">The texture is great...I like the wood grain and the texture that was left by the saw blade.  However, the picture doesn''t wow me at all. 5</td>', 'The texture is great...I like the wood grain and the texture that was left by the saw blade.  However, the picture doesn''t wow me at all. 5', '2004-02-20 10:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590379, 61076, 15295, '<td valign="top">A closer shot would be great!</td>', 'A closer shot would be great!', '2004-02-20 10:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(590381, 60814, 6999, '<td valign="top">I find this an uncomfortable composition, this curl away from the camera, and only really suggested by focus - I would try to shoot it so that that movement was at least in the two dimensions you actually have available in a photograph, that would lead the eye more successfully, I think. Good work on the metal texture.</td>', 'I find this an uncomfortable composition, this curl away from the camera, and only really suggested by focus - I would try to shoot it so that that movement was at least in the two dimensions you actually have available in a photograph, that would lead the eye more successfully, I think. Good work on the metal texture.', '2004-02-20 10:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(590383, 60433, 14476, '<td valign="top">Your fluffy  hawk has a great catchllight, but lacks a bit of feather detail.  The tree trunk, however, fits the Category.   Good seeing.</td>', 'Your fluffy  hawk has a great catchllight, but lacks a bit of feather detail.  The tree trunk, however, fits the Category.   Good seeing.', '2004-02-20 10:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(590386, 60922, 14476, '<td valign="top">Your coin is a good take on the Challenge even if it is hemmed in pretty tightly by that heavy border.  Good closeup photography.</td>', 'Your coin is a good take on the Challenge even if it is hemmed in pretty tightly by that heavy border.  Good closeup photography.', '2004-02-20 10:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(590387, 60785, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good detail composition - a strong sense of balance here. A feeliong of a rough texture, which is good. Perhaps a less harsh light would have emphasised that more, some of the shaping is flattened by the light like this.</td>', 'Good detail composition - a strong sense of balance here. A feeliong of a rough texture, which is good. Perhaps a less harsh light would have emphasised that more, some of the shaping is flattened by the light like this.', '2004-02-20 10:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(590389, 61132, 14476, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition on this one.  It''s cute and a nice take on the Challenge.  The popcorn (what remains of it!!) could have been a bit crisper, but overall, it is good.</td>', 'I really like your composition on this one.  It''s cute and a nice take on the Challenge.  The popcorn (what remains of it!!) could have been a bit crisper, but overall, it is good.', '2004-02-20 10:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(590390, 60817, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good on the fuzzy furriness, good on the black and white, and an interestingly high-tech approach to take to a kiddie''s toy -like the contrast of subject and presentation. Almost think he might have an Uzi hidden behind him. Mean.</td>', 'Good on the fuzzy furriness, good on the black and white, and an interestingly high-tech approach to take to a kiddie''s toy -like the contrast of subject and presentation. Almost think he might have an Uzi hidden behind him. Mean.', '2004-02-20 10:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(590393, 60036, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good light here -  especially effective on the towelling surfaces. A touch confusing with that panel or whatever it is in the background, but it serves to provide some balance at least.</td>', 'Good light here -  especially effective on the towelling surfaces. A touch confusing with that panel or whatever it is in the background, but it serves to provide some balance at least.', '2004-02-20 10:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(590394, 59961, 14476, '<td valign="top">You were going to limited depth of field and you succeeded nicely.  It''s a good take on the Challenge.  If I was to "nit pick", I''d say maybe some of the background could be cropped out without losing the statement you wanted to make.  Nice job, good color!</td>', 'You were going to limited depth of field and you succeeded nicely.  It''s a good take on the Challenge.  If I was to "nit pick", I''d say maybe some of the background could be cropped out without losing the statement you wanted to make.  Nice job, good color!', '2004-02-20 10:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(590395, 60192, 15295, '<td valign="top">If the light was used just little better this shot would win.  A sponge has so much texture, but your picture is a little over exposed in some areas and others the shadow hides that texture.</td>', 'If the light was used just little better this shot would win.  A sponge has so much texture, but your picture is a little over exposed in some areas and others the shadow hides that texture.', '2004-02-20 10:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(590396, 60858, 15295, '<td valign="top">Cha-Ching!  What is the texture of a bunch of coins?</td>', 'Cha-Ching!  What is the texture of a bunch of coins?', '2004-02-20 10:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(590398, 61101, 14476, '<td valign="top">You sure did get the texture on these keys.  Good seeing.  To make this photo really stand out, it might have been good to introduce another shape or color somewhere in the composition to give it extra interest.  Nevertheless, nice work.</td>', 'You sure did get the texture on these keys.  Good seeing.  To make this photo really stand out, it might have been good to introduce another shape or color somewhere in the composition to give it extra interest.  Nevertheless, nice work.', '2004-02-20 10:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(590400, 60862, 15295, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, are you getting much comments about focus?  I thinks it''s good but my picture has a similar focus and it''s getting beaten up.</td>', 'Very nice picture, are you getting much comments about focus?  I thinks it''s good but my picture has a similar focus and it''s getting beaten up.', '2004-02-20 10:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(590401, 61005, 6999, '<td valign="top">Weird - this might be the first time i''ve ever seen a shot here lit with on-board flash that actually works happily - those shadows serve here ot emphasise the depth of the scene, rather than flattening it out as with so much careless work. properly controlled too, not murdering the sense of texture at all. Good detailing, and good toning too.</td>', 'Weird - this might be the first time i''ve ever seen a shot here lit with on-board flash that actually works happily - those shadows serve here ot emphasise the depth of the scene, rather than flattening it out as with so much careless work. properly controlled too, not murdering the sense of texture at all. Good detailing, and good toning too.', '2004-02-20 10:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(590403, 60379, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good shaping, and works well for a simple rhythmic composition. The progression of light across frame adds a sense of interest, although not quite enough for me: it remains a pretty pattern, but not striking enough to really grab me. excellent detailing, and certainly fitting. 6</td>', 'Good shaping, and works well for a simple rhythmic composition. The progression of light across frame adds a sense of interest, although not quite enough for me: it remains a pretty pattern, but not striking enough to really grab me. excellent detailing, and certainly fitting. 6', '2004-02-20 10:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590406, 61027, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very good texture on the stone-work, and I quite like your title - almost the most insignificant detail in frame, and yet without it it would eb so very boring. Good colouring - that velvety purple-blue emphasises the stone nicely.</td>', 'Very good texture on the stone-work, and I quite like your title - almost the most insignificant detail in frame, and yet without it it would eb so very boring. Good colouring - that velvety purple-blue emphasises the stone nicely.', '2004-02-20 10:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(590410, 60885, 6999, '<td valign="top">Might almost be a plastic orang for all that one can tell here: reflecting the light from a surface, rather more impactfully than simply illuminating it, thends to lend things a certain plastic look, although it can emphasise shiny metallic surfaces too. Here it''s removed the organic quality from the subject, for me. Not an attention holding shot though, i fear.</td>', 'Might almost be a plastic orang for all that one can tell here: reflecting the light from a surface, rather more impactfully than simply illuminating it, thends to lend things a certain plastic look, although it can emphasise shiny metallic surfaces too. Here it''s removed the organic quality from the subject, for me. Not an attention holding shot though, i fear.', '2004-02-20 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(590414, 59885, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very good on the texture here. Good rhythmically too - and the slight progression of light, both in intensity and angle across frame is effective. Kind of thing that would make a good tiling pattern, but simply doesn''t have enough to hold my interest long. technically exemplary though, nevertheless.</td>', 'Very good on the texture here. Good rhythmically too - and the slight progression of light, both in intensity and angle across frame is effective. Kind of thing that would make a good tiling pattern, but simply doesn''t have enough to hold my interest long. technically exemplary though, nevertheless.', '2004-02-20 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(590417, 61066, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work. I think you''ve cropped too tighly to these stamens though - not given them room to breath in the composition., especially on the sides. Pity you couldn''t have kept some of the pollen off the petals too, but that''s a hell of an ask - but then this kind of shooting is for absolutelperfectionists, and that perfection is quantifiable in these terms. Still good work though.</td>', 'Good work. I think you''ve cropped too tighly to these stamens though - not given them room to breath in the composition., especially on the sides. Pity you couldn''t have kept some of the pollen off the petals too, but that''s a hell of an ask - but then this kind of shooting is for absolutelperfectionists, and that perfection is quantifiable in these terms. Still good work though.', '2004-02-20 10:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(590421, 60745, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very good. compositional use of the petals is top stuff, detailing and sense of feel on the opened bud is wonderful, high-key functions well, and balance within frame is spot-on. Greetings-card pretty. And I''m no fan of Flowery greetings cards :-)</td>', 'Very good. compositional use of the petals is top stuff, detailing and sense of feel on the opened bud is wonderful, high-key functions well, and balance within frame is spot-on. Greetings-card pretty. And I''m no fan of Flowery greetings cards :-)', '2004-02-20 11:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(590425, 60588, 15295, '<td valign="top">You know I don''t know if I could eat Turkey again without thinking of this picture.  This looks nasty as heck but it is a great picture.</td>', 'You know I don''t know if I could eat Turkey again without thinking of this picture.  This looks nasty as heck but it is a great picture.', '2004-02-20 11:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(590434, 61114, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nicely composed arrangement, and well lighted to bring out the textures.</td>', 'A nicely composed arrangement, and well lighted to bring out the textures.', '2004-02-20 11:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(590435, 61128, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice texture on the lizard''s leg. IMHO more DOF to keep the body in focus and the inculsion of the beast''s head - even at the expense of the back leg - would have added a lot.</td>', 'Nice texture on the lizard''s leg. IMHO more DOF to keep the body in focus and the inculsion of the beast''s head - even at the expense of the back leg - would have added a lot.', '2004-02-20 11:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(590436, 60939, 12733, '<td valign="top">The back light really brings out the textures of these transluscent petals. Nice color and compostion.</td>', 'The back light really brings out the textures of these transluscent petals. Nice color and compostion.', '2004-02-20 11:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(590439, 61130, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice textures in the foreground, but IMHO it needs either more DOF or less background.</td>', 'Nice textures in the foreground, but IMHO it needs either more DOF or less background.', '2004-02-20 11:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(590440, 60950, 14221, '<td valign="top">very nice aqua colors.</td>', 'very nice aqua colors.', '2004-02-20 11:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(590441, 60185, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice texture.  Lighting seems a little extreme -</td>', 'Nice texture.  Lighting seems a little extreme -', '2004-02-20 11:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(590442, 59908, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute pun in the title. The lighting brings out the smooth texture of the paper well. I''m not sure whether the glass adds to the picture or is simply a distraction, but that may be an element that keeps people looking at the picture.</td>', 'Cute pun in the title. The lighting brings out the smooth texture of the paper well. I''m not sure whether the glass adds to the picture or is simply a distraction, but that may be an element that keeps people looking at the picture.', '2004-02-20 11:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(590443, 60565, 12733, '<td valign="top">This brings out the color and texture of a pineapple in a way that changes the way I will look at them in the future. Very good shot.</td>', 'This brings out the color and texture of a pineapple in a way that changes the way I will look at them in the future. Very good shot.', '2004-02-20 11:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(590444, 61035, 14221, '<td valign="top">Why not a shot of just the clock, without so much of the surrounding cabinet?  I think it would have more visual impact.</td>', 'Why not a shot of just the clock, without so much of the surrounding cabinet?  I think it would have more visual impact.', '2004-02-20 11:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(590445, 61049, 4767, '<td valign="top">The bright light may have an important compositional raison d''etre, or I may be missing some subtle cerebral in-joke, but to me it''s distracting from the wonderful texture of the tee.</td>', 'The bright light may have an important compositional raison d''etre, or I may be missing some subtle cerebral in-joke, but to me it''s distracting from the wonderful texture of the tee.', '2004-02-20 11:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(590446, 61039, 12733, '<td valign="top">This shows the textures well, but the title throws me completely. The title is NOT part of the rating a picture gets.</td>', 'This shows the textures well, but the title throws me completely. The title is NOT part of the rating a picture gets.', '2004-02-20 11:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(590447, 61096, 4767, '<td valign="top">Textures are nice.  Make the ring almost incidental.</td>', 'Textures are nice.  Make the ring almost incidental.', '2004-02-20 11:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(590448, 61145, 14221, '<td valign="top">Great shot in a stock/advertising kind of way.  Lighting and exposure are just about perfect.</td>', 'Great shot in a stock/advertising kind of way.  Lighting and exposure are just about perfect.', '2004-02-20 11:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(590450, 60039, 4767, '<td valign="top">nice contrasting textures.</td>', 'nice contrasting textures.', '2004-02-20 11:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(590452, 60787, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the texture of toast. I think black and white was a good choice for this picture - color would have distracted from the texture.</td>', 'Nice capture of the texture of toast. I think black and white was a good choice for this picture - color would have distracted from the texture.', '2004-02-20 11:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(590453, 60241, 4767, '<td valign="top">Dramatic and intriguing!</td>', 'Dramatic and intriguing!', '2004-02-20 11:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(590454, 61091, 15660, '<td valign="top">Maybe if you got a difrend angle it would be better?</td>', 'Maybe if you got a difrend angle it would be better?', '2004-02-20 11:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(590455, 60705, 12733, '<td valign="top">This picture is too dark to make out what the subject is. It wouldn''t take much lightening to make it a much better photo.</td>', 'This picture is too dark to make out what the subject is. It wouldn''t take much lightening to make it a much better photo.', '2004-02-20 11:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(590457, 60439, 15660, '<td valign="top">Scary :)<br/>But I like it! Nice background.</td>', 'Scary :)But I like it! Nice background.', '2004-02-20 11:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(590458, 61069, 14221, '<td valign="top">For me, a shot like this needs to be well lit and in super sharp focus.  Not a bad attempt though.</td>', 'For me, a shot like this needs to be well lit and in super sharp focus.  Not a bad attempt though.', '2004-02-20 11:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(590459, 60185, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great closeup; it really brings out the texture.</td>', 'Great closeup; it really brings out the texture.', '2004-02-20 11:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(590460, 60792, 4767, '<td valign="top">Fron the Firth of Forth, I assume?  (Great name for a body of water!)  Has interesting composition.  I imagine some will not see this as a "texture" shot.  Their loss.</td>', 'Fron the Firth of Forth, I assume?  (Great name for a body of water!)  Has interesting composition.  I imagine some will not see this as a "texture" shot.  Their loss.', '2004-02-20 11:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(590461, 59996, 4767, '<td valign="top">Great title!  Nice shot!</td>', 'Great title!  Nice shot!', '2004-02-20 11:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(590462, 59955, 15660, '<td valign="top">he,he... the sparklying coloures remind me of Studio 54 ;)</td>', 'he,he... the sparklying coloures remind me of Studio 54 ;)', '2004-02-20 11:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590463, 60691, 4767, '<td valign="top">Ouch!!!  The texture of....pain?</td>', 'Ouch!!!  The texture of....pain?', '2004-02-20 11:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(590464, 60457, 12733, '<td valign="top">The closeup part of the photo is great - but the majority is way out of focus. A crop just above the sharp area, leaving only a little out of focus, or a straighter-on angle in taking the picture would improve it. I see what you''re trying to achieve, but IMHO it doesn''t work.</td>', 'The closeup part of the photo is great - but the majority is way out of focus. A crop just above the sharp area, leaving only a little out of focus, or a straighter-on angle in taking the picture would improve it. I see what you''re trying to achieve, but IMHO it doesn''t work.', '2004-02-20 11:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(590465, 61061, 4767, '<td valign="top">NICE!  I like it!</td>', 'NICE!  I like it!', '2004-02-20 11:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(590468, 60198, 14221, '<td valign="top">Weird subject, strangely compelling. Extra points for originality and composition.</td>', 'Weird subject, strangely compelling. Extra points for originality and composition.', '2004-02-20 11:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(590469, 61108, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great sense of the texture of the leather. The choice of an old, well-worn ball was a good one. A new ball would have been a lot less interesting.</td>', 'Great sense of the texture of the leather. The choice of an old, well-worn ball was a good one. A new ball would have been a lot less interesting.', '2004-02-20 11:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(590470, 61138, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice - you can see every stitch and even the texture within the threads.</td>', 'Very nice - you can see every stitch and even the texture within the threads.', '2004-02-20 11:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(590472, 60284, 12733, '<td valign="top">These are lovely, delicate colors and a nice capture of the plant''s texture.</td>', 'These are lovely, delicate colors and a nice capture of the plant''s texture.', '2004-02-20 11:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(590473, 60737, 12733, '<td valign="top">Peeling paint shows great texture, and you''ve captured it well.</td>', 'Peeling paint shows great texture, and you''ve captured it well.', '2004-02-20 11:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(590474, 60770, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good fine detail, and exemplary modelling of the shape of this thing with your lighting, colour rendition good too. Somehow it doesn''t really suggest texture to me - perhap either because the painting of it (I presume that''s how it gets to be grey) masks that, or perhaps because the light is just s touch too general: almost all shots which really display texture have more directional lighting than this. Cerainly one can see the different teypes of stuff - I''m talking about the really tactile quality one gets in some photos however. Nice work though.</td>', 'Good fine detail, and exemplary modelling of the shape of this thing with your lighting, colour rendition good too. Somehow it doesn''t really suggest texture to me - perhap either because the painting of it (I presume that''s how it gets to be grey) masks that, or perhaps because the light is just s touch too general: almost all shots which really display texture have more directional lighting than this. Cerainly one can see the different teypes of stuff - I''m talking about the really tactile quality one gets in some photos however. Nice work though.', '2004-02-20 11:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(590475, 60109, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of texture, and the colors are very pretty too.</td>', 'Nice capture of texture, and the colors are very pretty too.', '2004-02-20 11:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(590476, 59903, 12733, '<td valign="top">A pretty shell, and nicely lighted to bring out the texture.</td>', 'A pretty shell, and nicely lighted to bring out the texture.', '2004-02-20 11:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(590477, 60742, 15660, '<td valign="top">WOW! I like it!<br/>You are happy to live near such place! - 7</td>', 'WOW! I like it!You are happy to live near such place! - 7', '2004-02-20 11:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(590478, 61130, 6999, '<td valign="top">The tonality workd well with the theme and subject - a real sense of bedside light. You''ve caught a good sense of the osftness, and yet the patterened texture of that pillow; however its quite a bland scene really, isn''t it? Nice feel, but not a great deal going on to really grab the attention.</td>', 'The tonality workd well with the theme and subject - a real sense of bedside light. You''ve caught a good sense of the osftness, and yet the patterened texture of that pillow; however its quite a bland scene really, isn''t it? Nice feel, but not a great deal going on to really grab the attention.', '2004-02-20 11:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(590479, 59833, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting to bring out the texture. The texture of the fabric the mouse is resting on doesn''t look like a mouse pad, but you''ve brought it out well.</td>', 'Nice lighting to bring out the texture. The texture of the fabric the mouse is resting on doesn''t look like a mouse pad, but you''ve brought it out well.', '2004-02-20 11:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(590480, 59885, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice closeup, and the lighting brings the texture out nicely.</td>', 'This is a really nice closeup, and the lighting brings the texture out nicely.', '2004-02-20 11:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(590484, 60895, 6999, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what''s going on here, so I''ll ahve to treat this as an abstract shot. There is a little sense of texture, despite your use of  flash here, which has taken away a lot of the sense of depth and feel to this shot. That diagonal is a classic compositional technique, but there really isn''t enough going on here to hold my attention for very long I''m afraid. I''m certain you had some sort of impact in mind, but it isn''t clear to me.</td>', 'Don''t know what''s going on here, so I''ll ahve to treat this as an abstract shot. There is a little sense of texture, despite your use of  flash here, which has taken away a lot of the sense of depth and feel to this shot. That diagonal is a classic compositional technique, but there really isn''t enough going on here to hold my attention for very long I''m afraid. I''m certain you had some sort of impact in mind, but it isn''t clear to me.', '2004-02-20 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(590485, 60343, 17228, '<td valign="top">I agree that music has texture (audibly), but visually this pic just doesn''t show any texture of interest. If it''s there, it''s too far away to appreciate. Closer next perhaps? I think you''ve captured a good "mood" here, though.  :)</td>', 'I agree that music has texture (audibly), but visually this pic just doesn''t show any texture of interest. If it''s there, it''s too far away to appreciate. Closer next perhaps? I think you''ve captured a good "mood" here, though.  :)', '2004-02-20 11:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(590488, 60011, 14221, '<td valign="top">You really did capture the rough, yet soft texture very well.  Something about the composition....too busy maybe?  Still a good shot.</td>', 'You really did capture the rough, yet soft texture very well.  Something about the composition....too busy maybe?  Still a good shot.', '2004-02-20 11:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(590489, 60745, 14221, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting.  Congrats on a great shot.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting.  Congrats on a great shot.', '2004-02-20 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(590490, 60804, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup. Whatever is in the background that is partially filling up the button hole really clutters and detracts from an otherwise clean shot.</td>', 'Nice closeup. Whatever is in the background that is partially filling up the button hole really clutters and detracts from an otherwise clean shot.', '2004-02-20 11:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(590497, 60892, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and closeup. Others might have shot the entire frame and lost the impact of it''s texture and details.</td>', 'Nice composition and closeup. Others might have shot the entire frame and lost the impact of it''s texture and details.', '2004-02-20 11:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(590499, 60866, 16595, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better without the padlock</td>', 'I think it would be better without the padlock', '2004-02-20 11:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(590503, 60596, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a apretty good take on the challenge.  It could be a bit sharper.  The monochromatic technique isn''t quite perfect for this subject.  A bit of interest, perhaps a pin or flower would also work well with this image.  I  like the way you composed the shot.</td>', 'This is a apretty good take on the challenge.  It could be a bit sharper.  The monochromatic technique isn''t quite perfect for this subject.  A bit of interest, perhaps a pin or flower would also work well with this image.  I  like the way you composed the shot.', '2004-02-20 11:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(590504, 59882, 15660, '<td valign="top">I like it alot!<br/>I like the red/black contrast!! My fafourtite! - 9</td>', 'I like it alot!I like the red/black contrast!! My fafourtite! - 9', '2004-02-20 11:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(590505, 60145, 15295, '<td valign="top">Great picture, I like the fact that I can see the pores on the beak and by the eyes.  This should do very well in the challenge.</td>', 'Great picture, I like the fact that I can see the pores on the beak and by the eyes.  This should do very well in the challenge.', '2004-02-20 11:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(590506, 60281, 14476, '<td valign="top">Your sanddollar shot is nicely composed and fits the challenge.  It could be a bit sharper, but the colors are  nice.</td>', 'Your sanddollar shot is nicely composed and fits the challenge.  It could be a bit sharper, but the colors are  nice.', '2004-02-20 11:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(590507, 61151, 15660, '<td valign="top">nice!<br/>Works for me! ;)) - 7</td>', 'nice!Works for me! ;)) - 7', '2004-02-20 11:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(590509, 60995, 15660, '<td valign="top">I WANT OT POP IT! ;))<br/>Damn, that''s an addiction! ;)<br/>he,he... nice pic! - 7</td>', 'I WANT OT POP IT! ;))Damn, that''s an addiction! ;)he,he... nice pic! - 7', '2004-02-20 11:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(590510, 61070, 14476, '<td valign="top">I like your pony image with its good texture in the mane and face.  (Looks like one of those beautiful Icelandic blond beauties)  Good definition, but if it was a bit sharper it would be even better.</td>', 'I like your pony image with its good texture in the mane and face.  (Looks like one of those beautiful Icelandic blond beauties)  Good definition, but if it was a bit sharper it would be even better.', '2004-02-20 11:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(590513, 60814, 15660, '<td valign="top">Heavy Metall!! ;))) yeah! :)</td>', 'Heavy Metall!! ;))) yeah! :)', '2004-02-20 11:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(590514, 61116, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice colors and fits the challenge.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice composition, nice colors and fits the challenge.  Good job.', '2004-02-20 11:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(590515, 61049, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good take on the Challenge.  Could be a bit sharper with slightly better depth of field.  But well seen.</td>', 'Good take on the Challenge.  Could be a bit sharper with slightly better depth of field.  But well seen.', '2004-02-20 11:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(590516, 61137, 15660, '<td valign="top">wow! :)<br/>Where did you found such grat strawbarry in this time of year?<br/>nice!! 8</td>', 'wow! :)Where did you found such grat strawbarry in this time of year?nice!! 8', '2004-02-20 11:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590519, 60848, 14476, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern in the bubbles and glass.  Nice lights and darks.  Fits the challenge beautifully.  The background would help the shot a great deal if it was really, really smooth.  Good job.</td>', 'Interesting pattern in the bubbles and glass.  Nice lights and darks.  Fits the challenge beautifully.  The background would help the shot a great deal if it was really, really smooth.  Good job.', '2004-02-20 12:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(590521, 60630, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shooting. There is some sense of the smoothness of what you''ve caught here, but little actual sensation of texture, for me. Not to say it isn''t a very good image - just not quite doing what was asked for. Stilla worthy entry though.</td>', 'Nice shooting. There is some sense of the smoothness of what you''ve caught here, but little actual sensation of texture, for me. Not to say it isn''t a very good image - just not quite doing what was asked for. Stilla worthy entry though.', '2004-02-20 12:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(590522, 59910, 15295, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, great texture.  This shot should win it all!  10</td>', 'Excellent shot, great texture.  This shot should win it all!  10', '2004-02-20 12:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(590523, 61061, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is good seeing and a nice take on the Challenge.  I like the regularity of the composition - you probably tried an asymetrical view, but chose this one - so, I say, "good job!"</td>', 'This is good seeing and a nice take on the Challenge.  I like the regularity of the composition - you probably tried an asymetrical view, but chose this one - so, I say, "good job!"', '2004-02-20 12:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590525, 60993, 15660, '<td valign="top">I like the Bijela background! It id verry simpa!<br/>And the kapljice are werry nice isto!<br/>I like it vrlo mnogo puno! - 7</td>', 'I like the Bijela background! It id verry simpa!And the kapljice are werry nice isto!I like it vrlo mnogo puno! - 7', '2004-02-20 12:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(590526, 61128, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the Challenge, but I wish you had shown all of this critter or at least the head.  Good definition, composition is a little difficult, but a good effort over all.</td>', 'Nice take on the Challenge, but I wish you had shown all of this critter or at least the head.  Good definition, composition is a little difficult, but a good effort over all.', '2004-02-20 12:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(590527, 60321, 6999, '<td valign="top">For me this could use a little more punch in the colours, or a higher level of contrast - something to bring it away from the entirely everyday look that it has. You''ve captured the texture of that nearer tree very well, and your composition is promising - but its in the tonality of the image that it falls down i think. Also the light was very general, very non-specific at the time - perhaps a touch more directionality in that light would help to enhance the sense of depth. a promising scene, but perhaps not under these lighting conditions.</td>', 'For me this could use a little more punch in the colours, or a higher level of contrast - something to bring it away from the entirely everyday look that it has. You''ve captured the texture of that nearer tree very well, and your composition is promising - but its in the tonality of the image that it falls down i think. Also the light was very general, very non-specific at the time - perhaps a touch more directionality in that light would help to enhance the sense of depth. a promising scene, but perhaps not under these lighting conditions.', '2004-02-20 12:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(590528, 61148, 14614, '<td valign="top">would like a bigger dof to get more of a sense of the texture</td>', 'would like a bigger dof to get more of a sense of the texture', '2004-02-20 12:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(590529, 61090, 14476, '<td valign="top">good textural contrast on this image that fits the challenge nicely.  Glad to see the red to act as a foil for the neutral colors.</td>', 'good textural contrast on this image that fits the challenge nicely.  Glad to see the red to act as a foil for the neutral colors.', '2004-02-20 12:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(590530, 61096, 17228, '<td valign="top">Satin fabric lends itself well to softer focus, but hurts the preconception that a diamond  (the focal point of this pic) should always be hard and sharp. Perhaps bring ring to forground and let the fabric fall into soft focus. Rather monotone overall, with not much contrast,  which lessens the impact of this particular subject, making the ring disappear in a sea of like-colored satin.</td>', 'Satin fabric lends itself well to softer focus, but hurts the preconception that a diamond  (the focal point of this pic) should always be hard and sharp. Perhaps bring ring to forground and let the fabric fall into soft focus. Rather monotone overall, with not much contrast,  which lessens the impact of this particular subject, making the ring disappear in a sea of like-colored satin.', '2004-02-20 12:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(590531, 60439, 14476, '<td valign="top">This guy is in great focus and positioning is right on for good composition.  Nice job.</td>', 'This guy is in great focus and positioning is right on for good composition.  Nice job.', '2004-02-20 12:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(590532, 61089, 14476, '<td valign="top">Munch would not be too worried about this scream, I''m afraid.  It''s a good take on the challenge, but  needs a bit more excitement for a really great photo.  Still a nice try.</td>', 'Munch would not be too worried about this scream, I''m afraid.  It''s a good take on the challenge, but  needs a bit more excitement for a really great photo.  Still a nice try.', '2004-02-20 12:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(590533, 60111, 14476, '<td valign="top">Interesting design and fits the challenge.  Maybe a bit ''hot'' from the underlighting, but a pretty image.</td>', 'Interesting design and fits the challenge.  Maybe a bit ''hot'' from the underlighting, but a pretty image.', '2004-02-20 12:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(590535, 60758, 14614, '<td valign="top">With such a shallow dof, I find it hard to feel any of the texture I know is there.</td>', 'With such a shallow dof, I find it hard to feel any of the texture I know is there.', '2004-02-20 12:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(590536, 60747, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good seeing.  Fits the challenge nicely.  You were successful in your limited depth of field attempt, but if it was mine, I''d probably crop about 1/3 off the top to keep the viewer in the picture longer.</td>', 'Good seeing.  Fits the challenge nicely.  You were successful in your limited depth of field attempt, but if it was mine, I''d probably crop about 1/3 off the top to keep the viewer in the picture longer.', '2004-02-20 12:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(590537, 61109, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, not great execution. The warmer top-side light is effective, but your fill from the right is too general, and perhaps too far to the front of the subject to provide real shaping. Those bright white reflections of the lamps are a shame too - might be worth experimenting with covering them a sheet of paper, to make the light softer, or even to reflect the light off apiece of white board (styrofoam, as the Americans term it, works very well for that. That should give you a more pleasing illumination, and even if there are still reflections, they should have that more professional feel to them. You have caught some texture here - follow the line of the text to the left and it''s really quite well shaped there - if you could get that effct everywhere you''ll really notiv=ce the improvement, Finally, it''s a pretty ordinary subject, no? Great for experimenting with light actually, but in terms of a photographic presentation, not one of the more intriguing things.</td>', 'Neat idea, not great execution. The warmer top-side light is effective, but your fill from the right is too general, and perhaps too far to the front of the subject to provide real shaping. Those bright white reflections of the lamps are a shame too - might be worth experimenting with covering them a sheet of paper, to make the light softer, or even to reflect the light off apiece of white board (styrofoam, as the Americans term it, works very well for that. That should give you a more pleasing illumination, and even if there are still reflections, they should have that more professional feel to them. You have caught some texture here - follow the line of the text to the left and it''s really quite well shaped there - if you could get that effct everywhere you''ll really notiv=ce the improvement, Finally, it''s a pretty ordinary subject, no? Great for experimenting with light actually, but in terms of a photographic presentation, not one of the more intriguing things.', '2004-02-20 12:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(590539, 60866, 14476, '<td valign="top">Another super rust picture with the perfect foil of a bright smooth lock to make a good contrast and keep up the interest.  While the lock could have been in better focus, it still was nicely done.</td>', 'Another super rust picture with the perfect foil of a bright smooth lock to make a good contrast and keep up the interest.  While the lock could have been in better focus, it still was nicely done.', '2004-02-20 12:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(590540, 59934, 15660, '<td valign="top">SW like Stars Wars?? :)</td>', 'SW like Stars Wars?? :)', '2004-02-20 12:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(590541, 60325, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the steely grey tones, and that patch of blue; like the compositional shaping of this too. There''s a solidly triangular construction through the frame, and that always makes for a satisfying process for the eye. Good sense of texture throughout too. Not quite making it to the top if the list for me, I suspect, but very close</td>', 'Like the steely grey tones, and that patch of blue; like the compositional shaping of this too. There''s a solidly triangular construction through the frame, and that always makes for a satisfying process for the eye. Good sense of texture throughout too. Not quite making it to the top if the list for me, I suspect, but very close', '2004-02-20 12:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(590544, 60721, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ah, You se, people can understand the subject of the bloody challenge. Forgive my cursing. Excellent demonstration, enhanced by the blueness of that reflected sky. Suffers a touch from that optical illusion of making the corners of the images not appear quite square, qhich confuses the eye a bit. Like the balance of the transparent windows and the reflective ones too, and all of which complements that excellently photographed facade.</td>', 'Ah, You se, people can understand the subject of the bloody challenge. Forgive my cursing. Excellent demonstration, enhanced by the blueness of that reflected sky. Suffers a touch from that optical illusion of making the corners of the images not appear quite square, qhich confuses the eye a bit. Like the balance of the transparent windows and the reflective ones too, and all of which complements that excellently photographed facade.', '2004-02-20 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(590546, 60247, 15660, '<td valign="top">nice rose!!! - 7</td>', 'nice rose!!! - 7', '2004-02-20 12:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(590547, 60705, 17228, '<td valign="top">Very cool subject matter has real potential. Photo could use some light bounced in from shadow side to open up some detail in otherwise pitch black shadows.  Rim lighting would help separate  subject from background as well. Frame/compose in closer for greater impact and to leave out distracting vertical tan piece on righ-hand side. Keept it up!  :)</td>', 'Very cool subject matter has real potential. Photo could use some light bounced in from shadow side to open up some detail in otherwise pitch black shadows.  Rim lighting would help separate  subject from background as well. Frame/compose in closer for greater impact and to leave out distracting vertical tan piece on righ-hand side. Keept it up!  :)', '2004-02-20 12:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(590548, 60960, 6999, '<td valign="top">Splendidly battered subject. Good work on the looming out of the trees trick, great exposure for me too (I suspect many won''t like the darkness) Works very appropriately in black and white. Doesn''t quite do the texture thing, in a oure sense - I don''t get a strong sense of the feel of the thing, rather of the look and location, and of course a wonderful mood.</td>', 'Splendidly battered subject. Good work on the looming out of the trees trick, great exposure for me too (I suspect many won''t like the darkness) Works very appropriately in black and white. Doesn''t quite do the texture thing, in a oure sense - I don''t get a strong sense of the feel of the thing, rather of the look and location, and of course a wonderful mood.', '2004-02-20 12:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(590550, 60057, 6999, '<td valign="top">very straightforward presentation of a pretty simple idea: not necessarily a bad thing, but it is lacking a touch of inspiration i think. Perhaps it might have been a touch more successful with some sense of location, though you have attained some degree of a sense of texture with the shot.</td>', 'very straightforward presentation of a pretty simple idea: not necessarily a bad thing, but it is lacking a touch of inspiration i think. Perhaps it might have been a touch more successful with some sense of location, though you have attained some degree of a sense of texture with the shot.', '2004-02-20 12:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(590556, 60921, 6999, '<td valign="top">And a beautifully photographed one at that. Great sense of texture - I almost took the same shot myself. Great light, perfect exposure, functions well in black and white, though might still function well in colour I would think - has the look of being that very dark green that is so appealing. I do feel you might have allowed a touch more room between it and your frame, it feels just a bit cramped to me. Top work</td>', 'And a beautifully photographed one at that. Great sense of texture - I almost took the same shot myself. Great light, perfect exposure, functions well in black and white, though might still function well in colour I would think - has the look of being that very dark green that is so appealing. I do feel you might have allowed a touch more room between it and your frame, it feels just a bit cramped to me. Top work', '2004-02-20 12:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(590558, 60997, 17228, '<td valign="top">Not much interesting going on in this photo, especially at focal point where the viewer''s eyes are drawn  because of selective focus. Look deeper for subjects with greater visual interest, texture, patterns, etc. Geez, I sound like a Chinese fortunate cookie!!!   Keep pluggin'' away!  :)</td>', 'Not much interesting going on in this photo, especially at focal point where the viewer''s eyes are drawn  because of selective focus. Look deeper for subjects with greater visual interest, texture, patterns, etc. Geez, I sound like a Chinese fortunate cookie!!!   Keep pluggin'' away!  :)', '2004-02-20 12:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(590559, 61060, 6999, '<td valign="top">You haven''t communicated much of that smoothness here - the lighting is quite head on, no? That takes away from the sense of texture in the shot. Good colour, but your positioning of the tie is a bit arbitrary seeming - doesn''t give much for the eye to follow through the picture.</td>', 'You haven''t communicated much of that smoothness here - the lighting is quite head on, no? That takes away from the sense of texture in the shot. Good colour, but your positioning of the tie is a bit arbitrary seeming - doesn''t give much for the eye to follow through the picture.', '2004-02-20 12:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(590562, 61138, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very illustrative photograph - had you tried raking the light across the surface a bit more you would perhaps have brought attention rather more to the texture than the colour and pattern of the thing. Good exposure though, and colour work. As a photograph, it doesn''t do muich more for me than simply illustrate an object, however.</td>', 'Very illustrative photograph - had you tried raking the light across the surface a bit more you would perhaps have brought attention rather more to the texture than the colour and pattern of the thing. Good exposure though, and colour work. As a photograph, it doesn''t do muich more for me than simply illustrate an object, however.', '2004-02-20 12:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(590565, 60974, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite good, in that blown-out highlights kind of mood. the blating of that finger like that does also serve to concentrate the eye on the wool, which is a neat trick. Nice sense of the wiriness of the wool too.</td>', 'Quite good, in that blown-out highlights kind of mood. the blating of that finger like that does also serve to concentrate the eye on the wool, which is a neat trick. Nice sense of the wiriness of the wool too.', '2004-02-20 12:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590567, 60966, 6999, '<td valign="top">Never quite convinced about the high-key approach for textural shots - the brightness of the white always seems to overwhelm the ability to see the detail. That is slightly the case here - though I think you''ve got prety close to getting over it. Good on the surface of the leaf, rather more tricky toward the edges. It does allow those tones to come through very well. however.</td>', 'Never quite convinced about the high-key approach for textural shots - the brightness of the white always seems to overwhelm the ability to see the detail. That is slightly the case here - though I think you''ve got prety close to getting over it. Good on the surface of the leaf, rather more tricky toward the edges. It does allow those tones to come through very well. however.', '2004-02-20 12:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(590569, 60482, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great moment - and a real sense of the softness of the thing. Might perhaps have been a touch brighter overall, or had more contrast maybe? Though this way you have been able to get great detail, and I wouldn''t weant that to be lost - just wonder if it might have had more punch? Good work, though.</td>', 'Great moment - and a real sense of the softness of the thing. Might perhaps have been a touch brighter overall, or had more contrast maybe? Though this way you have been able to get great detail, and I wouldn''t weant that to be lost - just wonder if it might have had more punch? Good work, though.', '2004-02-20 12:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(590573, 61105, 6999, '<td valign="top">Abstract it may be, but I get little sense of prickliness from it, nor, to be frank, of any other texture very much. Very flat lighting, I fear.</td>', 'Abstract it may be, but I get little sense of prickliness from it, nor, to be frank, of any other texture very much. Very flat lighting, I fear.', '2004-02-20 12:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(590575, 59817, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Composition, colour, exposure, framing all very assured. as a minor point, in such a regular composition, i think i might have tried to get more precisely level with that collar, the slight perspective on it seems out of place, but that counts for very little against such a top shot.</td>', 'Nice image. Composition, colour, exposure, framing all very assured. as a minor point, in such a regular composition, i think i might have tried to get more precisely level with that collar, the slight perspective on it seems out of place, but that counts for very little against such a top shot.', '2004-02-20 12:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(590576, 59953, 674, '<td valign="top">nice contrast of textures!</td>', 'nice contrast of textures!', '2004-02-20 12:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(590577, 60245, 6999, '<td valign="top">Little sense of texture here, I fear. The difference between any two individual hairs is very hard to make out, I think because the light is very flat and straight on. No feeling of three-dimensionality to this.</td>', 'Little sense of texture here, I fear. The difference between any two individual hairs is very hard to make out, I think because the light is very flat and straight on. No feeling of three-dimensionality to this.', '2004-02-20 12:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(590580, 60700, 6999, '<td valign="top">Love the light through that gap, and the shaping and leaning of the trees. get a stronger sense of patterning and form, rather than the immediacy of texture, but it remains a good assured photograph. excellently composed too, there''s good motion in it.</td>', 'Love the light through that gap, and the shaping and leaning of the trees. get a stronger sense of patterning and form, rather than the immediacy of texture, but it remains a good assured photograph. excellently composed too, there''s good motion in it.', '2004-02-20 12:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(590581, 60738, 17228, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what that thing is in this photo, and I''m not sure I WANT to know.  ;)   Photo makes viewer feel like a voyeur, peeking  out from behind blurred object in foreground (cool), unfortunately I''m not rewarded for all my stealthy effort with a subject of greater interest or texture. The viewer really, REALLY needs this payoff since the majority of this pic is blurred. This idea might work really well in another challenge. Keep it up!</td>', 'I''m not sure what that thing is in this photo, and I''m not sure I WANT to know.  ;)   Photo makes viewer feel like a voyeur, peeking  out from behind blurred object in foreground (cool), unfortunately I''m not rewarded for all my stealthy effort with a subject of greater interest or texture. The viewer really, REALLY needs this payoff since the majority of this pic is blurred. This idea might work really well in another challenge. Keep it up!', '2004-02-20 12:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(590582, 61138, 17228, '<td valign="top">I think the title of this photo is even more interesting than the actual photo itself!  :)</td>', 'I think the title of this photo is even more interesting than the actual photo itself!  :)', '2004-02-20 12:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(590583, 60418, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very good on those tail feathers - perhaps less so on the head of the swan, which is inevitably the main attention grabber here. The focus and detail there seem so much more forced than on that tail, where the gentleness and sheer featheriness have really come through. A touch of halo-ing from too much sharpening around the neck and some of the shadow lines, but pretty good overall.</td>', 'Very good on those tail feathers - perhaps less so on the head of the swan, which is inevitably the main attention grabber here. The focus and detail there seem so much more forced than on that tail, where the gentleness and sheer featheriness have really come through. A touch of halo-ing from too much sharpening around the neck and some of the shadow lines, but pretty good overall.', '2004-02-20 12:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(590584, 60037, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very good on the feel of the metal. Perhaps your composition could be improved - it''s oretty central, and has a lamp-post sticking out of it here, and to the left, behind it, there seems to be the ideal opportunity to combine a perspective up that street with a shot of teh sculpture, adding meaning to your title. All the basic technical stuff is solidly executed though - and its quite a subject.</td>', 'Very good on the feel of the metal. Perhaps your composition could be improved - it''s oretty central, and has a lamp-post sticking out of it here, and to the left, behind it, there seems to be the ideal opportunity to combine a perspective up that street with a shot of teh sculpture, adding meaning to your title. All the basic technical stuff is solidly executed though - and its quite a subject.', '2004-02-20 12:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(590587, 59934, 17228, '<td valign="top">Not sure how much effort or thought was put into this pic, but the results are really static. Could use greater directional light (looks really flat with no contrast or highlights) and less distracting elements in pic. Keep pluggin'' away!</td>', 'Not sure how much effort or thought was put into this pic, but the results are really static. Could use greater directional light (looks really flat with no contrast or highlights) and less distracting elements in pic. Keep pluggin'' away!', '2004-02-20 12:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(590588, 61108, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific texture shot that fits the challenge nicely.  The black and white approach works too..  Nice job.</td>', 'This is a terrific texture shot that fits the challenge nicely.  The black and white approach works too..  Nice job.', '2004-02-20 12:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(590591, 60321, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  Good texture in that tree.  It might have been interesting to see this in a slightly underexposed version to bring out more detail, or else raise the contrast a touch.  Still, a good job.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  Good texture in that tree.  It might have been interesting to see this in a slightly underexposed version to bring out more detail, or else raise the contrast a touch.  Still, a good job.', '2004-02-20 13:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(590594, 60028, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of this - its just too weird. Given those white corners, it looks like a mobile phone picture of a photograph.</td>', 'Not sure what to make of this - its just too weird. Given those white corners, it looks like a mobile phone picture of a photograph.', '2004-02-20 13:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(590595, 59817, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice color and texture. My eyes would have liked to see more of the hydrant ''compositionally'' though (is that a word???)   Extreme closeup would have made for cool abstract image as well.  Cool!   :)</td>', 'Nice color and texture. My eyes would have liked to see more of the hydrant ''compositionally'' though (is that a word???)   Extreme closeup would have made for cool abstract image as well.  Cool!   :)', '2004-02-20 13:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(590599, 60990, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fine detail and sense of light are exemplary. , and the texture of the strap and clasp very good too. Good light and shade. doesn''t particularly excite as a subject, but it''s certainly well photographed.</td>', 'Fine detail and sense of light are exemplary. , and the texture of the strap and clasp very good too. Good light and shade. doesn''t particularly excite as a subject, but it''s certainly well photographed.', '2004-02-20 13:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(590602, 60758, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not much sense of the feel of this thing - other than the fraying about the edges of those leaves. Depth of field is simply not great enough, to actually show any detail in most areas, and you seem to have cropped out the area of foreground leaves where the light might show the most texture.</td>', 'Not much sense of the feel of this thing - other than the fraying about the edges of those leaves. Depth of field is simply not great enough, to actually show any detail in most areas, and you seem to have cropped out the area of foreground leaves where the light might show the most texture.', '2004-02-20 13:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(590608, 59837, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost textbook illustration of this animal. Hugely assured photography, but I feel the concentration is too much on portraiture and not sufficiently on the texture of the thing: I just get the sense that the light is a touch too even to really make a great feature of that wartiness.</td>', 'Almost textbook illustration of this animal. Hugely assured photography, but I feel the concentration is too much on portraiture and not sufficiently on the texture of the thing: I just get the sense that the light is a touch too even to really make a great feature of that wartiness.', '2004-02-20 13:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590609, 60762, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very general light here - indeed, like bathroom light. Doesn''t really allow a great deal of texture to come through, and I''m not convinved by your cropping part of the bar of soap out. I get no particular sense of the feel of the soap, either of solidity or slipperiness, and only a small amount from the towelling.</td>', 'Very general light here - indeed, like bathroom light. Doesn''t really allow a great deal of texture to come through, and I''m not convinved by your cropping part of the bar of soap out. I get no particular sense of the feel of the soap, either of solidity or slipperiness, and only a small amount from the towelling.', '2004-02-20 13:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(590610, 60744, 15295, '<td valign="top">Great idea for texture, I like the way the sun bounces of the tree bark.</td>', 'Great idea for texture, I like the way the sun bounces of the tree bark.', '2004-02-20 13:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590612, 61027, 15295, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.</td>', 'I don''t get it.', '2004-02-20 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(590613, 61121, 6999, '<td valign="top">Certainly textural, as well as mural. However that''s about allthere is to this; nothing that really grabs my interst , indeed its perhaps the most minimal photo I''ve seen here. even to have had more of the wall going into the distance might give more for the eye to dwell on.</td>', 'Certainly textural, as well as mural. However that''s about allthere is to this; nothing that really grabs my interst , indeed its perhaps the most minimal photo I''ve seen here. even to have had more of the wall going into the distance might give more for the eye to dwell on.', '2004-02-20 13:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(590614, 60102, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I like the colors.  Maybe you could''ve added a border.</td>', 'Nice picture, I like the colors.  Maybe you could''ve added a border.', '2004-02-20 13:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(590615, 60965, 15295, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but it doesn''t speak texture to me.  5</td>', 'Great picture, but it doesn''t speak texture to me.  5', '2004-02-20 13:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(590616, 61051, 6999, '<td valign="top">Odd shot. Doesn''t do a lot for me - seems an odd composition. I get the ''space'' thing, and an almost nebula like process, but it has very little to do with texture really.</td>', 'Odd shot. Doesn''t do a lot for me - seems an odd composition. I get the ''space'' thing, and an almost nebula like process, but it has very little to do with texture really.', '2004-02-20 13:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590617, 60068, 15295, '<td valign="top">IMHO you should''ve focused on the thorns because that shows more texture than the flower.</td>', 'IMHO you should''ve focused on the thorns because that shows more texture than the flower.', '2004-02-20 13:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(590620, 61137, 15295, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, I like everything about it.  10</td>', 'Excellent shot, I like everything about it.  10', '2004-02-20 13:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(590622, 59907, 15295, '<td valign="top">Legos, great toy to use for texture.  However I think that the green background distracts the picture.  IMHO a full frame of the legos is better.</td>', 'Legos, great toy to use for texture.  However I think that the green background distracts the picture.  IMHO a full frame of the legos is better.', '2004-02-20 13:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(590623, 60458, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent detailing and texture on the nut and bolt: a wonderful feel. Compositionally weak however, don''t find any visual order in this presentation of shapes, and the left hand of the image seems unused, and not to add anything.</td>', 'Excellent detailing and texture on the nut and bolt: a wonderful feel. Compositionally weak however, don''t find any visual order in this presentation of shapes, and the left hand of the image seems unused, and not to add anything.', '2004-02-20 13:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(590624, 60756, 15295, '<td valign="top">That is a whole lot of cheerios!  Nice shot.</td>', 'That is a whole lot of cheerios!  Nice shot.', '2004-02-20 13:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(590625, 60288, 15295, '<td valign="top">Kind of that erie scary movie feeling.  Great shot.</td>', 'Kind of that erie scary movie feeling.  Great shot.', '2004-02-20 13:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(590626, 60850, 15295, '<td valign="top">Texture all through this shot.  The brush hairs, the handle and even the background.  great way to meet the challenge. 7</td>', 'Texture all through this shot.  The brush hairs, the handle and even the background.  great way to meet the challenge. 7', '2004-02-20 13:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(590627, 60108, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very good texture, very assured photography too. Kind of overly contrived perhaps, and despite the great technical work, just a touch, well, dull, really?</td>', 'Very good texture, very assured photography too. Kind of overly contrived perhaps, and despite the great technical work, just a touch, well, dull, really?', '2004-02-20 13:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(590628, 60872, 15295, '<td valign="top">Where is the texture?  The picture is good, but IMHO it doesn''t fit the challenge.</td>', 'Where is the texture?  The picture is good, but IMHO it doesn''t fit the challenge.', '2004-02-20 13:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(590630, 60648, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very harsh lighting, and little chance for the texture of the subjects to shine through. Good detail and colour however.</td>', 'Very harsh lighting, and little chance for the texture of the subjects to shine through. Good detail and colour however.', '2004-02-20 13:26:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(590631, 61032, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good sense of patterning, though perhaps atouch dark - the snow seems grey to me rather than really white, thugh the cleanness of the image is wonderful. Doesn''t actually communicate much texture - more a kind of structure and patterning.</td>', 'Good sense of patterning, though perhaps atouch dark - the snow seems grey to me rather than really white, thugh the cleanness of the image is wonderful. Doesn''t actually communicate much texture - more a kind of structure and patterning.', '2004-02-20 13:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(590632, 59955, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good on the colours, though not everso appealling, rather metallic. detail is very difficult to percieve her, has the sense of being out of focus, though with that extreme contrast it''s tricky to be sure.</td>', 'Good on the colours, though not everso appealling, rather metallic. detail is very difficult to percieve her, has the sense of being out of focus, though with that extreme contrast it''s tricky to be sure.', '2004-02-20 13:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(590633, 60518, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful gentle colouring, and some sense of a jelliness of texture, though small. Seem to be quite clear reflections. or rather refractions of a room in those globes though.</td>', 'Beautiful gentle colouring, and some sense of a jelliness of texture, though small. Seem to be quite clear reflections. or rather refractions of a room in those globes though.', '2004-02-20 13:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(590635, 60950, 15295, '<td valign="top">Great colors.</td>', 'Great colors.', '2004-02-20 13:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590637, 59938, 15295, '<td valign="top">Great picture and I can feel the rough texture of the rust.  Nice.</td>', 'Great picture and I can feel the rough texture of the rust.  Nice.', '2004-02-20 13:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(590641, 60997, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite indistinct. No real sense of directness of light, and therefore of texture - what appears to be your subject is relegated to the lower mid-tones, and a lot of detail is therefore lost.</td>', 'Quite indistinct. No real sense of directness of light, and therefore of texture - what appears to be your subject is relegated to the lower mid-tones, and a lot of detail is therefore lost.', '2004-02-20 13:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(590642, 60700, 15295, '<td valign="top">What is that in the background.  Nice picture by the way.</td>', 'What is that in the background.  Nice picture by the way.', '2004-02-20 13:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(590643, 60111, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good on the luminous quality, and the clarity of the glass, but little sense of feel from  this. Whilst presumably following the rule of thirds, moving it out of frame like that seems arbitrary - and the rules don''t necessarily pertain to a square aspec ratio. Good detail though.</td>', 'Good on the luminous quality, and the clarity of the glass, but little sense of feel from  this. Whilst presumably following the rule of thirds, moving it out of frame like that seems arbitrary - and the rules don''t necessarily pertain to a square aspec ratio. Good detail though.', '2004-02-20 13:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(590644, 60706, 15295, '<td valign="top">The blue background does a nice job to help me the viewer to focus on the hatch door.  Great picture, but I would''ve gone in closer to get more of the rust texture.</td>', 'The blue background does a nice job to help me the viewer to focus on the hatch door.  Great picture, but I would''ve gone in closer to get more of the rust texture.', '2004-02-20 13:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(590645, 60648, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nice, really nice...I could almost feel the flower.</td>', 'Nice, really nice...I could almost feel the flower.', '2004-02-20 13:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(590646, 60950, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not sure I go for those electric colours, don''t think they help with the display of these textures. It allseems very low in frame, too, and the empty space above it doesn''t serve a lot of function to me.</td>', 'Not sure I go for those electric colours, don''t think they help with the display of these textures. It allseems very low in frame, too, and the empty space above it doesn''t serve a lot of function to me.', '2004-02-20 13:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(590648, 60148, 15295, '<td valign="top">I can feel the texture, however with the title and the picture, I have no idea what I am looking at. I have been looking at this for a few minutes now, and I still have no clue.</td>', 'I can feel the texture, however with the title and the picture, I have no idea what I am looking at. I have been looking at this for a few minutes now, and I still have no clue.', '2004-02-20 13:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(590651, 61039, 15295, '<td valign="top">hahaha, with some hardware you are dead on...nice form of texture.</td>', 'hahaha, with some hardware you are dead on...nice form of texture.', '2004-02-20 13:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(590654, 60883, 15295, '<td valign="top">Texture all around, good job.</td>', 'Texture all around, good job.', '2004-02-20 13:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(590655, 60519, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting phenomenon, but not very well displayed, I feel: the fill flash on the nearer curls seems overly bright, and glaring off at least one of them, and then the tonality changes as we follow the tree up. No great sense of the texure of the curls either.</td>', 'Interesting phenomenon, but not very well displayed, I feel: the fill flash on the nearer curls seems overly bright, and glaring off at least one of them, and then the tonality changes as we follow the tree up. No great sense of the texure of the curls either.', '2004-02-20 13:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(590656, 60363, 15295, '<td valign="top">Lots of texture but very boring...4</td>', 'Lots of texture but very boring...4', '2004-02-20 13:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(590657, 60036, 15295, '<td valign="top">A terry cloth bunny, I like that kind of texture.  Nice shot, good use of natural light, and great colors.  Should do fairly well in this challenge.</td>', 'A terry cloth bunny, I like that kind of texture.  Nice shot, good use of natural light, and great colors.  Should do fairly well in this challenge.', '2004-02-20 13:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(590660, 61031, 15295, '<td valign="top">Ah man that would hurt.  Good idea but not very original.  I saw a similar B&amp;W in the previous texture challenge.</td>', 'Ah man that would hurt.  Good idea but not very original.  I saw a similar B&W in the previous texture challenge.', '2004-02-20 13:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(590661, 60273, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the suggestion of landscape in this weathered tree-stump (?) The rhythm of the circles shows well in black and white. Beyond that, lacks a fair bit of interest for me - noothing grabs and holds my eye, and doesn''t have that real detail of focus and lighting that are needed to reveal the texture, though that could also be simply the light you''ve chosen.</td>', 'Like the suggestion of landscape in this weathered tree-stump (?) The rhythm of the circles shows well in black and white. Beyond that, lacks a fair bit of interest for me - noothing grabs and holds my eye, and doesn''t have that real detail of focus and lighting that are needed to reveal the texture, though that could also be simply the light you''ve chosen.', '2004-02-20 13:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(590662, 60880, 15295, '<td valign="top">I like it, it does well in black and white.</td>', 'I like it, it does well in black and white.', '2004-02-20 13:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(590663, 60291, 15295, '<td valign="top">No wow effect in this picture.</td>', 'No wow effect in this picture.', '2004-02-20 13:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(590664, 60915, 6999, '<td valign="top">Really can''t see this as being about texture - the over-exposure on those pipes and boards doesn''t help that. Good, and reasonably intersting on the patterning of the scaffold, but without that real dynamic to grab the eye.</td>', 'Really can''t see this as being about texture - the over-exposure on those pipes and boards doesn''t help that. Good, and reasonably intersting on the patterning of the scaffold, but without that real dynamic to grab the eye.', '2004-02-20 13:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590667, 59996, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent sense of form, and gentleness of light to reveal that: really like the toning and shading. Nogreat sense of tactility I fear, but nevertheless a good photograph.</td>', 'Excellent sense of form, and gentleness of light to reveal that: really like the toning and shading. Nogreat sense of tactility I fear, but nevertheless a good photograph.', '2004-02-20 13:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(590668, 59998, 6999, '<td valign="top">Too small animage, don''t find the composition very pleasant, doesn''t exhibit much quality of texture to me either. Poor, as an entry I fear - just a snapshot.</td>', 'Too small animage, don''t find the composition very pleasant, doesn''t exhibit much quality of texture to me either. Poor, as an entry I fear - just a snapshot.', '2004-02-20 13:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(590672, 60093, 15295, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I don''t feel texture.</td>', 'Great shot, but I don''t feel texture.', '2004-02-20 13:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(590673, 60358, 15295, '<td valign="top">This is one of the winners, at least 3rd in my list.</td>', 'This is one of the winners, at least 3rd in my list.', '2004-02-20 13:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590674, 60039, 15295, '<td valign="top">Not focused.  nice idea though.</td>', 'Not focused.  nice idea though.', '2004-02-20 13:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(590676, 60925, 6999, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not enough regularity in this rhythmical composition to make it work - this kind of thing really needs to be almost absolutely regular to be effective, and this is broken up too much. Light is good, and detailing, though somehow not a reat deal of feel of texture comes through.</td>', 'Perhaps not enough regularity in this rhythmical composition to make it work - this kind of thing really needs to be almost absolutely regular to be effective, and this is broken up too much. Light is good, and detailing, though somehow not a reat deal of feel of texture comes through.', '2004-02-20 13:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(590677, 60316, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nice picture...</td>', 'Nice picture...', '2004-02-20 13:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(590679, 61121, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but more thought on the focus is needed.</td>', 'Nice shot, but more thought on the focus is needed.', '2004-02-20 13:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(590680, 60812, 11467, '<td valign="top">A bit too datrk</td>', 'A bit too datrk', '2004-02-20 13:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(590681, 60572, 6999, '<td valign="top">Pretty - might have been even more effective without those foreground drops - on the less is more proposition. Don''t get a strong sense of texture from it, but its a good image nevertheless.</td>', 'Pretty - might have been even more effective without those foreground drops - on the less is more proposition. Don''t get a strong sense of texture from it, but its a good image nevertheless.', '2004-02-20 13:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(590682, 60151, 15295, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  This is what I was going for but mine did not come out as good as yours did.  8</td>', 'Excellent.  This is what I was going for but mine did not come out as good as yours did.  8', '2004-02-20 13:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(590684, 60820, 11467, '<td valign="top">A more interesting background could make this into a nice image</td>', 'A more interesting background could make this into a nice image', '2004-02-20 13:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(590685, 61113, 15295, '<td valign="top">Texture is well represented but there is something about this that bothers me.  Maybe the color, which you can''t control, or the light.</td>', 'Texture is well represented but there is something about this that bothers me.  Maybe the color, which you can''t control, or the light.', '2004-02-20 13:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(590686, 60604, 6999, '<td valign="top">Works. First soft-focus shot i''ve seen i think, and very effective to soften that texture. Good composition, and marvellous gentle colouring.</td>', 'Works. First soft-focus shot i''ve seen i think, and very effective to soften that texture. Good composition, and marvellous gentle colouring.', '2004-02-20 13:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(590687, 60482, 15295, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture.  Godd job in representing texture.</td>', 'Really nice picture.  Godd job in representing texture.', '2004-02-20 13:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(590689, 60917, 11467, '<td valign="top">Image is too small</td>', 'Image is too small', '2004-02-20 13:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(590690, 61147, 15295, '<td valign="top">Texture??  Never seen a sea monkey before, very interesting.</td>', 'Texture??  Never seen a sea monkey before, very interesting.', '2004-02-20 13:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(590691, 60560, 15295, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.</td>', 'Nice picture.', '2004-02-20 13:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
