(590702, 60015, 6999, '<td valign="top">Rather meaningless, even as an abstract pattern. Might make a pleasant background for something, in an unobtrusive and bland kind of way. I find little interest in it, personally.</td>', 'Rather meaningless, even as an abstract pattern. Might make a pleasant background for something, in an unobtrusive and bland kind of way. I find little interest in it, personally.', '2004-02-20 14:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(590703, 60360, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very detailed, very realistic - which is what might be bothering me about it - just too simplistic an image. Don''t find a great deal to hold my attention in it. Some sense of texture atleast, which is more than many managed. very even light, almost like laboratory conditions.</td>', 'Very detailed, very realistic - which is what might be bothering me about it - just too simplistic an image. Don''t find a great deal to hold my attention in it. Some sense of texture atleast, which is more than many managed. very even light, almost like laboratory conditions.', '2004-02-20 14:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(590705, 60664, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good tones, good detail, and a very fine sense of texture - can almost fel the roughness of that wool, and the mtallicness of the zip is well displayed. Strong composition, but without that spark of fascination for me.</td>', 'Good tones, good detail, and a very fine sense of texture - can almost fel the roughness of that wool, and the mtallicness of the zip is well displayed. Strong composition, but without that spark of fascination for me.', '2004-02-20 14:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(590706, 60595, 6999, '<td valign="top">A touch too confused as a composition for me. Like the tones, like the sense of fragility. Doesn''t speak of texture to me exactly, but there is a certain quality of light that I do quite like here.</td>', 'A touch too confused as a composition for me. Like the tones, like the sense of fragility. Doesn''t speak of texture to me exactly, but there is a certain quality of light that I do quite like here.', '2004-02-20 14:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
