(590729, 60746, 6999, '<td valign="top">I find this a confising composition - the geometry of these forms is displayed in a slightly too busy manner, with the weight of the composition perhaps too heavily pushed toward the right of frame. Good tonally, and the focus is fine, but whether it''s the lighting or the fine detail something has removed a sense of real texture from this to my eye.</td>', 'I find this a confising composition - the geometry of these forms is displayed in a slightly too busy manner, with the weight of the composition perhaps too heavily pushed toward the right of frame. Good tonally, and the focus is fine, but whether it''s the lighting or the fine detail something has removed a sense of real texture from this to my eye.', '2004-02-20 14:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(590731, 60753, 17300, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot, but I dont really connect the photo to a creative interpretation of the theme texture.  Not off topic or anything, but does the viewer connect it to texture? Or is there something in the picture that makes you think about other themes?  Looking back at my own entry, I see the same weakness I like the DOF and thered texture of the wings.</td>', 'I like it a lot, but I dont really connect the photo to a creative interpretation of the theme texture.  Not off topic or anything, but does the viewer connect it to texture? Or is there something in the picture that makes you think about other themes?  Looking back at my own entry, I see the same weakness I like the DOF and thered texture of the wings.', '2004-02-20 14:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(590735, 60363, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great colours here, and good sense of feel. Despite the interest of those colours, I find this lacks a real sense of subject, of something to catch and hold my attention.</td>', 'Great colours here, and good sense of feel. Despite the interest of those colours, I find this lacks a real sense of subject, of something to catch and hold my attention.', '2004-02-20 14:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
