(590743, 60099, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good muted photo - a sense of the ominous from it - really good definition on the cotton. well framed, well composed, and beautiful lighting. I must say that I don''t understand your title however.</td>', 'Good muted photo - a sense of the ominous from it - really good definition on the cotton. well framed, well composed, and beautiful lighting. I must say that I don''t understand your title however.', '2004-02-20 14:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(590744, 61108, 17300, '<td valign="top">I like it and I see where you are going with it, but I dont really connect the photo to a creative interpretation of the theme texture.  Not off topic or anything, but I think of sports, somewhere around the 1950''s or so... There''s something in the picture that makes you think about other things than texture.  Choice of motif? Colour range? Don''t know and can''t exactly pinpoint it... But I like it anyway...</td>', 'I like it and I see where you are going with it, but I dont really connect the photo to a creative interpretation of the theme texture.  Not off topic or anything, but I think of sports, somewhere around the 1950''s or so... There''s something in the picture that makes you think about other things than texture.  Choice of motif? Colour range? Don''t know and can''t exactly pinpoint it... But I like it anyway...', '2004-02-20 14:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
