(590750, 60512, 15295, '<td valign="top">What the hell is that????  Great shot of the fuzzy feet and the leaf beneath this creature.  Is it a toy??  What the.......</td>', 'What the hell is that????  Great shot of the fuzzy feet and the leaf beneath this creature.  Is it a toy??  What the.......', '2004-02-20 14:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
