(590764, 59993, 6999, '<td valign="top">neat - but you need to look at your lighting - this angle is from pretty much the same direction as the camera, and that really gives you no chance whatsoever to see the texture nor to capture it photographically. The composition is quite strong basically, but the confusion of elements, and the lack of visible sense of surface really hurt this entry.</td>', 'neat - but you need to look at your lighting - this angle is from pretty much the same direction as the camera, and that really gives you no chance whatsoever to see the texture nor to capture it photographically. The composition is quite strong basically, but the confusion of elements, and the lack of visible sense of surface really hurt this entry.', '2004-02-20 14:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
