(590803, 60546, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice low key shot.  You are cropped a little tight for my taste.  Also the textures a bit de-emphasized due to not so creative lighting...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice low key shot.  You are cropped a little tight for my taste.  Also the textures a bit de-emphasized due to not so creative lighting...TC', '2004-02-20 14:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(590805, 60879, 14035, '<td valign="top">If you don''t win Iit will be a travesty. Wonderfull, wonderful photograph - you got one of my very rare 10s. Good luck.</td>', 'If you don''t win Iit will be a travesty. Wonderfull, wonderful photograph - you got one of my very rare 10s. Good luck.', '2004-02-20 14:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(590806, 60629, 6999, '<td valign="top">The colour is a touch muted for me - the ornage is quite geyed as I see it. Some sense of texture in that bag, but not much impression of the surfaces of the oranges. The composition is deceptively good though - at first i thought there was no reason for the cropping out fo the rest of teh bag, but actually there is a movememt through the scene here which is quite pleasing.</td>', 'The colour is a touch muted for me - the ornage is quite geyed as I see it. Some sense of texture in that bag, but not much impression of the surfaces of the oranges. The composition is deceptively good though - at first i thought there was no reason for the cropping out fo the rest of teh bag, but actually there is a movememt through the scene here which is quite pleasing.', '2004-02-20 14:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(590807, 61032, 9906, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it amazing what a fresh snow will do to mundane objects?  Nice shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'Isn''t it amazing what a fresh snow will do to mundane objects?  Nice shot.TC', '2004-02-20 14:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(590808, 59785, 14035, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and I like to monochromatic nature of it, but I ''d personally like to see a sharper focus in the foreground and the top right black spot is distracting. Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent idea and I like to monochromatic nature of it, but I ''d personally like to see a sharper focus in the foreground and the top right black spot is distracting. Good luck.', '2004-02-20 14:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(590809, 59979, 7369, '<td valign="top">[World Record Attempt]<br/>+ Texture is present and you have tried to make it somehow interesting by using the composition.<br/>- Still it isn''t very appealing to me.</td>', '[World Record Attempt]+ Texture is present and you have tried to make it somehow interesting by using the composition.- Still it isn''t very appealing to me.', '2004-02-20 14:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(590812, 61065, 14221, '<td valign="top">You know, this is pretty good photo that I wish I could take, but I''m thinking it does not represent the theme.  One, light is not 3-dimensional, nor does it have a texture in the traditional sense.  I''d like to know your thinking on this.  I''m voting it above average for the image itself, but taking some points off for not meeting the theme.</td>', 'You know, this is pretty good photo that I wish I could take, but I''m thinking it does not represent the theme.  One, light is not 3-dimensional, nor does it have a texture in the traditional sense.  I''d like to know your thinking on this.  I''m voting it above average for the image itself, but taking some points off for not meeting the theme.', '2004-02-20 14:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(590813, 60745, 17300, '<td valign="top">Really like this one, but for the theme I don''t associate it with texture (even if there is a lot of texture).I start thinking of other themes instead. I''ll give it a high rating anyway because I like the photo itself... a 10</td>', 'Really like this one, but for the theme I don''t associate it with texture (even if there is a lot of texture).I start thinking of other themes instead. I''ll give it a high rating anyway because I like the photo itself... a 10', '2004-02-20 14:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(590814, 60884, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m curious as to which textures the emphasis s suposed to be on.  I see more interesting textures in the background rather then the subject...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m curious as to which textures the emphasis s suposed to be on.  I see more interesting textures in the background rather then the subject...TC', '2004-02-20 14:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(590815, 59997, 6999, '<td valign="top">All about colour, and the range of intensities is so very limited. That almost exact fifty/fifty split of the screen doesn''t make for a pleasing composition in this image. No strong sense of texture either - could be plastic, or metal, or even organic.</td>', 'All about colour, and the range of intensities is so very limited. That almost exact fifty/fifty split of the screen doesn''t make for a pleasing composition in this image. No strong sense of texture either - could be plastic, or metal, or even organic.', '2004-02-20 14:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(590817, 60325, 17300, '<td valign="top">Good thinking. Like the structure the water brings out from mud... 10</td>', 'Good thinking. Like the structure the water brings out from mud... 10', '2004-02-20 14:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(590819, 60812, 14035, '<td valign="top">I know you can''t help it - Mother  Nature is a pretty headstrong old lady - but I find that my eye is drawn to the shafts of light in the left corner. Great idea. Aside from the lighting - excellent composition.</td>', 'I know you can''t help it - Mother  Nature is a pretty headstrong old lady - but I find that my eye is drawn to the shafts of light in the left corner. Great idea. Aside from the lighting - excellent composition.', '2004-02-20 14:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(590820, 60247, 14773, '<td valign="top">beautiful, the lack of lighting isn''t harsh at all...nice job</td>', 'beautiful, the lack of lighting isn''t harsh at all...nice job', '2004-02-20 14:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(590821, 59766, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting sense of perspective, and some feel of a plastic texture. doesn''t have anything to really grab my interst though, nothing to hold the eye.</td>', 'Interesting sense of perspective, and some feel of a plastic texture. doesn''t have anything to really grab my interst though, nothing to hold the eye.', '2004-02-20 14:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(590822, 61132, 9906, '<td valign="top">Decent composition, but it looks flat due to unimaginative lighting.  Bring in some light from the side and your popcorn might pop!<br/>TC</td>', 'Decent composition, but it looks flat due to unimaginative lighting.  Bring in some light from the side and your popcorn might pop!TC', '2004-02-20 14:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(590823, 59817, 14773, '<td valign="top">fire hydrant? Nice texture and color</td>', 'fire hydrant? Nice texture and color', '2004-02-20 14:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(590827, 60388, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, excellent colours and sense of motion. Almost a metallic solidity to the water here, and the refraction of the weed through the water is fantastic. Not sure it genuinely represents texture, but it''s so good anyway ...</td>', 'Beautiful shot, excellent colours and sense of motion. Almost a metallic solidity to the water here, and the refraction of the weed through the water is fantastic. Not sure it genuinely represents texture, but it''s so good anyway ...', '2004-02-20 15:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(590828, 59895, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice textures in the petals, but the center part (pistol?) is flat in appearance.  Nice overall composition and use of negative space!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice textures in the petals, but the center part (pistol?) is flat in appearance.  Nice overall composition and use of negative space!TC', '2004-02-20 15:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(590830, 60656, 6999, '<td valign="top">cool rhythmic composition: really like the regression of this. Some sense of metallic smoothness, but it''s really much more about that regression than about the sutfaces. Like it, but have reservations about it for this particular challenge.</td>', 'cool rhythmic composition: really like the regression of this. Some sense of metallic smoothness, but it''s really much more about that regression than about the sutfaces. Like it, but have reservations about it for this particular challenge.', '2004-02-20 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(590834, 59894, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very good on the powder, and the subtlety of the light is a joy. The low-contrast  mood is perfect for this kind of reflective mood.</td>', 'Very good on the powder, and the subtlety of the light is a joy. The low-contrast  mood is perfect for this kind of reflective mood.', '2004-02-20 15:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(590835, 60302, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very creative take on the challenge.  You have lovely colors and textures within a larger (somewhat chaotic) texture.  You are a touch overexposed in a couple of spots but not terribly distracting...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very creative take on the challenge.  You have lovely colors and textures within a larger (somewhat chaotic) texture.  You are a touch overexposed in a couple of spots but not terribly distracting...TC', '2004-02-20 15:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(590836, 60247, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful - looks almost like wood. Intense contrast, satisfying composition, real sense of weight and shape, and texture - albeit not an accurate texture, but what has that to do with anything?</td>', 'Wonderful - looks almost like wood. Intense contrast, satisfying composition, real sense of weight and shape, and texture - albeit not an accurate texture, but what has that to do with anything?', '2004-02-20 15:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(590839, 60727, 9906, '<td valign="top">A roll of paper towels?  Nice texture, but your focus appears to be a touch off.<br/>TC</td>', 'A roll of paper towels?  Nice texture, but your focus appears to be a touch off.TC', '2004-02-20 15:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(590841, 60932, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Wonderful lighting.  My only complaint is that the stem appears to be a touch soft on focus.  Love the crop.  I''d have to say best of show so far...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cool!  Wonderful lighting.  My only complaint is that the stem appears to be a touch soft on focus.  Love the crop.  I''d have to say best of show so far...TC', '2004-02-20 15:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
