(590846, 60768, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool portrait!  I love the tones here.   Is this a duo tone or tri or quad?  If so, I would love the recipe!  Focus is spot on for a portrait.  Unfortunately for this challenge (textures) the theme has been de-emphasized here.  A deeper DOF would help in this regard.  Overall a great shot that I''m sure will not score as well as it would in another challenge...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a very cool portrait!  I love the tones here.   Is this a duo tone or tri or quad?  If so, I would love the recipe!  Focus is spot on for a portrait.  Unfortunately for this challenge (textures) the theme has been de-emphasized here.  A deeper DOF would help in this regard.  Overall a great shot that I''m sure will not score as well as it would in another challenge...TC', '2004-02-20 15:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(590847, 61066, 14773, '<td valign="top">beautiful, nice color, light and composition</td>', 'beautiful, nice color, light and composition', '2004-02-20 15:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(590851, 59883, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice composition for the challenge.  The colors are very dull though.  I think that this might be a lighting issue, but it could just be that it needs a boost in levels...  As far as the textures go, you need to be just a bit more creative in the lighting.  Instead of from above, shine your lights in from the side.  This would help to create more shadows and thus more depth.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a very nice composition for the challenge.  The colors are very dull though.  I think that this might be a lighting issue, but it could just be that it needs a boost in levels...  As far as the textures go, you need to be just a bit more creative in the lighting.  Instead of from above, shine your lights in from the side.  This would help to create more shadows and thus more depth.TC', '2004-02-20 15:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(590852, 60758, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot appears to be underexposed and out of focus.  The composition might work if these other two elements were in place.  Nice color scheme!<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot appears to be underexposed and out of focus.  The composition might work if these other two elements were in place.  Nice color scheme!TC', '2004-02-20 15:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(590853, 60892, 14773, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, just something simple and symmetrical that keeps in interesting.</td>', 'I love this photo, just something simple and symmetrical that keeps in interesting.', '2004-02-20 15:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(590854, 59817, 7889, '<td valign="top">Excellent, i can feel the texture on this, great colours as well. good luck</td>', 'Excellent, i can feel the texture on this, great colours as well. good luck', '2004-02-20 15:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
