(591044, 60894, 13591, '<td valign="top">While I like this very much, and I did bump up the score on the third pass, the texture side of it weak.  If you get a chance to retake the photo, put a black backdrop behind you to block out the windows and reveal the true symmetry of the lenses.  Just my thoughts, but very nice shot.</td>', 'While I like this very much, and I did bump up the score on the third pass, the texture side of it weak.  If you get a chance to retake the photo, put a black backdrop behind you to block out the windows and reveal the true symmetry of the lenses.  Just my thoughts, but very nice shot.', '2004-02-20 17:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(591078, 60514, 14837, '<td valign="top">Very colorful!  This one is really nice</td>', 'Very colorful!  This one is really nice', '2004-02-20 18:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
