(591296, 61071, 11570, '<td valign="top">Err!!!  I have heard of strawberries and cream but rice?<br/> <br/>Very novel concept and well composed but the highlights blown on the cut surface &amp; that has diminished the texture effect. But a 6 for all that.</td>', 'Err!!!  I have heard of strawberries and cream but rice? Very novel concept and well composed but the highlights blown on the cut surface & that has diminished the texture effect. But a 6 for all that.', '2004-02-20 20:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(591298, 60744, 11570, '<td valign="top">Looks almost like a rock face.<br/> <br/>I do like tree bark but IMHO the incident lighting just does not seem to do it justice.  Maybe a little more sharpening would have given that "zip" to make it stand out.  Not sure.</td>', 'Looks almost like a rock face. I do like tree bark but IMHO the incident lighting just does not seem to do it justice.  Maybe a little more sharpening would have given that "zip" to make it stand out.  Not sure.', '2004-02-20 20:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
