(591305, 59837, 11570, '<td valign="top">I could like this a lot more if the DOF allowed the whole toad to be in focus especially as it would have given the chance to sharpen it just that tad more to reveal the texture.<br/> <br/>How did you get it sit still on that black backdrop?</td>', 'I could like this a lot more if the DOF allowed the whole toad to be in focus especially as it would have given the chance to sharpen it just that tad more to reveal the texture. How did you get it sit still on that black backdrop?', '2004-02-20 20:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
