(591478, 60894, 15330, '<td valign="top">The reflections are a little distracting from the headlight. I like the composition, its a nice take on an average object.</td>', 'The reflections are a little distracting from the headlight. I like the composition, its a nice take on an average object.', '2004-02-20 23:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(591480, 59997, 6349, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I''m afraid it''s not going to do so well on here though, people aren''t big fans of anything so rare.</td>', 'I really like this.  I''m afraid it''s not going to do so well on here though, people aren''t big fans of anything so rare.', '2004-02-20 23:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(591482, 60499, 15330, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting texture, one I haven''t seen used in the challenge yet. This photo needs an object too focus on, not just a plain texture.</td>', 'This is an interesting texture, one I haven''t seen used in the challenge yet. This photo needs an object too focus on, not just a plain texture.', '2004-02-20 23:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(591483, 61053, 6349, '<td valign="top">This shot is fantastic.  One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'This shot is fantastic.  One of my favorites so far.', '2004-02-20 23:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(591486, 61031, 6349, '<td valign="top">ouch!  poor grandma.  this is just silly, as I''m betting it was actually your idea and not the kids, but it''s cute  :)</td>', 'ouch!  poor grandma.  this is just silly, as I''m betting it was actually your idea and not the kids, but it''s cute  :)', '2004-02-20 23:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(591487, 60964, 6349, '<td valign="top">very intriguing shot.  That black band at the top needs to go.</td>', 'very intriguing shot.  That black band at the top needs to go.', '2004-02-20 23:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(591490, 60706, 6349, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I hate the border.  It is way too big.  I am sure a lot of other people have told you this already...but my suggestion would be eliminate the blue entirely and keep just the white line but make it a black line so that it doesn''t blend in with the right side of the photo where the burned out highlight is.  7</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I hate the border.  It is way too big.  I am sure a lot of other people have told you this already...but my suggestion would be eliminate the blue entirely and keep just the white line but make it a black line so that it doesn''t blend in with the right side of the photo where the burned out highlight is.  7', '2004-02-20 23:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(591493, 59953, 6349, '<td valign="top">seashells by the seashore.  Very abstract.  A good way of capturing the essence of texture without burdening the image with other information.  Great job.</td>', 'seashells by the seashore.  Very abstract.  A good way of capturing the essence of texture without burdening the image with other information.  Great job.', '2004-02-20 23:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(591494, 60980, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and exposure.  10</td>', 'Great lighting and exposure.  10', '2004-02-20 23:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(591495, 60151, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a good texture shot and it meets the challenge.,  To make it stand out, it could be a good idea to introduce another shape or color to keep the viewer interested in your composition.  Still, well exposed and good depth of field.</td>', 'This is a good texture shot and it meets the challenge.,  To make it stand out, it could be a good idea to introduce another shape or color to keep the viewer interested in your composition.  Still, well exposed and good depth of field.', '2004-02-20 23:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(591496, 60753, 6349, '<td valign="top">great macro.  I wish the background was a little darker, as that shade of green so light is a little to powerful for the naked human eye!  Ha, still a 10</td>', 'great macro.  I wish the background was a little darker, as that shade of green so light is a little to powerful for the naked human eye!  Ha, still a 10', '2004-02-20 23:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(591498, 60852, 6349, '<td valign="top">That''s a bizarre iris!</td>', 'That''s a bizarre iris!', '2004-02-20 23:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(591499, 61131, 14476, '<td valign="top">The soft focus makes it difficult to find the textures in this very nice composition.  Patterns of the carnations are nice and the vase shadow is good, depth of field could be a bit stronger on the vase.</td>', 'The soft focus makes it difficult to find the textures in this very nice composition.  Patterns of the carnations are nice and the vase shadow is good, depth of field could be a bit stronger on the vase.', '2004-02-20 23:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(591500, 60756, 14476, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the texture challenge.  It might have been a more interesting composition if you h ad introduced another shape or color.  Alternately, a severe crop and enlargement of the cereal would be an interesting take.  The border is a bit strong for the delicate circles.</td>', 'Certainly meets the texture challenge.  It might have been a more interesting composition if you h ad introduced another shape or color.  Alternately, a severe crop and enlargement of the cereal would be an interesting take.  The border is a bit strong for the delicate circles.', '2004-02-20 23:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(591501, 61094, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding photo and I''m going to give it a 10 for sure.  I do have a suggestion for what I think might be interesting to do with it outside of the challenge when you are allowed to selectively edit.  I would select just the people and make the one in the foreground lighter and the one in the background darker, or play around with such ideas.  I think it would be an interesting contrast and juxtaposition.</td>', 'This is an outstanding photo and I''m going to give it a 10 for sure.  I do have a suggestion for what I think might be interesting to do with it outside of the challenge when you are allowed to selectively edit.  I would select just the people and make the one in the foreground lighter and the one in the background darker, or play around with such ideas.  I think it would be an interesting contrast and juxtaposition.', '2004-02-20 23:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(591502, 60084, 14476, '<td valign="top">This looks something like a desert scene with your selective depth of field.  Maybe it could be a bit crisper.</td>', 'This looks something like a desert scene with your selective depth of field.  Maybe it could be a bit crisper.', '2004-02-20 23:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(591503, 60842, 6349, '<td valign="top">now this is wierd.  those are really large pieces of salt?</td>', 'now this is wierd.  those are really large pieces of salt?', '2004-02-20 23:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(591505, 60404, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nicely photographed and meets the Challenge.  The offset center of interest is good.  The monochromatic take works, but to add interest you might consider introducing a different shape into the composition.  Love the detail you captured.</td>', 'Nicely photographed and meets the Challenge.  The offset center of interest is good.  The monochromatic take works, but to add interest you might consider introducing a different shape into the composition.  Love the detail you captured.', '2004-02-20 23:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(591506, 60920, 6349, '<td valign="top">very nice for texture.  good composition and lighting.  A tough thing to photograph.</td>', 'very nice for texture.  good composition and lighting.  A tough thing to photograph.', '2004-02-20 23:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(591507, 60947, 6349, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far.  10</td>', 'One of my favorites so far.  10', '2004-02-20 23:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(591508, 61114, 14476, '<td valign="top">Pleasant, if crowded, still life certainly meets the challenge. Nicely lighted.  the border is a bit heavy for this nice piece.</td>', 'Pleasant, if crowded, still life certainly meets the challenge. Nicely lighted.  the border is a bit heavy for this nice piece.', '2004-02-20 23:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(591509, 61120, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks overexposed in the highlights, which drew my attention there rather than to the other interesting parts of this shot.</td>', 'This looks overexposed in the highlights, which drew my attention there rather than to the other interesting parts of this shot.', '2004-02-20 23:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(591511, 60860, 14476, '<td valign="top">Like the crispness and detail in this shot which certainly meets the challenge.  I''d like to see another shape or color in there somewhere to enhance the composition.</td>', 'Like the crispness and detail in this shot which certainly meets the challenge.  I''d like to see another shape or color in there somewhere to enhance the composition.', '2004-02-20 23:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(591512, 61144, 6349, '<td valign="top">Oh no, not another beard shot!  Good lighting and toning on this one.</td>', 'Oh no, not another beard shot!  Good lighting and toning on this one.', '2004-02-20 23:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(591513, 60983, 15920, '<td valign="top">I like this techinque a lot.  I might have let the shutter stay open just a little longer to smooth out the water a little.</td>', 'I like this techinque a lot.  I might have let the shutter stay open just a little longer to smooth out the water a little.', '2004-02-20 23:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(591514, 60464, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  10</td>', 'Great shot.  10', '2004-02-20 23:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(591515, 60782, 14476, '<td valign="top">Cute pose meets the challenge nicely.  Wish the rest of the muzzle could have also been in focus.  Nicely placed in the frame.</td>', 'Cute pose meets the challenge nicely.  Wish the rest of the muzzle could have also been in focus.  Nicely placed in the frame.', '2004-02-20 23:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(591516, 60874, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks overexposed in the highlights, which drew my attention there rather than to the other interesting parts of this shot.</td>', 'This looks overexposed in the highlights, which drew my attention there rather than to the other interesting parts of this shot.', '2004-02-20 23:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(591517, 60737, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Love the composition, the colors, and the textures.  10</td>', 'Great shot.  Love the composition, the colors, and the textures.  10', '2004-02-20 23:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(591518, 60068, 6349, '<td valign="top">Are you sure that''s a rose?  I wish the thorns had been in focus instead of the flower, or both.</td>', 'Are you sure that''s a rose?  I wish the thorns had been in focus instead of the flower, or both.', '2004-02-20 23:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(591519, 60809, 14476, '<td valign="top">While there are textural values in this very nice landscape they are not the center of the composition.  It is, however, beautiful.  Frame is a bit heavy...</td>', 'While there are textural values in this very nice landscape they are not the center of the composition.  It is, however, beautiful.  Frame is a bit heavy...', '2004-02-20 23:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(591521, 60798, 6349, '<td valign="top">A very lovely piece of art.  My family has something similar but without the wood around it.  Great lighting too.</td>', 'A very lovely piece of art.  My family has something similar but without the wood around it.  Great lighting too.', '2004-02-20 23:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(591522, 60738, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like it.  Good luck!', '2004-02-20 23:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(591523, 61105, 15920, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.  It also looks slightly out of focus.</td>', 'This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.  It also looks slightly out of focus.', '2004-02-20 23:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(591524, 60648, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice texture in the tulips.  Perhaps a slightly lower number on the f stop would have produced a stronger contrast, but the freshness is certainly nice.  Sure does meet the challenge.</td>', 'Nice texture in the tulips.  Perhaps a slightly lower number on the f stop would have produced a stronger contrast, but the freshness is certainly nice.  Sure does meet the challenge.', '2004-02-20 23:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(591525, 60105, 6349, '<td valign="top">Perfect.  I can''t imagine a better photograph of a football.  I''m giving you a 10 and I don''t even like football.</td>', 'Perfect.  I can''t imagine a better photograph of a football.  I''m giving you a 10 and I don''t even like football.', '2004-02-20 23:25:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(591526, 60929, 14476, '<td valign="top">this could have been a ''knockout'' if you had placed that jub off to oneside (perhaps on a 3rd line).  Also if a contrasting shape could have been introduced it would add to the composition.  Still, nicely photographed.</td>', 'this could have been a ''knockout'' if you had placed that jub off to oneside (perhaps on a 3rd line).  Also if a contrasting shape could have been introduced it would add to the composition.  Still, nicely photographed.', '2004-02-20 23:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(591527, 59908, 6349, '<td valign="top">Ah, Glenlivet, my old friend.  Very interesting take on the challenge.  Not sure what you were going for with the set-up of the composition on this one.  Is there a reason you made the box the main subject and not the bottle or the glass?</td>', 'Ah, Glenlivet, my old friend.  Very interesting take on the challenge.  Not sure what you were going for with the set-up of the composition on this one.  Is there a reason you made the box the main subject and not the bottle or the glass?', '2004-02-20 23:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(591528, 61070, 6349, '<td valign="top">Haven''t I already seen a photo of this exact horse on here?  That is some fine texture! Or rather, coarse horse.</td>', 'Haven''t I already seen a photo of this exact horse on here?  That is some fine texture! Or rather, coarse horse.', '2004-02-20 23:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(591529, 60596, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks slightly out of focus.</td>', 'This looks slightly out of focus.', '2004-02-20 23:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(591530, 60990, 14476, '<td valign="top">that old basket has been nicely photographed and the catch adds the interest needed to keep a viewer interested.  Wish it had been in better focus, but overall, it''s an excellent photograph!  Even the blurred background is interesting to look at.</td>', 'that old basket has been nicely photographed and the catch adds the interest needed to keep a viewer interested.  Wish it had been in better focus, but overall, it''s an excellent photograph!  Even the blurred background is interesting to look at.', '2004-02-20 23:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(591531, 60013, 6349, '<td valign="top">I think this is fantastic.  The detail you got in the eye is very interesting, but I''m not sure how that will do for texture.  I was trying to get some shots of my pupil dilating the other day and found that it was pretty much impossible with the techniques I was trying.  Have you tried that in your eye experiments?</td>', 'I think this is fantastic.  The detail you got in the eye is very interesting, but I''m not sure how that will do for texture.  I was trying to get some shots of my pupil dilating the other day and found that it was pretty much impossible with the techniques I was trying.  Have you tried that in your eye experiments?', '2004-02-20 23:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(591532, 60705, 6349, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark for me.</td>', 'A bit too dark for me.', '2004-02-20 23:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(591533, 59916, 15920, '<td valign="top">It was a good idea, but I think you needed to be closer to get some more detail into the competition.  It also looks a bit out of focus.</td>', 'It was a good idea, but I think you needed to be closer to get some more detail into the competition.  It also looks a bit out of focus.', '2004-02-20 23:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(591534, 60914, 6349, '<td valign="top">perfect.  10</td>', 'perfect.  10', '2004-02-20 23:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(591535, 60482, 14476, '<td valign="top">These lovely flamingos show off their textured wings beautifully and you captured the difficult subject.  Good catch of the eye.  With live subjects it''s awfully difficult to blur out the background when it''s that close, but you did a creditable job.  Bird''s great!</td>', 'These lovely flamingos show off their textured wings beautifully and you captured the difficult subject.  Good catch of the eye.  With live subjects it''s awfully difficult to blur out the background when it''s that close, but you did a creditable job.  Bird''s great!', '2004-02-20 23:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(591536, 60803, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice work.  I like your style.  10</td>', 'Very nice work.  I like your style.  10', '2004-02-20 23:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(591537, 60084, 15920, '<td valign="top">God idea, but looks dark.  Maybe a soft spotlight on the focus area to add some additional contrast?  Not sure about that, just a suggestion to try.</td>', 'God idea, but looks dark.  Maybe a soft spotlight on the focus area to add some additional contrast?  Not sure about that, just a suggestion to try.', '2004-02-20 23:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(591538, 60088, 6349, '<td valign="top">This REALLY converys texture.  Great job.</td>', 'This REALLY converys texture.  Great job.', '2004-02-20 23:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(591540, 60192, 6349, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Reminds me of all the slides of tissue and muscle I''ve been looking at in anatomy class lately!</td>', 'Cool shot.  Reminds me of all the slides of tissue and muscle I''ve been looking at in anatomy class lately!', '2004-02-20 23:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(591541, 60780, 6349, '<td valign="top">hahaha.  very creative idea.</td>', 'hahaha.  very creative idea.', '2004-02-20 23:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(591542, 59848, 14476, '<td valign="top">This looks like a billboard that you photographed.  And that would likely be someone else''s art.   I guess I can''t see much else to comment on here.</td>', 'This looks like a billboard that you photographed.  And that would likely be someone else''s art.   I guess I can''t see much else to comment on here.', '2004-02-20 23:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(591543, 60512, 6349, '<td valign="top">whatever that is, it CAN''T be real!  hahaha.  It looks RIDICULOUS!  Did you change the colors or something?  If this is real I want to own one!</td>', 'whatever that is, it CAN''T be real!  hahaha.  It looks RIDICULOUS!  Did you change the colors or something?  If this is real I want to own one!', '2004-02-20 23:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(591544, 60950, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  It would be great if you could include a scuba diver or swimmer in this later!</td>', 'Great shot.  It would be great if you could include a scuba diver or swimmer in this later!', '2004-02-20 23:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(591545, 60563, 6349, '<td valign="top">beautiful but doesn''t say texture to me at all.</td>', 'beautiful but doesn''t say texture to me at all.', '2004-02-20 23:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(591546, 60808, 6349, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I feel like that sometimes too...</td>', 'Yeah, I feel like that sometimes too...', '2004-02-20 23:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(591547, 60756, 6349, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand you title.  You sure did buy a lot of cheerios!  Great photo.  One of my favorites.  10</td>', 'I don''t understand you title.  You sure did buy a lot of cheerios!  Great photo.  One of my favorites.  10', '2004-02-20 23:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(591548, 60768, 6349, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  One of the better of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  One of the better of the challenge.', '2004-02-20 23:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(591549, 60315, 6349, '<td valign="top">Cool stuff, I''m feeling it.  10</td>', 'Cool stuff, I''m feeling it.  10', '2004-02-20 23:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(591550, 60248, 6349, '<td valign="top">good stock/product photo.</td>', 'good stock/product photo.', '2004-02-20 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(591551, 60929, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  It''s making my eyes crazy and I enjoy that kind of thing!</td>', 'Very nice.  It''s making my eyes crazy and I enjoy that kind of thing!', '2004-02-20 23:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(591552, 60742, 6349, '<td valign="top">Where colorblind gods play paint by numbers?</td>', 'Where colorblind gods play paint by numbers?', '2004-02-20 23:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(591554, 60934, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic tilt, and i find the scene very intriguing.  I have never seen anything like it before.</td>', 'I like the dramatic tilt, and i find the scene very intriguing.  I have never seen anything like it before.', '2004-02-20 23:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(591555, 61099, 6349, '<td valign="top">looks like one of those finger-trap toys.</td>', 'looks like one of those finger-trap toys.', '2004-02-20 23:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(591556, 60629, 6349, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this the more I like it!</td>', 'The more I look at this the more I like it!', '2004-02-20 23:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(591557, 60488, 6349, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2004-02-20 23:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(591558, 59996, 6349, '<td valign="top">I love it.  I''m a big fan of taking out the garbage too!</td>', 'I love it.  I''m a big fan of taking out the garbage too!', '2004-02-20 23:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(591559, 60994, 6349, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  One of my favorites.  10</td>', 'Awesome.  One of my favorites.  10', '2004-02-20 23:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(591560, 60990, 6349, '<td valign="top">very nice lines and texture.</td>', 'very nice lines and texture.', '2004-02-20 23:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(591562, 60085, 6349, '<td valign="top">haha.  funny.  i like to see humor done well in photos.</td>', 'haha.  funny.  i like to see humor done well in photos.', '2004-02-20 23:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(591563, 61152, 6349, '<td valign="top">why have there been so many nut shots?  Well, anyway, this is the best of them that I''ve seen so far (and I''ve been doing this for over an hour now :)</td>', 'why have there been so many nut shots?  Well, anyway, this is the best of them that I''ve seen so far (and I''ve been doing this for over an hour now :)', '2004-02-20 23:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(591564, 60434, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  I feel as if I can see with the photographers mind and delight in their sense of humor and intellect. 10</td>', 'I like this a lot.  I feel as if I can see with the photographers mind and delight in their sense of humor and intellect. 10', '2004-02-20 23:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(591565, 60734, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Great composition, great lighting.</td>', 'Great shot.  Great composition, great lighting.', '2004-02-20 23:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(591566, 60921, 6349, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  My two favorite shots for this challenge are vegetable shots in black and white.  As I said in the other one, I find the choice of b+w to be very bold and successful as well.  Reminds me of a brain (I''m in a lot of anatomy classes in school this semester).  The brain is a terrible thing to eat.  10</td>', 'Awesome!  My two favorite shots for this challenge are vegetable shots in black and white.  As I said in the other one, I find the choice of b+w to be very bold and successful as well.  Reminds me of a brain (I''m in a lot of anatomy classes in school this semester).  The brain is a terrible thing to eat.  10', '2004-02-20 23:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(591567, 61061, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea.  I like the lighting.</td>', 'Very cool idea.  I like the lighting.', '2004-02-20 23:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(591568, 61142, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Nice composition.  Love the triangle as the focal point. 10</td>', 'Great shot.  Nice composition.  Love the triangle as the focal point. 10', '2004-02-20 23:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(591569, 60923, 6349, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I really get it.</td>', 'I don''t think I really get it.', '2004-02-20 23:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(591570, 60762, 6349, '<td valign="top">Uh, don''t put soap on your towel...</td>', 'Uh, don''t put soap on your towel...', '2004-02-20 23:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(591571, 60960, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great black and white with a vintage feel.  The darkness, the light, the white window frame, the bucket, the collapsing supports....everything is just right.  10</td>', 'Great black and white with a vintage feel.  The darkness, the light, the white window frame, the bucket, the collapsing supports....everything is just right.  10', '2004-02-20 23:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(591573, 60185, 6349, '<td valign="top">I had an intense phobia of starfish as a kid (seriously).  Luckily, I have grown out of it so I didn''t freak out when I saw this.  Only a little.  The texture is very good.</td>', 'I had an intense phobia of starfish as a kid (seriously).  Luckily, I have grown out of it so I didn''t freak out when I saw this.  Only a little.  The texture is very good.', '2004-02-20 23:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(591574, 59711, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice 10</td>', 'Very nice 10', '2004-02-20 23:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(591575, 60863, 6349, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  I like that it doesn''t seem post-processed at all.  10</td>', 'Lovely shot.  I like that it doesn''t seem post-processed at all.  10', '2004-02-20 23:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(591576, 61122, 6349, '<td valign="top">I really like this, esp. how the shadow splits into it.  10</td>', 'I really like this, esp. how the shadow splits into it.  10', '2004-02-20 23:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(591577, 60388, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Love the colors in the leaf and that you managed to get in it decent focus through the rushing water.</td>', 'Great capture!  Love the colors in the leaf and that you managed to get in it decent focus through the rushing water.', '2004-02-20 23:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
