(591751, 61127, 10084, '<td valign="top">The placement of the orange makes the composition very interesting. The picture size almost makes this look like a pumpkin. I like the lighting, kind of gives you a feeling of the way that the moon is lit."10"</td>', 'The placement of the orange makes the composition very interesting. The picture size almost makes this look like a pumpkin. I like the lighting, kind of gives you a feeling of the way that the moon is lit."10"', '2004-02-21 05:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(591752, 60758, 17594, '<td valign="top">GOOD PIC BUT NO TEXTURES<br/></td>', 'GOOD PIC BUT NO TEXTURES', '2004-02-21 05:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(591753, 60727, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice quilting pattern captured. Compostion would be a lot better to see the context of the roll of towel. White balance needs to be adjusted or fixed in post-production.</td>', 'Nice quilting pattern captured. Compostion would be a lot better to see the context of the roll of towel. White balance needs to be adjusted or fixed in post-production.', '2004-02-21 05:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(591755, 60809, 245, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous, but it doesn''t really read ''texture'' to me. Did you try cropping the little thing on the left middle edge, or that little strip of building in the upper right? It might clean up the image a bit and put more focus on the house.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous, but it doesn''t really read ''texture'' to me. Did you try cropping the little thing on the left middle edge, or that little strip of building in the upper right? It might clean up the image a bit and put more focus on the house.', '2004-02-21 05:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(591756, 61126, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very nice closeup of a feather. The ridges or strand of the individual textures of the feather was captured beautifully. Love the great colors. The shadows and the highlights helps to bring out the details.</td>', 'Very nice closeup of a feather. The ridges or strand of the individual textures of the feather was captured beautifully. Love the great colors. The shadows and the highlights helps to bring out the details.', '2004-02-21 05:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(591757, 61031, 17594, '<td valign="top">GOOD.......</td>', 'GOOD.......', '2004-02-21 05:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(591758, 60656, 10084, '<td valign="top">The abstract of the lines that leads your eyes from the bottom of the picture makes for an interesting composition. Unfortunately the lighting make it almost painful to look at it too long. The colors are very bright. Redoing in B&amp;W or toning down and make the colors not so vibrant would help to make the pleasing composition a lot better. "8"</td>', 'The abstract of the lines that leads your eyes from the bottom of the picture makes for an interesting composition. Unfortunately the lighting make it almost painful to look at it too long. The colors are very bright. Redoing in B&W or toning down and make the colors not so vibrant would help to make the pleasing composition a lot better. "8"', '2004-02-21 05:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(591759, 60338, 245, '<td valign="top">Good technicals, but the subject is a little bland... perhaps if it were all the same pattern, like the diamonds... with the different patterns it''s a bit jumbled.</td>', 'Good technicals, but the subject is a little bland... perhaps if it were all the same pattern, like the diamonds... with the different patterns it''s a bit jumbled.', '2004-02-21 05:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(591760, 60978, 245, '<td valign="top">Really good job placing the rope, it''s nice and precise. Blur your eyes, see the two complete hilights on each one? I would have framed the picture about 5% lower, to center those hilights. I like it!</td>', 'Really good job placing the rope, it''s nice and precise. Blur your eyes, see the two complete hilights on each one? I would have framed the picture about 5% lower, to center those hilights. I like it!', '2004-02-21 05:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(591761, 60795, 10084, '<td valign="top">Incredible closeup of a hand. Incredible details of the texture of the hand itself. Love the way you choose to light this composition. Seems to separate the segments of the fingers all the way down the hand. Would love to see a version of this without all the details in the hands. The abstract lighting is great. "8"</td>', 'Incredible closeup of a hand. Incredible details of the texture of the hand itself. Love the way you choose to light this composition. Seems to separate the segments of the fingers all the way down the hand. Would love to see a version of this without all the details in the hands. The abstract lighting is great. "8"', '2004-02-21 05:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(591762, 60892, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple, I lke it. The light seems to be coming from the side though, it feels a little off-kilter to me. :)</td>', 'Nice and simple, I lke it. The light seems to be coming from the side though, it feels a little off-kilter to me. :)', '2004-02-21 05:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(591764, 61098, 10084, '<td valign="top">The piled up pennies gives a feeling of scales of an animal. Very interesting idea. The composition would really be brought out if lighting was from the sides so that highlights and shadow would make the subjects pop out of the shot. Currently the hotspot on the one penny is distracting. "7''</td>', 'The piled up pennies gives a feeling of scales of an animal. Very interesting idea. The composition would really be brought out if lighting was from the sides so that highlights and shadow would make the subjects pop out of the shot. Currently the hotspot on the one penny is distracting. "7''', '2004-02-21 05:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(591765, 61128, 245, '<td valign="top">I really love the soft glow and the texture is fantastic, but i wish it were a more dynamic shot of the whole lizard, or more focsed on the leg itself. It doesn''t feel balances to me. A nice tight vertical shot right around the leg could get rid of a lot of extraneous detail. :)<br/></td>', 'I really love the soft glow and the texture is fantastic, but i wish it were a more dynamic shot of the whole lizard, or more focsed on the leg itself. It doesn''t feel balances to me. A nice tight vertical shot right around the leg could get rid of a lot of extraneous detail. :)', '2004-02-21 05:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(591766, 60872, 10084, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the most difficult color to photograph is the color red. Almost all digital cameras don''t capture it like it looks in real life. Your composition is interesting in that it seems to contain different levels: the fence, the painter, the wall, and the sky. this makes for an interesting composition. Only suggestion is to level the way so that it lines up horizontal. Without the framing it may be more difficult to tell but with it the shot looks crooked.</td>', 'Unfortunately the most difficult color to photograph is the color red. Almost all digital cameras don''t capture it like it looks in real life. Your composition is interesting in that it seems to contain different levels: the fence, the painter, the wall, and the sky. this makes for an interesting composition. Only suggestion is to level the way so that it lines up horizontal. Without the framing it may be more difficult to tell but with it the shot looks crooked.', '2004-02-21 05:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(591767, 60925, 245, '<td valign="top">Cute, nice use of depth of field, but I don''t like the lighting much for some reason. It needs more mid-tones I think, or maybe the opposite, way more contrast. Also, you could have put another row or two of pasta in the rear... I can see through to the background. it''s just a litle detail I''d obsess over if I were shooting this, maybe you wanted it that way. :)</td>', 'Cute, nice use of depth of field, but I don''t like the lighting much for some reason. It needs more mid-tones I think, or maybe the opposite, way more contrast. Also, you could have put another row or two of pasta in the rear... I can see through to the background. it''s just a litle detail I''d obsess over if I were shooting this, maybe you wanted it that way. :)', '2004-02-21 05:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(591768, 60024, 10084, '<td valign="top">The color of the tree trunk almost looks golden. The composition is interesting with the tree reaching for the sky. Very nice capture of the perfect blue sky.</td>', 'The color of the tree trunk almost looks golden. The composition is interesting with the tree reaching for the sky. Very nice capture of the perfect blue sky.', '2004-02-21 05:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(591769, 60192, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting compostion of a sponge. The closeup is very interesting in that you can see all the pores with the sponge itself. Love the shadows in the shot, it really gives you a sense of the texture of the sponge.</td>', 'Very interesting compostion of a sponge. The closeup is very interesting in that you can see all the pores with the sponge itself. Love the shadows in the shot, it really gives you a sense of the texture of the sponge.', '2004-02-21 05:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(591770, 60766, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice blow out! I wish the reflections in the drops were less detailed, and they seem a bit less then random in placement to me. You certainly pegged the dynamic range!<br/></td>', 'Nice blow out! I wish the reflections in the drops were less detailed, and they seem a bit less then random in placement to me. You certainly pegged the dynamic range!', '2004-02-21 05:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(591771, 61144, 17551, '<td valign="top">I thought grizzled was 3 day growth, but I was wrong.. it''s grey streaks. Leather collar suits the rough texture. Works well.</td>', 'I thought grizzled was 3 day growth, but I was wrong.. it''s grey streaks. Leather collar suits the rough texture. Works well.', '2004-02-21 05:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(591772, 60070, 245, '<td valign="top">I love the freaked out color, and that you''re not looking into the subject straight on. Their head appears to be at a substantial angle, and it adds a nice tension to the stare. I bet you''re going to get hammered for an eye picture, though. :)</td>', 'I love the freaked out color, and that you''re not looking into the subject straight on. Their head appears to be at a substantial angle, and it adds a nice tension to the stare. I bet you''re going to get hammered for an eye picture, though. :)', '2004-02-21 05:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(591773, 59882, 17551, '<td valign="top">Really nice rich colour to suit the texture.</td>', 'Really nice rich colour to suit the texture.', '2004-02-21 05:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(591774, 61069, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject to use for a texture challenge. Feels like the scales of an animal. Would love to see more details in the coins themselves. A little more focus would helps to keep the shot even more interesting, but otherwise a good idea. "7"</td>', 'Interesting subject to use for a texture challenge. Feels like the scales of an animal. Would love to see more details in the coins themselves. A little more focus would helps to keep the shot even more interesting, but otherwise a good idea. "7"', '2004-02-21 05:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(591775, 60648, 17551, '<td valign="top">Great</td>', 'Great', '2004-02-21 05:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(591776, 59885, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but I would have tried to get the horizontal weave perfectly horizontal. At this slight angle it looks too off-handed to be really striking, for me. You could try centering the black part in a strong Thirds location, to draw the eye to an interesting detail that''s kind of lost up near the top.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but I would have tried to get the horizontal weave perfectly horizontal. At this slight angle it looks too off-handed to be really striking, for me. You could try centering the black part in a strong Thirds location, to draw the eye to an interesting detail that''s kind of lost up near the top.', '2004-02-21 05:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(591777, 60358, 17551, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.. what animal is this?</td>', 'Nice detail.. what animal is this?', '2004-02-21 05:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(591778, 61108, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice mood, It''s refreshing to see a photo that captures sentiment.</td>', 'Nice mood, It''s refreshing to see a photo that captures sentiment.', '2004-02-21 05:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(591779, 60860, 17551, '<td valign="top">Gotta love the texture of peanuts... very nice composition, if not that original</td>', 'Gotta love the texture of peanuts... very nice composition, if not that original', '2004-02-21 05:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(591780, 61069, 245, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is way too narrow for a shot with so much detail around the edges. It also seems a bit underexposed, the mid-tones could be brought up a bit.</td>', 'The depth of field is way too narrow for a shot with so much detail around the edges. It also seems a bit underexposed, the mid-tones could be brought up a bit.', '2004-02-21 05:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(591781, 60021, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting ridges in the tree. More contrast would really bring out the subject. Looks like you found a great subject for the challenge. The abstract waves in the ridges make this composition fairly interesting. Post processing by bringing out the darks would really make this pop.</td>', 'Interesting ridges in the tree. More contrast would really bring out the subject. Looks like you found a great subject for the challenge. The abstract waves in the ridges make this composition fairly interesting. Post processing by bringing out the darks would really make this pop.', '2004-02-21 05:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(591782, 60872, 17551, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast in this, blue, red, white.. and the unpainted boards just have character.. one of my fav''s</td>', 'I love the contrast in this, blue, red, white.. and the unpainted boards just have character.. one of my fav''s', '2004-02-21 05:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(591784, 60982, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle colors, and I like the simple composition. My two comments are about the lighting... the shadow is cast upwards, not a more natural downwards. Could you have rotated the whole scene 180 degrees and re-shot, then flipped it? Also, the left edge of the orange seems to be in shadow, perhaps tilting it ever so slightly would have brightented it up or even added a hilight.</td>', 'Nice subtle colors, and I like the simple composition. My two comments are about the lighting... the shadow is cast upwards, not a more natural downwards. Could you have rotated the whole scene 180 degrees and re-shot, then flipped it? Also, the left edge of the orange seems to be in shadow, perhaps tilting it ever so slightly would have brightented it up or even added a hilight.', '2004-02-21 05:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(591785, 60876, 17551, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of a backlit leaf, but just didn''t work for me.</td>', 'I like the idea of a backlit leaf, but just didn''t work for me.', '2004-02-21 05:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(591786, 61058, 17594, '<td valign="top">EXCELENT TEXTURES PICTUE  10/10</td>', 'EXCELENT TEXTURES PICTUE  10/10', '2004-02-21 05:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(591787, 60706, 17551, '<td valign="top">This a ship? Looks great.</td>', 'This a ship? Looks great.', '2004-02-21 05:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(591788, 60379, 17551, '<td valign="top">I''m just starting a reef aquarium.. you captured this (dead) coral skeleton perfectly.</td>', 'I''m just starting a reef aquarium.. you captured this (dead) coral skeleton perfectly.', '2004-02-21 05:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(591789, 60593, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice color! I feel like a slightly wider shot might have balanced the image a bit better, the arcs of the central shelves come very close to the edges. Pull back! The light on the top one is really nice, too... it enhances the *texture* and gets bonus points!</td>', 'Nice color! I feel like a slightly wider shot might have balanced the image a bit better, the arcs of the central shelves come very close to the edges. Pull back! The light on the top one is really nice, too... it enhances the *texture* and gets bonus points!', '2004-02-21 05:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(591790, 60158, 17551, '<td valign="top">The bridge in the background didn''t seem to come out very clearly.. but the foreground stuff is great</td>', 'The bridge in the background didn''t seem to come out very clearly.. but the foreground stuff is great', '2004-02-21 05:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(591791, 61109, 17551, '<td valign="top">Seems to need something extra... not sure what.</td>', 'Seems to need something extra... not sure what.', '2004-02-21 06:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(591792, 61013, 17551, '<td valign="top">err.. what can I say.. fantastic</td>', 'err.. what can I say.. fantastic', '2004-02-21 06:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(591793, 60812, 17551, '<td valign="top">I love it .. very bleak</td>', 'I love it .. very bleak', '2004-02-21 06:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(591794, 60878, 10084, '<td valign="top">Would love to see more details in the shot. You have some nice splashes of contrast colors that work good together.</td>', 'Would love to see more details in the shot. You have some nice splashes of contrast colors that work good together.', '2004-02-21 06:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(591795, 60820, 245, '<td valign="top">The depth of field could be a bit wider and pulled towards the camera, you lose detail in the cone right as it gets close. :)</td>', 'The depth of field could be a bit wider and pulled towards the camera, you lose detail in the cone right as it gets close. :)', '2004-02-21 06:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(591796, 59895, 17551, '<td valign="top">This colour doesn''t help the texture IMHO.. but the detail and slight imperfections are great</td>', 'This colour doesn''t help the texture IMHO.. but the detail and slight imperfections are great', '2004-02-21 06:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(591798, 60458, 245, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the blow out doesn''t add to the image. Crop that white out!<br/></td>', 'I like the composition, but the blow out doesn''t add to the image. Crop that white out!', '2004-02-21 06:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(591799, 60145, 10084, '<td valign="top">Incredible closeup, very in your face type shot. Incredible display of textures in the bird, from the soft feathers , the roughness of the black forehead to the smooth texture of the beak. "10"</td>', 'Incredible closeup, very in your face type shot. Incredible display of textures in the bird, from the soft feathers , the roughness of the black forehead to the smooth texture of the beak. "10"', '2004-02-21 06:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(591800, 60024, 245, '<td valign="top">The tree seems to just end in a freakish stump, you might try a more straight-ahead shot, making the tree a texturesrectangle with blue strips down the sides. :)<br/></td>', 'The tree seems to just end in a freakish stump, you might try a more straight-ahead shot, making the tree a texturesrectangle with blue strips down the sides. :)', '2004-02-21 06:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(591801, 59914, 17551, '<td valign="top">Not quite as good as the other coral skeleton submission, but there is more detail in this one and less symmetry.<br/></td>', 'Not quite as good as the other coral skeleton submission, but there is more detail in this one and less symmetry.', '2004-02-21 06:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(591802, 60988, 245, '<td valign="top">I like the technique a lot, but I don''t like the composition... there''s not much going on.</td>', 'I like the technique a lot, but I don''t like the composition... there''s not much going on.', '2004-02-21 06:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(591803, 61090, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition with the different colors and textures represented, from the shininess of the jacket, to the cotton t-shirt, and finally to the terry cloth of the towel. The lighting and the shadows help to bring out the texture of each material.</td>', 'Interesting composition with the different colors and textures represented, from the shininess of the jacket, to the cotton t-shirt, and finally to the terry cloth of the towel. The lighting and the shadows help to bring out the texture of each material.', '2004-02-21 06:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(591804, 60316, 17551, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, and the colours are great.. but the little piece of apple sticking out at the front bottom seems to be out of place if it was sliding down.</td>', 'Nice concept, and the colours are great.. but the little piece of apple sticking out at the front bottom seems to be out of place if it was sliding down.', '2004-02-21 06:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(591805, 60013, 17551, '<td valign="top">nice work</td>', 'nice work', '2004-02-21 06:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(591806, 60887, 245, '<td valign="top">I like simple abstract images, but I like them really obsessive...  the ridge on the left is closer to the edge of the picture than the one on the right. Also, the circular hole just kisses the edge, which feels awkward to me... if you cropped off just a touch of the right side it would address both of those issues and polish the composition, I think.</td>', 'I like simple abstract images, but I like them really obsessive...  the ridge on the left is closer to the edge of the picture than the one on the right. Also, the circular hole just kisses the edge, which feels awkward to me... if you cropped off just a touch of the right side it would address both of those issues and polish the composition, I think.', '2004-02-21 06:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(591807, 59833, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition choosing the mouse has a main subject. The lighting helps to bring out the beautiful curves and shapes of the mouse. The shininess of the plastic, the ridges on the wheel, the beautiful weave of the carpet  is really evident in the shot. A reflector or extra lighting on the right side of the shot would make the shot even more appealing."9"</td>', 'Interesting composition choosing the mouse has a main subject. The lighting helps to bring out the beautiful curves and shapes of the mouse. The shininess of the plastic, the ridges on the wheel, the beautiful weave of the carpet  is really evident in the shot. A reflector or extra lighting on the right side of the shot would make the shot even more appealing."9"', '2004-02-21 06:11:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(591808, 61035, 245, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, but the hands of the clock could be at a more intresting angle. :)</td>', 'Nice exposure, but the hands of the clock could be at a more intresting angle. :)', '2004-02-21 06:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(591809, 60789, 17551, '<td valign="top">I like your knife selection.. it has character.. sort of like old style cottage piece.</td>', 'I like your knife selection.. it has character.. sort of like old style cottage piece.', '2004-02-21 06:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(591810, 60441, 245, '<td valign="top">Too much of the interesting stuff is out of focus!</td>', 'Too much of the interesting stuff is out of focus!', '2004-02-21 06:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(591812, 59785, 245, '<td valign="top">What *is* it??? I have no idea! I wish the image were sharper, but not so I can figure out what it is, just because it''s too blurry. :) I would have cropped off the black in the corner, too!</td>', 'What *is* it??? I have no idea! I wish the image were sharper, but not so I can figure out what it is, just because it''s too blurry. :) I would have cropped off the black in the corner, too!', '2004-02-21 06:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(591813, 61129, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. I love the way you have the seam of the article of subject. Lighting really gives a great sense of the texture of the leather. The highlights and shadows captured really make this shot what it is. Not going too shallow of a DOF would improve this a bit. "9"</td>', 'Very interesting composition. I love the way you have the seam of the article of subject. Lighting really gives a great sense of the texture of the leather. The highlights and shadows captured really make this shot what it is. Not going too shallow of a DOF would improve this a bit. "9"', '2004-02-21 06:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(591814, 60501, 17551, '<td valign="top">I see it.. quite a nice shot</td>', 'I see it.. quite a nice shot', '2004-02-21 06:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(591815, 61053, 17551, '<td valign="top">The glass reflection seems to add to this photo.. vivid colours, and sharp details. Very nice.</td>', 'The glass reflection seems to add to this photo.. vivid colours, and sharp details. Very nice.', '2004-02-21 06:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(591816, 60999, 245, '<td valign="top">This is amazing looking. The light is wonderfully soft, and the blown out background is great, it really hilghts the curve and leaves of the tomato.</td>', 'This is amazing looking. The light is wonderfully soft, and the blown out background is great, it really hilghts the curve and leaves of the tomato.', '2004-02-21 06:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(591817, 60664, 10084, '<td valign="top">The diagonal setup of the composition really helps to make this an interesting composition. The closeup is great. Love the way you have the lighting. The shadows and highlights really bring out the textures in the weave of the cloth and the smoothness of the metallic zipper. "8"</td>', 'The diagonal setup of the composition really helps to make this an interesting composition. The closeup is great. Love the way you have the lighting. The shadows and highlights really bring out the textures in the weave of the cloth and the smoothness of the metallic zipper. "8"', '2004-02-21 06:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(591818, 60934, 245, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the angled composition works well here.</td>', 'I''m not sure the angled composition works well here.', '2004-02-21 06:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(591819, 60404, 17551, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot.. but I think the title could be better</td>', 'I like this photo a lot.. but I think the title could be better', '2004-02-21 06:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(591820, 60734, 245, '<td valign="top">While the image is cool, it doesn''t emphasize texture as far as far as I can see... texture is the surface of something, not the shape of something. :) Also, I would have cropped that orange bit off the upper right.</td>', 'While the image is cool, it doesn''t emphasize texture as far as far as I can see... texture is the surface of something, not the shape of something. :) Also, I would have cropped that orange bit off the upper right.', '2004-02-21 06:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(591822, 60964, 245, '<td valign="top">Shape is not texture, and these definitely fall into the shape category... with ''texture'' in the title if feels like you''re trying to sell it too hard. It''s neat but doesn''t fit, in my opinion.</td>', 'Shape is not texture, and these definitely fall into the shape category... with ''texture'' in the title if feels like you''re trying to sell it too hard. It''s neat but doesn''t fit, in my opinion.', '2004-02-21 06:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(591823, 60247, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the regular red rose. I like the diagonal compostion of the rose really makes it dynamic and interesting. The lighting helps to bring forth the soft texture of the rose petals. Contrast helps not to really give great details but helps to give you the form of the rose itself. This keeps it nice and simple. "9"</td>', 'Interesting take on the regular red rose. I like the diagonal compostion of the rose really makes it dynamic and interesting. The lighting helps to bring forth the soft texture of the rose petals. Contrast helps not to really give great details but helps to give you the form of the rose itself. This keeps it nice and simple. "9"', '2004-02-21 06:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(591824, 60486, 245, '<td valign="top">Great color, great composition, but I wih the face of the duck were just a touch sharper... the same goes for the leaves... a telephoto shot to snap it all into focus at once would be nice!</td>', 'Great color, great composition, but I wih the face of the duck were just a touch sharper... the same goes for the leaves... a telephoto shot to snap it all into focus at once would be nice!', '2004-02-21 06:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(591826, 59924, 245, '<td valign="top">There''s no strong focal point, and it doesn''t hold up as a purely abstract piece either in my opinion... There''s some strong shadows on the left, perhaps if you had used more of them to add some bold detail and interesting shapes to the non-contrasty rock.</td>', 'There''s no strong focal point, and it doesn''t hold up as a purely abstract piece either in my opinion... There''s some strong shadows on the left, perhaps if you had used more of them to add some bold detail and interesting shapes to the non-contrasty rock.', '2004-02-21 06:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(591828, 60035, 245, '<td valign="top">Good color!</td>', 'Good color!', '2004-02-21 06:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
