(591893, 60921, 16790, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting on this!  The texture is so crisp, and without too much contrast...  Great picture.</td>', 'I love the lighting on this!  The texture is so crisp, and without too much contrast...  Great picture.', '2004-02-21 07:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(591895, 60262, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous... I can feel the softness from here.  Beautiful photo.</td>', 'This is gorgeous... I can feel the softness from here.  Beautiful photo.', '2004-02-21 07:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(591897, 60805, 17387, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have expected someone to use clouds as texture.   I imagine you will be penalized by the folks who believe that for something to have texture, one should be able to touch and feel its texture.   I get where you''re coming from with the picture though.   I can imagine the sky feeling like cotton glued onto construction paper - which brings me back to the first grade.   Kudos - 7</td>', 'I wouldn''t have expected someone to use clouds as texture.   I imagine you will be penalized by the folks who believe that for something to have texture, one should be able to touch and feel its texture.   I get where you''re coming from with the picture though.   I can imagine the sky feeling like cotton glued onto construction paper - which brings me back to the first grade.   Kudos - 7', '2004-02-21 07:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(591899, 61039, 16790, '<td valign="top">Pretty colours; you don''t see orange enough.  I like this, though the little reflection of light on the right is distracting.</td>', 'Pretty colours; you don''t see orange enough.  I like this, though the little reflection of light on the right is distracting.', '2004-02-21 07:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(591902, 60817, 16790, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is great... the bear looks so squeezable and soft.</td>', 'The lighting on this is great... the bear looks so squeezable and soft.', '2004-02-21 07:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(591903, 60905, 17387, '<td valign="top">I showed my mom''s friend a drawing of a tree I once made..   The flow of the bark in my drawing very much resembled the bark in this photograph -   More interesting is how this woman commented on the drawing -    "wow, this is great... you realize that this drawing you made is overwhelmingly vaginal"   then she proceeded to point out the various "vagina-like" crevasses that made up the trunk of my tree.   Needless to say, she was tickled.  It might be worth mentioning that the woman was a very eccentric and feministic lesbian.   Anyway, the point is:  I''m afraid to say it, but your photograph reminds me of vaginas now.   Be that as it may, I award you an 8 for having to swallow this drivel :)    Keep it up.</td>', 'I showed my mom''s friend a drawing of a tree I once made..   The flow of the bark in my drawing very much resembled the bark in this photograph -   More interesting is how this woman commented on the drawing -    "wow, this is great... you realize that this drawing you made is overwhelmingly vaginal"   then she proceeded to point out the various "vagina-like" crevasses that made up the trunk of my tree.   Needless to say, she was tickled.  It might be worth mentioning that the woman was a very eccentric and feministic lesbian.   Anyway, the point is:  I''m afraid to say it, but your photograph reminds me of vaginas now.   Be that as it may, I award you an 8 for having to swallow this drivel :)    Keep it up.', '2004-02-21 07:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(591905, 60757, 17387, '<td valign="top">What you did with the contrast really helps the image work.   The saturation of color is very striking, and does well to add to the already apparant texture of the shoe an oily secondary characteristic.   The image would otherwise be very dull and not very remarkable at all.  Good work.   I will give you a 7 instead of a 3-4 rating for the post processing.</td>', 'What you did with the contrast really helps the image work.   The saturation of color is very striking, and does well to add to the already apparant texture of the shoe an oily secondary characteristic.   The image would otherwise be very dull and not very remarkable at all.  Good work.   I will give you a 7 instead of a 3-4 rating for the post processing.', '2004-02-21 07:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(591907, 60994, 17387, '<td valign="top">Somehow this photograph is very disorienting....  I can''t seem to get a very strong sense of its dimensions because of the different layers of paint and their individual qualities..  I guess I can''t score you very highly as the subject to me (although it fits the challenge, i suppose) is not particularly interesting or exciting.  5 just the same, and I don''t think it will hurt your overall score very much.</td>', 'Somehow this photograph is very disorienting....  I can''t seem to get a very strong sense of its dimensions because of the different layers of paint and their individual qualities..  I guess I can''t score you very highly as the subject to me (although it fits the challenge, i suppose) is not particularly interesting or exciting.  5 just the same, and I don''t think it will hurt your overall score very much.', '2004-02-21 07:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(591908, 60905, 16790, '<td valign="top">I''m admittedly a sucker for this type of photograph, but I really love this picture.  The lighting is beautiful, soft but with a healthy amount of contrast, and the title is perfect as there is definitely a feel of flowing.  One of my favourites.</td>', 'I''m admittedly a sucker for this type of photograph, but I really love this picture.  The lighting is beautiful, soft but with a healthy amount of contrast, and the title is perfect as there is definitely a feel of flowing.  One of my favourites.', '2004-02-21 07:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(591909, 60226, 17387, '<td valign="top">What a pointless and yet...addicting toy.  I can''t tell you how many times I''ve picked one of these up and swung it around by a single ... rubber-string-like thing until it snapped off..     And then I would pick it up and do it again.  The nostalgia is like a flood.   6.</td>', 'What a pointless and yet...addicting toy.  I can''t tell you how many times I''ve picked one of these up and swung it around by a single ... rubber-string-like thing until it snapped off..     And then I would pick it up and do it again.  The nostalgia is like a flood.   6.', '2004-02-21 07:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(591911, 60705, 17387, '<td valign="top">I guess I don''t say this often:  but I think this shot is a tad too dark for my liking.</td>', 'I guess I don''t say this often:  but I think this shot is a tad too dark for my liking.', '2004-02-21 07:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(591912, 60787, 17387, '<td valign="top">This shot shouldn''t be so.. appetizing to me..  I guess I am underfed.  7</td>', 'This shot shouldn''t be so.. appetizing to me..  I guess I am underfed.  7', '2004-02-21 07:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(591915, 60560, 17387, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photograph..  I would like to learn how you post-processed this one.   The polished rocks are sharp until I look closely at them...    This photograph very much resembles the qualities of a painting to me.   Excellently done. 9</td>', 'It''s a beautiful photograph..  I would like to learn how you post-processed this one.   The polished rocks are sharp until I look closely at them...    This photograph very much resembles the qualities of a painting to me.   Excellently done. 9', '2004-02-21 07:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(591917, 59997, 17387, '<td valign="top">I would venture to guess that the size of this object PROBABLY falls somewhere in between..   This shot would hold more value to me if I knew what I was looking at...  or maybe not..    I get the sense that its been inverted, anyway.   Nothing is that "pastel" in real life :-p   Not even the 80s.</td>', 'I would venture to guess that the size of this object PROBABLY falls somewhere in between..   This shot would hold more value to me if I knew what I was looking at...  or maybe not..    I get the sense that its been inverted, anyway.   Nothing is that "pastel" in real life :-p   Not even the 80s.', '2004-02-21 07:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(591918, 60588, 17387, '<td valign="top">Hideous, hideous bird.   It looks like a pile of maggots crossed with someone''s exposed intestines...  that or the after-birth of a yak.    You did well to capture the essense of this disgusting-looking bird.   9... uugh, you''re lucky i''m not penalizing you for how much this photograph actually turns my stomach.  (good work with the colors as well)</td>', 'Hideous, hideous bird.   It looks like a pile of maggots crossed with someone''s exposed intestines...  that or the after-birth of a yak.    You did well to capture the essense of this disgusting-looking bird.   9... uugh, you''re lucky i''m not penalizing you for how much this photograph actually turns my stomach.  (good work with the colors as well)', '2004-02-21 07:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
