(592371, 60845, 4338, '<td valign="top">the lighting seems too harsh on the left hand side and the angle looks a little too high up, over all its a great photo</td>', 'the lighting seems too harsh on the left hand side and the angle looks a little too high up, over all its a great photo', '2004-02-21 18:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(592373, 60742, 4338, '<td valign="top">to me it looks like there was too much editing to bring out the red and pinks</td>', 'to me it looks like there was too much editing to bring out the red and pinks', '2004-02-21 18:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(592389, 61128, 6458, '<td valign="top">Great.. I love the smoothness of the BG and the foreground against the boody of the lizard. The bumps and textures really make this a treate to look at. The spots on the ground disturb me a little, but not enough to hurt thr picture. 9</td>', 'Great.. I love the smoothness of the BG and the foreground against the boody of the lizard. The bumps and textures really make this a treate to look at. The spots on the ground disturb me a little, but not enough to hurt thr picture. 9', '2004-02-21 18:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(592427, 61103, 14035, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully creative, Wonderfully dimensional as well as textural.  My single critical observation is that the  uneven vertical line of the "dots" on the left side distracts me,. I believe it would be marginally improved if the left line of sight was straight as the right side is dimensional enough to hide the unevenness. ( It looks like the angle does not allow a vertical alignment on both sides. )  Excellent photo.</td>', 'Wonderfully creative, Wonderfully dimensional as well as textural.  My single critical observation is that the  uneven vertical line of the "dots" on the left side distracts me,. I believe it would be marginally improved if the left line of sight was straight as the right side is dimensional enough to hide the unevenness. ( It looks like the angle does not allow a vertical alignment on both sides. )  Excellent photo.', '2004-02-21 18:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(592429, 61099, 15554, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, well done</td>', 'Interesting shot, well done', '2004-02-21 18:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(592440, 61049, 16106, '<td valign="top">A bit too flat. It needs more light to bring up the texture</td>', 'A bit too flat. It needs more light to bring up the texture', '2004-02-21 19:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(592442, 60083, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but I wish there was less mid range grey.</td>', 'Nice idea but I wish there was less mid range grey.', '2004-02-21 19:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(592443, 60808, 2158, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I wish the fish was a bit more to the right of the picture.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but I wish the fish was a bit more to the right of the picture.', '2004-02-21 19:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(592444, 60852, 16106, '<td valign="top">Irish terrier? nice balance.</td>', 'Irish terrier? nice balance.', '2004-02-21 19:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
