(592455, 60866, 16106, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I wish the texture of the lock hadn''t blown out, it would have helped the contrast with the door greatly. A bit of spot editing and this is a winner.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I wish the texture of the lock hadn''t blown out, it would have helped the contrast with the door greatly. A bit of spot editing and this is a winner.', '2004-02-21 19:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
