(592468, 60921, 4767, '<td valign="top">I quit.  Anybody wanta buy a G2 with only 12,000 pix on it?  I will NEVER shoot this exquisite a photo if I live to 600 years old.  DANG, that is GORGEOUS!  BRAVISSIMO!  (And I''ve voted on 86% of this challenge before I saw this. Man, am I glad I kept going!)  10, but it should be higher!</td>', 'I quit.  Anybody wanta buy a G2 with only 12,000 pix on it?  I will NEVER shoot this exquisite a photo if I live to 600 years old.  DANG, that is GORGEOUS!  BRAVISSIMO!  (And I''ve voted on 86% of this challenge before I saw this. Man, am I glad I kept going!)  10, but it should be higher!', '2004-02-21 19:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(592469, 59895, 4767, '<td valign="top">As a friend recently said, "I''ve never met a diagonal I didn''t like."  Aside from that, this would be among my favorites in ANY category!  Composition, exposure, le tout ensemble - lovely!</td>', 'As a friend recently said, "I''ve never met a diagonal I didn''t like."  Aside from that, this would be among my favorites in ANY category!  Composition, exposure, le tout ensemble - lovely!', '2004-02-21 19:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
