(592662, 60458, 13136, '<td valign="top">Everything in this shot shouts ''Ancient''. The only real minus is the bright spot at the bottom. Nice shot.</td>', 'Everything in this shot shouts ''Ancient''. The only real minus is the bright spot at the bottom. Nice shot.', '2004-02-22 00:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
