(592666, 60809, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. I like the different surfaces (smooth and turgid) on the water. The only minus is the haze, but that isn''t controllable.</td>', 'Very nice picture. I like the different surfaces (smooth and turgid) on the water. The only minus is the haze, but that isn''t controllable.', '2004-02-22 00:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
