(592669, 60593, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like how these look like rock walls growing out of a forest. Not sure if it would have helped to get closer so we could see their texture a little better.</td>', 'I like how these look like rock walls growing out of a forest. Not sure if it would have helped to get closer so we could see their texture a little better.', '2004-02-22 00:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
