(592703, 61094, 17387, '<td valign="top">I love shots like this--  As far as I know, its anybody''s guess as to what is actually happening in the photograph.   Very cool..   I look forward to finding out what this is about.     I''m afraid you''ll get knocked because texture obviously takes backseat to the subjects in this photo-  I''ll give you a 6 anyway.  I would rather encourage more shots like this to tell you the truth :-p  Kudos</td>', 'I love shots like this--  As far as I know, its anybody''s guess as to what is actually happening in the photograph.   Very cool..   I look forward to finding out what this is about.     I''m afraid you''ll get knocked because texture obviously takes backseat to the subjects in this photo-  I''ll give you a 6 anyway.  I would rather encourage more shots like this to tell you the truth :-p  Kudos', '2004-02-22 02:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(592704, 60974, 17387, '<td valign="top">I like the high-contrast/saturation.   Choosing to include the fingers actually "feeling" the texture helps to make the photo very vivid...  I am surprised I haven''t seen more like this.   Beyond this, the actual subject seems a bit dull- but I can''t penalize you much for that..  6</td>', 'I like the high-contrast/saturation.   Choosing to include the fingers actually "feeling" the texture helps to make the photo very vivid...  I am surprised I haven''t seen more like this.   Beyond this, the actual subject seems a bit dull- but I can''t penalize you much for that..  6', '2004-02-22 02:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
