(593060, 60037, 15920, '<td valign="top">That light post is not your friend.  Without that,I really like this composition, but with it, the image falls back to the rest of the pack.</td>', 'That light post is not your friend.  Without that,I really like this composition, but with it, the image falls back to the rest of the pack.', '2004-02-22 08:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(593061, 60595, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks overexposed in the highlights, which drew my attention there rather than to the other interesting parts of this shot.</td>', 'This looks overexposed in the highlights, which drew my attention there rather than to the other interesting parts of this shot.', '2004-02-22 08:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(593063, 60880, 15920, '<td valign="top">Technically this seems well done to me.  Unfortunately in a contest of so many images, it doesnt have an interesting enough feature to separate it from the pack.</td>', 'Technically this seems well done to me.  Unfortunately in a contest of so many images, it doesnt have an interesting enough feature to separate it from the pack.', '2004-02-22 08:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(593065, 60798, 17377, '<td valign="top">Nice texture.  But,  I would have like to have seen it cropped with less black.</td>', 'Nice texture.  But,  I would have like to have seen it cropped with less black.', '2004-02-22 08:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(593067, 61060, 15920, '<td valign="top">The two different backgrounds just don''t work for me.  I''ve seen it on teh site a few times, so others must like it.  My advice: ignore my comment and shoot things the way you like, but at least you know what I thought.</td>', 'The two different backgrounds just don''t work for me.  I''ve seen it on teh site a few times, so others must like it.  My advice: ignore my comment and shoot things the way you like, but at least you know what I thought.', '2004-02-22 08:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(593068, 59817, 15920, '<td valign="top">OK, this is great.  Good colors, cropping, and excellent focus and DOF.  I hope you do very well.</td>', 'OK, this is great.  Good colors, cropping, and excellent focus and DOF.  I hope you do very well.', '2004-02-22 08:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(593069, 61070, 3724, '<td valign="top">High score for this - colour appears very natural and detail of the delicate hair is rendered so well.  The receding seamless depth of field is pleasing.</td>', 'High score for this - colour appears very natural and detail of the delicate hair is rendered so well.  The receding seamless depth of field is pleasing.', '2004-02-22 08:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(593070, 60160, 15920, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the DOF decision worked.  I always prefer sharp eyes, but beyond that, this is nicely done.</td>', 'I''m not sure the DOF decision worked.  I always prefer sharp eyes, but beyond that, this is nicely done.', '2004-02-22 08:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(593072, 60151, 15920, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.</td>', 'This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.', '2004-02-22 09:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(593073, 59785, 15920, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.  A little sharper would have helped as well.</td>', 'This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.  A little sharper would have helped as well.', '2004-02-22 09:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(593074, 61116, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks overexposed in the highlights, which drew my attention there rather than to the other interesting parts of this shot.</td>', 'This looks overexposed in the highlights, which drew my attention there rather than to the other interesting parts of this shot.', '2004-02-22 09:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(593075, 60885, 15920, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.</td>', 'This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.', '2004-02-22 09:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(593076, 60875, 15920, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.</td>', 'This certainly meets the texture part of the challenge, but, it could use a single point of interest to make good use of that interesting texture as background.', '2004-02-22 09:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(593077, 59839, 17377, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you are getting a lot of comments on this shot. Interesting!</td>', 'I''m sure you are getting a lot of comments on this shot. Interesting!', '2004-02-22 09:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(593079, 60281, 12674, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I might''ve cropped it in even closer to pick up more of the texture of the sand dollar and the sand.</td>', 'Good idea. I might''ve cropped it in even closer to pick up more of the texture of the sand dollar and the sand.', '2004-02-22 09:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(593085, 60757, 17377, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I think I may have tried to crop out the green in the upper right hand corner.  Also trying to diffuse the light from the flash would have helped with the over exposed hot spots. Overall I think it is a great shot.</td>', 'Nice shot!  I think I may have tried to crop out the green in the upper right hand corner.  Also trying to diffuse the light from the flash would have helped with the over exposed hot spots. Overall I think it is a great shot.', '2004-02-22 09:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(593088, 60377, 17377, '<td valign="top">Could have been a really nice shot if it was not over exposed.  Some simple editing in a photo- editing program would have helped a lot.</td>', 'Could have been a really nice shot if it was not over exposed.  Some simple editing in a photo- editing program would have helped a lot.', '2004-02-22 09:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(593094, 60705, 11897, '<td valign="top">A lttle too dark for me. I originally scored you way down but it has grown on me and the lightis the problem.</td>', 'A lttle too dark for me. I originally scored you way down but it has grown on me and the lightis the problem.', '2004-02-22 09:31:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(593095, 61024, 11897, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this is too small and a poor shot.</td>', 'I''m afraid this is too small and a poor shot.', '2004-02-22 09:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(593097, 60343, 11897, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge at all, and to be honest is just not a good picture.<br/>increasing the iso rating would have produced a better image maybe.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge at all, and to be honest is just not a good picture.increasing the iso rating would have produced a better image maybe.', '2004-02-22 09:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(593098, 59851, 11897, '<td valign="top">Far too small, a little out of focus too.</td>', 'Far too small, a little out of focus too.', '2004-02-22 09:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(593100, 60997, 11897, '<td valign="top">Unsharp I''m afraid, could be much better.</td>', 'Unsharp I''m afraid, could be much better.', '2004-02-22 09:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(593101, 59882, 11897, '<td valign="top">Not very well focussed, lighting lets it down also.</td>', 'Not very well focussed, lighting lets it down also.', '2004-02-22 09:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(593102, 59785, 11897, '<td valign="top">Needs to be a little sharper, good idea.</td>', 'Needs to be a little sharper, good idea.', '2004-02-22 09:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(593103, 60315, 3724, '<td valign="top">Paper shade with random opaque strands of fiber - it appears that the light is on!  Various sizes of the strands eludes to depth on this sand like mottled field.   For me the black window restrains - I could see this one bleed and breath to the edge.</td>', 'Paper shade with random opaque strands of fiber - it appears that the light is on!  Various sizes of the strands eludes to depth on this sand like mottled field.   For me the black window restrains - I could see this one bleed and breath to the edge.', '2004-02-22 09:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(593104, 60405, 11897, '<td valign="top">a little better focus needed.</td>', 'a little better focus needed.', '2004-02-22 09:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(593105, 61086, 11897, '<td valign="top">I think it needs a focus point somewhere in the shot, too soft for a texture challenge. just my opinion of course.</td>', 'I think it needs a focus point somewhere in the shot, too soft for a texture challenge. just my opinion of course.', '2004-02-22 09:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(593106, 61120, 11897, '<td valign="top">Don''t really think this fits the challenge, the reference to the hat is not good enough<br/>A closer shot on the hat would have produced a much better picture for texture..</td>', 'Don''t really think this fits the challenge, the reference to the hat is not good enoughA closer shot on the hat would have produced a much better picture for texture..', '2004-02-22 09:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(593108, 60493, 11897, '<td valign="top">The focus is not as sharp as it could be and the lighting is not quite right.</td>', 'The focus is not as sharp as it could be and the lighting is not quite right.', '2004-02-22 09:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(593109, 60821, 11897, '<td valign="top">I think your title sums up the picture to be honest, not much to do with the challenge here.</td>', 'I think your title sums up the picture to be honest, not much to do with the challenge here.', '2004-02-22 09:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(593123, 60099, 3724, '<td valign="top">Top lit soft edged material, maybe q-tips or something woven,  bunched into the more or less centered  triangle on the black back has great detail.  The hardly noticable depth of field and  the sepia add something extra....  well done piece.</td>', 'Top lit soft edged material, maybe q-tips or something woven,  bunched into the more or less centered  triangle on the black back has great detail.  The hardly noticable depth of field and  the sepia add something extra....  well done piece.', '2004-02-22 10:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
