(594376, 60291, 7263, '<td valign="top">Needs more attention paying to the BG in my opinion. Kind of off white and plain.</td>', 'Needs more attention paying to the BG in my opinion. Kind of off white and plain.', '2004-02-23 10:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
