(594806, 60756, 12802, '<td valign="top">I like this, good idea for the challenge.  Nice and clear, glad it''s not a flattened mound of O''s. <br/> <br/>The front seems a little out of focus, and maybe a little more light at the back right?</td>', 'I like this, good idea for the challenge.  Nice and clear, glad it''s not a flattened mound of O''s.  The front seems a little out of focus, and maybe a little more light at the back right?', '2004-02-23 16:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(594813, 60995, 12802, '<td valign="top">LOL, two different textures here...  One when it''s popped and one when it''s not.<br/> <br/>The lighting could maybe have been a little better, seems a little overexposed towards the back, but too dark at the front.</td>', 'LOL, two different textures here...  One when it''s popped and one when it''s not. The lighting could maybe have been a little better, seems a little overexposed towards the back, but too dark at the front.', '2004-02-23 16:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(594815, 59766, 12802, '<td valign="top">:-)  Good idea!  Can just see the ladies bums and legs with the marks made by these chairs!<br/> <br/>I like the DOF you''ve used. good use of symmetry too.  The only thing is the lighted area on the top right hand side, maybe the light coming from a window?  Just a little distracting.</td>', ':-)  Good idea!  Can just see the ladies bums and legs with the marks made by these chairs! I like the DOF you''ve used. good use of symmetry too.  The only thing is the lighted area on the top right hand side, maybe the light coming from a window?  Just a little distracting.', '2004-02-23 16:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(594818, 59785, 12802, '<td valign="top">Too out of focus I''m afraid...  Maybe use Macro mode if you have it, or bring your camera back a little?</td>', 'Too out of focus I''m afraid...  Maybe use Macro mode if you have it, or bring your camera back a little?', '2004-02-23 16:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(594829, 60887, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting piece of metal. Lots of character to it.</td>', 'Interesting piece of metal. Lots of character to it.', '2004-02-23 16:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(594840, 61114, 13136, '<td valign="top">Lots of different ''Textures'' in this shot. All with similar colors. Good combination. Not sure I like the double border.</td>', 'Lots of different ''Textures'' in this shot. All with similar colors. Good combination. Not sure I like the double border.', '2004-02-23 16:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(594842, 60760, 9504, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous cat...I really like the perspective.</td>', 'Gorgeous cat...I really like the perspective.', '2004-02-23 16:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(594848, 60922, 13136, '<td valign="top">Lots of use and character in this quarter. Good for a ''Texture'' challenge. Still not a very interesting shot to me.</td>', 'Lots of use and character in this quarter. Good for a ''Texture'' challenge. Still not a very interesting shot to me.', '2004-02-23 16:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(594853, 60288, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Contrast of the marble to the sky is well done. Since this is a ''Texture'' challenge, you may actually need to be closer to the marble to fit better.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Contrast of the marble to the sky is well done. Since this is a ''Texture'' challenge, you may actually need to be closer to the marble to fit better.', '2004-02-23 17:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(594856, 60787, 17279, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the execution leaves a little to be desired.  Needs greater DOF and I don''t think B&amp;W was the way to go here.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the execution leaves a little to be desired.  Needs greater DOF and I don''t think B&W was the way to go here.', '2004-02-23 17:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(594858, 60185, 15968, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting nice one</td>', 'beautiful lighting nice one', '2004-02-23 17:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(594859, 60769, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  I don''t think the soft focus helped though.  Also, too much dead space between the paints.  OTOH, I like the colors and textures.  Great idea!</td>', 'Nice colors.  I don''t think the soft focus helped though.  Also, too much dead space between the paints.  OTOH, I like the colors and textures.  Great idea!', '2004-02-23 17:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(594875, 61086, 11895, '<td valign="top">I know that calla lilies have texture but this shot is so soft and/or out of focus that I can''t see any texture, just looks soft and fuzzy to me, color may have helped</td>', 'I know that calla lilies have texture but this shot is so soft and/or out of focus that I can''t see any texture, just looks soft and fuzzy to me, color may have helped', '2004-02-23 17:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(594894, 61094, 11895, '<td valign="top">this is a very interesting picture but IMHO it is a stretch in a texture challenge</td>', 'this is a very interesting picture but IMHO it is a stretch in a texture challenge', '2004-02-23 17:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(594895, 59916, 15968, '<td valign="top">wonderful photograph!  People work so hard!</td>', 'wonderful photograph!  People work so hard!', '2004-02-23 17:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(594899, 59958, 15002, '<td valign="top">good picture,  leveling before cropping would have made it better</td>', 'good picture,  leveling before cropping would have made it better', '2004-02-23 17:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(594903, 60322, 17279, '<td valign="top">Not in focus, composition/framing could be better</td>', 'Not in focus, composition/framing could be better', '2004-02-23 17:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(594905, 60422, 17279, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is, but texture is certainly there. Too much direct lighting on the bottom half.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is, but texture is certainly there. Too much direct lighting on the bottom half.', '2004-02-23 17:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(594907, 60488, 15002, '<td valign="top">Lots of different textures.  How did it look in color?</td>', 'Lots of different textures.  How did it look in color?', '2004-02-23 17:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(594908, 60762, 17279, '<td valign="top">I like it!  Nice color!  Not sure about use of the towl though...</td>', 'I like it!  Nice color!  Not sure about use of the towl though...', '2004-02-23 17:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(594911, 60786, 17279, '<td valign="top">I don''t really feel the texture here.  There''s too much to take in with no specific subject or focal point in the image.</td>', 'I don''t really feel the texture here.  There''s too much to take in with no specific subject or focal point in the image.', '2004-02-23 17:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(594912, 60035, 17279, '<td valign="top">I like it :) very interesting.  Might have gone with softer lighting or a darker background.</td>', 'I like it :) very interesting.  Might have gone with softer lighting or a darker background.', '2004-02-23 17:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(594914, 61130, 11295, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked to see more DOF... would have carried the texute motif all the way through the picture.</td>', 'I''d have liked to see more DOF... would have carried the texute motif all the way through the picture.', '2004-02-23 17:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(594916, 61128, 11295, '<td valign="top">Kewl!</td>', 'Kewl!', '2004-02-23 17:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(594917, 61066, 17279, '<td valign="top">Great colors! A little too contrasty for my taste between red/white though...Maybe a softer/diffused lighting would help.</td>', 'Great colors! A little too contrasty for my taste between red/white though...Maybe a softer/diffused lighting would help.', '2004-02-23 17:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(594919, 60932, 11295, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. You''ve chosen a good subject, and created a lot of detail.</td>', 'I really like this one. You''ve chosen a good subject, and created a lot of detail.', '2004-02-23 17:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(594920, 60262, 17279, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...The black background is wonderfully complementary and good job bringing out detail on the feathers.</td>', 'Beautiful...The black background is wonderfully complementary and good job bringing out detail on the feathers.', '2004-02-23 17:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(594921, 60745, 17279, '<td valign="top">This is simply wonderful!</td>', 'This is simply wonderful!', '2004-02-23 17:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(594922, 59935, 11295, '<td valign="top">Colour overload! I love it... great work... this has a lot of ''wow'' factor, and the subject matter is really interesting too.</td>', 'Colour overload! I love it... great work... this has a lot of ''wow'' factor, and the subject matter is really interesting too.', '2004-02-23 17:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(594923, 60939, 17279, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and color!</td>', 'Excellent detail and color!', '2004-02-23 17:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(594924, 60921, 17279, '<td valign="top">Wow...texture in spades!  Good job with lighting!</td>', 'Wow...texture in spades!  Good job with lighting!', '2004-02-23 17:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(594926, 60770, 17279, '<td valign="top">This is really well done!  You really did a great job bringing out the texture and colors add so much to this shot!</td>', 'This is really well done!  You really did a great job bringing out the texture and colors add so much to this shot!', '2004-02-23 17:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(594929, 60845, 15002, '<td valign="top">excellent use of light</td>', 'excellent use of light', '2004-02-23 18:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(594933, 60262, 16531, '<td valign="top">The swan looks very soft, just cropped a little to tight for me ,still a great shot.. <br/> good luck at the polls...</td>', 'The swan looks very soft, just cropped a little to tight for me ,still a great shot..  good luck at the polls...', '2004-02-23 18:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(594934, 59995, 11295, '<td valign="top">This is an exceptional portrait. I really like the way this was lit, and there''s a good sense of texture all around. Well done!</td>', 'This is an exceptional portrait. I really like the way this was lit, and there''s a good sense of texture all around. Well done!', '2004-02-23 18:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(594935, 61094, 11295, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! A little more sharpness next time is my only suggestion. This shot is a really good capture.</td>', 'Beautiful! A little more sharpness next time is my only suggestion. This shot is a really good capture.', '2004-02-23 18:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(594938, 60765, 11295, '<td valign="top">A little too soft on the focus, but otherwise a nice shot...</td>', 'A little too soft on the focus, but otherwise a nice shot...', '2004-02-23 18:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(594940, 60834, 11295, '<td valign="top">Perspective, ho! ) Creative capture... nicely done!</td>', 'Perspective, ho! ) Creative capture... nicely done!', '2004-02-23 18:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(594945, 59839, 11295, '<td valign="top">Strangely disturbing, and I don''t get the title, but it''s a nice shot, and it fits the challenge well. 8</td>', 'Strangely disturbing, and I don''t get the title, but it''s a nice shot, and it fits the challenge well. 8', '2004-02-23 18:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(594946, 60974, 11295, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a little oversaturated, and the highlights are a bit burned out. I do like the detail you got with the fingers. They seem quite punished.</td>', 'Seems to be a little oversaturated, and the highlights are a bit burned out. I do like the detail you got with the fingers. They seem quite punished.', '2004-02-23 18:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(594949, 60808, 11295, '<td valign="top">Strangely, I find myself liking this after I got over the initial ''ugh'' factor.  I like the fact that you''ve included as much context as you did, but the sand, which may be the best textur point is *almost* lost. 7.</td>', 'Strangely, I find myself liking this after I got over the initial ''ugh'' factor.  I like the fact that you''ve included as much context as you did, but the sand, which may be the best textur point is *almost* lost. 7.', '2004-02-23 18:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(594953, 60879, 11295, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. This is an excellent shot! 9.</td>', 'Nice macro. This is an excellent shot! 9.', '2004-02-23 18:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(594970, 60756, 11295, '<td valign="top">Zounds! How did you get so many of these? Great shot! Nicely lit and the texture is there. I would have gone a bit closer down, but still. Cool! 8.</td>', 'Zounds! How did you get so many of these? Great shot! Nicely lit and the texture is there. I would have gone a bit closer down, but still. Cool! 8.', '2004-02-23 18:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(594979, 60780, 17113, '<td valign="top">Both the idea and the implementation are pure genius.</td>', 'Both the idea and the implementation are pure genius.', '2004-02-23 18:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(594997, 61136, 17498, '<td valign="top">textural, sensual, sensational!</td>', 'textural, sensual, sensational!', '2004-02-23 18:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(595001, 60766, 17498, '<td valign="top">exquisite!</td>', 'exquisite!', '2004-02-23 18:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(595023, 60404, 17498, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge equisitely</td>', 'meets the challenge equisitely', '2004-02-23 18:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(595027, 60780, 17498, '<td valign="top">love this! Beautifully done</td>', 'love this! Beautifully done', '2004-02-23 18:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(595095, 60284, 3724, '<td valign="top">soft pastel colour different from the plant? but still in the spirit of the true colour of the agave some how.   I think superior vertical composition and use of the shadow -  which might be even more  dramatic if darker, however still very effective.  Pink and purple barbs as a secondary design focus provides extra complexity to the design.  Very adept composition and design.</td>', 'soft pastel colour different from the plant? but still in the spirit of the true colour of the agave some how.   I think superior vertical composition and use of the shadow -  which might be even more  dramatic if darker, however still very effective.  Pink and purple barbs as a secondary design focus provides extra complexity to the design.  Very adept composition and design.', '2004-02-23 19:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(595100, 61013, 16033, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Love that black against yellow contrast, and nicely integrated with the sky colour.</td>', 'Great shot!  Love that black against yellow contrast, and nicely integrated with the sky colour.', '2004-02-23 19:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(595105, 60284, 16033, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. love that passive colour yet stimulating. nice texture. 10</td>', 'Excellent shot. love that passive colour yet stimulating. nice texture. 10', '2004-02-23 19:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(595107, 60499, 16033, '<td valign="top">nice effect</td>', 'nice effect', '2004-02-23 19:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(595109, 60185, 16033, '<td valign="top">maybe a bit more light?</td>', 'maybe a bit more light?', '2004-02-23 19:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(595110, 61108, 11570, '<td valign="top">I feel the lighting is too flat to reveal the texture that is there.</td>', 'I feel the lighting is too flat to reveal the texture that is there.', '2004-02-23 19:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(595111, 60979, 9581, '<td valign="top">pretty! I like this!</td>', 'pretty! I like this!', '2004-02-23 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(595112, 60226, 16033, '<td valign="top">nice mixture of colours</td>', 'nice mixture of colours', '2004-02-23 19:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(595114, 61106, 11570, '<td valign="top">Just maybe this would have worked better if it was converted to B&amp;W.<br/> <br/> <br/>IMHO the lighting does not do the potential texture justice.</td>', 'Just maybe this would have worked better if it was converted to B&W.  IMHO the lighting does not do the potential texture justice.', '2004-02-23 19:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(595116, 60924, 16033, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Simple but nice, nicely saturated colours. 10</td>', 'Great shot! Simple but nice, nicely saturated colours. 10', '2004-02-23 19:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(595117, 60924, 11570, '<td valign="top">Makes me such my cheeks in just to look at this.<br/> <br/>IMHO the lighting is too harsh and blown as such the texture is lost.</td>', 'Makes me such my cheeks in just to look at this. IMHO the lighting is too harsh and blown as such the texture is lost.', '2004-02-23 19:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(595118, 60664, 16033, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot.</td>', 'Great macro shot.', '2004-02-23 19:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(595120, 59953, 11570, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but for me lacking because there is nothing in sharp focus to give me the textural feeling.</td>', 'Interesting idea but for me lacking because there is nothing in sharp focus to give me the textural feeling.', '2004-02-23 19:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
