(595176, 60013, 16033, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2004-02-23 20:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(595178, 59885, 3724, '<td valign="top">riet - Real Estate Institute of Tasmania or real estate investment trust.   Probably not. Unusuall word for a basket weave.  Another meaning for the word according to my dictionary is sedge or seaweed [Prov. Eng.]   I can see how this may have been woven from those materials.......   Maybe it is a word which relates to some type of weaving?  Regardless of your title definition, your picture is sharp and clear, colours appear to be accurate.  Exposure is beautiful, with shadow detail and highlights totally legible.  Nice traditional subject matter.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-25 00:15:58.</i></td>', 'riet - Real Estate Institute of Tasmania or real estate investment trust.   Probably not. Unusuall word for a basket weave.  Another meaning for the word according to my dictionary is sedge or seaweed [Prov. Eng.]   I can see how this may have been woven from those materials.......   Maybe it is a word which relates to some type of weaving?  Regardless of your title definition, your picture is sharp and clear, colours appear to be accurate.  Exposure is beautiful, with shadow detail and highlights totally legible.  Nice traditional subject matter.', '2004-02-23 20:26:12.000000', '2004-02-25 00:15:58.000000', 1),
(595183, 60782, 17683, '<td valign="top">Looks like a flower...</td>', 'Looks like a flower...', '2004-02-23 20:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(595186, 60379, 3724, '<td valign="top">A difficult subject.......   your exposure is pretty good - detail in the shadow is evident and highlights except for the left side is about right.  A nice specimen!</td>', 'A difficult subject.......   your exposure is pretty good - detail in the shadow is evident and highlights except for the left side is about right.  A nice specimen!', '2004-02-23 20:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(595190, 60988, 17683, '<td valign="top">As if painted...</td>', 'As if painted...', '2004-02-23 20:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(595194, 60198, 2158, '<td valign="top">Despite your title, I haven''t a clue what it is.  Certainly an interesting shot though.</td>', 'Despite your title, I haven''t a clue what it is.  Certainly an interesting shot though.', '2004-02-23 20:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(595208, 60700, 5534, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge and probably the best photo showing the texture of wood. Nice different tones on the wood,  the angles, shape and that color in the background bring this photo all together.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge and probably the best photo showing the texture of wood. Nice different tones on the wood,  the angles, shape and that color in the background bring this photo all together.', '2004-02-23 20:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(595222, 60879, 12252, '<td valign="top">Stunning and one my two favorites for this challenge. You nailed texture!</td>', 'Stunning and one my two favorites for this challenge. You nailed texture!', '2004-02-23 21:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(595225, 60745, 12252, '<td valign="top">What I love about this picture is the fresh POV, the wonderful light, and the terrific sense of texture in the green portion of the plant. One of my top two favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'What I love about this picture is the fresh POV, the wonderful light, and the terrific sense of texture in the green portion of the plant. One of my top two favorites for this challenge.', '2004-02-23 21:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(595227, 61032, 12252, '<td valign="top">A magical photograph! The laciness of the snow on the branches is texture, right? Well, it is in my book. 8</td>', 'A magical photograph! The laciness of the snow on the branches is texture, right? Well, it is in my book. 8', '2004-02-23 21:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(595228, 60767, 12252, '<td valign="top">I just love this picture! You can "feel" the rough pads on that foot. Composition nicely done, even if it''s centered. Should be a top ten finisher, maybe even a ribbon!</td>', 'I just love this picture! You can "feel" the rough pads on that foot. Composition nicely done, even if it''s centered. Should be a top ten finisher, maybe even a ribbon!', '2004-02-23 21:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(595229, 60358, 12252, '<td valign="top">Good job. Composition is great; I can feel the nose just by looking at it.</td>', 'Good job. Composition is great; I can feel the nose just by looking at it.', '2004-02-23 21:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(595231, 60932, 12252, '<td valign="top">Good capture, terrific POV, great composition. Top Ten for sure! 8</td>', 'Good capture, terrific POV, great composition. Top Ten for sure! 8', '2004-02-23 21:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(595233, 60358, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2004-02-23 21:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(595234, 60845, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like this picture a lot, and it meets the challenge easily. Personally, I''d like a lower angle on the basket if it were up to me. Lighting is great, background sensational -- good job and good luck!</td>', 'I like this picture a lot, and it meets the challenge easily. Personally, I''d like a lower angle on the basket if it were up to me. Lighting is great, background sensational -- good job and good luck!', '2004-02-23 21:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(595239, 60960, 12252, '<td valign="top">Black and white is a good choice, lots of texture here so you meet the challenge, it''s a bit dark but on the other hand that conveys a mood, so if I were to change just one thing I''d make the black frame thinner (with perhaps a white line between the frame and the image. This kind of subject is one of my favorites and I like how you''ve done this one.</td>', 'Black and white is a good choice, lots of texture here so you meet the challenge, it''s a bit dark but on the other hand that conveys a mood, so if I were to change just one thing I''d make the black frame thinner (with perhaps a white line between the frame and the image. This kind of subject is one of my favorites and I like how you''ve done this one.', '2004-02-23 21:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
