(595596, 60922, 6172, '<td valign="top">Composition doesn''t thrill me too much, and the front is a little off focus.  Good example of texture though, and a good title.</td>', 'Composition doesn''t thrill me too much, and the front is a little off focus.  Good example of texture though, and a good title.', '2004-02-24 03:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
