(595599, 60306, 16676, '<td valign="top">Good composition. The frame and startling white back ground distract.</td>', 'Good composition. The frame and startling white back ground distract.', '2004-02-24 03:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(595620, 61101, 16004, '<td valign="top">I actually like this - fingers are naturally gravitated to keyboards anyway, and it''s partly interactive because i''m experiencing the touch of a keyboard right now!  I like how the characters appear raised on the keys too.  very nice.  10.</td>', 'I actually like this - fingers are naturally gravitated to keyboards anyway, and it''s partly interactive because i''m experiencing the touch of a keyboard right now!  I like how the characters appear raised on the keys too.  very nice.  10.', '2004-02-24 04:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(595638, 61053, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of the blue world and the warm colour of the wooden figure - like imagination and reality in a drear world. great sense of the smooth polishedness of the figure too, and the highlighting of it works well. Do like this very much.</td>', 'Nice contrast of the blue world and the warm colour of the wooden figure - like imagination and reality in a drear world. great sense of the smooth polishedness of the figure too, and the highlighting of it works well. Do like this very much.', '2004-02-24 05:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(595639, 59973, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good and ominous tones here. great light too - perhaps the most subtle use of natural light I''ve seen in this challenge. Great sense of threat here too - almost a 1970''s Hammer movie feel. The more I look, the more I like ...</td>', 'Good and ominous tones here. great light too - perhaps the most subtle use of natural light I''ve seen in this challenge. Great sense of threat here too - almost a 1970''s Hammer movie feel. The more I look, the more I like ...', '2004-02-24 05:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(595641, 60905, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now this is good photography. Great rhythm, detail, feel and balance. Found photography, rather than set-up? I kind of hope so, out fo some (probably misguided) sense of what constitutes ''proper'' photography. Don''t misunderstand this, but I''m not sure the real detail of texture comes through - it''s more on a grand scale of the shaping of those roots and that leaf than the contrast between the two surfaces. Still very good stuff though.</td>', 'Now this is good photography. Great rhythm, detail, feel and balance. Found photography, rather than set-up? I kind of hope so, out fo some (probably misguided) sense of what constitutes ''proper'' photography. Don''t misunderstand this, but I''m not sure the real detail of texture comes through - it''s more on a grand scale of the shaping of those roots and that leaf than the contrast between the two surfaces. Still very good stuff though.', '2004-02-24 05:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(595651, 59837, 16676, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the warts on the skin.</td>', 'Great capture of the warts on the skin.', '2004-02-24 06:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
