(595692, 60878, 7263, '<td valign="top">This really does nothing for me. They say to give comments for images you rank low, but my point is sometimes one can''t find much to say - and in this case that is true.<br/> <br/>I will have a go though ;)<br/> <br/>The effect you have done has not helped this image, there is no feeling of texture or of the silk your title suggests, to me silk is smooth and well silky, but this is noisy funny colours and a bit messy.<br/> <br/>I think using the camera more and photoshop less would have helped this image.<br/> <br/>Hope it hasn''t put you off submitting more!<br/> <br/>JP</td>', 'This really does nothing for me. They say to give comments for images you rank low, but my point is sometimes one can''t find much to say - and in this case that is true. I will have a go though ;) The effect you have done has not helped this image, there is no feeling of texture or of the silk your title suggests, to me silk is smooth and well silky, but this is noisy funny colours and a bit messy. I think using the camera more and photoshop less would have helped this image. Hope it hasn''t put you off submitting more! JP', '2004-02-24 08:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(595693, 60404, 11068, '<td valign="top">very good<br/> <br/>Harm</td>', 'very good Harm', '2004-02-24 08:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(595694, 60957, 7263, '<td valign="top">looks a bit over sharpened in camera or post, otherwsie a nice subject and photo.</td>', 'looks a bit over sharpened in camera or post, otherwsie a nice subject and photo.', '2004-02-24 08:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(595695, 61113, 7263, '<td valign="top">not a fan of the composition going one end to the other. but very well exposed and focused.</td>', 'not a fan of the composition going one end to the other. but very well exposed and focused.', '2004-02-24 08:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(595696, 60814, 7263, '<td valign="top">ok textures, but scene lacks any focal point.</td>', 'ok textures, but scene lacks any focal point.', '2004-02-24 08:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(595701, 60084, 7263, '<td valign="top">This is pretty neat. Well done for adding a much needed bump in the fabric - gives it some depth and substance. 8</td>', 'This is pretty neat. Well done for adding a much needed bump in the fabric - gives it some depth and substance. 8', '2004-02-24 08:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(595702, 60439, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, nice texture. Composition could be improved, maybe with a different POV</td>', 'Interesting shot, nice texture. Composition could be improved, maybe with a different POV', '2004-02-24 08:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
