(595857, 61024, 15920, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid that this is very overexposed.  In shots like this, I like there to be some detail in the lighted areas.  The cameras movement up and down hurt as well (I realize it was probably a bump in the road) and finally, the cropping should have taken out the window frame.  Keep practising though, this was probably the hardest shot to attempt in the whole competition.</td>', 'I''m afraid that this is very overexposed.  In shots like this, I like there to be some detail in the lighted areas.  The cameras movement up and down hurt as well (I realize it was probably a bump in the road) and finally, the cropping should have taken out the window frame.  Keep practising though, this was probably the hardest shot to attempt in the whole competition.', '2004-02-24 10:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
