(595979, 61101, 16850, '<td valign="top">I like it, but (you knew there was going to be a but) I think I''d let the tab establish point of interest and go all sharp on the focus for more texture.</td>', 'I like it, but (you knew there was going to be a but) I think I''d let the tab establish point of interest and go all sharp on the focus for more texture.', '2004-02-24 11:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
