(596978, 60893, 8637, '<td valign="top">Would really liked to have seen more of the face/emotion of the person holding the doll.  But nice "texture" image.</td>', 'Would really liked to have seen more of the face/emotion of the person holding the doll.  But nice "texture" image.', '2004-02-24 23:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(596979, 60798, 15407, '<td valign="top">I think you have done an excellent job on this challenge. I think I would have like the Hot Spots removed on the polished piece yet it does help define the texture.</td>', 'I think you have done an excellent job on this challenge. I think I would have like the Hot Spots removed on the polished piece yet it does help define the texture.', '2004-02-24 23:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(596980, 60439, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the snake, there is sertaintly an interesting texture here. Its a shame that you didn''t make the photo big enough to see the details, I am sure you will see this effect your voting. Remember to always make the long side 640 pixles.</td>', 'I like the snake, there is sertaintly an interesting texture here. Its a shame that you didn''t make the photo big enough to see the details, I am sure you will see this effect your voting. Remember to always make the long side 640 pixles.', '2004-02-24 23:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(596981, 60765, 15330, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, I like the composition, and bright yellow color. It would''ve been better if the bee was in focus,it looks a little off. The yellow looks a little oversaturated, but that might just be me.</td>', 'This is a great photo, I like the composition, and bright yellow color. It would''ve been better if the bee was in focus,it looks a little off. The yellow looks a little oversaturated, but that might just be me.', '2004-02-24 23:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(596983, 59979, 8637, '<td valign="top">Yeahhhh!   This is what texture is all about!  Nice shot, great macro and focus.  Angle is nice...wonder if you had taken with sharper light angle, if it would have  brought out more of the contrast between the sheets? nice work.</td>', 'Yeahhhh!   This is what texture is all about!  Nice shot, great macro and focus.  Angle is nice...wonder if you had taken with sharper light angle, if it would have  brought out more of the contrast between the sheets? nice work.', '2004-02-24 23:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(596984, 60887, 15407, '<td valign="top">I think you have done an excellent job on this challenge. When I gave this another look @ 8x6 and compared it to the competition, I gave it an extra point. The fine detail will be lost on many I think.  Did you clean this part or was it ever even used?</td>', 'I think you have done an excellent job on this challenge. When I gave this another look @ 8x6 and compared it to the competition, I gave it an extra point. The fine detail will be lost on many I think.  Did you clean this part or was it ever even used?', '2004-02-24 23:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
