(597019, 59785, 14157, '<td valign="top">That is cool man. It just needs to be more focused.</td>', 'That is cool man. It just needs to be more focused.', '2004-02-25 00:14:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(597023, 60069, 14157, '<td valign="top">KITTY!!! wait.. I like that group... erm...maybe if it was a little less flashed or something.... myup...</td>', 'KITTY!!! wait.. I like that group... erm...maybe if it was a little less flashed or something.... myup...', '2004-02-25 00:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(597053, 60804, 9073, '<td valign="top">Well done, Renee, a very respectable finish among the biggest challenge so far. You were right, the lens cap was noticed. Most probably, your score would have been much higher otherwise. That''s too bad. The spelling in your title is a bit strange.</td>', 'Well done, Renee, a very respectable finish among the biggest challenge so far. You were right, the lens cap was noticed. Most probably, your score would have been much higher otherwise. That''s too bad. The spelling in your title is a bit strange.', '2004-02-25 00:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(597062, 61107, 10084, '<td valign="top">The layering with the feathers is a interesting composition. Great capture of the graduations in the feathers. Gave you a "10'' on this shot. Too many to comment on and wasn''t able to get to comment in the voting stage.</td>', 'The layering with the feathers is a interesting composition. Great capture of the graduations in the feathers. Gave you a "10'' on this shot. Too many to comment on and wasn''t able to get to comment in the voting stage.', '2004-02-25 00:34:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(597063, 60960, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You got robbed on this one.  I guess one out of two ribbons per shoot ain''t bad though.  :)</td>', 'Wow.  You got robbed on this one.  I guess one out of two ribbons per shoot ain''t bad though.  :)', '2004-02-25 00:34:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(597072, 60960, 15026, '<td valign="top">This is one image I missed - had much, much higher (in my top 10 or so).  Guess the masses assumed texture demanded a macro or the like.  There were others, so maybe I''m just out of touch?  Dunno.  In any event, I liked this shot - great feel to it.</td>', 'This is one image I missed - had much, much higher (in my top 10 or so).  Guess the masses assumed texture demanded a macro or the like.  There were others, so maybe I''m just out of touch?  Dunno.  In any event, I liked this shot - great feel to it.', '2004-02-25 00:37:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(597075, 60055, 9073, '<td valign="top">Interesting and effective image. It''s a pity to see such work score so lowly.</td>', 'Interesting and effective image. It''s a pity to see such work score so lowly.', '2004-02-25 00:37:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(597083, 60957, 15026, '<td valign="top">I had this photo finishing much higher.  It is a bit oversharpened, perhaps, but I think to good effect.</td>', 'I had this photo finishing much higher.  It is a bit oversharpened, perhaps, but I think to good effect.', '2004-02-25 00:39:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(597090, 61027, 9073, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot. I like the subtlety here. It''s a shame that this good image scored so lowly. That''s DPC.</td>', 'An interesting shot. I like the subtlety here. It''s a shame that this good image scored so lowly. That''s DPC.', '2004-02-25 00:41:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(597101, 60932, 11078, '<td valign="top">Great detail  Congrats on the ribbon well deserved I like fungi Pics <br/>I didn''t vote on this because my computer was being fixed,<br/> I really like this</td>', 'Great detail  Congrats on the ribbon well deserved I like fungi Pics I didn''t vote on this because my computer was being fixed, I really like this', '2004-02-25 00:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(597102, 60656, 14476, '<td valign="top">It''s a good image and it is too bad it didn''t place higher.  From the other remarks, it certainly seems that many of us liked your work.  Hang in there!</td>', 'It''s a good image and it is too bad it didn''t place higher.  From the other remarks, it certainly seems that many of us liked your work.  Hang in there!', '2004-02-25 00:45:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(597109, 59908, 9073, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea executed strangely. I like it, though, and I''m  (again) upset at DPC for scoring it so lowly.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea executed strangely. I like it, though, and I''m  (again) upset at DPC for scoring it so lowly.', '2004-02-25 00:46:47.000000', NULL, 0),
