(597118, 60588, 11078, '<td valign="top">Great shot but it''s a horrible looking bird<br/>great texture, colours, and detail Yuk! Put me off eating turkey.LOL<br/>Congrats on the ribbon though<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-25 00:51:55.</i></td>', 'Great shot but it''s a horrible looking birdgreat texture, colours, and detail Yuk! Put me off eating turkey.LOLCongrats on the ribbon though', '2004-02-25 00:50:53.000000', '2004-02-25 00:51:55.000000', 0),
(597198, 59958, 16477, '<td valign="top">Well i will be honest, i did not  shoot this for  the contest, i was shooting for  my work( i plan to upload  those pictures soon) , i was just checking  result in PS after shooting , that time i had opened  DP window and i saw this contest, all i did was  simply crop and that too badly.<br/> <br/>Well i really got some nice  comments despite my poor entry, i should have tried  harder.<br/>thanks for comments<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-25 01:32:35.</i></td>', 'Well i will be honest, i did not  shoot this for  the contest, i was shooting for  my work( i plan to upload  those pictures soon) , i was just checking  result in PS after shooting , that time i had opened  DP window and i saw this contest, all i did was  simply crop and that too badly. Well i really got some nice  comments despite my poor entry, i should have tried  harder.thanks for comments', '2004-02-25 01:26:49.000000', '2004-02-25 01:32:35.000000', 0),
(597199, 60876, 4258, '<td valign="top">Texture - yes , but some of the highlights look over burnt.. I like the gradient of light across the picture to the top left.<br/></td>', 'Texture - yes , but some of the highlights look over burnt.. I like the gradient of light across the picture to the top left.', '2004-02-25 01:27:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(597228, 60964, 10752, '<td valign="top">Thanks to you all for your vote! <br/> <br/>This is a coffee table with glass surface and the view is between the glass and the wooden surfaces that create a texture like the sea close to the seashore. The black shadow at the top is the edge of the glass and I couldn''t exclude from the photo because my lens is thick enough to get into the gap between the glass and the surfaces. Only noise reduction, crop and resize is applied to the photo.</td>', 'Thanks to you all for your vote!  This is a coffee table with glass surface and the view is between the glass and the wooden surfaces that create a texture like the sea close to the seashore. The black shadow at the top is the edge of the glass and I couldn''t exclude from the photo because my lens is thick enough to get into the gap between the glass and the surfaces. Only noise reduction, crop and resize is applied to the photo.', '2004-02-25 01:59:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(597229, 60963, 14499, '<td valign="top">Nice work! Looking at all these shots.. I really wish I had entered a pic in this one.</td>', 'Nice work! Looking at all these shots.. I really wish I had entered a pic in this one.', '2004-02-25 02:04:07.000000', NULL, 0),
