(597322, 60879, 16493, '<td valign="top">hmm, I only gave this picture 5 and it came out 2nd. I''m trying to think, why?.<br/>I don''t get a strog 3d textur feel from this photo. Bit confused how this texture would feel, I know these are soft feathers but I get a metalic wire feel from the photo.<br/>I usually sit close to the monitor and all these strong lines almost gave me a headache but its better if I move about 1 meter from the monitor but I did not do that dureing voting.<br/> <br/>After takeing a longer look and thought I would probably vote 7, from 1 meter distance.</td>', 'hmm, I only gave this picture 5 and it came out 2nd. I''m trying to think, why?.I don''t get a strog 3d textur feel from this photo. Bit confused how this texture would feel, I know these are soft feathers but I get a metalic wire feel from the photo.I usually sit close to the monitor and all these strong lines almost gave me a headache but its better if I move about 1 meter from the monitor but I did not do that dureing voting. After takeing a longer look and thought I would probably vote 7, from 1 meter distance.', '2004-02-25 03:44:16.000000', NULL, 0),
