(597499, 61153, 179, '<td valign="top">Ah ha! So this was it huh?<br/>I gave you an 8. Awesome job on this on Matt. The only thing that prevented me from scoring you higher is it was a jean texture, and there was quite a bit of jeans in that challenge.<br/> <br/>Love the idea, you are definitely getting into the "artsy" part of things. ;o)<br/>Nice placement, nice DoF, colors are a bit hot, contrast is nice. It''s all good except for the the jean part. Well for me anyways.<br/> <br/>You should let us know how you made that shot. <br/> <br/>Very well done!<br/> <br/>Stéphanie</td>', 'Ah ha! So this was it huh?I gave you an 8. Awesome job on this on Matt. The only thing that prevented me from scoring you higher is it was a jean texture, and there was quite a bit of jeans in that challenge. Love the idea, you are definitely getting into the "artsy" part of things. ;o)Nice placement, nice DoF, colors are a bit hot, contrast is nice. It''s all good except for the the jean part. Well for me anyways. You should let us know how you made that shot.  Very well done! Stéphanie', '2004-02-25 06:47:48.000000', NULL, 0),
