(597943, 59817, 259, '<td valign="top">thanks for all the comments.  it''s my new highest scoring pic, beating out two previous ribbons i have too.<br/> <br/>it''s cool to see that i didn''t get hammered too bad for the wild composition.<br/> <br/>thanks again.</td>', 'thanks for all the comments.  it''s my new highest scoring pic, beating out two previous ribbons i have too. it''s cool to see that i didn''t get hammered too bad for the wild composition. thanks again.', '2004-02-25 12:32:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(597944, 60932, 11843, '<td valign="top">Ed,<br/>Congratulations!<br/>I loved this one and rated it as one of my highest.<br/>What I like most is that it has an optical illusion to it. If you move your eye around in a circle around the outside, clockwise or counter, it seems to be bursting out from the page.<br/>Great job!<br/>Cheers....Martin</td>', 'Ed,Congratulations!I loved this one and rated it as one of my highest.What I like most is that it has an optical illusion to it. If you move your eye around in a circle around the outside, clockwise or counter, it seems to be bursting out from the page.Great job!Cheers....Martin', '2004-02-25 12:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(597949, 60932, 10055, '<td valign="top">Great job on getting your blue ribbon.</td>', 'Great job on getting your blue ribbon.', '2004-02-25 12:38:36.000000', NULL, 0),
