(598273, 61013, 13223, '<td valign="top">Hi,<br/>Thanks for all the nice comments. I know this picture wasn''t really the perfect shot for texture,  but I wanted to post it because I thought it fit abstractly and that it would be different from the norm. It''s true that usually texture needs light, but I think this shot shows texture too, in a different way.<br/>ciao</td>', 'Hi,Thanks for all the nice comments. I know this picture wasn''t really the perfect shot for texture,  but I wanted to post it because I thought it fit abstractly and that it would be different from the norm. It''s true that usually texture needs light, but I think this shot shows texture too, in a different way.ciao', '2004-02-25 15:09:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(598278, 60388, 14603, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot that deserved to finish much higher.<br/> <br/>Gordon</td>', 'Excellent shot that deserved to finish much higher. Gordon', '2004-02-25 15:13:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(598302, 60947, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a striking study - your choice to focus on this one small element of a larger sculpture is really fascinating - and the composition works very well. The detail really is excellent.</td>', 'What a striking study - your choice to focus on this one small element of a larger sculpture is really fascinating - and the composition works very well. The detail really is excellent.', '2004-02-25 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(598303, 60325, 14603, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who voted and commented.<br/> <br/>Gordon</td>', 'Thanks to all who voted and commented. Gordon', '2004-02-25 15:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(598306, 60011, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well composed, well lit, excellent choice to opt for black and white. I can feel the texture.</td>', 'Well composed, well lit, excellent choice to opt for black and white. I can feel the texture.', '2004-02-25 15:41:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(598310, 60824, 3087, '<td valign="top">-<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-22 04:16:40.</i></td>', '-', '2004-02-25 15:42:52.000000', '2004-03-22 04:16:40.000000', 0),
(598316, 59711, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and intriguing because it''s not obvious what it is. This image is all about light and shadow and shapes and I like that very much.</td>', 'This is beautiful and intriguing because it''s not obvious what it is. This image is all about light and shadow and shapes and I like that very much.', '2004-02-25 15:44:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(598326, 60980, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject matter - I feel I can''t quite see the detail clearly enough. Lighting is intriguing but I think it''s a touch dark towards the top which, to me, makes the overall image a little unbalanced. I like it best when I make it a square by cropping off the top - that seems to pull the focus more towards that wonderful sweeping curve.</td>', 'Beautiful subject matter - I feel I can''t quite see the detail clearly enough. Lighting is intriguing but I think it''s a touch dark towards the top which, to me, makes the overall image a little unbalanced. I like it best when I make it a square by cropping off the top - that seems to pull the focus more towards that wonderful sweeping curve.', '2004-02-25 15:47:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(598332, 60782, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a very unusual pet photo - I really like it. Not only the limited amount of the dog that''s showing but also the way the background creates compositional balance and balances with the black of his nose. Very cool!</td>', 'What a very unusual pet photo - I really like it. Not only the limited amount of the dog that''s showing but also the way the background creates compositional balance and balances with the black of his nose. Very cool!', '2004-02-25 15:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(598336, 60961, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very rich warm lighting, which really brings out the subject matter. I don''t know why but I think I like this better when rotated into a portrait orientation though it works very well as it is.</td>', 'Very rich warm lighting, which really brings out the subject matter. I don''t know why but I think I like this better when rotated into a portrait orientation though it works very well as it is.', '2004-02-25 15:50:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(598339, 60883, 2752, '<td valign="top">This is very mouth watering..We always had it at Christmas time and it is so delicious.</td>', 'This is very mouth watering..We always had it at Christmas time and it is so delicious.', '2004-02-25 15:52:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(598344, 61142, 3087, '<td valign="top">The colours are beautiful - isn''t it incredible how wide a colour palette can be created by oxidation?</td>', 'The colours are beautiful - isn''t it incredible how wide a colour palette can be created by oxidation?', '2004-02-25 15:54:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(598349, 61144, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, though I''m not sure the collar/ zip adds anything to it. I think your choice of going in close is good. Lighting is a little harsh to my mind - I don''t like that white chin area - I think softer lighting could have reduced that glare. This definitely speaks of texture though. Apologies if I''m repeating previous comments, I haven''t read them.</td>', 'I like the composition, though I''m not sure the collar/ zip adds anything to it. I think your choice of going in close is good. Lighting is a little harsh to my mind - I don''t like that white chin area - I think softer lighting could have reduced that glare. This definitely speaks of texture though. Apologies if I''m repeating previous comments, I haven''t read them.', '2004-02-25 15:56:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(598363, 61151, 7152, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody for the great comments...I must agree that there is little texture in the photo, but thanks for the positive feedback.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Mike</td>', 'Thanks everybody for the great comments...I must agree that there is little texture in the photo, but thanks for the positive feedback. Cheers,Mike', '2004-02-25 16:08:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(598385, 60932, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really marvelous work, Ed. Congratulations on the photo first, and the ribbon, too.</td>', 'Really marvelous work, Ed. Congratulations on the photo first, and the ribbon, too.', '2004-02-25 16:28:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(598387, 60879, 6870, '<td valign="top">Superb work, Lynn. The choice of contrasting lines is marvelous! Congratulations on the ribbon!</td>', 'Superb work, Lynn. The choice of contrasting lines is marvelous! Congratulations on the ribbon!', '2004-02-25 16:29:38.000000', NULL, 0),
