(603558, 60932, 11005, '<td valign="top">"I''ve looked and looked, and I can''t find a previous shot of this subject on dpc ... yet these are in every supermarket ... right under your eyes :-)"<br/> <br/>I''ve had a smililar shot up since last year. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=49941" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Here it is.</a></td>', '"I''ve looked and looked, and I can''t find a previous shot of this subject on dpc ... yet these are in every supermarket ... right under your eyes :-)" I''ve had a smililar shot up since last year. Here it is.', '2004-02-29 16:26:39.000000', NULL, 0),
